{
  // ==============================================================================
  // CS2 Workshop Tools FGD 实体定义待翻译字典 (fgd_extracted.jsonc)
  // 自动从游戏原版 FGD 文件中提取的描述与显示文本
  // ==============================================================================
  //
  // 【译制提示】
  // - 格式为标准键值对: "英文原文": "中文译文"
  // - 未翻译项的值保持为空字符串 "", 翻译完成后可填入对应译文. 
  // - 翻译完成后可直接合并至 fgd_translations.jsonc 中使用. 
  // ==============================================================================
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // 1. 实体类说明 (Entity Class Descriptions) (共 550 条)
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  "A navigation node for ground moving NPCs. Navigation nodes are baked into the nodegraph so that NPCs can move ": "用于地面移动 NPC 的导航节点. 这些导航节点会被编译进节点图中, 以便 NPC 能够顺利移动 ",
  "A navigation node for ground moving NPCs that includes some context information for NPCs that are interested in it. The hint might ": "这是一个用于地面移动 NPC 的导航节点, 其中包含了那些对此感兴趣的 NPC 所需的上下文信息. 该提示可能 ",
  "A navigation node for flying NPCs. Air navigation nodes are baked into the nodegraph so that NPCs can move ": "用于引导NPC飞行的导航节点. 空中导航节点已被预先集成到节点图中, 以便NPC能够顺利移动 ",
  "A navigation node for flying NPCs that includes some context information for NPCs that are interested in it. The hint might ": "用于控制NPC飞行的导航节点, 其中包含了对相关NPC有用的上下文信息. 此提示可能会 ",
  "A hint that is not used for navigation. They don't go into the nodegraph, nor do they fall to the ground. Use these to provide ": "仅作为提示信息使用, 不具备导航功能. 它们既不会出现在节点图中, 也不会掉落到地面上. 可利用此类提示来提供相关信息 ",
  "An entity that controls all connections between nodes that intersect the controller's volume. ": "一个用于控制所有与控制器作用域相交的节点间连接的实体.  ",
  "This entity automatically severs node connections that pass through its radius. If it moves, it will restore those connections.": "该实体会自动切断所有经过其作用范围的节点连接. 若该实体发生移动, 这些连接又会重新建立. ",
  "A climb-node for AI navigation. Only usable by NPCs that can climb.": "用于AI导航的攀爬节点. 仅可由具备攀爬能力的NPC使用. ",
  "NPC used to drive a target vehicle.": "该NPC曾负责驾驶目标载具. ",
  "NPC Spawn Destination. (Consult npc_template_maker help for more info)": "NPC生成目标地点. (详情请查阅 npc_template_maker 的帮助文档) (Consult npc_template_maker help for more info)",
  "Indicates items in the world that some NPCs may operate upon": "表示场景中某些 NPC 可能会操作的物品",
  "NPC Maker": "NPC制作器",
  "AI Relationship - Sets relationships between groups of NPCs in the AI.": "人工智能关系设置 — 用于设定人工智能中各 NPC 群组之间的关系. ",
  "AI Goal Follow": "AI目标跟随",
  "AI Goal Injured Follow": "AI目标受伤追踪",
  "Battle line": "战斗阵线",
  "AI Goal Act Busy": "模拟忙碌状态:AI目标执行",
  "AI Goal Act Busy Queue": "人工智能'假装忙碌'队列",
  "Change Hint Group": "更改提示分组",
  "AI Script Conditions": "AI脚本条件",
  "An entity that can be used to control the idle speech patterns of a set of NPCs.": "用于控制一组NPC的闲聊行为的实体. ",
  "Manages a choreographed scene of one or more actors.": "用于管理由一个或多个演员构成的编排场景. ",
  "Manages a list of logic_choreographed_scene entities. Store choreo scenes in them in order that they will be played by other inputs. Whenever a scene plays, the manager will remove all scenes before that one in the list. The name of another logic_scene_list_manager can be entered in a slot instead of an invididual scene, which will cause all scenes in that manager to be removed when a later scene in this list is played.": "用于管理一组 logic_choreographed_scene 实体. 将编排好的场景存储于其中, 以便供其他输入源调用播放. 每当某个场景开始播放时, 管理器便会移除列表中该场景之前的所有场景. 您也可以在相应位置输入另一个 logic_scene_list_manager 的名称, 以此替代单个场景; 这样, 当本列表中后续的场景被播放时, 该管理器中的所有场景都会被移除. ",
  "This entity makes sounds or smells that can be sensed by NPCs, but not by the player. This can be used ": "该实体会发出声音或散发出气味, 能被NPC感知到, 但玩家无法察觉. 这一特性可被加以利用 ",
  "An entity that creates NPCs. The NPCs it creates are clones of a template NPC. NPCs are spawned around this maker's origin, or at specified destination points.": "用于生成NPC的实体. 它生成的NPC都是某个模板NPC的复制品. 这些NPC会生成在生成器所在位置附近或指定的目标点处. ",
  "Puppet entity that mimics the animations of a target NPC.": "可模仿目标NPC动作的傀儡实体. ",
  "Detects AI events at a point, and outputs the sound level as a value between 0 and 1. It only detects events that match the specified event type.": "该工具可检测某一时间点上的AI事件, 并将声音强度以0到1之间的数值形式输出. 它仅能检测那些符合指定事件类型的事件. ",
  "AI Attached Item Manager - manages the items attached to one or more NPCs / ragdolls.": "AI附着物品管理器 - 用于管理附着在一个或多个NPC/布娃娃身上的物品. ",
  "Generic Actor NPC": "普通互动型NPC",
  "An entity used for non-NPCs that need to synchronise their animation with an NPC in a scripted_sequence. Usually a piece": "用于那些需要在 scripted_sequence 中与 NPC 的动画保持同步的非 NPC 实体. 通常为一个角色部件",
  "A meshless model you can use as a speaker location for vcd's": "一个无网格模型, 可用于设置 VCD 中的扬声器位置",
  "Bullseye": "百发百中",
  "EnemyFinder": "敌人搜寻器",
  "Scripted Target": "脚本目标",
  "Grabs an NPC and makes them play a specified set of animations. The NPC can be told to move to the scripted sequence position or can ": "抓取一个NPC并使其播放指定的动画序列. 可以指令该NPC移动到预定位置, 也可以 ",
  "Forces an NPC to idle (optionally at a specified location), allowing you to control what will interrupt it.": "强制让NPC进入空闲状态(可选择指定位置), 这样你就能控制哪些事件能打断它的行为. ",
  "Forces an NPC to move to a specified destination entity.": "强制让NPC移动到指定的目标实体处. ",
  "Forces an NPC to perform an ability at a specified target.": "强制 NPC 对指定目标使用某项技能. ",
  "An entity to control a global game state, with an optional associated counter, that persists across level transitions.": "用于控制全局游戏状态的实体, 可选择性地附带一个计数器, 且该状态能在关卡切换时得以保留. ",
  "Universal ambient sound. Use it to play and control a single sound.": "通用环境音效:用于播放与控制单一音效. ",
  "Plays a sound event from a point. The point can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从指定点播放声音事件. 该点可以是当前实体的位置, 也可以是其他指定实体的位置. ",
  "Plays a sound event from the closest point on a sphere to the player. The origin can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从球面上距离玩家最近的点播放声音事件. 原点可以是当前实体或指定实体的位置. ",
  "Plays a sound event from a point, passes along the min and max positions of its AABB. The point can be this entity or a specified entity's position.": "从指定点播放声音事件, 同时传递该点所在包围盒的最小与最大坐标值. 该点可以是当前实体所在位置, 也可以是其他指定实体的位置. ",
  "Plays a sound event from a point closest to the player on the box.": "从盒子上距离玩家最近的位置播放音效. ",
  "Plays some number of soundevents (up to max) along segments of a path corner network": "在路径拐角网络的各段上播放指定数量的声音事件(最多为上限值)",
  "Save/Load the fields of a specific operator stack.": "保存/加载特定运算符堆栈的字段. ",
  "Set a public parameter of a playing soundevent.": "设置正在播放的音效事件的公共参数. ",
  "Sets an opvar value on a library stack": "设置库堆栈中的操作变量值",
  "Analyzes a mostly enclosed space and defines walls and doorways within that space. Sets an opvar value on a library stack based on distance from the doorways": "分析一个基本封闭的空间, 确定其中的墙壁与门道. 根据与门道的距离, 为库堆栈设置一个操作变量值",
  "Creates a spherical Sound Area": "创建球形音效区域",
  "Creates a box Sound Area": "创建矩形音效区域",
  "An entity that allows you to change the textures on other brush-built entities.": "一种可让你修改其他通过画笔创建的实体表面纹理的工具. ",
  "An entity that creates a splash effect at its origin. If the 'find water surface' spawnflag is set, it will instead trace down below itself to find the water surface on which to create splashes.": "一种会在自身位置产生水花效果的实体. 如果设置了'寻找水面'生成标志, 它会向下探测以寻找水面并随之产生水花. ",
  "An entity that controls the HDR tonemapping for the player. Think of it as a method of controlling the exposure of the player's eyes.": "用于控制玩家视角下的HDR色调映射的实体. 可以将其视作调节玩家视野中曝光度的一种方式. ",
  "An entity to control the number of ragdolls in the world, for performance reasons.": "出于性能考虑, 此实体用于控制场景中布娃娃模型的数量. ",
  "An entity to control the number of gibs in the world, for performance reasons.": "出于性能考虑, 此实体用于控制场景中碎片的生成数量. ",
  "An entity that spits out a constant stream of smoke. See particlezoo.vmf for sample usage. You can place up to two env_particlelight entities near the smoke stack to add ambient light to its particles.": "一个能持续喷出烟雾的实体. 示例用法可参见 particlezoo.vmf. 您可以在烟雾源附近放置最多两个 env_particlelight 实体, 为烟雾粒子添加环境光照效果. ",
  "An entity that controls screen fades.": "用于控制屏幕淡入淡出的实体. ",
  "Changes tonemap controllers for players touching the trigger.": "修改触发区域内玩家所使用的色调映射控制器. ",
  "A Half-Life 2 ladder. Handles player auto mount/unmount, as well as +use to get onto the ladder.<br><br>": "这是《半条命2》中的梯子. 它能自动处理玩家的攀爬与脱离操作, 还支持通过按 +use 键来登上梯子. <br><br>",
  "An entity to handle endpoints for multiple ladders that are too close to each other.": "用于处理位置过于接近的多个阶梯端点的实体. ",
  "Legacy support. Use func_brush instead.": "旧版兼容模式. 请改用 func_brush. ",
  "A brush entity that is conditionally solid based on the interaction layer specified.": "一种根据指定的交互图层来决定是否具有实体属性的笔刷实体. ",
  "An brush built entity with various features.": "一个具备多种功能的画笔工具. ",
  "Slideshow Display": "幻灯片放映界面",
  "Movie Display": "电影展示",
  "A very simple model entity that has animations and response rules.": "一个非常简单的模型实体, 具备动画效果与响应规则. ",
  "An entity that creates a visible beam between two points. The points can be attached to entities to make the beam move around.": "一种能在两点之间生成可见光束的实体. 这两点可绑定到其他实体上, 从而使光束随之移动. ",
  "HL1 Legacy: Beverage Dispenser.": "HL1 经典版:饮料自动贩卖机. ",
  "An entity used to spawn blood effects.": "用于生成血迹效果的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates an explosion at its origin.": "一种会在自身位置产生爆炸的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates a smoke trail.": "用于生成烟雾轨迹的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates an explosion at its origin. If the no-damage spawnflag is set, the explosion won't be visible, but will apply force to any physics objects within its radius.": "一种会在自身位置产生爆炸的实体. 如果设置了'无伤害'标志, 则爆炸现象不会显现, 但仍会对半径范围内的所有物理物体施加作用力. ",
  "An entity that will cause a physics impact on another entity.": "会对其他实体产生物理影响的实体. ",
  "An entity that handles a single flame at its origin. The flame causes heat 'damage' to other env_fire entities around it, and will eventually ignite non-flaming env_fire entities nearby, causing the fire to spread.": "该实体负责控制初始生成的单一火焰. 该火焰会对周围的其他 env_fire 实体造成热量伤害, 最终还会引燃附近尚未着火的 env_fire 实体, 从而使火势蔓延. ",
  "An entity that provides heat to all nearby env_fire entities. Cannot be extinguished.": "一种能向周围所有 env_fire 实体提供热量的实体. 无法被扑灭. ",
  "An entity that detects changes in heat nearby.": "一种能够检测周围热量变化的实体. ",
  "An entity that catches a target entity on fire. If the entity is an animating model, it will have sprite flames attached to its skeleton. Otherwise the entity will emit particle flame puffs.": "能够使目标实体着火的实体. 若该实体为带有动画效果的模型, 则其骨骼上会附着火焰贴图; 否则该实体会释放出火焰粒子. ",
  "An entity that controls the fog and view distance in the map.": "用于控制地图中雾效及可视距离的实体. ",
  "An entity that controls the postprocess settings in the map.": "用于控制地图中后处理设置的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates a laser beam between itself and a given target.": "一种能在自身与指定目标之间生成激光束的实体. ",
  "An entity that draws a text message on player's HUDs.": "用于在玩家的HUD上绘制文本消息的实体. ",
  "An entity to control screen shake on players.": "用于控制玩家屏幕震动的实体. ",
  "An entity to control screen tilt on players.": "用于控制玩家屏幕倾斜度的实体. ",
  "Causes a view punch on players.": "使玩家产生视野眩晕效果. ",
  "Creates rotorwash.": "产生旋翼气流. ",
  "An entity that shoots out gibs. Style of body part depends on language type.": "一种会喷射出残肢碎块的实体. 其身体部位的样式取决于语言类型. ",
  "An entity that shoots models, or sprites, out of its origin.": "一种能从其原点发射模型或精灵的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates gibs when it's within the influence of a helicopter's rotor wash.": "一种在直升机旋翼产生的气流影响下会产生碎片的实体. ",
  "An entity that acts like a soundscape but gets all of its sound parameters from another env_soundscape entity.": "该实体的作用类似于声音场景, 但它所有的声音参数均来自另一个 env_soundscape 实体. ",
  "An entity to control sound in an area. The active soundscape at any time is the last one that had line-of-sight to the player, and was within the radius.": "用于控制特定区域内声音效果的实体. 任何时候生效的音景, 都是最后一个与玩家视线相连且位于作用半径内的音景. ",
  "An entity that works like env_soundscape except that it works in conjunction with trigger_soundscape to determine when a player hears it.": "这是一种类似 env_soundscape 的实体, 但它需与 trigger_soundscape 配合使用, 以决定玩家何时能听到声音. ",
  "An entity used to create sparks at its origin.": "用于在生成点产生火花的实体. ",
  "An entity that controls the drawing of a sprite in the world.": "用于控制场景中精灵绘制的实体. ",
  "A env_sprite that allows orientation.": "一个支持方向设置的 env_sprite. ",
  "An entity to control wind in the map.": "用于控制地图上风向的实体. ",
  "An entity used to control the 3D Skybox. Its origin is used to determine the 3D Skybox's position relative to the map. Place this entity, in the 3D Skybox, at the point where the origin of the map should be.": "该实体用于控制 3D 天空盒. 其原点用于确定 3D 天空盒相对于地图的位置. 请将此实体放置在 3D 天空盒中, 具体位置为地图原点应有的位置. ",
  "An entity used to limit the number of a particular weapon type in the world. Useful in places where NPCs are spawning rapidly, dying, and dropping weapons.": "用于限制世界上某种特定类型武器数量的实体. 在NPC大量生成、死亡并掉落武器的场景中尤为有用. ",
  "An entity that gives equipment to the player who activates it. To use, add new keys to this entity, where each key is the classname of a weapon/item, and the corresponding value is the number of those weapons/items to give to the player who uses this entity. If the 'Use Only' spawnflag isn't set, then players can just touch this entity to get the equipment.": "这是一种在玩家激活后会向其发放装备的实体. 使用时, 需向该实体添加新键值对:键为武器或物品的类别名称, 值则是要发放给使用该实体的玩家的相应物品数量. 若未设置'仅限使用'生成标志, 玩家只需触碰该实体即可获得装备. ",
  "An entity that displays text on player's screens.": "一种用于在玩家屏幕上显示文本的实体. ",
  "An entity used to move a motion-disabled prop when it enables motion. Parent this entity to the prop, and when the prop has its motion enabled, it will immediately teleport to the origin of this entity.": "该实体用于在启用运动功能时移动原本无法运动的道具. 将此实体设为该道具的父级, 当道具的运动功能被启用时, 它便会立即传送到此实体的初始位置. ",
  "An entity that displays a text message in the world, at its origin.": "一种用于在自身原点位置向世界中显示文本消息的实体. ",
  "An entity that issues commands to the client console, as if it was typed in by the player (if activator is a player, or the local player in single player).": "一个能够向客户端控制台发送命令的实体, 这些命令就如同由玩家输入的一样(若激活者为玩家, 或处于单人模式下的本地玩家). ",
  "An entity that issues commands to the server console.": "向服务器控制台发送命令的实体. ",
  "An entity that issues commands to each valid client's console, as if it was typed in by that player locally.": "一个能够向每个合法客户端的控制台发送命令的实体, 效果就如同由该玩家本地输入的一样. ",
  "An entity that will find an entity and pass it along as the !Caller with the OutEntity output.  Requires using !Caller as the parameter on the input.": "该实体会查找另一个实体, 并将其作为 !Caller 通过 OutEntity 输出. 使用时需在输入参数中指定 !Caller. ",
  "An entity used to count the number of players within a zone.": "用于统计区域内玩家数量的实体. ",
  "This entity indicates the position and facing direction at which the player will spawn. Any number of ": "该实体用于指定玩家生成时的位置及朝向. 可以设置任意数量的 ",
  "An entity that defines an intermission spot where dead players will float until they respawn.": "用于定义死亡玩家复活前停留区域的实体. ",
  "An entity that acts as a local coordinate frame for transitions to another level. There should be a corresponding info_landmark entity in the next map. ": "该实体充当本地坐标系, 用于切换到其他层级. 在下一个地图中应当存在一个对应的 info_landmark 实体.  ",
  "Logical entity that starts async loading or unloading a level.": "用于启动关卡异步加载或卸载的逻辑实体. ",
  "An entity that's immediately removed on spawning. Useful as a spotlight target.": "生成后会立即被移除的实体. 可用作聚光灯的目标. ",
  "An entity that does nothing. Very useful as a positioning entity for other entities to refer to (i.e. the endpoint of an env_beam)": "一个什么也不做的实体. 它非常适合作为其他实体的定位参考点(例如 env_beam 的端点)",
  "An entity that does nothing. Not networked.": "一个什么都不做的实体. 不进行网络同步. ",
  "An entity that is a target for particle system control points": "作为粒子系统控制点作用目标的实体",
  "An entity that spawns a particle system built using the particle editor.": "用于生成由粒子编辑器创建的粒子系统的实体. ",
  "An entity that acts like a magnet for ragdolls. Useful for crafting exaggerated ragdoll behavior (i.e. guys falling over rails on death). If the ": "一种能像磁铁一样吸引布娃娃实体的装置. 可用于创造夸张的布娃娃动作效果(比如角色死亡后顺着铁轨倒下). 若 ",
  "An entity that can be used to change the lighting origin of a prop_static. Set the prop_static's Lighting Origin to point at this entity to ": "该实体可用于修改 prop_static 的光源原点. 将 prop_static 的'光源原点'属性指向此实体即可 ",
  "An entity that does nothing itself, but can be used to specify the destination for a trigger_teleport entity. An info_target can be used instead.": "该实体本身不会执行任何操作, 但可用于指定 trigger_teleport 实体的传送目标. 也可使用 info_target 来代替. ",
  "An invisible lightsource that changes in some way over time.": "一种会随着时间以某种方式发生变化的不可见光源. ",
  "An entity to control the color correction in the map.": "用于控制地图色彩校正的实体. ",
  "A brush entity that moves linearly along a given distance, in a given direction.": "一种沿指定方向、按给定距离做直线运动的画笔实体. ",
  "A rotating brush entity.": "一个可旋转的画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity that moves vertically, and can rotate while doing so.": "一个可垂直移动且移动时还能旋转的画笔实体. ",
  "Animation KeyFrame": "动画关键帧",
  "Keyframed Move Behavior": "关键帧移动行为",
  "Track Move Behavior": "追踪移动行为",
  "A node entity that marks a point in a rope. The first node in the rope should be a move_rope, followed by 1 or more keyframe_ropes.": "用于标记绳索上某个点的节点实体. 绳索的首个节点应为 move_rope, 其后可跟随一个或多个 keyframe_rope. ",
  "The first node in set of nodes that are used to place ropes in the world. It should connect to 1 or more keyframe_rope entities.": "用于在世界中放置绳索的节点集合中的首个节点. 该节点应与至少一个 keyframe_rope 实体相连. ",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for a player-useable button. When used by the player, it moves to a pressed position.": "一种专门用作玩家可操作按钮的画笔实体. 当玩家点击时, 它会移动到被按下的位置. ",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for a rotating player-useable button. When used by the player, it rotates to a pressed position.": "一种画笔实体, 专为制作可由玩家操作的旋转按钮而设计. 当玩家使用该按钮时, 它会旋转至被按下的位置. ",
  "A brush entity that's designed to be used for rotating wheels, where the player can rotate them to arbitrary positions before stopping.": "这是一种专为旋转轮子而设计的画笔实体:玩家可将其旋转至任意角度后再固定下来. ",
  "A brush entity for use as a player-useable door.": "可供玩家使用的门形画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity for use as a rotating player-useable door.": "一种可用作可旋转且玩家可使用的门的画笔实体. ",
  "An entity that has special animation events that can be fired by a model with an animation inside its .qc designed for": "一个包含特殊动画事件的实体, 这些事件可由带有动画效果的模型通过其.qc文件来触发",
  "Fires outputs when a map spawns. ": "地图生成时触发输出.  ",
  "Compares an input value to another value. ": "将输入值与另一个值进行比较.  ",
  "Tests a boolean value and fires an output based on whether the value is true or false. ": "用于测试布尔值, 并根据该值为真还是假来触发相应的输出.  ",
  "Contains a list of logic_branch entities and fires outputs when the state of any of the logic_branches changes.<br><br>": "该组件包含一系列 logic_branch 实体, 当其中任意一个 logic_branch 的状态发生变更时, 便会触发对应的输出. <br><br>",
  "Compares an input to up to 32 preset values. If the input value is the same as ": "将输入值与最多32个预设值进行比较. 若输入值与某个预设值相同 ",
  "Compares a set of inputs to each other. If they are all the same, fires an OnEqual output. ": "用于比较一组输入值. 如果所有值都相同, 则会触发 OnEqual 输出.  ",
  "Fires an activity event of the specified type. ": "触发指定类型的活动事件.  ",
  "Primarily a pulse interface for examining game_state. ": "主要用于通过脉冲接口来检测游戏状态.  ",
  "Does calculations based on the number of a specified type of NPC in a specified region.": "根据指定区域内特定类型NPC的数量进行计算. ",
  "An entity that acts as a container for scripts": "用于容纳脚本的实体",
  "A message forwarder. Fires an OnTrigger output when triggered, and ": "消息转发器. 触发时会生成一条 OnTrigger 输出信号 ",
  "An entity that fires a timer event at regular, or random, intervals. It can also be set to oscillate between": "一种能够以固定或随机间隔触发计时器事件的实体. 它也可以被设置为在多个状态间来回切换",
  "Specifies entities that are to be ignored by the hammer_update_safe_entities console command. ": "指定那些应被 hammer_update_safe_entities 控制台命令忽略的实体.  ",
  "An entity that can be used to enables/disable vphysics collisions between two target entities.": "该实体用于启用或禁用两个目标实体之间的物理碰撞. ",
  "An entity that remaps a range of input values to a given range of output values.": "一种可将一定范围的输入值重新映射到指定范围的输出值的实体. ",
  "Used to create a blend between two colors for controlling the color of another entity.": "用于在两个颜色之间进行混合, 从而控制其他对象的颜色. ",
  "Holds a numeric value and performs arithmetic operations upon it. If either the minimum or maximum ": "用于存储数值并执行算术运算. 若数值低于最小值或高于最大值 ",
  "An entity that calculates and outputs a vector from one entity to another.": "一个用于计算并输出从一个实体指向另一个实体的向量的实体. ",
  "An entity that is used to set navigation properties on other entities. Useful to make NPCs ignore physics props in their way that they can easily push.": "用于设置其他实体的导航属性的实体. 该实体有助于让 NPC 忽略那些它们能够轻易推开的物理障碍物. ",
  "An entity that is used to force an autosave.": "用于强制触发自动保存的实体. ",
  "An entity that is used to look for opportunities to autosave.": "用于查找自动保存机会的实体. ",
  "Turns an entity, or set of entities, into a single template that can be instanced anywhere, and multiple times. ": "可将单个实体或多个实体转换为一个模板, 该模板可在任意位置被多次实例化.  ",
  "Spawns the specified entity template at its origin. If set to auto-spawn, it will spawn the template whenever there's room and the player ": "在指定位置生成对应的实体模板. 若设置为自动生成, 则只要有空间且玩家存在时就会生成该模板 ",
  "A filter that tests the activator against multiple filters. This allows you to build more complex filters, such as": "一种可将激活器与多个过滤器逐一比对的过滤器. 借助它, 您可以构建更复杂的过滤器, 例如",
  "A filter that filters by the name of the activator.": "一个根据激活器名称进行筛选的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters by the model of the activator.": "一种依据激活器型号进行筛选的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters by a context on the activator.": "一种根据激活器上的上下文进行筛选的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters by the class name of the activator.": "一个根据激活器的类名进行过滤的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters by the mass of the activator.": "一种根据激活体的质量进行筛选的过滤器. ",
  "A damage filter that filters by the type of damage inflicted. This can only be used as a damage filter, not as an activator filter.": "一种根据造成的伤害类型进行筛选的过滤器. 该过滤器仅能用作伤害过滤器, 无法用作激活过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters a potential enemy entity by a set of criteria.": "一种根据一系列条件来筛选潜在敌对实体的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters a potential entity by proximity from the origin of the filter.": "一种根据与过滤器原点之间的距离来筛选潜在实体的过滤器. ",
  "A filter that filters a potential entity by line of sight from the origin of the filter.": "一种过滤器, 可根据从过滤器原点发出的视线来筛选潜在的实体. ",
  "A filter that filters entities by active modifiers applied to them": "一种根据实体上所应用的激活修饰符来筛选实体的过滤器",
  "An entity that detects if another entity points in a given direction for a period of time.": "用于检测某个实体是否在一段时间内朝向指定方向的实体. ",
  "An entity that detects if another entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds a threshold value.": "用于检测某个实体的角速度是否达到或超过阈值. ",
  "An entity that detects and outputs an entity's velocity.": "用于检测并输出实体速度的组件. ",
  "An entity that detects another entity's proximity to a target position.": "一种能够检测其他实体是否靠近目标位置的实体. ",
  "An entity that teleports a target entity to this position and angles. ": "一个能将目标实体传送到指定位置与角度的实体.  ",
  "An entity that does damage to all entities in a radius around itself, with a specified delay.": "一种能够在指定延迟后对其周围一定范围内的所有实体造成伤害的实体. ",
  "A brush entity that's physically simulated.": "一个经过物理模拟的画笔实体. ",
  "A controller that tries to keep an entity facing a particular direction.": "一种旨在使实体始终朝向特定方向的控制器. ",
  "An entity used to attach constraints to a local position on an entity. Usually constraints will attach to the center of mass of an object. ": "该实体用于将约束条件附加到某个实体上的特定位置. 通常情况下, 约束条件会被附加到物体的质心处.  ",
  "A physically simulated spring. ": "一个基于物理模拟的弹簧.  ",
  "A physically simulated hinge. Use the helper to define the axis of rotation.": "一个基于物理模拟的铰链. 使用辅助工具来定义旋转轴. ",
  "A constraint that keeps the position of two objects fixed, relative to the constraint's origin. You can optionally specify limits for the relative twist and swing rotation.": "此约束用于固定两个对象相对于约束原点的位置. 您还可以选择性地设置相对扭转与摆动旋转的角度范围. ",
  "Constrain an entity to the world or another entity at a fixed relative position.": "将实体固定在世界坐标系中或另一个实体上, 并保持固定的相对位置. ",
  "A constraint that is essentially two length constraints and two points. Imagine it as a virtual rope connected to two objects, each suspended from a pulley above them.": "这是一种由两个长度约束以及两个点构成的约束条件. 可以把它想象成一根虚拟绳索, 两端分别连接着两个物体, 而这两个物体又各自通过滑轮悬挂在上方. ",
  "A constraint that constrains an entity along a line segment.": "一种用于将实体限定在一条线段上的约束条件. ",
  "A constraint that preserves the distance between two entities. If the 'Keep Rigid' flag is set, think of it as a rod. If not, think off it as a virtual rope.": "一种用于保持两个实体间距离的约束条件. 若启用了'保持刚性'选项, 可将其视为一根刚性杆; 否则, 可将其视作一根虚拟绳索. ",
  "A constraint that fixes the position of two entities, relative to this constraint's origin. Also allows for limits on the rotation around each axis, in the space of this constraint.": "一种用于固定两个实体位置的约束条件, 其基准点为该约束的原点. 此外, 该约束还可限定实体在各个轴上可旋转的范围. ",
  "A configurable constraint between two objects.": "一种可配置的、用于约束两个对象之间关系的规则. ",
  "Constrain an entity to a spline.": "将实体约束到样条曲线上. ",
  "An entity used to apply constant acceleration to a physics object. ": "用于对物理对象施加恒定加速度的实体.  ",
  "An angular thruster. Use it to apply angular force to an entity.": "一种角度推进器. 用它可对实体施加角度方向的力. ",
  "An entity that tries to spin a target entity at a particular speed.": "一个试图以特定速度使目标实体旋转的实体. ",
  "An entity that acts like a magnet, attaching metallic physics objects to itself when they touch it.": "一种具有磁性特性的实体, 当金属材质的物理物体接触到它时便会被吸附上去. ",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations and/or simulate cloth. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. ": "一种可置于层级结构中的道具, 能够播放动画和/或模拟布料效果. 该道具还可设置为在受到足够伤害时碎裂.  ",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage.<br>": "一种可放置在层级结构中并播放动画的道具. 它还可被设置为在承受足够伤害时破碎. <br>",
  "A prop that physically simulates as a single rigid body. It can be constrained to other physics objects using hinges ": "一种在物理上模拟为单个刚体的道具. 可通过铰链将其与其他物理对象约束在一起 ",
  "This class is the same as prop_physics, except the runtime collisions use a more bouncy method that avoids ": "此类与 prop_physics 完全相同, 唯一的区别在于运行时碰撞处理采用了一种弹性更强的算法, 从而避免了 ",
  "A prop that physically simulates and can be articulated with internal joints. The joint constraints are part of the physics model.": "一种可借助内部关节进行活动模拟的物理道具. 这些关节约束属于物理模型的一部分. ",
  "A way to attach one model to another as an ornament. It will render in the way that player/NPC weapons render.": "一种将一个模型作为装饰物附加到另一个模型上的方法. 该模型会以玩家或NPC武器相同的方式进行渲染. ",
  "A brush entity that can be broken from damage, or an input.": "一种可因受到损伤或外部输入而破碎的画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity that creates precipitation inside its volume.": "一种能够在自身范围内产生降水的 Brush 实体. ",
  "A brush entity that prevents rain and snow inside its volume.": "一种可阻挡雨雪进入其范围内的画笔实体. ",
  "A Hammer-only brush entity that prevents detail sprites from being placed inside its volume.": "一种仅适用于锤子工具的笔刷实体, 可阻止细节精灵被放置在其范围内. ",
  "A brush entity that can be toggled on/off. When off, the brush will be non-solid and invisible. Does not cast lightmap shadows.": "一种可开启/关闭的笔刷实体. 关闭时, 该笔刷将变为不可触及且不可见的状态, 也不会产生光照贴图阴影. ",
  "This is a moving target that moves along a path of path_tracks. It can be shot and killed.": "这是一个会在 path_tracks 路径上移动的活动目标. 它可以被射击并消灭. ",
  "Creates a school of interactive fish that swim near this entity.": "创建一群可在该实体附近游动的互动型鱼群. ",
  "An entity that works as a rotating/moving platform that will carry a train to a new track. ": "一种可旋转或移动的平台实体, 用于将列车转移至新的轨道上.  ",
  "A moving platform that the player can ride. It follows a path of path_track entities.<br>": "一种可供玩家乘坐的移动平台. 它会沿着一系列 path_track 实体所定义的路径行进",
  "A moving train that follows a path of path_track entities, shoots at the player, and can be killed.<br>": "一列沿着path_track实体所定义的路径移动的火车, 会向玩家开火, 且可以被击毁. <br>",
  "When used by the player, this entity overrides the player's controls to let them drive a train.": "当玩家使用此实体后, 它会接管玩家的控制权限, 使玩家能够驾驶火车. ",
  "An entity that changes the target of a tanktrain_ai entity.": "用于修改 tanktrain_ai 实体目标的实体. ",
  "Train chase AI": "训练追踪人工智能",
  "An entity used to build paths for other entities to follow. Each path_track is a node on the path, each holding the name of the next path_track in the path.": "该实体用于为其他实体构建行进路径. 每个 path_track 都是路径上的一个节点, 且每个节点都保存着路径中下一个 path_track 的名称. ",
  "A debugging tool for testing tracelines.": "用于测试追踪线的调试工具. ",
  "A trigger volume that autosaves when the player touches it.": "当玩家触碰时会自动保存的触发区域. ",
  "An entity that triggers a level change.<br><br>": "用于触发关卡切换的实体. <br><br>",
  "A trigger volume that changes the gravity on any entity that touches it.": "一个触发区域, 当任意实体触碰它时便会改变该实体的重力. ",
  "Soundscape trigger. ": "音景触发器.  ",
  "A trigger volume that damages entities that touch it.": "一种触发区域, 接触它的实体会受到伤害. ",
  "A trigger volume that removes any entities that touch it. Be careful, removing some entities can cause instability. ": "这是一种触发区域, 会移除所有接触到它的实体. 请注意, 移除某些实体可能导致系统不稳定.  ",
  "A trigger volume that can be triggered multiple times.": "一种可多次触发的触发区域. ",
  "A trigger volume that removes itself after it is triggered once.": "一种触发一次后便会自动消失的触发区域. ",
  "A trigger volume that sets the value of an snd_sos opvar.": "一种触发区域, 用于设置 snd_sos 操作变量的值. ",
  "An entity used to trigger something when the player looks at something. It fires 'OnTrigger' when the player ": "一种当玩家注视某物时用于触发相应事件的实体. 当玩家注视目标时, 它会触发'OnTrigger'事件 ",
  "A trigger volume that pushes entities that touch it.": "一种触发区域, 可推动触碰到它的实体. ",
  "A trigger volume that pushes physics objects that touch it.": "一种触发区域, 可推动接触到它的物理物体. ",
  "A trigger volume that can be told to push all physics objects that are inside of it in the direction specified by this trigger's angles.<br>": "一个触发区域, 可使其将所有位于其中的物理对象沿着该触发器所设定的角度方向推开. <br>",
  "Measures the distance of the player within the trigger volume from a given point (and within ": "测量玩家在触发区域内距离指定点的距离(且在此范围内 ",
  "A trigger volume that teleports entities that touch it. Entities are teleported to the Remote Destination, and have their angles ": "这是一个触发区域, 触碰它的实体会被传送. 实体会被传送到远程目的地, 同时其角度也会发生变化 ",
  "A volume that's used to control which entities go through the level transition. Create one or more trigger_transitions and ": "该卷用于控制哪些实体能够执行关卡切换. 请创建一个或多个 trigger_transitions ",
  "A volume that forces any NPC inside it to create a server side ragdoll instead of a client one.": "该区域会强制区域内所有NPC生成服务器端布娃娃模型, 而非客户端模型. ",
  "An entity used to control the LOD behavior of any water in the map. If your map has water, this entity is required.": "此实体用于控制地图中所有水体的细节层次表现. 如果地图中有水体, 则必须添加此实体. ",
  "Camera": "摄像头",
  "Orient Towards": "朝向设置",
  "Camera Vertical FOV": "相机垂直视野范围",
  "An entity that can measure the movement of an entity relative to another entity ": "一种能够测量某个实体相对于另一个实体的运动情况的实体 ",
  "An entity to control the rolling credits.": "用于控制滚动字幕的实体. ",
  "An entity used by the -makedevshots system, which automatically takes screenshots at the position of every devshot camera in the level.": "此实体供 -makedevshots 系统使用, 该系统可自动在关卡中每个开发快照摄像机所在位置截取屏幕画面. ",
  "An entity that is used to relay inputs/ouputs to the player and back to the world.": "用于将输入/输出信息传递给玩家并回传给游戏世界的实体. ",
  "Simple projected decal entity": "简单的投影贴花实体",
  "Used to produce perfectly reflective glass that renders world + entities. ": "用于制造具备完美反射效果的玻璃, 能够呈现现实世界及其中的物体.  ",
  "Generic game statistics counter.": "通用游戏数据统计器. ",
  "An entity to draw a spotlight. Will draw a beam when the player views it side on, and a halo when it's facing towards the player. ": "用于绘制聚光灯的实体. 当玩家从侧面观察时会显示光束, 而当其正对玩家时则会显示光环.  ",
  "An entity for placing an instance of a prefab map file.  You may translate and rotate this entity. ": "用于放置预制地图文件实例的实体. 您可以对该实体进行平移和旋转操作.  ",
  "An entity that allows for creation and control of instructor lessons by map logic": "一个可根据地图逻辑来创建并控制教师授课内容的实体",
  "A generic target that gets replicated to the client for hud hint targeting": "一个通用目标, 会被复制到客户端以用于HUD提示定位",
  "An entity that allows for creation and control of VR Based instructor lessons by map logic": "一个可根据地图逻辑来创建并控制基于VR的教学课程的实体",
  "An entity that fires simple game events from map logic for game instructor": "用于从地图逻辑中触发简单游戏事件以帮助游戏引导的实体",
  "Adjust the time scale of the server and client.": "调整服务器与客户端的时间刻度. ",
  "3D text in the world": "世界中的3D文字",
  "An entity to control the fog in the map.": "用于控制地图中雾气的实体. ",
  "A dummy entity used to bookmark a frequently used workplane origin and angles. Not compiled into the map.": "这是一个虚拟实体, 用于标记经常使用的工作平面原点与角度. 不会被编译进地图中. ",
  "Generic path point": "通用路径点",
  "Used by info_spawngroup_load to specify a landmark between two spawngroups to load": "供 info_spawngroup_load 使用, 用于指定两个生成组之间需要加载的地标",
  "Controls the sky.": "控制天空. ",
  "A procedurally-shattering glass panel.": "一个能通过程序生成碎裂效果的玻璃面板. ",
  "Controller for volumetric fogging - bounds are extents of fog irradiance volume (for indirect)": "体积雾效果控制器 - 边界即雾光照体积的范围(用于间接光照) (for indirect)",
  "Sets a user bounding volume for volumetric fog - if one of these are in the map then all fog will get clamped to it. More than one then fog gets rendered if it's inside any of them.": "设置体积雾的用户限定区域 - 如果地图中存在此类区域, 所有雾效都会被限制在该区域内. 若存在多个区域, 则只要雾效位于任意一个区域内便可进行渲染. ",
  "A dynamic visibility culling box which can be used to hide objects at runtime and can be toggled on and off by entity I/O.": "一个动态的可见性剔除框, 可用于在运行时隐藏对象, 并能通过实体 I/O 功能开启或关闭. ",
  "A static (compile-time) volume that will delete geometry inside it as part of map compile.": "一种静态的(编译时生成)体积区域, 在地图编译过程中会删除该区域内的几何体. ",
  "Takes Eventoutput and translates them to a Haptic Event (VR / Controller Target)": "接收事件输出并将其转换为触觉事件(适用于 VR/控制器)",
  "Fires outputs when a map spawns in commentary mode.": "在解说模式下, 当地图生成时触发输出. ",
  "Defines the position and data of a commentary node.": "定义注释节点的位置与数据. ",
  "Causes nav mesh to be generated here and at all points that are reachable via ground movement from here.": "使导航网格在此处生成, 同时在所有能从此处通过地面移动到达的位置也生成导航网格. ",
  "A grid of precomputed light probes.": "预计算好的光照探针网格. ",
  "Cubemap for sampling indirect specular reflection.": "用于采样间接镜面反射的立方体贴图. ",
  "An env_cubemap with box projection.": "一个采用盒状投影的 env_cubemap. ",
  "Combination of an env_cubemap_box and an env_light_probe_volume": "Env_cubemap_box与Env_light_probe_volume的组合",
  "A sphere or tube shaped light": "球形或管状灯光",
  "Sets the color and angle of the light from the sun and sky.<br><br>": "设置来自太阳和天空的光线的颜色与角度. <br><br>",
  "Generic markup volume entity, can be queried in-game by name/type/location": "通用标记体积实体, 可在游戏内通过名称/类型/位置进行查询",
  "Tagged generic markup volume entity, can be queried in-game by tag/name/type/location": "这是一个带有标签的通用标记体积实体, 可通过标签、名称、类型或位置在游戏内进行查询",
  "Tagged markup volume entity with a target reference point.  Points are only in volume if behind the reference point relative to a given query position.": "已标记带有目标参考点的体积实体. 只有当这些点相对于指定查询位置处于参考点后方时, 才属于该体积范围内. ",
  "Markup group entity; add the group's targetname to the 'Markup Groups' field of a markup entity to add that entity to this group": "标记组实体:将该组的目标名称添加到标记实体的'标记组'字段中, 即可将该实体归入此组",
  "Tagged NAV markup volume entity, used during export and can be queried in-game by tag/name/type/location": "已标记的 NAV 路径体积实体, 用于导出操作; 也可在游戏中通过标签/名称/类型/位置进行查询",
  "Generate nav inside this volume and in the direction of the arrow": "在此区域内按照箭头方向生成导航路径",
  "Applies a radial burst to breakpieces outwards from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "应用径向爆炸效果, 使碎片从影响点(默认为模型原点)向外散开 (default is the origin of the model)",
  "Applies an angular 'flip' to breakpieces (like objects tipping over from an explosion or flower petals opening) causing them to tip outwards from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "使破碎的碎片产生角度上的'翻转'效果(类似于物体因爆炸而倾倒或花瓣展开的情形), 从而让它们从影响点(默认为该模型的原点)向外侧倾倒.  (default is the origin of the model)",
  "Applies an angular 'twist' to breakpieces, causing them to roll around the radial axis outward from the influence point (default is the origin of the model)": "使碎块产生角度上的'扭转', 从而使其以影响点(默认为模型原点)为中心沿径向轴向外滚动 (default is the origin of the model)",
  "Overrides the materialgroup on spawned breakpieces. (By default the active material group of the parent model is propagated to the breakpieces.)": "可覆盖生成的碎片所使用的材质组. (默认情况下, 父模型的当前材质组会被应用到这些碎片上. )",
  "Spawn a particle system when this model breaks": "在此模型破碎时生成粒子系统",
  "After breaking, further damage the spawned pieces (creates more dynamic breaks for multi-tier breakables)": "破坏后, 继续对生成的碎片造成损伤(这样能让可多层破坏的物体产生更多动态碎裂效果) (creates more dynamic breaks for multi-tier breakables)",
  "Disables impact (physics) damage on spawned breakpiece(s)": "禁用对生成的破碎碎片产生的物理伤害(s)",
  "Disables collisions (physics) with player on spawned breakpiece(s)": "禁用生成的破碎物与玩家之间的碰撞(物理效果)(s)",
  "Creates a revolute (hinge) joint between two spawned breakpieces": "在两个生成的碎片之间创建旋转(铰链)关节",
  "Creates a prismatic (slide) joint between two spawned breakpieces": "在两个生成的碎块之间创建棱柱形(滑动)连接",
  "A stage in a prop_animating_breakable progression": "这是 prop_animating_breakable 流程中的一个阶段",
  "Adds a modifier to each break piece": "为每个断点片段添加修饰符",
  "Set postprocessing params while a player is inside the volume.": "在播放器处于该体积区域内时设置后处理参数. ",
  "Addon info": "插件信息",
  "This entity indicates the FOV override for cascading shadow maps.   .": "该参数用于指定级联阴影贴图的视场角覆盖值. ",
  "This is the world entity. Each map can only contain one, and it's automatically created for you.": "这是世界实体. 每张地图只能存在一个世界实体, 系统会自动为您创建. ",
  "An entity that ends a multiplayer game.": "用于结束多人游戏的实体. ",
  "Controls the 2D skybox material. Rotation of this entity rotates the skybox material": "用于控制 2D 天空盒材质. 旋转此实体即可旋转天空盒材质",
  "An entity to control the display of HUD hints. HUD hints are used to show the player what key is bound to a particular command.": "用于控制HUD提示显示的实体. HUD提示可帮助玩家了解哪些按键对应特定的命令. ",
  "This entity marks the start point for counter-terrorists. One of these needs to be placed for each team member. ": "该实体标记了反恐精英的起始点. 每位队员都需要放置一个此类实体.  ",
  "This entity marks the start point for terrorists. One of these needs to be placed for each team member. ": "该实体表示恐怖分子的起点. 每位队员都需要放置一个这样的实体.  ",
  "This entity marks a deathmatch spawn point. This is the entity that populates the map when mp_random_spawn is used.": "此实体用于标记死亡竞赛的出生点. 当启用 mp_random_spawn 时, 地图中的玩家即由此实体生成. ",
  "This entity marks the start point for counter-terrorists in Arms Race. ": "该实体标志着反恐精英在军备竞赛模式中的起始点.  ",
  "This entity marks the start point for terrorists in Arms Race. ": "该实体标志着'军备竞赛'模式中恐怖分子的起始点.  ",
  "This entity marks the start point for enemy terrorists in a coop game. ": "该实体标志着合作模式游戏中敌方恐怖分子的起始点.  ",
  "Hostage. A hostage NPC will spawn at this point.\n\n": "人质. 一个作为人质的NPC将会出现在此处. \n\n",
  "Hostage Rescue Zone. When a hostage is led into this zone, it is marked as rescued.": "人质营救区域. 当人质被带入该区域后, 即被视为已成功营救. ",
  "A trigger volume that resets the bomb by teleporting it back into the playable area.": "一个触发区域, 能将炸弹传送回可游玩区域从而实现重置. ",
  "A trigger volume that resets the hostage by teleporting it back into the playable area.": "一个触发区域, 能将人质传送回可游戏区域内从而实现重置. ",
  "An entity to create light glows built via the particle editor": "通过粒子编辑器生成的用于创建光晕效果的实体",
  "Offscreen Panorama Texture": "屏幕外全景纹理",
  "An entity used to place a door in the world. If two doors have the same name, they will open and close together as double doors.": "用于在场景中放置门的实体. 如果两扇门的名称相同, 它们就会作为双扇门一同开合. ",
  "A security door.": "安全门. ",
  "Flashbang Projectile": "闪光弹投射物",
  "DZ Spawn Location": "DZ生成位置",
  "DZ Named Map Region": "DZ命名地图区域",
  "Exploding barrel": "爆炸的木桶",
  "C4 target": "C4目标",
  "Door price counter": "门价格计算器",
  "Weapon spawn group.": "武器生成组. ",
  "Drone Gun": "无人机干扰枪",
  "Paradrop denial area.": "禁止投放区域. ",
  "An entity that can listen to events fired from code and fire ": "一个能够监听代码触发的事件并作出响应的实体 ",
  "An entity used to define a place on a CSGO map.": "用于定义 CSGO 地图上某个位置的实体. ",
  "A brush entity that can block nav areas touching its AABB.": "一种能够阻挡与其轴对齐包围盒相接触的导航区域的画笔实体. ",
  "A trigger used to define a buyzone.": "用于定义买入区域的触发条件. ",
  "A trigger used to define the survial play area.": "用于定义生存模式游戏区域的触发器. ",
  "Defines areas where tablet is covered by static.": "定义平板电脑受到静电影响的区域. ",
  "A brush entity that's considered solid to vphysics.": "一种对物理引擎来说被视为实心物体的画笔实体. ",
  "Bomb Target. The terrorists can place C4 explosives while standing in this zone.\n\n": "炸弹目标区. 恐怖分子可在此区域内放置C4炸药. \n\n",
  "Map parameters. Used to set which teams can buys, and the C4 bomb detonation radius.": "地图参数. 用于设置哪些队伍可以购买物品, 以及C4炸弹的引爆范围. ",
  "An editable path which controls an animated camera. Can only be used in background UI maps": "这是一个可编辑的路径, 用于控制动画摄像机的移动. 仅可在背景界面地图中使用",
  "A brush entity with a moving surface that moves linearly in a given direction": "一种表面可沿指定方向做直线运动的画笔实体",
  "In-map team select position.": "在地图上选择队伍位置. ",
  "In-map terrorist team intro variant #1.": "地图内恐怖分子小队介绍变体#1. ",
  "In-map terrorist team intro variant #2.": "地图内恐怖分子小队介绍变体#2. ",
  "In-map counter-terrorist team intro variant #1.": "地图内反恐小组介绍变体#1. ",
  "In-map counter-terrorist team intro variant #2.": "地图内反恐小组介绍变体 #2. ",
  "In-map terrorist wingman intro.": "地图内恐怖分子辅助角色登场介绍. ",
  "In-map counter-terrorist wingman intro.": "地图内反恐支援伙伴介绍. ",
  "In-map end-of-match position.": "地图中显示的对局结束位置. ",
  "One of two corners needed to define the minimap boundaries (extend to support multilevel maps).": "用于定义小地图边界的两个角点之一(后续将扩展以支持多层地图). ",
  "Location on the map where to place pet.": "在地图上放置宠物的位置. ",
  "An entity that awards money to a specific team.": "向特定团队发放资金的实体. ",
  "Scale Reference (Human)": "比例参考物(人类) (Human)",
  "Panorama UI that can be controlled by cs_script. See point_script.": "可通过 cs_script 控制的全景界面, 详见 point_script. ",
  "A filter that filters by the team of the activator.": "一种根据激活者所属团队进行筛选的过滤器. ",
  "Brush-built model that fades out over a specified distance. Useful for creating world detail that doesn't need to be drawn far away, for performance reasons.": "通过画笔绘制的模型, 会在指定距离后逐渐淡出. 此功能适用于出于性能考虑而无需在远处渲染的细节元素. ",
  "An entity that can display and control a set of screen overlays, to be displayed over the player's view. Useful for view effects like drunkenness, or teleporter afterimages, etc.": "一种能够显示并控制一系列屏幕覆盖层的实体, 这些覆盖层会呈现在玩家视野之上. 该功能适用于实现醉酒效果、传送器残影等视觉特效. ",
  "Allows screenspace effects to be played on the player's view.": "允许在玩家的视野中播放屏幕特效. ",
  "An entity that can be used to light the smoke particles emitted by env_smokestack entities. Does not light any other particle types.": "该实体可用于照亮由 env_smokestack 实体生成的烟雾粒子, 但无法照亮其他类型的粒子. ",
  "An entity to control & draw a sun effect in the sky.": "用于控制并绘制天空中太阳效果的实体. ",
  "An entity that controls the depth of field settings for the player. Depth of field simulates camera blur of out-of-focus regions of the scene.": "用于控制玩家视角下景深设置的实体. 景深效果能够模拟场景中处于失焦状态的区域的模糊效果. ",
  "An entity that puts an additive glow in the world, mostly used over light sources.": "一种能为场景添加发光效果的实体, 通常用于光源上方. ",
  "An entity that monitors the material of the surface the player is standing on, and fires outputs whenever it changes to/from a specific material.": "该实体用于监测玩家所处表面的材质, 每当该材质变为或变为非指定材质时即触发输出信号. ",
  "A Half-Life 2 ladder. Handles player auto mount/unmount, as well as +use to get onto the ladder. \n\n": "这是《半条命2》中使用的梯子. 它支持玩家自动攀爬/脱离梯子, 还支持通过按 +use 键来登上梯子.  \n\n",
  "An entity used to specify the endpoints of a ladder. This entity is functional, but has been replaced by the ": "用于指定阶梯两端端点的实体. 该实体目前仍可正常使用, 但已被替换为 ",
  "An entity that can be used to optimize the visibility in a map. If you seal off an area with them, when the viewer moves the specified distance away from them, they will go opaque and the parts inside the area will not be drawn. The 'target' brush model should enclose the func_areaportal window so no parts of it are culled by the window. If you use the optional foreground brush model, then it should enclose the 'target' brush model.": "一种用于优化地图可见性的实体. 使用该实体封闭某个区域后, 当观察者移动到距离该区域一定距离之外时, 该区域会变得不透明且内部内容也不会被渲染. ‘目标’画笔模型必须完全包围 func_areaportal 窗口, 以避免其任何部分被窗口剔除. 若使用了可选的前景画笔模型, 则该模型也应完全包围‘目标’画笔模型. ",
  "A VGUI screen. Useful for in-world monitors.": "一个 VGUI 屏幕, 适用于游戏世界中的显示器. ",
  "An entity used to display a model for testing purposes. Shooting it with cycle through the model's animations.": "该实体用于展示模型以供测试使用. 对其射击可循环播放模型的各种动画. ",
  "An entity used to create a volume in which to spawn fire embers.": "用于创建可生成火焰灰烬的区域的实体. ",
  "HL1 Legacy: Large Portal Funnel": "HL1 经典版:大型传送门漏斗",
  "An entity used to create a volume in which to spawn bubbles.": "用于创建可生成气泡的容器的实体. ",
  "An entity used to create a jet of steam.": "用于产生蒸汽射流的装置. ",
  "A env_sprite thats only clientside.": "仅在客户端生效的 env_sprite. ",
  "An entity to control wind in the map. Partially functional.": "用于控制地图中风向的实体. 目前仅部分功能可用. ",
  "An entity that gives equipment to the player who activates it. To use, add new keys to this entity, where each key is the classname of a weapon/item, and the corresponding value is the number of those weapons/items to give to the player who uses this entity. If the 'Use Only' spawnflag isn't set, then players can just touch this entity to get the equipment (or the TriggerForAllPlayers input can be used).  If the Strip Player First flag is set, the player will be stripped of all weapons and items (including armor) before being given the items specified in this entity.": "该实体用于向激活它的玩家发放装备. 使用时, 需向该实体添加新键值对:键为武器或物品的类别名称, 值则为要发放给玩家的该类物品的数量. 若未设置'仅限特定玩家使用'标记, 玩家只需触碰该实体即可获得装备(也可通过'TriggerForAllPlayers'输入指令来触发). 若启用了'先没收玩家物品'标记, 则在发放本实体中指定的物品前, 玩家所有的武器、物品乃至护甲都会被先没收. ",
  "An entity that changes the team of the player who activates it.": "用于更换激活它的玩家所属队伍的实体. ",
  "An entity that awards/deducts points from the player who activates it.": "用于为激活它的玩家增加或扣除积分的实体. ",
  "An entity that displays a text message oriented in the world, at its origin.": "一种用于在世界空间中于原点位置显示文本消息的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates tesla lightning arcs around its origin.": "一种能在自身位置周围生成特斯拉闪电弧的实体. ",
  "An entity that relays bonus maps changes.": "用于转发奖励地图变更的实体. ",
  "An entity used to override player input when the player is looking at it.": "用于在玩家注视该实体时覆盖玩家输入的实体. ",
  "An entity that places a decal on the world. If the decal has no target name, it will immediately apply itself when the level is loaded. ": "用于在场景中放置贴花的实体. 如果该贴花未指定目标名称, 则会在关卡加载时立即应用自身.  ",
  "An entity that projects a decal onto the world (or props). If the decal has no target name, it will immediately apply itself when ": "用于将贴花投射到世界环境或物体上的实体. 如果该贴花未指定目标名称, 则会立即应用自身 ",
  "Use this entity to mark surfaces that shouldn't receive dynamic shadows. Useful to apply to walls and floors ": "使用该实体来标记那些不应产生动态阴影的表面, 非常适合用于墙壁和地板 ",
  "An entity that places an overlay on the world.": "用于在现实世界中叠加图层的实体. ",
  "Overlay Transition": "叠加过渡效果",
  "An entity that acts as a landmark for transitions to another level. There should be a corresponding info_landmark entity in the next map. Entities will be transitioned to the next level relative to the info_landmark entities.": "该实体用作切换到下一级的标记点. 下一张地图中应当存在一个对应的 info_landmark 实体. 各实体将根据与这些 info_landmark 实体的相对位置被传送至下一级. ",
  "A dynamic connection between two navigation nodes. You specify the node IDs of the start and end nodes, and then you can use entity I/O ": "两个导航节点之间的动态连接. 您需要指定起始节点与结束节点的 ID, 之后即可使用实体输入输出功能 ",
  "An invisible omnidirectional lightsource.": "一种不可见的全方位光源. ",
  "Sets the color and angle of the light from the sun and sky.": "设置太阳与天空光源的颜色及角度. ",
  "An invisible and directional spotlight.": "一种不可见且具有方向性的聚光灯. ",
  "An entity to control the shadows in the map.": "用于控制地图上阴影效果的实体. ",
  "An entity to control the sunlight that casts shadows in the map.": "用于控制地图上投射阴影的阳光的实体. ",
  "An entity to control the sunlight that casts cascaded shadows in the map.": "用于控制地图上投射出级联阴影的阳光的实体. ",
  "A water brush entity that moves linearly along a given distance, in a given direction": "一种沿指定方向、在指定距离内直线移动的水笔实体",
  "An entity used to place a door in the world.": "用于在场景中放置门的实体. ",
  "An entity that creates a sample point for the Cubic Environment Map.": "用于为立方体环境贴图创建采样点的实体. ",
  "A brush entity that spawns sparkling dust motes within its volume.": "一种会在自身范围内生成闪闪发光的尘埃微粒的画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity that spawns smoke particles within its volume.": "一种会在自身范围内生成烟雾粒子的画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity that spawns a translucent dust cloud within its volume.": "一种画笔实体, 可在其作用范围内生成半透明的尘埃云. ",
  "An entity that can emit dust puffs.": "能够产生粉尘团的实体. ",
  "An entity that allows you to script special visual effects via a script file.": "一个可通过脚本文件来设定特殊视觉效果的实体. ",
  "A camera entity that controls the player's view. While it's active, the player will see out of the camera.": "用于控制玩家视角的摄像机实体. 当其处于激活状态时, 玩家看到的画面便来自该摄像机. ",
  "A camera entity that controls all players' views. While it's active, the players will see out of the camera.": "一个用于控制所有玩家视角的摄像机实体. 当其处于激活状态时, 所有玩家的视角都将跟随该摄像机. ",
  "A camera entity that moves the player's view. Use this if you want the player to retain control of where the player looks but want to base the position to be based on the proxy.": "一种用于控制玩家视角的摄像机实体. 如果您希望玩家仍能自行控制视向, 但同时希望其位置由代理对象决定, 则可使用此实体. ",
  "An entity that controls a pose parameter of a prop and cycles the pose clientside.": "一个用于控制道具姿态参数并在客户端循环切换不同姿态的实体. ",
  "Contains a list of logic_branch entities and fires outputs when the state of any of the logic_branches changes.\n\n": "此节点包含一个 logic_branch 实体列表, 当其中任一 logic_branch 的状态发生变更时, 便会触发相应的输出. \n\n",
  "Compares an input to up to 16 preset values. If the input value is the same as ": "该功能可将输入值与最多16个预设值进行比较. 若输入值与某预设值相同 ",
  "Stores an entity and sends messages with it as the activator\n": "保存实体并将其作为触发器来发送消息\n",
  "A message forwarder. Fires up to eight separate outputs, each with a different chance of firing.": "消息转发器. 可同时触发最多八个输出端口, 每个端口的触发概率各不相同. ",
  "An entity that acts as a microphone. It works in one of two modes. If it has a 'Speaker' set, it picks up all sounds within the specified sound range, ": "一种充当麦克风功能的实体. 它有两种工作模式. 如果设置了'扬声器'属性, 它便会拾取指定声音范围内的所有声音 ",
  "Plays a movie and allows for various playback options": "可播放影片并提供多种播放选项",
  "An entity that constrains players to a radius around itself, slowing them down the closer they get to the edge of the radius.": "一种实体, 能将玩家限制在自身周围一定半径范围内; 玩家越接近该半径的边缘, 移动速度就越慢. ",
  "An entity used to manage a group of interacting constraints and keep them stable. ": "用于管理一组相互关联的约束并确保其保持稳定的实体.  ",
  "A physically simulated gas cannister that can have its cap shot off, at which point gas will start escaping and cause the cannister to fly around. If it takes enough damage, it will explode.": "这是一个基于物理模拟的气体罐, 其盖子可被击中击落. 此时气体会从罐中泄漏出来, 导致气体罐四处飞散. 若受到足够多的损伤, 它还会发生爆炸. ",
  "An entity that overrides the mass center of the target physics prop, or func_physbox, by moving it to the info_mass_center's location.": "该实体会将目标物理物体或 func_physbox 的质量中心移动到 info_mass_center 所在位置, 从而覆盖其原始质量中心. ",
  "A constraint that keeps the position of two objects fixed, relative to the constraint's origin. It does not affect rotation.": "该约束用于固定两个对象相对于约束原点的位置, 但不会影响其旋转. ",
  "A constraint that keeps the relative position and orientation of two objects fixed.": "一种用于固定两个对象相对位置与方向的约束. ",
  "Turns an arbitrary entity into a physically simulated entity. i.e. brush entities will behave like func_physbox, model entities behave like prop_physics.": "将任意实体转换为受物理模拟影响的实体. 例如:刷子生成的实体会表现得像 func_physbox, 模型实体则会表现得像 prop_physics. ",
  "Detail Prop": "详情属性",
  "A prop that doesn't move and doesn't animate.": "一个不会移动也不会产生动画效果的道具. ",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage. ": "一种可置于层级结构中并播放动画的道具. 也可进行设置, 使其在受到足够伤害后破碎.  ",
  "A prop that can be placed in hierarchy and can play animations. It can also be configured to break when it takes enough damage.\n": "一种可放置在层级结构中并播放动画的道具. 当受到足够多的伤害时, 它也会破碎. \n",
  "A way to attach one studio model to another as an ornament. It will render in the way that player/NPC weapons render.": "一种将一个工作室模型作为装饰品附加到另一个模型上的方法. 该模型会以玩家或NPC武器同样的方式来渲染. ",
  "A portal brush used to manage visibility in maps. Portals define areas, which are spaces ": "这是一种用于控制地图可见性的传送门画笔. 传送门用于定义区域, 即特定的空间范围 ",
  "A occluder brush used to manage dynamic visibility in maps. Occluders are used to dynamically ": "一种用于控制地图中动态可见性的遮挡笔刷. 该笔刷可用于动态调整对象的可见性 ",
  "A breakable surface, for partially breakable glass / tile / etc.  All faces but the desired visible one must be marked as NODRAW and that": "一种可破碎的表面, 适用于部分可破碎的玻璃/瓷砖等. 除需要显示的那个面外, 其余所有面都必须标记为 NODRAW",
  "Conveyor Belt": "传送带",
  "An entity that turns its brushes into detail brushes. Detail brushes do NOT contribute to visibility in the PVS. World geometry ": "一种能将普通笔刷转换为细节笔刷的实体. 细节笔刷不会对PVS中的可见性产生影响. 世界几何结构 ",
  "Any leaves touching this brush will have their vis merged together into a single cluster.  Use multiple func_viscluster entities to reduce vis time": "任何接触到此笔刷的叶子都会被合并为一个可见性集群. 可使用多个 func_viscluster 实体来缩短可见性计算时间",
  "A brush entity that creates rain and snow inside its volume.": "一种可在其范围内产生雨滴与雪花的画笔实体. ",
  "A brush entity that prevents detail sprites from being placed inside its volume.": "一种画笔实体, 可防止细节精灵被放置在其内部区域中. ",
  "A moving platform that the player can ride. It follows a path of path_track entities.\n": "玩家可以乘坐的移动平台. 它会沿着由 path_track 实体所构成的路径移动. \n",
  "A moving train that follows a path of path_track entities, shoots at the player, and can be killed.\n": "沿着由 path_track 实体构成的路径移动的列车, 会向玩家开火, 且可以被消灭. \n",
  "An entity that triggers a level change.\n": "触发等级变化的实体. \n",
  "An entity that can be used to disable player's automatic ducking/unducking when jumping.": "用于禁用玩家跳跃时自动下蹲/恢复站立状态的实体. ",
  "An entity that can control sound operator parameters.": "能够控制音频操作参数的实体. ",
  "A trigger volume that can will check if any of trigger's children pass a secondary filter.": "一个触发区域, 用于检测其下属的任意触发器是否符合二级过滤条件. ",
  "A trigger volume that can be told to push all physics objects that are inside of it in the direction specified by this trigger's angles.\n": "一个触发区域, 可使其推动所有位于其中的物理对象, 推动方向由该触发器的角度设定决定. \n",
  "An entity that can use point_cameras to render images for materials used by entities. ": "一种能够借助 point_cameras 为其他实体所使用的材质生成图像的实体.  ",
  "An entity that can listen to the item_equip event fired from code and fire ": "一个能够监听代码中触发的 item_equip 事件并作出响应的实体 ",
  "An entity that can be used to directly control material vars. To use it, you need to read the .vmt of the material you ": "一个可用于直接控制材质变量的实体. 使用时, 你需要先读取对应材质的 .vmt 文件 ",
  "A magical trail you can parent to anything you heart desires.": "一条神奇的轨迹, 你可以将其附加到任何你心仪的对象上. ",
  "Projected texture entity.": "投影纹理实体. ",
  "An entity for turning on and off measuring and display of particle throughput.": "用于开启或关闭粒子流量测量及显示的实体. ",
  "An entity for placing an instance of a map file.  You may translate and rotate this entity. ": "用于放置地图文件实例的实体. 您可以对其进行平移与旋转.  ",
  "Place one copy of this entity inside of an instance.  Whenever you add a $parameter for the instance, get the properties ": "将此实体的一个副本放入实例中. 每当你为该实例添加 $parameter 时, 即可获取其属性 ",
  "Place one copy of this entity inside of an instance.  Sending messages to entities inside the instance from the Proxy's OnProxyRelay output ": "在此实例中放置此实体的一个副本. 可通过代理的 OnProxyRelay 输出端口向该实例中的实体发送消息 ",
  "This is the center of the instance for rotation.": "这是实例旋转的中心点. ",
  "Entity that, when seen, generates a simple game event.": "这种实体在被触发时会产生一个简单的游戏事件. ",
  "A prop that players can't get a good look at, hopefully making them unsure if it's there at all": "一个玩家难以看清的道具, 这样就能让他们不确定它到底是否存在了",
  "A directional light with no falloff. Similar to sunlight in light_environment.": "一种没有衰减效果的方向光. 类似于 light_environment 中的阳光. ",
  "Brush Gun Turret": "刷子炮塔",
  "This entity marks a potential spawn point for a survival crates. ": "该实体标记了可能是生存补给箱生成点的位置.  ",
  "This is for logo maps for demos. All players will spawn here, and there will be no ": "此功能用于演示用的地图标志. 所有玩家都会在此处生成, 且不会出现其他情况 ",
  "Pet. A pet animal will spawn at this point.\n": "宠物:一只宠物动物会在此处出现. \n",
  "This entity selects whether or not this level uses the Half-Life 2 view parameters (eye height: 64, FOV: 75) ": "此选项用于设定当前关卡是否采用《半条命2》的视角参数(眼睛高度:64, 视野角度:75) ",
  "An entity that lets you control the fade distances for detail props.": "一个可用来调整细节道具淡入/淡出距离的实体. ",
  "Zone Repulsor Device": "区域排斥装置",
  "HE Grenade Projectile": "HE手雷弹体",
  "Molotov Projectile": "莫洛托夫燃烧弹",
  "Training C4": "培训 C4",
  "A Generic NPC entity that hears and reports 'danger' and is not preverved on round restart. ": "一种普通的NPC实体, 能够听到'危险'信号并上报, 且在回合重置时不会被保留.  ",
  "Ladder. Players will be able to freely along this brush, as if it was a ladder. If you are using a model prop ": "梯子. 玩家可以像攀梯子一样自由沿着这个刷子移动. 如果您正在使用模型道具 ",
  "This class is the same as func_physbox, except the runtime collisions use a more bouncy method that avoids ": "此类与 func_physbox 类似, 只不过在运行时碰撞处理上采用了更具弹性的算法以避免 ",
  "Buy Zone. Players can buy equipment while standing in this zone, if the zone matches their current team.\n\n": "购买区. 当该区域与玩家当前所在队伍匹配时, 玩家可在此区域内购买装备. \n\n",
  "No Defuse Area.  The counter-terrorists will not be able to defuse bombs while they are touching this trigger volume.\n\n": "无拆弹区域. 反恐特警在接触到该触发区域时无法拆除炸弹. \n\n",
  "Hospital Territory Control Point": "医院区域控制点",
  "Terrorists' Base Territory Point (Non-Capturable)": "恐怖分子基地区域点(无法占领) (Non-Capturable)",
  "Counter-Terrorists' Base Territory Point (Non-Capturable)": "反恐特警基地领地点(无法占领) (Non-Capturable)",
  "Barracks Territory Control Point": "兵营领地控制点",
  "Bank Territory Control Point": "银行领地控制点",
  "Surveillance Center Territory Control Point": "监控中心领地控制点",
  "The position a gas canister will launch from in Survival Mode.": "在生存模式中, 燃气罐的发射位置. ",
  "Players will respawn inside this area.": "玩家将会在此区域内重生. ",
  "An entity that ends a multiplayer game ROUND.": "用于结束多人游戏回合的实体. ",
  "An entity that awards/deducts points from the player who activates it or to a specific team.": "用于对激活该实体的玩家或特定团队进行加分/扣分的实体. ",
  "Studiomodel vehicle that can be driven via inputs.": "可通过输入指令进行操控的Studiomodel车辆. ",
  "Generic driveable studiomodel vehicle.": "通用的可驾驶演播室用模型车辆. ",
  "An entity that will fire outputs when events happen during Survival mode.": "该实体会在生存模式中发生事件时触发输出. ",
  "An entity that keeps track of the coop wave/phase and fires outputs when players complete them.": "用于记录合作模式的关卡阶段信息, 并在玩家完成相应阶段时触发输出结果的实体. ",
  "Gunfire Effect": "枪火特效",
  "Adds a hiding spot to the nav mesh at this location.": "在此位置向导航网格添加一个隐蔽点. ",
  "Collectable coin for coop missions.": "用于合作任务的可收集硬币. ",
  "Exploding barrel.  BOOM!": "爆炸的木桶. 轰! ",
  "A trigger volume that softly slows player velocity in a given direction.": "一种触发区域, 可在指定方向上缓慢降低玩家的移动速度. ",
  "An entity that gives ammo to the activator.  Use a trigger or a button to trigger this entity.": "用于向激活者提供弹药的实体. 请使用触发器或按钮来激活此实体. ",
  "An entity that precaches skybox materials and swaps them on trigger.": "用于预加载天空盒材质并在触发时进行切换的实体. ",
  "Survival item spawn point.\n": "生存道具生成点. \n",
  "Survival weapon spawn point.\n": "生存武器生成点. \n",
  "Survival item spawn grouping.\n": "生存物品生成分组. \n",
  "Survival weapon spawn grouping.\n": "生存类武器的生成分组. \n",
  "A trigger volume that defines the bounds of the survival play area.": "用于界定生存模式游戏区域范围的触发体积. ",
  "A trigger volume that encompasses the survival map room.": "一个覆盖整个生存模式地图区域的触发区域. ",
  "A trigger volume that defines the top of the survival map room minimap table.": "用于定义生存地图房间小地图表格顶部的触发区域. ",
  "DroneGun Emplacement\n": "无人机发射器部署点\n",
  "Parachute Backpack\n": "降落伞背包\n",
  "Survival Door": "生存之门",
  "Numerical Display Counter\n": "数字显示计数器\n",
  "A VGUI world panel that can be placed and modified by entity logic and display localized text": "一个可通过实体逻辑进行放置与修改的VGUI世界面板, 并能显示本地化后的文本",
  "A brush entity that can be broken by c4 within specific radius in survival mode.": "一种画笔实体, 在生存模式下可在特定半径范围内被C4炸毁. ",
  "Disable the tablet for players within this region.": "禁用此区域内玩家的平板功能. ",
  "Point entity for setting the name of a map region for display.": "用于设置待显示的地图区域名称的点实体. ",
  "Danger Zone paradrops will avoid this volume.": "危险区域的空降部队将避开此区域. ",
  "Manager for DZ coop missions.": "DZ合作任务管理器. ",
  "Sharable ammo box.": "可共享的弹药箱. ",
  "One time use armor activating on touch.": "一次性护甲, 触碰即可激活. ",
  "One time heavy armor refill activating with long use.": "一次性重型护甲补充功能正在激活, 可长期使用. ",
  "A map placed entity which activates with long use.": "一个需要长时间使用才能激活的地图放置型实体. ",
  "Chicken AI entity.": "鸡形AI实体. ",
  "A monitor that renders the view from a given point_camera entity.": "一种能够渲染指定点_摄像机实体所看到的视图的监视器. ",
  "Map veto controller.": "地图否决控制器. ",
  "Global settings that apply across your entire addon": "适用于整个插件的全局设置",
  "Camera preset position names for patch slots on this character.": "此角色各个补丁插槽对应的相机预设位置名称. ",
  "Explicit order for composite material evaluation.": "复合材料评估的明确顺序. ",
  "Override inspect model for keychains": "覆盖钥匙链的检查模型",
