  "Goal Tolerance": "目标容忍度",
  "Wait until player gets within this distance before starting to Lead them. If set to 0, start Leading as soon as the player is visible.": "请等待玩家进入此距离范围内再开始引导. 若设为 0, 则只要玩家出现便立即开始引导. ",
