  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // 3. 属性悬停描述 (Property Hover Descriptions) (共 1782 条)
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  "String identifying what the hint type is, if generic.": "用于标识提示类型的字符串; 若该提示为通用类型则显示此内容. ",
  "Relative importance of this hint. Will factor into how NPCs will choose a hint.": "此提示的相对重要性. 该值会影响NPC选择提示时的决策. ",
  "Animgraph action that NPCs using this hint should use to initiate a handshake when they start using it.": "当NPC开始使用此提示时, 它们应执行的动画动作即为握手动作. ",
  "Animgraph action that NPCs using this hint should use to initiate a handshake when they want to stop using it.": "当NPC不再需要使用此提示时, 它们应执行此动画动作来开始握手. ",
  "Animgraph command that NPCs using this hint should apply to their animgraph when they start using it.": "当NPC开始使用此提示时, 它们应将其对应的动画图命令应用到自身的动画图中. ",
  "Animgraph command that NPCs using this hint should apply to their animgraph when they want to stop using it.": "当NPC想要停止使用此提示时, 应在其动画图中执行的动画图命令. ",
  "The name of an info_target entity that specifies the location that the animgraph's 'v_navlink_target' parameter should be set to when an NPC uses this node.": "该参数用于指定当NPC使用该节点时, 动画图状态机的 ‘v_navlink_target’ 参数应被设置为哪个 info_target 实体的位置. ",
  "Imagine this node requires that an NPC be in the node's field of view in order to use this hint.": "假设这个节点要求某个NPC必须处于节点的视野范围内, 才能显示该提示. ",
  "If specified, gives the hint a specific group name.  Useful for hint nodes that need to be logically grouped together. NPCs may also refuse to use hint nodes that don't match their hint group.": "若进行了设置, 则该提示会获得指定的组名. 此功能适用于那些需要在逻辑上归为同一组的提示节点. 此外, NPC也可能拒绝使用与其提示组不匹配的提示节点. ",
  "How close an NPC must be to consider this hint. 0 means infinite.": "NPC与触发提示位置的接近程度阈值. 值为0表示无限制. ",
  "Don't pay attention to the facing of the node. May not apply to a given hint type.": "无需在意节点的朝向. 此规则可能不适用于某些提示类型. ",
  "Require an NPC have a minimum state to use the hint.": "需要NPC具备最低等级状态才能使用该提示. ",
  "Require an NPC have a maximum state to use the hint.": "需要NPC的状态值不超过特定上限才能使用该提示. ",
  "After use, how long does another NPC has to wait in order to use this hint (in seconds).": "使用后, 其他 NPC需等待多少秒才能再次使用此提示(以秒为单位). ",
  "If > 0, don't snap the NPC to this hint position until the NPC is within the specified range (allows animgraph or other systems to move the entity even after the animations have started). If < 0, don't snap unless you have a Follow Entity specified.": "若值大于0:在NPC进入指定范围之前, 不会将其吸附到该提示位置(这样动画系统及其他系统便能在动画开始后继续控制NPC的移动). 若值小于0:除非指定了'跟随实体'选项, 否则不会进行吸附操作. ",
  "Entity or class to allow passage even when node is off.": "即使节点处于关闭状态也能允许通行的实体或类. ",
  "Allowed entity is the only entity NOT allowed when this is checked.": "选中此选项后, 允许的实体反而会成为唯一不被允许的实体. ",
  "Check this if this controller is intended to control air links. ": "若此控制器用于控制空中链路, 请勾选此项.  ",
  "Name of the NPC Unit.": "NPC单位的名称. ",
  "NPCs that are in the same squad (i.e. have matching squad names) will share information about enemies, and will take turns attacking and covering each other.": "同属一个小队的NPC(即小队名称相同的NPC)会共享敌方信息, 并轮流进行攻击与掩护. ",
  "Comma-separated list of hint groups. Hint groups are used by NPCs to restrict their hint-node searching to a subset of the map's hint nodes. Only hint nodes with matching hint group names will be considered by this NPC. If this is empty, the NPC will only be able to use hint nodes that do not have a group.": "提示组列表, 各项之间以逗号分隔. NPC可借助提示组来将其可搜索的提示节点限定为地图中特定的一组. 只有提示组名称与之匹配的提示节点才会被该NPC采纳. 若此列表为空, 则该NPC只能使用那些未指定任何提示组的提示节点. ",
  "Force this NPC to use a dynamic hull even if its vdata doesn't request it": "强制让该 NPC 使用动态外壳, 即便其 vdata 中并未要求进行该设置",
  "Scales damage energy when this character is hit by a physics object. With a value of 0 the NPC will take no damage from physics.": "当该角色被物理物体击中时, 用于调整所受伤害的数值. 若此值为0, 则NPC不会受到任何物理伤害. ",
  "Markup volume entity to restrict unit navigation": "标记卷对象以限制单位导航",
  "Name of an animation to preview in Hammer, does not do anything in game.": "在Hammer中用于预览的动画名称, 在游戏中无实际作用. ",
  "Determines what AI features are enabled/disabled for performance reasons": "用于根据性能需求决定启用或禁用哪些 AI 功能",
  "Parts assigned to this hit group will be initialized as destructed.": "分配给此命中组的部件将被初始化为已损坏状态. ",
  "Damage level to be set as fully destructed.": "需设置为完全损坏的损伤等级. ",
  "Damage level to fully destroy.": "破坏程度足以彻底摧毁. ",
  "Radius around this maker within which NPCs are to be placed. Spawned NPCs will try and find empty space within this radius to spawn.": "在此标记点周围设定的半径范围, NPC将在此范围内生成. 生成的NPC会尝试在该半径范围内寻找空旷位置来出现. ",
  "If you'd like spawned NPCs to be created at an info_npc_spawn_destination entity, enter the name of that entity here. If you have more than one destination entity by that name, the Destination Criteria will be used to select one from the group.": "如果您希望生成的 NPC 能够在指定的 info_npc_spawn_destination 实体处出现, 请在此输入该实体的名称. 如果存在多个同名的目的地实体, 系统将根据'目的地筛选条件'从中选择一个. ",
  "Should the NPC try to spawn at a destination that the player can see? Only applicable if a Destination Group is being used.": "NPC是否应尝试在玩家能够看到的位置生成?此选项仅在使用了'目标点组'时才生效. ",
  "Should the NPC try to spawn nearest to or farthest from the player's current location? Only applicable if a Destination Group is being used.": "该NPC应该生成在离玩家当前位置最近还是最远的地方?此设置仅在使用了'目标点组'时才生效. ",
  "The spawn destination node distance to the player will have to be further or equal than this value.": "生成目标节点与玩家之间的距离必须大于或等于此值. ",
  "Number of NPCs that will spawn before this spawner is exhausted.": "在此生成器用尽之前将生成的NPC数量. ",
  "Number of NPCs to spawn at once, before delaying next spawn by Frequency. (If you change this, you usually want to set Spawn Threshold too)": "一次生成的NPC数量, 之后会按照'生成频率'的设定延迟下一次生成. (若修改此值, 通常也需要同时设置'生成阈值')",
  "How often (in seconds) a new NPC will be spawned. If set to -1, a new NPC will be made when the last NPC dies.": "每隔多少秒生成一个新的NPC. 若设为-1, 则在最后一个NPC死亡后才会生成新的NPC. ",
  "How long (in seconds) to wait before trying again after failing to spawn an NPC when no valid spot could be found. If set to -1, Spawn Frequency is used.": "在无法找到合适位置从而生成NPC失败时, 需等待多少秒才能再次尝试生成. 若设置为 -1, 则使用'生成频率'的值. ",
  "Maximum number of live children allowed at any one time (new ones will not be made until one dies). If set to -1, no limit is applied.": "允许同时存在的最大子实例数量(只有当某个子实例退出后才会创建新的实例). 如果设置为 -1, 则表示无数量限制. ",
  "Number of NPCs below max before we start spawning new ones. (ie, if set to 3, no NPCs will be spawned until we're 3 below our max, at which point we spawn until max)": "在开始生成新NPC之前, 允许存在的NPC数量上限. (例如:若设为3, 则只有当当前NPC数量比上限少3时才会开始生成新NPC, 之后会持续生成直至达到上限)",
  "How NPC's hull should be checked at spawn destination?": "如何在NPC生成时检查其外壳状态?",
  "Should we only orient the NPC using the YAW of the destination or spawner, or should we allow any angle?": "我们是应该仅根据目标点或生成点的偏航角来调整 NPC 的朝向, 还是允许任意角度呢?",
  "Entity to center the tactical search spawn test around.  Filling in this field will enable this spawning path.  Requiers AI_DefaultNPC currently.": "作为战术搜索生成测试中心的实体. 填写此字段即可启用该生成路径. 目前需要使用 AI_DefaultNPC. ",
  "Minimum distance allowed from the origin of the centered entity.": "允许的距居中实体原点的最小距离. ",
  "Maximum distance allowed from the origin of the centered entity.": "允许的与居中实体原点之间的最大距离. ",
  "View angle used, if other than -1, to create side planes of a view frustum.": "若值不为 -1, 则表示用于生成视锥体侧面平面的视角. ",
  "If enalbed, allow the search to fallback to outside the defined view angle in order to find a spawn position.": "启用后, 允许搜索范围超出设定的视角范围, 以便找到合适的生成位置. ",
  "Nav tag filter constraint requirement.": "导航标签过滤约束条件. ",
  "Ground material contraint requirement.  Defined in material's surface properties.": "地面材料约束条件. 在材料的表面属性中定义. ",
  "Calculate a random spawn point within this radius centered around the center entity (WIP).": "计算以中心实体为圆心、在该半径范围内的随机生成点(开发中). ",
  "Allow non-Z up nav meshes as part of the path search.": "允许将非Z轴向上的导航网格纳入路径搜索范围. ",
  "After an NPC is spawned at this destination, the delay before this destination is eligible for selection again.": "在此目的地生成NPC后, 需等待该时长方可再次选择此目的地. ",
  "If an NPC spawns at this destination, change that NPC's targetname to this.": "如果有 NPC 在此处生成, 请将该 NPC 的 targetname 属性设置为此处的值. ",
  "NPC that should perform this operation": "应执行此操作的NPC",
  "Name of the entity that the NPC should move to in order to perform the operation.": "NPC执行操作时需要前往的目标实体的名称. ",
  "(Optional) Name of an entity that the operator will use within context.": "(可选)操作者在当前上下文中使用的实体名称. ",
  "Choose the way the Subject(s) should feel about the Target(s)": "请选择主体对目标应该抱有的情感. (s)",
  "How much the Subject(s) should Like/Hate/Fear the Target(s). Higher priority = stronger feeling.": "主题对象对目标对象的喜爱/厌恶/畏惧程度. 优先级越高, 这种情感就越强烈. ",
  "Set this to YES to have the new relationship mirrored by Target": "设为'YES'后, 新的关系设置将会同步到目标端",
  "This is the NPC(s) whose disposition about the Target(s) will change. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这些就是对目标的态度会发生变化的NPC, 可能是具体的名字或职业名称. ",
  "This is the player or NPC(s) about whom the Subject(s) will change their disposition. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是相关玩家或 NPC, 主题对象会对其改变态度. 可以是目标名称或类名. ",
  "This is the Classification of the NPC who's disposition will change. Optionally used instead of the subject targetname or classname.": "这是指那些性情会发生变化的NPC的分类. 该参数可选择性地使用, 以替代目标NPC的姓名或类别. ",
  "This is the Classification of the target(s) about whom the Subject(s) will change their disposition. Optionally used instead of the target targetname or classname.": "这是目标对象的分类信息, 主体将据此改变对它们的处置方式. 此分类也可作为目标名称或类别名称的替代项. ",
  "If the Actor doesn't get to the lead goal exactly, but gets within this distance, it considers itself as having reached the goal. -1 means use the NPC's default tolerance (which is half their hull width).": "如果该角色未能精准抵达目标位置, 但只要距离在设定的范围内, 即视为已到达目标. 值为 -1 时表示采用 NPC 的默认容差(即其外壳宽度的一半). ",
  "The distance from the player that this NPC should move to before speaking the TLK_LEAD_START concept.": "该NPC在说出 TLK_LEAD_START 内容前, 需要与玩家保持的距离. ",
  "The player is considered to be Close if they're within this distance.": "如果玩家与目标的距离在此范围内, 则被视为'靠近'. ",
  "The player is considered to be Lagging if they're beyond this distance. If the player is Lagging > 3-4s, they're considered Lost, and the NPC will go back to retrieve them. If the Retrieve Player option is set to 'No', the NPC will stop moving and wait instead.": "若玩家与NPC的距离超出此数值, 则被视为出现延迟. 若延迟时间超过3-4秒, 玩家即被视为迷失方向, 此时NPC会返回去寻找他们. 如果'找回迷失玩家'选项设为'否', NPC则会停止移动并原地等待. ",
  "The distance from the player (to the NPC) that the player must be within for the Lead to succeed, once the NPC has reached the goal. If set to 0, it'll use the lead distance instead (for legacy support).": "当NPC到达目标点后, 玩家必须与NPC保持的一定距离范围, 该任务才算成功. 若此值设为0, 则会改用引导距离(为兼容旧版本而设). ",
  "If set, pause any choreo scenes the Leader is running when the player lags. They'll be resumed after the player has been retrieved.": "若启用此选项, 当玩家出现延迟时, 系统会暂停 Leader 正在播放的所有过场动画. 待玩家恢复连接后, 动画便会继续播放. ",
  "Prevent the Leader from speaking any concepts related to the Lead behavior.": "禁止领导者提及任何与引导行为相关的概念. ",
  "If set, the Lead won't be allowed to succeed and finish. Use this when you want the Lead to continue forever, until some other external logic intervenes and tells it to stop.": "若启用此选项, 引导流程将无法顺利完成. 当您希望引导流程无限持续下去, 直到有其他外部逻辑介入并发出停止指令时, 请使用此选项. ",
  "While waiting at the lead goal for the player to arrive, should the Leader face along the yaw specified by the goal entity?": "在等待玩家到达目标点时, 领导者是否应朝向目标实体所指定的偏航角度?",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_ATTRACTPLAYER' concept is spoken.": "当触发'TLK_LEAD_ATTRACTPLAYER'概念时, 此内容会被追加到传入响应规则的键值对中. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_WAITOVER' concept is spoken.": "当触发'TLK_LEAD_WAITOVER'概念时, 该内容会被附加到传入响应规则的键值对中. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_ARRIVAL' concept is spoken.": "当触发'TLK_LEAD_ARRIVAL'概念时, 该内容会被附加到传递给响应规则的键值对中. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_SUCCESS' concept is spoken.": "当说出'TLK_LEAD_SUCCESS'这一语句时, 该内容会被附加到传入响应规则的键值对中. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'lead_fail' concept is spoken.": "当触发'lead_fail'概念时, 此内容会被附加到传入响应规则的键值对中. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_RETRIEVE' concept is spoken. Spoken as the NPC starts returning to the player to retrieve him.": "当触发'TLK_LEAD_RETRIEVE'对话内容时, 此文本会被附加到传入响应规则的键值对中. 该文本会在NPC开始返回以接回玩家时播报. ",
  "Appended to the keyvalues passed into the response rules when the 'TLK_LEAD_COMINGBACK' concept is spoken. Spoken when NPC has finally reached the player to retrieve him.": "当触发'TLK_LEAD_COMINGBACK'对话内容时, 此文本会被附加到响应规则中所传递的键值对中. 该文本会在 NPC 终于找到玩家并前来接他时使用. ",
  "How to search for the entities using the targetname.": "如何使用 targetname 来搜索实体. ",
  "The name of the entity to follow. If blank, and the actor likes the player, then defaults to player": "要跟随的实体名称. 如果留空且该角色对玩家有好感, 则默认值为'player'",
  "If false, match by squad name as well as actor name.": "如果为否, 则同时根据小队名称和演员姓名进行匹配. ",
  "Player orders can override, applies to allies only": "玩家指令可覆盖此设置, 仅对友方单位生效",
  "NPC's that should act busy": "应表现得很忙碌的NPC",
  "The Sight Entity (if you provide one) is an entity that will leave the current ActBusy if the Actor playing the ActBusy loses sight of it for the amount of time specified in 'Sight Entity Timeout'. THIS MAY ONLY BE A TARGET NAME. NO CLASSNAMES.": "可视实体(若提供了的话)指的是这样一个实体:当正在执行 ActBusy 动作的 Actor 在'可视实体超时时间'所设定的时长内无法看到该实体时, 该实体便会使当前的 ActBusy 状态结束. 此处的输入内容仅能为目标名称, 不可输入类名. ",
  "If you provide a Sight Entity, the Actor will leave the current ActBusy if the Actor has lost sight of Sight Entity for this many seconds.": "如果您指定了监视目标实体, 则当角色连续数秒无法看到该实体时, 便会退出当前的'忙碌状态'. ",
  "If set, Actors won't search for act busy opportunities, even when the act busy goal is enabled. Instead, they'll require the NPC AI code to trigger act busies opportunistically (i.e. like zombies with unreachable enemies do).": "如果启用此选项, 即使'执行忙碌行为'目标已启用, 角色也不会主动寻找执行忙碌行为的时机. 此时, 唯有通过 NPC AI 代码才能随机触发相关行为(类似于那些无法触及敌人时的僵尸). ",
  "The method to use to determine whether the Sight enemy is visible.": "用于判断视野中的敌人是否可见的方法. ",
  "Only for combat actbusy. Lets you specify a volume which is the 'safe zone'. The Combat ActBusy will cancel if any enemies are seen in the safe zone.": "仅适用于战斗状态下的ActBusy功能. 你可以设定一个音量范围作为'安全区域'; 一旦在安全区域内检测到敌人, 战斗状态下的ActBusy便会自动取消. ",
  "The name of the node the first NPC in the queue should move to when he leaves the head of the queue.": "队列中排在首位的 NPC 离开队列后, 应移动到的节点名称. ",
  "The name of the first actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第一个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the second actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第二个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the third actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第三个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the fourth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第四个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the fifth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第五个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the sixth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第六个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the seventh actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第七个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the eighth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第八个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the ninth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第九个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the tenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第十个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the eleventh actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第11个'正在忙碌'提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the twelfth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第12个忙状态提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the thirteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第13个忙闲提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the fourteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第14个 ActBusy 提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the fifteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第15个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the sixteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第16个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the seventeenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第17个忙状态提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the eighteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第18个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the nineteenth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第19个'忙碌提示'节点的名称. ",
  "The name of the twentieth actbusy hint node in the queue.": "队列中第20个忙碌提示节点的名称. ",
  "If true, NPCs much reach the front node in the queue before they're allowed to leave the queue.": "若设置为真, NPC必须先抵达队列中的前端节点后才可离开队列. ",
  "How to search for the entities to change.": "如何搜索需要修改的实体. ",
  "Radius to search (0 for all of map)": "搜索半径(设为0则搜索整个地图) (0 for all of map)",
  "NPC Target": "NPC目标",
  "Duration of time that all the conditions must be true": "所有条件都必须为真的持续时间",
  "Minimum time before OnConditionsTimeout is fired. 0 = never expire.": "在触发 OnConditionsTimeout 之前的最短等待时间. 0 表示永不过期. ",
  "Maximum time before OnConditionsTimeout is fired. 0 = ignore (If you don't specify a Maximum timeout, conditions will time out at exactly Minimum Time Out. If you DO specify a Maximum time out, timeout will occur randomly between Minimum and Maximum time out values.)": "在触发 OnConditionsTimeout 之前允许等待的最长时间. 值为 0 表示忽略此限制. (若未设置最大超时时间, 则条件会在等于最小超时时间时立即超时; 若设置了最大超时时间, 则超时会随机在最小和最大超时时间之间发生. )",
  "The distance the player must/must not be to the actor. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "玩家与演员之间必须/不得保持的距离. 负值表示'不得', 0表示'忽略'. ",
  "Specify angle of view cone in degrees. Negative value = NOT": "请输入视角锥的角度值(单位:度). 负值表示无效",
  "Player's view cone is evaluated as a true cone, not pie slice ": "玩家的视野范围是以完整的圆锥体来计算的, 而非扇形区域 ",
  "Checks that the player has clear Line of Sight to the Actor": "检查玩家是否能够清晰地看到该角色",
  "Optional entity to include in conditions": "可选的实体, 可用于条件设置",
  "The distance the actor must/must not be to the Target. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "角色与目标之间的距离要求:正值表示必须满足的距离, 负值表示不允许的距离, 0 表示忽略此限制. ",
  "The distance the player must/must not be to the Target. Negative values for NOT, 0 for ignore.": "玩家与目标之间的距离要求:正值表示必须满足的距离, 负值则表示不允许的距离, 0表示忽略此条件. ",
  "Checks that the player has clear Line of Sight to the Target": "检查玩家是否能清楚看到目标",
  "Checks that the player is blocking the Actor's path": "检查玩家是否挡住了角色的行进路径",
  "Checks that the actor is in the player's PVS": "检查该角色是否位于玩家的PVS范围内",
  "Checks the actor's state in a vehicle": "检查角色在载具中的状态",
  "Checks the player's state in a vehicle": "检查玩家在载具中的状态",
  "This is the NPC(s) whose speech we're filtering. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是我们正在过滤其对话的 NPC, 可能是目标名称或类名. ",
  "Multiplier to the percentage chance that our NPC(s) will idle speak. Set to 0 to prevent all idle speech.": "用于调整 NPC 闲聊概率的倍率值. 设置为 0 则可禁止所有闲聊行为. ",
  "If set to Yes, our NPC(s) won't greet the player when they first meet him.": "若设置为'是', 我们的NPC在首次遇到玩家时将不会向其打招呼. ",
  "What to do if an actor this scene needs is already talking when this scene is told to start.": "如果场景开始播放时, 该场景所需的演员已经在说话了, 该怎么办?. ",
  "What should this entity do if the player dies": "如果玩家死亡, 该实体该执行什么操作",
  "The name of a logic_choreographed_scene, or logic_scene_list_manager.": "逻辑编排场景或逻辑场景列表管理器的名称. ",
  "How far away this event can be detected. This is a radius.": "此事件能够被探测到的距离范围. 这是一个半径值. ",
  "How long the event persists each time you start it.": "每次启动事件后, 该事件会持续多长时间. ",
  "The type of sound or smell will determine the reaction of NPCs that sense it.": "声音或气味的类型会决定感知到它们的NPC所做出的反应. ",
  "Optional settings specifying such things as who can or cannot detect the event.": "可选设置, 用于指定谁可以或无法检测到该事件等信息. ",
  "The name of an entity to use as a proxy to determine the location at which to make the sound. If you specify an entity here, the sound will be made at that entity's location (!player included)": "用于确定声音播放位置的实体名称. 如果您在此处指定了某个实体, 声音便会在该实体的位置播放(包括!player)",
  "Template NPC that this maker should be creating clones of.": "此制作器应用来创建克隆体的模板 NPC. ",
  "The name of an filter entity which specifies the only entities the microphone can hear. Sounds emitted by other entities will not be heard.": "该过滤器实体的名称, 用于指定麦克风能够听到的实体类型. 其他实体发出的声音则无法被听到. ",
  "The type of event to listen for": "要监听的事件类型",
  "How much to scale event radii when doing sensing": "进行感知操作时, 事件半径需要放大多少倍?",
  "Events beyond this range won't be detected, irrelevant of event radius.": "在此范围之外的事件均无法被检测到, 即便事件半径不同也是如此. ",
  "Subclass of the NPC Unit.": "NPC单位的子类. ",
  "Specifies if the NPC will spawn as a temporary ragdoll and the behavior after becoming a ragdoll.": "指定 NPC 是否会以临时布娃娃形态生成, 以及变为布娃娃后的行为. ",
  "Filter by which to filter potential enemies": "按条件筛选潜在敌人",
  "Prefer visible enemies, regardless of distance or relationship priority": "优先选择可见的敌人, 无论距离远近或亲疏关系如何",
  "Disable sensing until this NPC has been seen by the player": "禁用感应功能, 直到玩家见到该NPC为止",
  "Friendly NPCs are not allowed to speak if another friendly NPC is speaking. In some cases we don't want speaking NPCs to prevent other NPCs from speaking (for instance, if there is a friendly NPC speaking for a long time on a monitor). To make this NPC not prevent other NPCs from talking, make it not grab the semaphore when it speaks.": "当另一个友好型 NPC 正在说话时, 其他友好型 NPC 则不可发言. 不过在某些情况下, 我们不希望正在说话的 NPC 阻止其他 NPC 发言(例如, 当有友好型 NPC 长时间通过显示器发言时). 若希望该 NPC 不会妨碍其他 NPC 发言, 可设置其在发言时不获取信号量. ",
  "If yes, this NPC spawns suspended in air and awaits a BeginRappel input. It will then spawn a zipline and slide down. When it hits the ground, NPC will cut away the line and try to move forward a few feet to make room for the next NPC. The NPC will not attempt to clear its landing space if it cannot do so by taking a few steps forward": "若选择'是', 该NPC会出现在半空中并等待'BeginRappel'指令. 随后它会生成一条滑索并顺着滑下. 落地后, NPC会切断滑索, 再向前挪动几步以便为下一个NPC腾出空间. 如果向前挪动几步仍无法清理出所需空间, 该NPC便不会再试图清理着陆区域",
  "Sets the helicopter's desired speed that it should try to reach as soon as it's spawned.": "设置直升机生成后应尝试达到的目标速度. ",
  "(Optional) The name of a path_track entity that this NPC will fly to after spawning.": "(可选)NPC生成后要飞往的 path_track 实体名称. ",
  "This is the entity who's items this manager should be managing. May be a targetname or a classname.": "这是该管理员需要管理的实体, 可能是目标名称或类名. ",
  "If you want this manager to affect valid targets that are spawned after the manager, you need to set this. Most likely only needed if you want to target NPCs via a classname to catch all future spawns on that NPC type. It has a perf cost, so don't turn it on if you don't need it.": "如果您希望该管理器能作用于其启动之后才生成的有效目标, 就需要设置此选项. 通常只有在您想通过类名来指定特定类型的 NPC, 从而捕捉此后生成的所有该类型 NPC 时才会用到此设置. 不过此设置会带来一定的性能开销, 因此非必要情况下请勿开启. ",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 1.": "可置于第1个槽位的物品或技能的子类. ",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 2.": "可放置在第2个插槽中的物品或技能的子类. ",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 3.": "可放置在第3个插槽中的物品或技能的子类. ",
  "Subclass of item or ability to attach in slot 4.": "可用于第4槽位的物品或技能的子类. ",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 1st ability to add.": "(可选)主能力的子类, 用于关联到需要添加的第一项能力. ",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 2nd ability to add.": "(可选)主能力的子类, 用于关联到需要添加的第二个能力. ",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 3rd ability to add.": "(可选)主能力的子类, 用于关联到需要添加的第三个能力. ",
  "(Optional) Subclass of primary ability to link to 4th ability to add.": "(可选)主技能的子类, 用于与新增的第4个技能进行关联. ",
  "Subclass of 1st ability to remove.": "可移除的第一项技能的子技能. ",
  "Subclass of 2nd ability to remove.": "可移除的第二项技能的子类. ",
  "Subclass of 3rd ability to remove.": "可移除的第三项技能的子类. ",
  "Subclass of 4th ability to remove.": "可移除的第四项技能的子类. ",
  "Set for the NPC to notify the game is it friendly and players should not be allowed to attack it": "设置此选项后, NPC会向游戏系统表明自己是友好单位, 玩家不得对其发起攻击",
  "Does this entity have an animated face?": "这个实体有动画面部吗?",
  "Create (kinematic) physics for the furniture. (By default npc_furniture is nonsolid to avoid unintentional interactions with any co-actors.)": "为家具创建(运动学)物理效果. (默认情况下, npc_furniture被设置为不可碰撞, 以防止与其他角色发生意外的互动. )",
  "Select an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "请选择一个实体来指定光照采样的位置, 而非使用该实体的原点. ",
  "If enabled, this will have a ton of health and will not allow damage.": "启用后, 该对象将拥有极高的生命值且不会受到任何伤害. ",
  "Angle from the bullseye required for bullseye to be a valid enemy": "要使靶心被视为有效的敌人, 其与靶心中心形成的角度需为多少",
  "Distance from the bullseye required for bullseye to be a valid enemy": "离靶心所需的最小距离 - 只有满足该距离靶心才会被视为有效敌人",
  "Radius of autoaim influence. Use ent_autoaim <picker> to visualize.": "自动瞄准的影响半径. 使用 ent_autoaim <picker> 可查看效果. ",
  "How far to look (1.0 = straight ahead, 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees, -1.0 = all directions)": "搜索范围(1.0表示正前方, 0.0表示±90度, -1.0表示所有方向)",
  "Amount of time an enemy is hidden after which a 'free pass' on reaquire is granted": "敌人隐藏后, 需经过此时长才会获得重新捕捉的'免罚机会'",
  "After granted 'free pass', the amount of time a target is allowed before reaquire": "获得'免限权限'后, 目标可使用的时长直至需重新获取该权限",
  "After granted 'free pass', the distance the target is allowed to move before reaquire": "授予'自由移动权'后, 目标可移动的最大距离(超过此距离则需重新申请权限)",
  "After free pass begins expiring, how much the time the target gets back for every second they hide again": "免费通行权限开始失效后, 目标每次重新隐匿便可恢复的时长是多少",
  "How long targets in cover are allowed to peek without penalty": "处于掩体后的目标可在不受惩罚的情况下进行窥视的最长时间",
  "The name or class name (such as 'npc_zombie') of an NPC to use for this script.": "用于此脚本的 NPC 名称或类名(例如 'npc_zombie'). ",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play before the action animation if the NPC must wait for the script to be triggered. Use 'Start on Spawn' flag or MoveToPosition input to play this idle animation.": "当 NPC 需要等待脚本触发时, 可在动作动画前播放的待机动画序列名称(例如 'idle01'). 可通过启用'生成时开始播放'标志或调用 MoveToPosition 输入指令来播放该待机动画. ",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'reload02') to play when the sequence starts, before transitioning to play the main action sequence.": "序列的名称(例如 'reload02'), 该序列会在主动作序列开始播放前先执行. ",
  "The name of the main sequence (such as 'reload02') to play.": "要播放的主序列名称(例如 'reload02'). ",
  "The name of the sequence (such as 'idle01') to play after the action animation.": "动作动画播放完毕后要播放的序列名称(例如 'idle01'). ",
  "If set, identifier used to match other scripted sequences to synchronze with (alternative to name-based sync)": "设置后, 该标识符将用于匹配其他脚本序列以实现同步(此为基于名称同步的替代方案) (alternative to name-based sync)",
  "What to do if this scripted sequence begins and the actor is already executing a scripted sequence.": "如果此脚本序列开始执行时, 演员本身已在运行另一个脚本序列, 该如何处理?. ",
  "Radius to search within for an NPC to use. 0 searches everywhere.": "搜索NPC时所用的半径范围. 设为0则表示搜索整个区域. ",
  "Gait to use if Move to Position is set to 'Use Specified Gait'.": "当'移动到指定位置'设置为'使用指定步态'时, 需采用的步态. ",
  "What do to with any held weapon before starting the sequence.": "在开始序列前, 该如何处理手中持有的武器?. ",
  "The name of the script to run immediately after this script completes. The NPC will not return to AI between the two scripts.": "该脚本用于在当前脚本执行完毕后立即运行. 在这两段脚本执行期间, NPC不会返回到AI控制状态. ",
  "If this is set to 'Yes', the NPC will not be subject to gravity while playing this script.": "如果设为'是', 则 NPC 在执行此脚本时将不受重力影响. ",
  "If this is set to 'Yes', the NPC will not look at the look at target when playing the script.": "如果设置为'是', NPC在执行脚本时将不会注视目标. ",
  "Useful for when NPCs playing scripts must interpenetrate while riding on trains, elevators, etc. This only disables collisions between the NPCs in the script and must be enabled on BOTH scripted_sequences.": "此功能在需要让执行脚本的NPC一同乘坐火车、电梯等交通工具时十分有用. 它仅能禁用脚本中各个NPC之间的碰撞效果, 因此必须在两个 scripted_sequences 中均开启此功能. ",
  "If set, the animgraph will remain locked in the Direct Playback node after this sequence finishes. This is only useful if you have a 'Next Script' set, and you don't want the animgraph to return to Idle during the transition. Note that the 'Next Script' cannot require the NPC to animate/move to it, because the NPC will be unable to move while in the Direct Playback node. In that case, or if you have no 'Next Script' set, selecting this will simply cause the NPC to freeze after it finishes the sequence.": "如果勾选此项, 在该动画序列播放完毕后, 动画图仍会锁定在'直接播放'节点上. 此选项仅在您设置了'下一个脚本', 且不希望动画图在过渡期间回到闲置状态时才有作用. 请注意, '下一个脚本'不可要求NPC执行动画或移动到指定位置, 因为NPC处于'直接播放'节点状态时无法移动. 在此类情况下, 或者若您未设置'下一个脚本', 勾选此项只会导致NPC在动画序列播放完成后静止不动. ",
  "If yes, this scripted sequence can be started multiple times.": "若是, 则此脚本序列可多次执行. ",
  "If no, the NPC will fade out if it's in a dying state.": "若选择否, 当NPC处于濒死状态时将会逐渐消失. ",
  "We can start the sequence, no matter the NPC state.": "无论NPC处于何种状态, 我们都可以启动该序列. ",
  "Don't fixup end position with a teleport when the SS is finished.": "当SS执行完毕后, 切勿使用传送功能来修正结束位置. ",
  "If set, we don't allow other scripts to steal our spot in the queue.": "设置后, 我们将禁止其他脚本抢占我们在队列中的位置. ",
  "Allow other NPC actors to continue after this NPC actor's death": "允许其他 NPC 在該 NPC 死亡后继续行动",
  "What this entity should do if the player dies.": "玩家死亡时, 该实体应执行的操作. ",
  "What the NPC performing this script should do if it dies.": "当执行此脚本的NPC死亡时, 它应执行的操作. ",
  "By default, when finishing the sequence, the NPC has its ideal yaw updated to maintain the current forward facing. This allows you to prevent that if you want to return to the facing prior to starting the sequence.": "默认情况下, 当序列执行完毕后, NPC的理想偏航角会被更新, 以保持其当前朝向. 这样, 若您希望让NPC恢复至执行序列前的朝向, 便可实现这一效果. ",
  "When finishing the sequence, if the NPC uses the navmesh, ensure the NPC is on a valid location on the navmesh.": "完成序列后, 如果NPC使用了导航网格, 请确保该NPC位于导航网格上的有效位置. ",
  "Optionnal per NPC override of the same parameter defined in the lock trigger.": "可选设置:每个NPC可单独覆盖在锁定触发器中定义的相同参数. ",
  "The name or classname of an NPC which will run the scripted command. If multiple NPCs are found, all of them will perform the command.": "执行脚本命令的 NPC 名称或类名. 如果找到多个符合条件的 NPC, 它们都会执行该命令. ",
  "An optional entity that marks the target of the scripted command.": "一个可选的实体, 用于标记脚本命令的目标. ",
  "Used to decide when to start the scripted command. Low means only start when the NPC is about to idle. High means it should start as soon as possible, unless the NPC needs to perform a critical schedule (like being required to flinch in response to heavy damage).": "用于决定何时启动脚本命令. 数值越低, 表示仅在 NPC 即将进入闲置状态时才启动; 数值越高, 则表示应尽可能早地启动, 除非 NPC 需要执行某些关键动作(比如因受到重创而做出闪避反应). ",
  "If set, once the NPC has nothing important to do, it'll return to idling, even if it previously broke out of the schedule due to the Interruptability choices.": "若勾选此选项, 当 NPC 没有重要事务需要处理时, 它会重新进入闲置状态, 即便此前因'可中断性'设置而暂时脱离了原有日程安排. ",
  "Sets what kind of events can interrupt an NPC that's performing this scripted command. Note that when set to 'Everything', NPCs can be easily interrupted by small things like physics impact sounds, or distant combat sounds.": "设置哪些类型的事件可以中断正在执行该脚本命令的NPC. 请注意, 若设置为'所有事件', NPC很容易被诸如物理碰撞声或远处的战斗声等细微声响打断. ",
  "If checked, when this entity is spawned, it will start the scripted command on all eligible NPC(s).": "勾选后, 当此实体生成时, 将会对所有符合条件的NPC执行脚本命令. ",
  "If the commanded NPC(s) is in Idle state, switch them to Alert state.": "若被指令的NPC处于闲置状态, 请将其切换为警戒状态. ",
  "If the script target is an NPC or player, setting this to 'Yes' will also give commanded NPCs memory of the target, and cause them to set their enemy to it. Note that if there's another NPC that's a better enemy, commanded NPCs will flip to the better enemy on their next think.": "若脚本目标为某个 NPC 或玩家, 将此选项设为'是'后, 被指挥的 NPC 也会记住该目标并将其设为敌人. 需要注意的是, 若存在其他更适合作为敌人的 NPC, 被指挥的 NPC 会在下一次判断时转而将该 NPC 视为敌人. ",
  "If the script would find multiple npcs on start, pick only one of them to run the command. Will only select NPCs who aren't currently scripted.": "如果脚本启动时发现多个NPC, 请仅选择其中一个来执行命令. 系统只会选择当前未被脚本控制的NPC. ",
  "The e_action_desired animgraph parameter will be set to this value during this idle. If it is a looping animation, the idle will not exit until explicitly canceled or interrupted by game code.": "在此闲置阶段, e_action_desired动画图参数将被设置为该值. 如果该动画为循环动画, 则除非被显式取消或由游戏代码中断, 否则闲置状态不会结束. ",
  "The e_action_desired animgraph parameter will be set to this value during the move. The action will not complete until both the movement and the action are finished.": "在移动过程中, e_action_desired动画图参数将被设置为此值. 只有当移动与动作均完成后, 该动作才算执行完毕. ",
  "Force this NPC to use a specific movement gait. Will return to the AI's default value afterwards.": "强制此NPC使用指定的移动步态. 之后将恢复为AI的默认值. ",
  "In general, NPCs always try to exactly reach the goal target. If the target is blocked for some reason, being this close to the goal means we'll still consider the movement a success anyways. -1 means use the default settings.": "通常情况下, NPC都会力求准确抵达目标位置. 若因某些原因无法到达目标点, 只要距离足够接近, 我们仍会判定此次移动为成功. -1则表示使用默认设置. ",
  "Optional distance from the goal position within which the NPC is allowed to end the navigation. -1 means use the blocked success radius. WARNING: You probably want to be setting blocked success radius rather than this, since in general, you want NPCs to actually reach their goals.": "可选择的 NPC 到达目标位置后停止导航的允许误差范围. 值为 -1 时表示使用'受阻成功半径'. 注意:通常建议您设置'受阻成功半径'而非此参数, 因为一般情况下我们希望 NPC 能够真正抵达目标位置. ",
  "Optional distance to goal at which to terminate the path.  Clips the goal to this distance away from the goal, along the path, so the NPC will never get closer than this to the goal.": "可选参数:终止路径时与目标点的最小距离. 该参数会将路径上距离目标点在此距离以内的部分截断, 确保NPC不会离目标点比此距离更近. ",
  "Should we stop at goal with zero velocity or keep our speed.": "我们应该在到达目标点时速度降为零, 还是保持当前速度呢?. ",
  "Subclass of the ability that target NPC(s) should perform against the Ability Target.": "该能力子类定义了目标NPC应针对能力目标执行的操作. ",
  "If yes, we'll add the ability to the NPC when trying to execute it. ": "如果选择'是', 我们在尝试执行时就会为该NPC添加相应功能.  ",
  "The body location on the Ability Target entity that the ability should target.": "该技能所针对的目标实体上的身体部位. ",
  "The method by which we determine the origin of the entity that the Ability will target. The Target Body Location is then used as a local offset on top of this origin. Predicated Abs Origin uses the current velocity of the target to anticipate where they'll be 0.5s in the future. Last Known/Seen position only really applies to enemies that the performing NPC has lost sight of.": "我们用来确定技能所瞄准实体起始位置的方法. 之后会将'目标身体位置'作为偏移量叠加在该起始位置之上. '基于速度的预测起始位置'则会利用目标的当前移动速度来预测其0.5秒后的位置. 而'最后已知/被观测到的位置'则主要适用于那些已脱离施法者视野范围的敌人. ",
  "An optional entity that marks where to move BEFORE using the ability.": "一个可选实体, 用于标记使用技能前需要移动到的位置. ",
  "An optional entity that marks where to move to while using the ability.": "一个可选的实体, 用于标记使用技能时需要移动到的位置. ",
  "Optional per NPC override of the same parameter defined in the lock trigger.": "可针对每个 NPC 单独设置此参数, 该设置会覆盖锁定触发器中所定义的参数值. ",
  "Name(s) of script files that are executed after all entities have spawned.": "所有实体生成后执行的脚本文件名称. ",
  "The name that other entities refer to this entity by.": "其他实体用来指代此实体的名称. ",
  "The name of this entity's parent in the movement hierarchy. Entities with parents move with their parent.": "该实体在移动层级结构中的父级名称. 拥有父级的实体会随父级一同移动. ",
  "The name of the bone or attachment to attach to on the entity's parent in the movement hierarchy. Use !bonemerge to use bone-merge style attachment. NOTE: If this is specified the Hammer transform will be disregarded, even if 'Use Local Transform' is NOT specified (in that case local transform will be identity)": "在运动层级中, 需要绑定到实体父级上的骨骼或附着点的名称. 若需使用骨骼合并式附着方式, 请填入 !bonemerge. 注意:一旦指定了此参数, 无论是否勾选'使用局部变换'选项, Hammer变换都将被忽略(此时局部变换值将默认为恒等变换).  (in that case local transform will be identity)",
  "Whether to respect the specified local offset when doing the initial hierarchical attachment to its parent.": "是否在执行初始层级绑定操作时遵循指定的本地偏移量. ",
  "Offset in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在父模型的附加点/骨骼的局部空间中, 用于层级结构的偏移值. 若未使用父附加点, 则此值无效. ",
  "Angular offset in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在层级结构中, 用于指定父模型附着点/骨骼的局部空间中的角度偏移量. 若未使用父级附着点, 则此参数无效. ",
  "Scale in the local space of the parent model's attachment/bone to use in hierarchy. Not used if you are not using parent attachment.": "在父模型的附着点/骨骼的局部空间中设置缩放值, 该值将用于层级结构中. 若未使用父级附着点, 则此设置无效. ",
  "Some models have multiple versions of their textures, called skins.": "某些模型拥有多个纹理版本, 这些版本被称为皮肤. ",
  "Used to disable shadow casting from this entity.": "用于禁用该实体的阴影投射. ",
  "Will add an additional attribute that AI/player entities can query when checking props for information (ex: 'DogToy' or 'GrabbableResource')": "将会新增一个属性, 供 AI 或玩家实体在查询物品信息时使用(例如:‘DogToy’ 或 ‘GrabbableResource’)",
  "Will add this modifier when the entity spawns.": "实体生成时将添加此修饰符. ",
  "Which animgraph should we use when spawning the entity? Animgraph identifiers are authored in modeldoc, see the AnimGraph2 reference node.": "在生成实体时我们应该使用哪个动画图呢?动画图的标识符是在 modeldoc 中定义的, 请参见 AnimGraph2 的参考节点. ",
  "Used to set a non-standard rendering mode on this entity. See also 'FX Amount' and 'FX Color'.": "用于为此实体设置非标准的渲染模式. 另请参阅'特效强度'和'特效颜色'. ",
  "Range at which the glow becomes visible. (0 = always visible)": "光晕开始显现的范围. (0 = 始终可见)",
  "Range at which the glow stops being visible. (0 = always visible)": "光晕不再可见的范围. (0 = 始终可见)",
  "Change the render color of the glow.": "更改光晕的渲染颜色. ",
  "Change the team we glow for.": "更换我们支持的团队. ",
  "The FX amount is used by the selected Render Mode.": "所选的渲染模式会使用该特效金额. ",
  "The FX color is used by the selected Render Mode.": "所选的渲染模式会使用该特效颜色. ",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (-1 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "覆盖层开始淡出的距离(-1表示用 fademaxdist 的值减去此数值). ",
  "Maximum distance at which the overlay is visible (0 = don't fade out).": "覆盖层可见的最大距离(0 = 不淡出). ",
  "Modifies culling behaviour when the object is small / distant": "调整物体尺寸较小或距离较远时的剔除行为",
  "If true, this geometry renders into baked cube maps": "若设为真, 此几何体将被渲染至预烘焙的立方体贴图中",
  "Determines if this geometry be considered static & cast shadows/bounce light when baking lightmaps?": "确定此几何体是否应被视为静态对象, 并在生成光照贴图时投射阴影/反射光线?",
  "Used to specify which inputs this entity will accept.": "用于指定此实体可接受的输入类型. ",
  "Name by which this entity is linked to another entity in a different map. When the player transitions to a new map, entities in the new map with globalnames matching entities in the previous map will have the previous map's state copied over their state.": "该名称用于将当前地图中的实体与另一地图中的实体进行关联. 当玩家切换到新地图时, 新地图中那些全局名称与原地图实体相匹配的实体, 将会继承原地图中对应实体的状态. ",
  "An integer counter value associated with this global.": "与此全局变量关联的整数计数器值. ",
  "Name of the filter entity that controls which entities can damage us.": "用于控制哪些实体能够对我们造成伤害的过滤器实体名称. ",
  "Response system context(s) for this entity. Format should be: 'key:value,key2:value2,etc'. When this entity speaks, the list of keys & values will be passed to the response rules system.": "此实体的回复系统上下文信息. 格式应为:'键名:值,键名2:值2,等等'. 当此实体发言时, 这些键名与值会被传递至回复规则系统. ",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion that causes the specified amount of damage. See also 'Explosion Radius'.": "若此值不为零, 当该实体破碎时会产生一次爆炸, 造成指定数值的伤害. 另请参阅'爆炸半径'. ",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion with a radius of the specified amount. See also 'Explosion Damage'.": "若值不为零, 当该实体破裂时便会产生一个半径等于此数值的爆炸效果. 亦可参考'爆炸伤害'. ",
  "Used to limit the amount of gibs produced when this entity breaks, for performance reasons.": "出于性能考虑, 此设置用于限制该实体破坏时产生的残骸数量. ",
  "Set to the best approximation of the size and material of this entity's brushes. If set, it will override this entity's health and damage taken from various weapons. See the propdata.txt file in the scripts directory of your MOD to get a detailed list of what each entry specifies.": "设置为与该实体所用画笔的尺寸和材质最接近的值. 设置后, 该值将覆盖实体的生命值以及受到各类武器攻击时的伤害值. 请查阅您 MOD 的 scripts 目录下的 propdata.txt 文件, 以获取每个参数具体含义的详细说明. ",
  "Number of points of damage to take before breaking. 0 means don't break.": "承受多少点伤害后会破碎. 0 表示不会破碎. ",
  "Set to the material type of the brush. Used to decide what sounds to make when damaged, and what gibs to produce when broken.": "设置为画笔所使用的材质类型. 该设置用于决定物体受损时播放何种音效, 以及碎裂时产生何种碎片. ",
  "Used to decide which direction to throw gibs when broken.": "用于决定物体破碎时碎片飞散的方向. ",
  "Used to determine whether or not damage should cause the brush to move.": "用于判定伤害是否会导致画笔移动. ",
  "When broken, an entity of the selected type will be created.": "当触发条件满足时, 系统会创建一个所选类型的实体. ",
  "If non-zero, when this entity breaks it will create an explosion that causes the specified amount of damage.": "若此值不为零, 则当该实体破碎时会产生一次爆炸, 对周围造成指定数值的伤害. ",
  "Delay, in seconds, after 'broken' by pressure before breaking apart (allows for sound to play before breaking apart).": "在受到压力而变为'破损'状态后, 到真正碎裂为止的延迟时间(单位:秒), 该延迟可确保碎裂前声音能够播放. ",
  "Radial force applied to our pieces when we break.": "当我们破坏部件时, 作用于其上的径向力. ",
  "Location in local space where the burst force is applied.": "局部空间中施加爆发力的位置. ",
  "Set the type of contents inside this breakable.": "设置此可破坏容器内内容的类型. ",
  "Prop Group to use when the prop is broken": "道具损坏时要使用的道具组",
  "Amount to scale the light by when compiling for HDR.": "在编译HDR内容时, 用于调整光照强度的数值. ",
  "Set a custom pattern of light brightness for this light. Pattern format is a string of characters, where 'a' is total darkness, 'z' fully bright. i.e. 'aaggnnttzz' would be a steppy fade in from dark to light.": "为该灯具设置自定义的亮度变化模式. 该模式由一个字符字符串构成, 其中‘a’表示完全黑暗, ‘z’表示最亮. 例如, ‘aaggnnttzz’就表示亮度从暗逐渐升至最亮. ",
  "Distance at which brightness should fall off to 50%. If set, overrides linear constant and quadratic paramaters.": "亮度降至50%时所对应的距离. 设置该值后, 将忽略线性常数与二次方参数. ",
  "Distance at which brightness should fall off to negligible (1/256)%. Must set _fifty_percent_distance to use.": "亮度降至可忽略不计水平(1/256%)时所对应的距离. 必须先设置 _fifty_percent_distance 才能使用此参数. ",
  "If set, causes lights to fall to exactly zero beyond the zero percent distance. May cause unrealistic lightijng if not used carefully.": "如果启用此选项, 当距离超过零百分比阈值时灯光强度会直接降为零. 若使用不当则可能导致光照效果失真. ",
  "Filter to use to see if activator triggers me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于判断激活器是否会触发本程序的过滤条件. 详情请参阅 filter_activator_name. ",
  "Used to clear out savegame data of previous levels to keep the savegame size as small as possible. Only set it to Yes if the player cannot return to any previous levels.": "该选项用于清除之前关卡的存档数据, 以尽可能减小存档文件的体积. 只有当玩家无法返回任何之前的关卡时, 才应将其设为'是'. ",
  "Number of pixels wide at which all props in the level start to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist). This number is ignored if the prop has a specific fade distance specified.": "当关卡中所有道具的可见距离达到此像素值时便会开始逐渐淡出(<0 表示使用 fademaxdist 的值). 如果某个道具已单独设定了淡出距离, 则此数值将被忽略. ",
  "Minimum number of pixels wide at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out). This number is ignored if the prop has a specific fade distance specified.": "该属性在屏幕上显示时的最小像素宽度(0 表示不淡出). 如果为该属性指定了特定的淡出距离, 则此数值将被忽略. ",
  "Sound volume, expressed as a range from 0 to 10, where 10 is the loudest.": "音量大小, 以0到10的数值范围表示, 其中10为最大音量. ",
  "Sound pitch, expressed as a range from 1 to 255, where 100 is the sound's default pitch.": "音高值的取值范围为1至255, 其中100为声音的默认音高. ",
  "Maximum distance at which this sound is audible.": "此声音可被听到的最大距离. ",
  "If an entity is specified, sound will come from this named entity instead of the location of ambient_generic.": "如果指定了实体, 声音将会从该实体处发出, 而非从 ambient_generic 所在的位置发出. ",
  "Name of the sound event to play": "要播放的声音事件的名称",
  "Name of the entity the sound should emit from.": "声音应该从中发出的实体的名称. ",
  "Play the sound immediately upon spawning": "生成时立即播放声音",
  "Play the sound directly to the local player": "直接将声音播放给本地播放器",
  "Stop a previously playing event when a new one is started": "当开始新的事件时, 停止之前正在播放的事件",
  "This soundevent should be saved and restored.": "此音效事件应当被保存并恢复. ",
  "If set, will play the soundevent from this attachment point.": "若已设置, 则会从此附着点播放声音事件. ",
  "Size of soundevent sphere": "声音事件作用域的大小",
  "Name of the first path corner node in the chain": "链中第一个路径拐角节点的名称",
  "The max number of soundevents the path corner chain will emit": "路径拐角链可触发的声音事件的最大数量",
  "The distance beyond which a segment will not emit a soundevent": "超出此距离后, 音段将不再触发声音事件",
  "For excluding soundevents that are close to eachother": "用于排除彼此过于接近的声音事件",
  "Name of the parameter to set": "待设置的参数名称",
  "Angle of the emitter cone": "发射器锥形角度",
  "Angle of the 'sweet spot' in the emitter cone": "发射器锥体内的'最佳区域'角度",
  "Attenuation Value when the player is outside of the cone": "玩家处于锥体范围外时的衰减值",
  "Attenuation Value when the player is inside the sweet spot": "玩家处于最佳位置时的衰减值",
  "Name of the stack to save op fields.": "要保存操作字段的堆栈名称. ",
  "Single float value to set on parameter.": "要设置到参数中的单个浮点数值. ",
  "The name of the stack the operator is in": "操作员所在堆栈的名称",
  "The name of the operator the OpVar is in": "OpVar所属的操作器名称",
  "The name of the OpVar to change": "需要修改的 OpVar 名称",
  "The interpreted type of value to be set on the opvar.": "要在操作变量中设置的值的类型. ",
  "Value to set the OpVar to": "要设置给 OpVar 的值",
  "String to set the OpVar to": "用于设置 OpVar 的字符串",
  "Index of the OpVar to set": "待设置的 OpVar 的索引",
  "Set the opvar upon spawning": "设置生成时的操作变量",
  "All entities that point to the same opvar and have this selected will automatically have their values compared and the largest set to the opvar value": "所有指向同一操作变量且勾选了此选项的实体, 其数值都会自动进行比较, 最大的数值将被设定为该操作变量的值",
  "Index of the OpVar array to set": "待设置的 OpVar 数组索引",
  "Minimum value to map distance to": "用于将距离映射的最小值",
  "Maximum value to map distance to": "用于将距离映射为最大值的值",
  "Size of the occlusion sphere": "遮挡球体的大小",
  "Occlusion value when fully occluded": "完全被遮挡时的遮挡值",
  "Occlusion value when un-occluded": "未被遮挡时的遮挡值",
  "Simulation Mode for occlusion check.": "用于遮挡检查的模拟模式. ",
  "Number of samples to use for volumetric occlusion or dynamic pathing.": "用于体积遮挡计算或动态路径规划的采样点数量. ",
  "Value to set the OpVar index to when disabled": "禁用时用于设置 OpVar 索引的值",
  "Entity will run at a faster refresh rate when enabled.  Use sparingly.": "启用后, 该实体将以更快的刷新速率运行. 请谨慎使用. ",
  "Minimum distance to map the OpVar value to": "将 OpVar 值映射时的最小距离",
  "Maximum distance to map the OpVar value to": "将 OpVar 值映射的最大距离",
  "Name of the entity to check distance/occlusion from": "待检测距离和遮挡关系的实体名称",
  "Name of the dynamic prop_door_rotating_physics entity to check for dynamic factor calculation.": "用于计算动态因子的动态 prop_door_rotating_physics 实体名称. ",
  "Position of a proxy point across a dynamic point to use for visiblity calculation. Make sure to set the Occlusion Radius such that it is entirely on one side of the dynamic object.": "用于可见性计算的、位于动态对象一侧的代理点位置. 请确保设置的遮挡半径值能使该代理点完全处于动态对象的同一侧. ",
  "Value when the dynamic occlusion is considered fully unoccluded and return 1.": "当动态遮挡被视为完全无遮挡时, 其对应值为1. ",
  "Limit the evaluation of the box to a single axis": "将盒体评估限制在单一轴上",
  "The name of the entity that is at the start of the path": "路径起始处的实体名称",
  "Enables the path corner entities to be parented to another entity and update their position accordingly": "启用后, 路径拐角实体可作为子实体依附于其他实体, 并随之更新位置",
  "Size of the room to analyze": "待分析的房间尺寸",
  "If the player's height and the raycast height are within this many units, the difference is ignored when performing distance calculations": "如果玩家的身高与射线检测高度的差值在此单位数范围内, 则在计算距离时可忽略该差值",
  "Minimum value of env_wind": "env_wind的最小值",
  "Maximum value of env_wind": "env_wind的最大值",
  "Minimum value to map env_wind to opvar": "将 env_wind 映射到 opvar 时的最小值",
  "Maximum value to map env_wind to opvar": "可将 env_wind 映射至 opvar 的最大值",
  "Name of the type of Sound Area": "声音区域类型名称",
  "The radius of the Sound Area": "音效区域的半径",
  "Minimum extents of the model throughout the whole animation": "整个动画过程中模型的最小范围",
  "Maximum extents of the model throughout the whole animation": "整个动画过程中模型的最大范围",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of its own origins.": "请选择一个 info_lighting, 以指定一个采样光源的位置, 而非使用其自身的初始位置. ",
  "Set a target for percentage of pixels above a certain brightness. (-1 for default engine behavior)": "设置亮度高于特定阈值的像素占比目标值. (-1 表示使用引擎的默认行为) (-1 for default engine behavior)",
  "Set a custom brightness target to go along with 'Target Bright Pixel Percentage'. (-1 for default engine behavior)": "设置自定义的亮度目标值, 以配合'目标亮像素百分比'使用. (设置为 -1 则采用引擎的默认行为) (-1 for default engine behavior)",
  "The master tonemap controller for the map presents the default values to use. Will be used initially and whenever active tonemaps are disabled.": "地图的主色调映射控制器会显示应使用的默认值. 这些默认值会在初始状态下被采用, 或在所有已启用的色调映射被禁用时使用. ",
  "Sets the max number of ragdolls that can be in the world at a time (if they are flagged to fade). Set to -1 if you want to use the default value (g_ragdoll_maxcount).": "设置同时存在于世界中的可渐隐布娃娃的最大数量. 若希望使用默认值 (g_ragdoll_maxcount), 请设为 -1. ",
  "Should the ragdoll manager make sure ally ragdolls aren't deleted?": "布偶管理器是否应当确保友方布偶不会被删除?",
  "Can ragdolls be damaged and eventually destroyed if they have health?": "如果布娃娃模型具有生命值, 它们是否会受到损伤并最终被摧毁呢?",
  "Sets the max number of gib that can be spawned at a time. (-1=no limit)": "设置一次可生成的GIB最大数量. (-1表示无限制)",
  "If true, when the max gib count is reached, oldest gibs are removed as new gibs spawn. If false, new gibs will not be spawned once the gib limit is reached.": "若设为 true, 当达到最大碎片数量时, 新碎片生成后会自动移除最旧的碎片. 若设为 false, 则达到碎片数量上限后将不再生成新碎片. ",
  "Amount of random spread in the origins of the smoke particles when they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成时, 其初始位置的随机散布范围. ",
  "Amount of random spread in the velocity of the smoke particles after they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成后, 其速度的随机波动幅度. ",
  "The speed at which the smoke particles move after they're spawned.": "烟雾粒子生成后的移动速度. ",
  "Size of the smoke particles when they're first emitted.": "烟雾粒子刚被发射时的尺寸. ",
  "Size of the smoke particles at the point they fade out completely.": "烟雾粒子在完全消失时的尺寸. ",
  "Rate at which to emit smoke particles (i.e. particles to emit per second).": "烟雾粒子的发射速率(即每秒发射的粒子数量). ",
  "Length of the smokestack. Lifetime of the smoke particles is derived from this & particle speed.": "烟囱的高度. 烟雾粒子的存活时间由该数值及粒子速度共同决定. ",
  "This specifies the wind direction. It is an angle in the XY plane. WindSpeed specifies the strength of the wind.": "该参数用于指定风向, 表示 XY 平面上的角度. WindSpeed 则用于指定风力强度. ",
  "The strength of the wind.": "风力强弱. ",
  "Material of the smoke particles emitted by this stack.": "此堆叠物释放出的烟雾颗粒的材质. ",
  "The amount, in degrees per second, that the smoke particles twist around the origin.": "烟雾粒子绕原点旋转的速率, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Amount of roll in degrees per second.": "每秒旋转的角度值. ",
  "The time that it will take to fade the screen in or out.": "屏幕淡入或淡出所需的时长. ",
  "The time to hold the faded in/out state.": "淡入/淡出状态持续的时长. ",
  "Alpha of the fade, where 0 = fully transparent and 255 = fully opaque.": "淡入淡出的透明度值, 其中 0 表示完全透明, 255 表示完全不透明. ",
  "The name of the tonemap controller entity associated with this trigger.": "与此触发器关联的色调映射控制器实体的名称. ",
  "Ladder end point.": "梯子的终点. ",
  "If multiple ladders are near multiple endpoints, use this to stop them from interfering with each other.": "当多个梯子靠近多个端点时, 使用此功能可防止它们互相干扰. ",
  "The minimum level of ambient light that hits this brush.": "该画笔所感知到的环境光最小强度值. ",
  "Set the interacts as layer": "将交互元素设置为图层",
  "Set the interacts with layer": "设置交互图层",
  "Used to control the solidity/collision of these brushes.": "用于控制这些画笔的硬度与碰撞效果. ",
  "If an NPC classname is specified here, NPCs of that type won't collide with these brushes. In Episodic, you may also specify an individual entity's name.": "若在此处指定了 NPC 的类名, 则该类型的 NPC 将不会与这些画刷发生碰撞. 在 Episodic 模式下, 您还可以指定某个具体实体的名称. ",
  "If set, then the excluded NPC class will consider this brush solid, and all other NPC classes will consider it non-solid.": "若启用此选项, 被排除的NPC类别会将该笔刷区域视为实心, 而其他所有NPC类别则视为非实心. ",
  "If set, nav generation will ignore this func_brush if 'Solidity' is set to 'Always Solid'.": "若已设置, 当'Solidity'选项设为'始终为实体'时, 导航生成功能将忽略此 func_brush. ",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers": "以逗号分隔的交互层列表",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to interact with": "以逗号分隔的、可交互的图层列表",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to not collide with": "无需进行碰撞检测的交互层列表, 各项之间以逗号分隔",
  "Set this if this brush is in hierarchy with a moving object of some kind, and the player can stand on this brush.": "如果此笔刷属于某个可移动物体的层级结构, 且玩家能够站在此笔刷上, 请勾选此选项. ",
  "Set this to allow vscript code to move the brush via SetVelocity() calls.": "将其设置为启用, 以便允许 vscript 代码通过 SetVelocity() 调用来移动画刷. ",
  "Name of a material to overlay over the top of the VGUI screen. NOTE: This material must write Z for the VGUI screen to work.": "用于覆盖在 VGUI 屏幕上方的材质名称. 注意:此材质必须设置 Z 值才能使 VGUI 屏幕正常工作. ",
  "Width of the panel in units.": "面板的宽度, 以单位计. ",
  "Height of the panel in units.": "面板的高度, 以单位计量. ",
  "Minimum amount of random time that a slide is displayed.": "幻灯片显示的最短随机时长. ",
  "Maximum amount of random time that a slide is displayed.": "幻灯片显示的最大随机时长. ",
  "A 'then ANY' followup on a response from this orator will dispatch to characters up to this many units away. Leave 0 to mean that even an infinitely distant character may respond.": "在此演说者发出的响应之后, 若选择'随后任何目标', 消息将被发送至距离不超过指定数值的单位. 若设为0, 则表示即便是距离无限遥远的单位也能收到响应. ",
  "The direction the gibs will fly.": "残骸飞散的方向. ",
  "Total number of gibs to shoot each time it's activated.": "每次激活时可发射的弹药总数. ",
  "Delay (in seconds) between shooting each gib. If 0, all gibs shoot at once.": "发射每个碎片时的延迟时间(秒). 若设为0, 则所有碎片会同时发射. ",
  "The orientation of the spawned gibs.": "生成的碎片的朝向. ",
  "How fast (degrees/sec) the gib pieces should spin. They will spin on x and y axis at between 10% and 100% of this speed.": "碎片旋转的速度(度/秒). 它们会在 X 轴和 Y 轴上以该速度的 10% 至 100% 之间进行旋转. ",
  "Speed of the fired gibs": "喷射出的碎片的飞行速度",
  "How much variance in the direction gibs are fired.": "子弹发射时的方向偏差范围有多大. ",
  "Time in seconds for gibs to live +/- 5%": "残体存在的时间(秒), 误差范围为 ±5%",
  "Select an entity to specify a location to sample lighting from for all gibs spawned by this shooter, instead of their own origins.": "请选择一个实体, 以便为该发射器生成的所有残骸指定光照采样位置, 而非使用它们自身的原点. ",
  "If the 'Random Strike' spawnflag is set, this radius determines the area within which the endpoints will randomly strike.": "若设置了'随机打击'生成标志, 此半径即决定了端点随机进行打击的作用范围. ",
  "Amount of time before the beam dies. Setting to zero will make the beam stay forever.": "光束消失所需的时长. 设置为零则光束会永久存在. ",
  "Pixel width of the beam.": "光束的像素宽度. ",
  "The amount of noise in the beam. 0 is a perfectly straight beam.": "光束中的噪声程度. 值为0表示光束完全笔直. ",
  "The material used to draw the beam.": "用于绘制光束的材质. ",
  "Rate at which the beam texture should scroll along the beam.": "光束纹理沿光束方向滚动的速率. ",
  "Framerate at which the beam texture should animate, if it has multiple frames.": "光束纹理进行动画播放时的帧率, 前提是该纹理包含多个帧. ",
  "The frame to start the beam texture on.": "开始应用光束纹理的帧数. ",
  "Refire time between random strikes of the beam. Only used if the 'Random Strike' spawnflag is set.": "光束随机打击之间的重新发射间隔时间. 仅当设置了'随机打击'生成标志时才会生效. ",
  "How much damage this beam does per second to things it hits when it is continually on, or instantaneously if it strikes. For continuous damage, the value should be greater than 10 or it may not work.": "该光束持续发射时, 每秒对击中目标造成的伤害值; 若为瞬间攻击则为此值即为总伤害值. 若需实现持续伤害效果, 该数值应大于10, 否则可能无效. ",
  "Entity that the beam starts at.": "光束的起始实体. ",
  "Entity that the beam ends at.": "光束的终点所对应的实体. ",
  "Decal to be applied at the end of the beam": "需粘贴在光束末端的贴纸",
  "float value to multiply sprite color by when running in HDR mode.": "在 HDR 模式下, 用于乘以精灵颜色的浮点数值. ",
  "If a LightningEnd entity is not specified, use this point as the destination instead. If the env_beam moves, the destination point will move along with it.": "若未指定 LightningEnd 实体, 则将此点作为目标点. 当 env_beam 发生移动时, 该目标点也会随之移动. ",
  "If you want the beam to fire an output when touched by entities, choose the entity type here.": "若希望光束在被实体触碰时触发输出效果, 请在此选择实体类型. ",
  "Select whether you want the beam to clip against geometry or characters": "请选择是让光束受到几何体或角色的裁剪",
  "Number of cans in the dispenser.": "分配器中罐子的数量. ",
  "The general direction that the blood should spray and the direction to trace to apply the decal.": "血液喷溅的大致方向, 以及用于绘制贴图时的追踪方向. ",
  "The amount of damage done by the explosion.": "爆炸造成的伤害值. ",
  "If specified, the radius in which the explosion damages entities. If unspecified, the radius will be based on the magnitude.": "若已指定, 则表示爆炸对实体造成伤害的作用半径; 若未指定, 则该半径由爆炸强度决定. ",
  "Do not harm or affect the named entity.": "切勿损害或影响该指定实体. ",
  "Do not harm or affect this class.": "切勿破坏或影响此类程序. ",
  "Opacity of the sprites (range from 0 - 1).": "精灵的不透明度(取值范围为 0 到 1). ",
  "Number of particles to emit each second.": "每秒发射的粒子数量. ",
  "Number of seconds until each particle dies.": "每个粒子消亡所需的秒数. ",
  "Starting color of the emitted particles.": "发射粒子的起始颜色. ",
  "Ending color of the emitted particles.": "发射出的粒子的结束颜色. ",
  "Number of seconds until the env_smoketrail stops emitting particles. 0 means never stop emitting particles.": "环境烟雾轨迹停止发射粒子所需的秒数. 值为0则表示永不停止发射粒子. ",
  "Minimum randomly-directed speed to use for emitted particles.": "用于发射粒子的最小随机方向速度. ",
  "Maximum randomly-directed speed to use for emitted particles.": "用于发射粒子的随机方向最大速度. ",
  "Minimum speed along the env_smoketrail's forward direction (x axis) to use for emitted particles.": "环境烟雾轨迹沿前进方向(X轴)的最小速度值, 该值用于计算发射粒子的速度. ",
  "Maximum speed along the env_smoketrail's forward direction (x axis) to use for emitted particles.": "用于发射粒子时, 沿 env_smoketrail 正向方向(X轴)的最大速度. ",
  "Starting particle size.": "初始颗粒大小. ",
  "Ending particle size.": "最终颗粒尺寸. ",
  "Distance from env_smoketrail at which particles are emitted.": "粒子生成点与 env_smoketrail 之间的距离. ",
  "Amount of physics force applied by the explosion.": "爆炸所产生的物理作用力的大小. ",
  "If specified, amount of damage to deal. If unspecified, magnitude is used as the damage.": "若已指定, 则以此数值作为造成的伤害量; 若未指定, 则使用'幅度'值作为伤害量. ",
  "If specified, the explosion will only affect the matching entity.": "若指定了此选项, 爆炸效果仅会对匹配的实体产生影响. ",
  "If not zero, the LOS is calculated from a point intersecting this sphere.": "若此值不为零, 则视线距离是从与该球体相交的点开始计算的. ",
  "Scale the applied physics force by this value.": "按此数值缩放所应用的物理力. ",
  "If true, also push entities that do not take damage (like func_physbox)": "若设为 true, 则同时推送不会受到伤害的实体(如 func_physbox).  (like func_physbox)",
  "Disable clamping of push impulses (by default limits impulses that would move 75kg object more than 400 units-per-second)": "禁用推力脉冲限制功能(默认情况下, 该限制会防止推动75公斤物体时的速度超过每秒400单位) (by default limits impulses that would move 75kg object more than 400 units-per-second)",
  "Direction to project the impact.": "影响方向设置. ",
  "Strength of the impact.": "冲击强度. ",
  "How far to project the impact (if 0 uses a default value).": "影响范围的大小(若设为0则使用默认值). ",
  "If set, 'Distance' and Angle settings are ignored and the direction and distance to the target entity will be used.": "若勾选此选项, 则'距离'和'角度'设置将被忽略, 系统会使用指向目标实体的方向及距离. ",
  "Amount of time the fire will burn.": "火焰燃烧的持续时间. ",
  "Height (in world units) of the flame.": "火焰的高度(以世界单位计). ",
  "Amount of time the fire takes to grow to full strength.": "火焰达到最大强度所需的时间. ",
  "Amount of heat 'damage' to take before this flame should ignite.": "此火焰点燃前可承受的热'损伤'量. ",
  "Multiplier of the burn damage done by the flame.": "火焰造成的燃烧伤害倍率. ",
  "The radius around this entity in which to provide heat.": "用于提供热量的以该实体为中心的半径范围. ",
  "Amount of heat 'damage' to apply to env_fire entities within the radius.": "施加到半径范围内所有 env_fire 实体上的热量'损伤'值. ",
  "The radius around this entity in which to detect heat changes.": "用于检测热变化的、以该实体为中心的作用半径. ",
  "The target heat level to check for. Outputs are fired when the heat moves over this target level (increasing or decreasing).": "需要监测的目标热量值. 当实际热量值超过此目标值(无论升高还是降低)时, 系统会触发输出. ",
  "The amount of time the heat level must spend over the target level before the 'OnHeatLevelStart' output is fired.": "在触发‘OnHeatLevelStart’输出之前, 热量等级需保持在目标等级以上的时间长度. ",
  "Name of the entity to catch on fire.": "即将着火的实体名称. ",
  "Duration of flames.": "火焰持续时间. ",
  "float value to multiply fog color by when running in HDR mode.": "在 HDR 模式下, 用于乘以雾气颜色的浮点数值. ",
  "Name of entity, or entities, to strike at. The target is randomly chosen if there are multiple entities matching the given name.": "要攻击的实体名称. 如果存在多个名称匹配的实体, 则会随机选择其中一个作为目标. ",
  "The width of the laser beam, in pixels.": "激光束的宽度, 单位为像素. ",
  "The material used to draw the laser beam.": "用于生成激光束的材料. ",
  "If specified, this sprite will be drawn at the end of the laser beam.": "若进行了设置, 此精灵将被绘制在激光束的末端. ",
  "How much damage this laser does. per second. to things it hits.": "此激光每秒对击中的目标造成的伤害值. ",
  "When the message is shown, this sound effect will be played, originating from this entity.": "当该消息显示时, 会播放此音效, 声音来源即为该实体. ",
  "Volume of the sound effect.": "音效音量. ",
  "Limit the shake to entity or entities matching the name or class name.": "将抖动效果仅应用于名称或类名匹配的实体. ",
  "The amount of noise in the screen shake. Should be a range between 0 and 16.": "屏幕抖动的噪波强度. 取值范围应在0到16之间. ",
  "The radius around this entity in which to affect players.": "影响玩家的作用范围半径, 以该实体为中心计算. ",
  "The length of time in which to shake the player's screens.": "玩家屏幕震动的持续时间. ",
  "The frequency used to apply the screen shake. Should be a value between 0 and 255, where 0.1 = jerk, and 255.0 = rumble.": "用于控制屏幕震动频率的参数. 该值应介于 0 到 255 之间:0.1 代表轻微震动, 255.0 则代表剧烈震动. ",
  "The length of time in which to tilt the player's screens.": "玩家屏幕倾斜的持续时间. ",
  "How long it takes to reach full tilt.": "达到全速状态需要多长时间. ",
  "The punch angles to apply.": "要应用的冲孔角度. ",
  "Altitude the rotorwash will show up.": "旋翼气流出现的高度. ",
  "Some models have multiple versions of their textures, called skins. Set this to a number other than 0 to use that skin on all gibs produced by this shooter.": "某些模型拥有多个纹理版本, 这些版本被称为皮肤. 将此值设为非0数值, 即可让该发射器生成的所有碎片都使用指定的皮肤. ",
  "ONLY WORKS FOR POINT GIBS. This field allows you to scale gravity so that gibs fall faster, slower, or not at all.": "仅适用于点状碎片. 此字段可用于调整重力强度, 使碎片下落速度变快、变慢或完全停止下落. ",
  "EPISODIC ONLY. Specify an arbitrary mass for the gibs emitted by me.": "仅适用于分段模式. 可自行指定由我发射的碎片的质量. ",
  "The average time it has to be under the rotor before it shoots a gib.": "在发射弹片之前, 物体需在转子下方停留的平均时间. ",
  "The random amount to vary the time it has to be under the rotor before it shoots a gib.": "随机数值, 用于决定物体需要在转子下方停留多久才会被弹射出去. ",
  "The soundscape to get all sound parameters from.": "用于获取所有声音参数的声音环境. ",
  "If set to -1, then the player can hear the soundscape as long as he can see it (regardless of distance to it).": "若设置为 -1, 则只要玩家能够看到声景, 就能听到其声音(无论与声景的距离有多远). ",
  "The name of the soundscape to use. Corresponds to an entry in the soundscapes*.txt file in the scripts directory.": "要使用的音景名称. 该名称需与脚本目录中 soundscapes*.txt 文件里的一项内容相对应. ",
  "The name of the sound event to start from the soundscape entity.": "要从音景实体中播放的音效事件名称. ",
  "A sound position that will be referenced inside the soundscape text file. Usually used to position a set of sounds within the world.": "此音效位置会在音景文本文件中被引用, 通常用于确定一组音效在世界中的位置. ",
  "The longest delay between sparks (in seconds).": "火花出现之间的最长间隔时间(以秒为单位). ",
  "What Type of Spark Effect": "选择火花效果类型",
  "The size of the sparks.": "火花的大小. ",
  "Rate at which the sprite should animate, if at all.": "精灵进行动画播放的速率, 如果需要进行动画的话. ",
  "Material of the sprite to be drawn.": "要绘制的精灵所使用的材质. ",
  "Scale multiplier of the sprite.": "精灵的缩放倍数. ",
  "Size of the glow to be rendered for visibility testing. Must be larger than the distance from the sprite center to empty space.  So if this glow is inside geometry (like a light bulb), set this value to be bigger than the bulb's radius. Any time a sphere of this radius would be visible (poking through any nearby geometry), the glow will be rendered.": "用于可见性测试的发光区域大小. 该值必须大于从精灵中心到周围空白区域的距离. 举例来说, 如果该发光区域位于某个几何物体内部(如灯泡), 则需将此值设为大于灯泡半径的数值. 只要以该半径为直径的球体能够被看到(即从周围几何物体中显露出来), 发光效果就会被渲染出来. ",
  "Minimum speed of the wind while idling.": "闲置状态下的最低风速. ",
  "Maximum speed of the wind while idling.": "怠速状态下的最大风速. ",
  "Minimum speed of wind gusts.": "阵风的最小速度. ",
  "Maximum speed of wind gusts.": "阵风的最大风速. ",
  "Minimum time delay between random gusts.": "随机阵风之间的最小时间间隔. ",
  "Maximum time delay between random gusts.": "随机阵风之间的最大时间间隔. ",
  "How long will the wind gust for.": "阵风会持续多久. ",
  "Maximum amount that the wind's direction changes due to a gust.": "因阵风导致风向变化的最大幅度. ",
  "The radius this entity applies wind effects to.  -1 for global effect, other value to allow multiple or limited wind entities.": "该实体产生风效的作用半径. 值为 -1 则表示全局生效; 其他数值则可用于设置多个或特定范围的风效实体. ",
  "Scale of the skybox.": "天空盒的缩放比例. ",
  "Offset for the near clip plane for the 3D sky in world units.  This is only used if the above field is true.  Negative values to pull closer, etc.": "以世界单位表示的 3D 天空近裁剪面偏移量. 仅当上述选项为启用状态时才生效. 负值表示将裁剪面向近处移动, 以此类推. ",
  "Name of the skybox this camera belongs to.": "此相机所属的天空盒名称. ",
  "Distance at which the skybox fog should start.": "天空盒雾效开始生效的距离. ",
  "Distance at which the skybox fog should be fully opaque.": "天空盒雾气完全变得不透明时的距离. ",
  "Script file containing rules for playing appropriate sounds.": "包含播放合适音效规则的脚本文件. ",
  "High level concept name used as primary search key.": "用作主要搜索关键词的高级概念名称. ",
  "Classname of the weapon type to limit.": "要限制的武器类型对应的类名. ",
  "The maximum amount of the specified weapon type allowed in the world.": "允许在游戏中存在的指定武器类型的最大数量. ",
  "Modifier for ammount of ammo dropped by a weapon.": "武器掉落弹药量的修正值. ",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this entity will not activate.": "旧版兼容支持:主实体的名称. 若该主实体尚未激活, 此实体也将无法激活. ",
  "Classname of item to equip, eg 'weapon_ak47'.": "待装备物品的类名, 例如 'weapon_ak47'. ",
  "Message to display onscreen.": "要在屏幕上显示的消息. ",
  "Horizontal position on the player's screens to draw the text. The value should be between 0 and 1, where 0 is the far left of the screen and 1 is the far right. -1 centers the text.": "在播放器屏幕上绘制文本时的水平位置. 该值应介于0到1之间, 其中0表示屏幕最左侧, 1表示屏幕最右侧. -1则会使文本居中. ",
  "Vertical position on the player's screens to draw the text. The value should be between 0 and 1, where 0 is the top of the screen and 1 is the bottom. -1 centers the text.": "在播放器屏幕上绘制文本时的垂直位置. 该值需介于0到1之间, 其中0表示屏幕顶部, 1表示屏幕底部. -1表示将文本居中显示. ",
  "The time it should take for the text to fully fade in.": "文本完全淡入所需的时间. ",
  "The time it should take for the text to fade out, after the hold time has expired.": "文本在停留时间结束后逐渐淡出的所需时间. ",
  "The time the text should stay onscreen, after fading in, before it begins to fade out.": "文本淡入后在屏幕上停留的时间, 之后才会开始淡出. ",
  "If the 'Text Effect' is set to Scan Out, this is the time it should take to scan out all the letters in the text.": "若'文本特效'设置为'扫出效果', 此数值即表示将所有文本字符完全扫出所需的时间. ",
  "You can have up to four individual game_text messages onscreen at once, stored in channels. Select which channel this text should be placed in, which will overwrite any active message already in that channel.": "屏幕上最多可同时显示四条独立的游戏文本消息, 这些消息被存储在不同的频道中. 请选择该文本要显示在哪个频道, 此举会覆盖该频道中原有正在显示的文本. ",
  "Distance the player must be within to see this message.": "玩家必须处于该距离范围内才能看到此消息. ",
  "If set, this message will only be visible when developer mode is on.": "设置后, 此消息仅在开发者模式开启时显示. ",
  "Filter to use to narrow set of findable entities. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于筛选并缩小可查找实体范围的过滤器. 详情请参阅 filter_activator_name. ",
  "Name of the entity to use when evaluating criteria.  For example, when using 'Nearest', this is the entity that distance will be measured from.  If left blank will use the point_entity_finder.": "用于评估条件的实体名称. 例如, 当选择'最近'时, 此实体即为计算距离的基准点. 若留空, 则会使用 point_entity_finder. ",
  "Master has priority if multiple info_player_starts exist": "若存在多个 info_player_start 点, 则以主点为准",
  "Subclass of the player pawn to spawn.": "要生成的玩家棋子子类. ",
  "Name of entity that dead players will face while in intermission at this spot.": "在该位置的间歇期间, 死亡的玩家将面对的实体名称. ",
  "The amount of seconds after which, if any client hasn't finished streaming the necessary assets, that client is disconnected and the spawngroup spawns anyways. 0 means use some reasonable default set in the code.": "该数值表示经过多少秒后, 若仍有客户端未能完成所需资源的流传输, 则该客户端会被断开连接, 而生成组仍会正常生成实体. 值为0时表示使用代码中设定的合理默认值. ",
  "Automatically activates the spawn group once loaded.": "加载后即自动激活生成组. ",
  "Name of .VSNAP (Particle Snapshot File) to be loaded and used by this particle system (e.g. 'smoke_snapshot1')": "待加载并供此粒子系统使用的 .VSNAP 文件名称(粒子快照文件), 例如'smoke_snapshot1'",
  "Id of a node in the map to be used to generate a particle snapshot, if specified Particle Snapshot File is ignored.": "用于生成粒子快照的地图节点ID; 若指定了该参数, 则会忽略'粒子快照文件'设置. ",
  "What controlpoint to set data on.  -1 means this is not used.": "要设置数据的控制点. -1 表示未使用此控制点. ",
  "Data Control Point Value to set.": "待设置的数据控制点数值. ",
  "What controlpoint to set color on.  -1 means this is not used.": "要设置颜色的控制点. -1 表示未使用该控制点. ",
  "Color for the specified Control Point": "指定控制点的颜色",
  "If set, control point 0 of the effect will be at this entity's location. (Otherwise it is at the info_particle_system origin)": "若设置此项, 该特效的控制点0将位于此实体的位置. (否则则位于 info_particle_system 的原点处) (Otherwise it is at the info_particle_system origin)",
  "If set, control point 1 of the effect will be at this entity's location.": "若设置此项, 效果的第一个控制点将位于此实体的位置. ",
  "If set, control point 2 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 1 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第二个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第一个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 3 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 2 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点3将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点2未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 4 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 3 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第4控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果未设置第3控制点, 该设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 5 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 4 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的控制点5将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点4未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 6 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 5 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第六个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第五个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 7 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 6 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置此项, 效果的控点7将位于该实体的位置. 如果未设置控点6, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 8 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 7 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置此项, 特效的第8个控制点将位于此实体所在位置. 若未设置第7个控制点, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 9 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 8 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置了此选项, 效果的控点9将位于该实体的位置. 如果控点8未设置, 则该选项会被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 10 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 9 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置了此项, 特效的控制点10将位于该实体的位置. 若控制点9未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 11 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 10 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第11个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第10个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 12 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 11 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置了此项, 特效的控制点12将位于该实体的位置. 如果未设置控制点11, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 13 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 12 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该效果的13号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若12号控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 14 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 13 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点14将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点13未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 15 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 14 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的第15个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 但如果第14个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 16 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 15 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置此项, 该特效的第16个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第15个控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 17 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 16 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的控制点17将位于此实体的位置. 若控制点16未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 18 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 17 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第18个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第17个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 19 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 18 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 特效的第19个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第18个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 20 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 19 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设定此项, 该特效的第20个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 但若第19个控制点未被设定, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 21 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 10 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 特效的控制点21将位于此实体的位置. 若控制点10未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 22 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 21 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 特效的控制点22将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点21尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 23 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 22 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点23将位于此实体的位置. 若控制点22未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 24 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 23 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置了此项, 该特效的第24个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第23个控制点未被设置, 则该设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 25 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 24 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若进行设置, 该特效的第25个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 但若第24个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 26 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 25 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的第26个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第25个控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 27 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 26 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置此项, 效果的操控点27将位于此实体的位置. 若操控点26未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 28 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 27 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点28将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点27未设置, 此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 29 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 28 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置此项, 该效果的第29个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第28个控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 30 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 29 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置此选项, 效果的30号控制点将位于该实体的位置. 若29号控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 31 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 30 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第31个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第30个控制点未设置, 则该设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 32 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 31 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第32个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第31个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 33 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 32 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该效果的 33 号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若 32 号控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 34 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 33 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则效果的34号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果33号控制点未设置, 该设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 35 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 34 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该效果的控件点35将位于此实体的位置. 如果控件点34未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 36 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 35 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的第36个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第35个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 37 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 36 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第37个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第36个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 38 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 37 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果中的控制点38将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点37尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 39 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 38 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 特效的第39个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第38个控制点未设置, 则该设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 40 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 39 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该效果的控点40将位于此实体的位置. 如果控点39未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 41 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 40 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点41将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点40尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 42 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 41 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点42将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点41未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 43 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 42 is not set, this will be ignored.": "设置后, 该特效的第43号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第42号控制点未被设置, 则此设定将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 44 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 43 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若设置了此选项, 该效果的44号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若未设置43号控制点, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 45 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 44 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则效果的45号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果44号控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 46 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 45 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第46个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第45个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 47 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 46 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果中的控制点47将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点46未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 48 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 47 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的第48个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 但若第47个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 49 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 48 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点49将位于此实体的位置. 若控制点48未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 50 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 49 is not set, this will be ignored.": "设置后, 该特效的第50个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第49个控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 51 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 50 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则效果的控件点51将位于此实体的位置. 如果控件点50尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 52 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 51 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该特效的第52个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若第51个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 53 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 52 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点53将位于此实体的位置. 如果控制点52未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 54 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 53 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第54个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第53个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 55 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 54 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置此项, 效果中的控制点55将位于该实体的位置. 若控制点54未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 56 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 55 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第56个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第55个控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 57 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 56 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第57个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第56个控制点未设置, 此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 58 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 57 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 效果的第58号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第57号控制点未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 59 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 58 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 该效果的59号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若58号控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 60 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 59 is not set, this will be ignored.": "如果设置了该选项, 效果的 60 号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 若 59 号控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 61 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 60 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的第61个控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果第60个控制点尚未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 62 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 61 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则该特效的控制点62将位于此实体的位置. 若控制点61未设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set, control point 63 of the effect will be at this entity's location. If control point 62 is not set, this will be ignored.": "若已设置, 则效果的63号控制点将位于此实体的位置. 如果62号控制点未被设置, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 1 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若已设置且值非零, 则该效果的控制点1将以此点作为其父级点. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 2 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若已设置且值不为零, 则该效果的控制点2将以此点作为其父级. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 3 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若此项已设置且值非零, 则该特效的控制点3将以此点作为其父节点. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 4 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若已设置且值不为零, 则该效果的控制点4将以此点作为其父级点. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 5 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若已设置且值不为零, 则该特效的控制点5将以此点作为其父级点. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 6 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "若已设置且值非零, 则该效果的控制点6将以此点作为其父级点. ",
  "If set and nonzero, control point 7 of the effect will use this point for its parent.": "如果设置了该值且不为零, 则效果的控制点7将以此点作为其父级点. ",
  "Radius in which ragdolls are affected around this entity's origin.": "以该实体为中心, 在此半径范围内的布娃娃会受到影响. ",
  "Magnetic force to apply to ragdolls within the radius. Expressed as kilograms per inch per second. So a force of 1000 will add 10 inches/second to a 100kg man. It will add 100 inches per second to a 10kg headcrab.": "作用于半径范围内布娃娃模型的磁力. 数值单位为千克/英寸/秒. 举例来说, 若设定为1000, 则会对一个100千克重的人体模型产生10英寸/秒的速度增量; 而对一只10千克重的头壳虫而言, 则会产生100英寸/秒的速度增量. ",
  "If specified, the phys_ragdollmagnet will only affect the target entity.": "若已指定, phys_ragdollmagnet 仅会对目标实体产生影响. ",
  "The name of an entity in the map that the dynamic light will point at.": "动态光源所指向的地图中实体的名称. ",
  "This is the distance that light is allowed to cast, in inches.": "这是光线可投射的距离, 单位为英寸. ",
  "This is the radius of the light, in inches, at the object that it is hitting.": "这是光线照射到物体上时所形成的光斑半径, 单位为英寸. ",
  "This is the distance to the start of the falloff region (-1 = everywhere)": "这是距离衰减区域起点的距离(-1表示整个区域)",
  "This is the distance to the end of the falloff region (-1 = everywhere)": "这是到衰减区域末端的距离(-1 表示整个范围)",
  "This is the maximum weight for this lookup": "这是该查找操作允许的最大权重值",
  "This is the lookup table filename": "这是查找表的文件名",
  "Duration of fade in on when enabled.": "启用时的淡入持续时间. ",
  "Dration of fade out on when disabled.": "禁用时渐隐效果的持续时间. ",
  "An exclusive color_correction entity disables and fades out all other color corrections when it is enabled. There should only be one active exclusive color_correction ent at any time.": "启用独占型色彩校正实体后, 所有其他色彩校正功能均会被禁用并逐渐失效. 任何时候系统中只能有一个处于激活状态的独占型色彩校正实体. ",
  "This is the duration for the lookup to fade in/out on extry/exit": "这是指进入/退出时淡入淡出效果的持续时间",
  "Name of the next keyframe along this keyframe path.": "当前关键帧路径上下一个关键帧的名称. ",
  "The direction the brushes will move, when told to.": "画笔在收到指令后的移动方向. ",
  "Position of brush when spawned. The range is a value between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "画笔生成时的位置. 该值的范围为 0.0 到 1.0, 其中 0 表示起始位置, 1 表示起始位置加上(移动方向 × 移动距离). ",
  "The entity may be authored in one of three positions for convenience.": "为方便操作, 该实体可在以下三个位置中的任意一个进行创建. ",
  "Just moves the entity and anything attached to it, without going the expensive process of finding and pushing potentially blocking brush entities and NPCs. Will still push dynamic physics entities.": "仅移动实体及其附属物, 而无需执行耗费资源的步骤去检测并推开可能阻挡路径的植被实体或NPC. 不过动态物理实体仍会被推开. ",
  "The speed that the brush moves, in inches per second.": "画笔移动的速度, 单位:英寸/秒. ",
  "The distance from the starting point that the brush should move, in inches.": "画笔从起始点开始移动的距离, 单位为英寸. ",
  "The amount of damage to do to any entity that blocks the brushes, per frame.": "每帧对阻挡画笔路径的任何实体造成的伤害值. ",
  "Create a navigation obstacle to assist NPC pathfinding": "创建导航障碍物以帮助NPC规划路径",
  "Create a navigation mesh that moves with the brush.": "创建一个随画笔移动的导航网格. ",
  "If this entity creates a movable nav mesh, then allow docking test across the entire entity.": "如果此实体生成了可移动的导航网格, 则允许在整个实体范围内进行停靠测试. ",
  "The maximum rotation speed of the brushes, in degrees per second.": "刷子的最大旋转速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "The amount of rotational friction. Value must be between 0 and 100 %.": "旋转摩擦力的大小. 该数值必须介于 0 到 100% 之间. ",
  "Sound to play while rotating.": "旋转时播放的音效. ",
  "The volume of the rotation sound.": "旋转音效的音量. ",
  "Damage done to any entity that blocks the rotation, per frame.": "每帧对阻碍旋转的任何实体造成的伤害值. ",
  "Just rotates the entity and anything attached to it, without going the expensive process of finding and pushing potentially blocking brush entities and NPCs. Will still push dynamic physics entities.": "仅旋转实体及其附属物, 无需执行复杂的运算来检测并推开可能阻挡路径的植被实体和NPC. 不过动态物理实体仍会被推开. ",
  "The sound to play when the brush moves.": "画笔移动时播放的音效. ",
  "The sound to play when the brush stops moving.": "画笔停止移动时播放的声音. ",
  "Speed at which the brush rotates, in degrees per second.": "画笔旋转速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "The vertical distance from the starting position that this platform moves. If negative, the platform will lower.": "该平台从起始位置开始移动的垂直距离. 若值为负数, 则平台会下降. ",
  "The amount this platform should rotate as it moves, in degrees.": "该平台在移动时应旋转的角度, 单位为度. ",
  "How much extra length the rope has (by default it has the length between its two endpoints in the editor).": "这条绳子的额外长度是多少(默认情况下, 其长度即编辑器中两端点之间的距离). ",
  "Number of subdivisions between each rope segment. Maximum value is 8. Higher values make smoother ropes, but are slower to render.": "每个绳索线段之间的细分数量. 最大值为 8. 数值越大, 绳索看起来越平滑, 但渲染速度会变慢. ",
  "Test effect that makes the rope look sharper and more barbed.": "测试效果:使绳索看起来更清晰且带有更多倒刺. ",
  "Width of the rope.": "绳索的宽度. ",
  "This changes the texture resolution. The default resolution is 4 pixels per inch. Larger values stretch the texture and smaller values scrunch it up.": "此设置可调整纹理分辨率. 默认分辨率为每英寸4像素. 数值越大纹理越拉伸, 数值越小则纹理越压缩. ",
  "Whether the rope starts out detached from its target endpoint.": "绳索初始时是否未与目标端点相连. ",
  "Whether the rope can be detached from either endpoint when shot.": "子弹击中后, 绳索是否可从任意一端断开. ",
  "Whether the rope be blown by the wind (enabling this is expensive!)": "绳索是否受风影响(启用此功能成本很高! )",
  "The material to use when rendering the rope.": "渲染绳索时所使用的材质. ",
  "Curve Type. Currently only type 2 (Rope) is fully supported.": "曲线类型. 目前仅类型 2(绳索)得到了完全支持. ",
  "Place localization text here and it will be displayed in tooltips, etc.": "在此处填写本地化文本, 该文本将会显示在工具提示等位置. ",
  "Sound event played when the button is successfully used.": "按钮被成功使用时播放的声音事件. ",
  "Sound played when the player tries to use the button, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家尝试使用被锁定的按钮时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the button is unlocked.": "按钮解锁时播放的音效. ",
  "Specifies the direction of motion to move when the button is used.": "指定使用该按钮时移动的方向. ",
  "The speed that the button moves, in inches per second.": "按钮移动的速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "The name of an entity that will get the +use glow for this button.": "将获得此按钮的'使用发光效果'的实体名称. ",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the button has been pressed before it returns to the starting position. Once it has returned, it can be used again. If the value is set to -1, the button never returns.": "按钮被按下后, 经过多少秒才会恢复到初始位置. 恢复后便可再次使用. 若设置为 -1, 则按钮永远不会复位. ",
  "The amount, in inches, of the button to leave sticking out of the wall it recedes into when pressed. Negative values make the button recede even further into the wall.": "按钮按下后, 从其嵌入的墙面中伸出的长度, 单位以英寸计. 若输入负值, 则按钮会更深入墙面内部. ",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this button cannot be pressed.": "旧版支持:主实体的名称. 若主实体尚未激活, 则无法点击此按钮. ",
  "Specify an override for the GetUsePreviewAction for this button (the anticipation type)": "请为此按钮的 GetUsePreviewAction 指定一个覆盖值(即预期类型).  (the anticipation type)",
  "NPC movement and collision will ignore this button": "NPC移动与碰撞将忽略此按钮",
  "Legacy support: The name of a master entity. If the master hasn't been activated, this button cannot be used.": "旧版支持:主实体的名称. 若该主实体尚未激活, 则此按钮无法使用. ",
  "The speed that the button rotates, in degrees per second.": "按钮旋转的速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Legacy method of specifying whether or not the button can be shot to activate it. Use the 'Damage Activates' spawnflag instead.": "传统的设置方式, 用于指定是否可通过射击来激活按钮. 请改用'Damage Activates'生成标志. ",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the button should rotate when it's pressed.": "按钮被按下时应旋转的角度值, 单位为度. ",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the wheel turns per second.": "滚轮每秒转动的度数. ",
  "The maximum amount, in degrees, that the wheel is allowed to rotate.": "滚轮允许旋转的最大角度值. ",
  "If the 'Toggle' spawnflag is not set, the speed at which the wheel auto-returns when left alone, in degrees per second.": "如果未设置'Toggle'生成标志, 则指车轮在无人操控时自动回正的速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Postion when spawned. The value is a range between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "生成时的位置. 该值的取值范围为 0.0 到 1.0, 其中 0 表示未旋转时的位置, 1 则表示旋转后的位置加上'距离'值. ",
  "The speed at which the door moves.": "门移动的速度. ",
  "Sound to play when the door starts moving.": "门开始移动时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound to play when the door stops moving.": "门停止移动时播放的音效. ",
  "(Optional) Sound to play when the door starts closing.": "(可选)门开始关闭时播放的音效. ",
  "(Optional) Sound to play when the door stops closing.": "(可选)门停止关闭时播放的音效. ",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the door has opened before it closes. Once it has closed, it can be used again. If the value is set to -1, the door never closes itself.": "门打开后, 经过多少秒会自动关闭. 关闭后便可再次使用. 若此值设为 -1, 则门不会自动关闭. ",
  "Amount of damage done to entities that block the movement of this door, per frame.": "每帧内对阻挡此门移动的实体造成的伤害值. ",
  "If set, this door will close no matter what. Useful for doors that have to close even if the player tries to block them with objects.": "设置后, 此门将无论如何都会关闭. 适用于那些即便玩家试图用物体挡住也必须关闭的门. ",
  "If set this will change the door's collision group to one that ignore collisions with debris objects (note that this is not compatible with the non-solid-to-player spawnflag).": "如果启用此选项, 门的碰撞组将被设置为忽略与碎片物体的碰撞(请注意, 此设置与'玩家无法穿透'生成标志不兼容). ",
  "Sound played when the player tries to use the door, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家尝试使用门锁着的门时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the door is unlocked.": "门解锁时播放的音效. ",
  "If set to true, the door's 'Start Sound' will be continually looped until the door finishes moving.": "如果设为 true, 则门的'启动音效'会持续循环播放, 直至门的移动结束. ",
  "The direction the door will move, when it opens.": "门在打开时的移动方向. ",
  "Filter to use to determine entities that block the door. ( Half-Life: Source port only )": "用于确定哪些实体会阻挡门开启的过滤条件. (仅适用于《半条命:Source》移植版)",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "道具开始淡出的距离(<0 表示从 fademaxdist 值中减去该数值). ",
  "Max fade distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out)": "道具可见的最大渐隐距离(0 = 不渐隐)",
  "The name of any doors that should be slaved to this door (i.e. should open when this one opens, and close when this one closes).": "应与此门联动的所有门的名称(即:当此门打开时它们也应打开, 当此门关闭时它们也应关闭). ",
  "If the door 'Spawn Position' is set to Ajar, this is the angle to spawn at, relative to the closed position.": "如果将门的'生成位置'设为'半开状态', 此数值即表示相对于门完全关闭状态时的生成角度. ",
  "By default, Ajar doors always open fully when +USEd. If this is set to true, Ajar doors will stop opening if they cross the close position.": "默认情况下, 使用 +USE 操作时半开状态的门总会完全打开. 若将此选项设为 true, 则半开状态的门在越过完全关闭的位置后便会停止开启. ",
  "The amount, in degrees, that the door should rotate when opened.": "门在打开时应旋转的角度值, 单位为度. ",
  "Sound played when the door has finished opening.": "门完全打开时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the door has finished closing.": "门完全关闭时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the door starts to move.": "门开始移动时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the player tries to move the door while the latch is engaged.": "当门锁已锁定且玩家试图移动门时播放的音效. ",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the door has opened before it closes. If the value is set to -1, the door never closes itself.": "门打开后, 自动关闭前所等待的时间, 以秒为单位. 若此值设为 -1, 则门不会自动关闭. ",
  "Sound played when the player tries to open the door, and fails because it's locked.": "玩家试图打开门但因门被锁住而失败时播放的音效. ",
  "Sound played when the door's latch is engaged.": "门锁合上时播放的声音. ",
  "Force the door to open only forwards or only backwards. Both directions is the standard door behavior.": "强制设置门只能向前或向后打开. 默认情况下, 门可双向打开. ",
  "Number of particles to spawn, per second.": "每秒生成的粒子数量. ",
  "Maximum speed that the particles can move after spawning.": "粒子生成后可达到的最大移动速度. ",
  "Minimum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between this and 'Maximum Particle Lifetime'.": "每个粒子死亡前的最短存活时间. 粒子的实际存活时间会在此值与'最大粒子存活时间'之间随机生成. ",
  "Maximum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between 'Minimum Particle Lifetime' and this.": "每个粒子存活的最大时长(以秒为单位). 粒子的实际存活时间会在'最小粒子存活时间'与此值之间随机取值. ",
  "Maximum distance at which particles are visible. They fade to translucent at this distance.": "粒子可见的最大距离. 在此距离处, 粒子会逐渐变为半透明状态. ",
  "When set, this entity spawns the number of particles in SpawnRate immediately, and then goes inactive.": "设置后, 该实体会立即生成指定数量的粒子, 随后进入非激活状态. ",
  "Model to use for animation sequences.": "用于动画序列的模型. ",
  "If set, this specifies a global state to check before firing. The OnMapSpawn output will only fire if the global state is set.": "若设置了此项, 则它定义了触发前需要检查的全局状态. 只有在该全局状态已设置的情况下, 'OnMapSpawn'输出才会被触发. ",
  "Initial value for the input value.": "输入值的初始值. ",
  "The value to compare against.": "待比较的值. ",
  "Initial value for the boolean value (0 or 1).": "布尔值的初始值(0 或 1). ",
  "The name of one or more logic_branches (wildcards allowed).": "一个或多个 logic_branches 的名称(支持通配符). ",
  "Activity Event type to fire.": "要触发的活动事件类型. ",
  "Name of the entity the event will be associated with. If unspecified, it will be 'this'.": "该事件所关联的实体名称. 如果未指定, 则默认为'this'. ",
  "Name of the entity to check distance from": "需要计算距离的实体名称",
  "The minimum count threshold of all npcs": "所有NPC的最小数量阈值",
  "The maximum count threshold of all npcs": "所有NPC的最大数量上限",
  "The minimum count of all npcs for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的所有NPC的最小数量",
  "The maximum count of all npcs for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的所有NPC的最大数量",
  "Only match NPCs in this state": "仅匹配处于此状态的NPC",
  "The minimum count threshold of npc 1": "NPC 1的最小计数阈值",
  "The maximum count threshold of npc 1": "NPC1的最大数量阈值",
  "The minimum count of npc 1 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的最低NPC数量为1",
  "The maximum count of npc 1 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的NPC 1最大数量",
  "The default minimum player distance of npc 1": "NPC 1的默认最小玩家距离",
  "The minimum count threshold of npc 2": "NPC 2的最低计数阈值",
  "The maximum count threshold of npc 2": "NPC 2的最大计数阈值",
  "The minimum count of npc 2 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的最小NPC数量:2",
  "The maximum count of npc 2 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的NPC数量上限为2",
  "The default minimum player distance of npc 2": "NPC 2的默认最小玩家距离",
  "The minimum count threshold of npc 3": "NPC 3的最小计数阈值",
  "The maximum count threshold of npc 3": "NPC 3的最大数量阈值",
  "The minimum count of npc 3 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的最低NPC数量为3",
  "The maximum count of npc 3 for factor calculations": "用于因子计算的最大NPC数量:3",
  "The default minimum player distance of npc 3": "NPC 3的默认最小玩家距离为 3",
  "Maximum distance to test for NPC": "可测试的NPC最大距离",
  "Deletes the logic relay after firing an OnTrigger() or a connected OnSpawn() output": "在调用 OnTrigger() 或关联的 OnSpawn() 输出后删除逻辑中继",
  "Without this, the logic_relay will wait until all inputs connected to OnTrigger() have fired before retriggering": "若未设置此选项, logic_relay将一直等待所有连接到OnTrigger()的输入信号触发后, 才会再次触发",
  "If set, this logic_relay will be ignored by !caller in downstream IO connections. Instead, the previous caller in the IO chain will be found by !caller.": "如果设置了此选项, 下游 IO 连接中的 !caller 将会忽略该 logic_relay. 此时, !caller 会转而寻找 IO 链中的上一个调用者. ",
  "If 'Use Random Time' is set, this is the minimum time between timer fires. The time will be a random number between this and the 'Maximum Random Interval'.": "若勾选了'使用随机时间', 此值即表示定时器触发的最小间隔. 实际间隔时间将在此值与'最大随机间隔'之间随机生成. ",
  "If 'Use Random Time' is set, this is the maximum time between timer fires. The time will be a random number between the 'Minimum Random Interval' and this.": "若选中'使用随机时间', 此值即为定时器触发间隔的最大值. 实际间隔时间会在'最小随机间隔'与此值之间随机生成. ",
  "If 'Use Random Time' isn't set, this is the time between timer fires, in seconds.": "若未勾选'使用随机时间', 此值即为定时器触发间隔的秒数. ",
  "Time to wait after the timer is enabled before firing the first time. Negative values can be used to avoid ": "计时器启用后, 直至第一次触发所需的等待时间. 也可使用负值以避免触发 ",
  "Do not send this entity's information back to hammer during hammer_update_safe_entities": "请勿在 hammer_update_safe_entities 过程中将此实体的信息发送回 Hammer",
  "First entity.  Must be a single entity unless \"Support multiple entities with same name\" is specified.": "第一个实体. 该实体必须是唯一的, 除非已勾选'支持多个同名实体'. ",
  "Second entity.  Must be a single entity unless \"Support multiple entities with same name\" is specified.": "第二个实体. 该实体必须是唯一的, 除非已勾选'支持同名多个实体'选项. ",
  "If true, we affect all entities matching our attachment names. If false, we only affect the first entity found matching each attachment name.": "若为 true, 则会影响所有名称与附件名称相匹配的实体; 若为 false, 则仅影响每个附件名称所对应的第一个匹配实体. ",
  "Disable collision between the entire hierarchies of the two entities, instead of just the individual entities themselves.": "禁用两个实体的整个层级结构之间的碰撞检测, 而不仅仅是针对单个实体本身. ",
  "Input values below this value will be ignored.": "低于此值的输入内容将被忽略. ",
  "Input values above this value will be ignored.": "高于此值的输入内容将被忽略. ",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Minimum Valid Input Value', this is the output value.": "当输入值等于'最小有效输入值'时, 此值为输出值. ",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Maximum Valid Input Value', this is the output value.": "当输入值等于'最大有效输入值'时, 此即为输出值. ",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Minimum Valid Input Value', this is the output RGB color.": "当输入值等于'最小有效输入值'时, 此即为输出的 RGB 颜色. ",
  "When the input value is equal to 'Maximum Valid Input Value', this is the output RGB color.": "当输入值等于'最大合法输入值'时, 此即为输出的 RGB 颜色. ",
  "Starting value for the counter.": "计数器的初始值. ",
  "Minimum legal value for the counter. If min=0 and max=0, no clamping is performed.": "计数器的最低合法值. 如果最小值和最大值均为0, 则不会进行数值限制. ",
  "Maximum legal value for the counter. If min=0 and max=0, no clamping is performed.": "计数器的最大合法值. 如果最小值和最大值均为0, 则不进行数值限制. ",
  "Name of the entity the line should start from.": "该行起始处的实体名称. ",
  "Name of the entity that line should end at.": "线条的终点所对应的实体名称. ",
  "If set, the save will discard any savedata from previous levels, for the purpose of keeping savegame filesizes down. Can only be safely used if there is no way for the player to return to previous levels.": "启用后, 保存操作会清除之前各关卡的存档数据, 以控制存档文件的大小. 此功能仅在玩家无法返回到之前的关卡时才能安全使用. ",
  "Don't save dangerous when player has less than this many hitpoints.": "当玩家的生命值低于此数值时, 请勿保存危险状态. ",
  "Minimum hitpoints required to commit to save. The save will be made if you have at least Minimum Hit Points, but when the autosave timer expires, the autosave is only kept if you have at least Min Hitpoints to Commit.": "进行保存操作所需的最低生命值. 当你的生命值不低于该数值时即可执行保存; 而在自动保存计时器到期后, 只有生命值仍不低于此最低值才能成功完成自动保存. ",
  "Start looking for an opportunity to save if player drops below this hitpoint level.": "当玩家的生命值低于此数值时, 开始寻找节省资源的机会. ",
  "If started looking for an opportunity, save when hitpoints reach this level.": "一旦开始寻找机会, 当生命值降至此数值时请保存. ",
  "If > 0, how long to try and get a save off before giving up": "若数值大于0, 则表示在放弃前尝试保存的最长时间",
  "If 0, just autosave. Otherwise, do an autosavedangerous with this time threshold": "如果为 0, 则仅执行自动保存. 否则, 会在达到该时间阈值后执行自动保存",
  "Name of the world layer which this entity will control": "此实体将要控制的世界图层的名称",
  "If you select Child Spawn Group, it means the world layer is dependent on resources in the parent map that defines the info_worldlayer. For example, the dota world layers containing the dire and radiant bases refer to the tree maps of the main dota map. They would need to be set as Child spawn groups.": "若选择'子生成组', 则表示该世界图层依赖于父地图中用于定义 info_worldlayer 的相关资源. 例如, 包含天辉与夜魇基地的 Dota 世界图层便引用了主 Dota 地图中的树木图层, 此类图层均应设置为'子生成组'. ",
  "Allows you to asynchronously spawn the entities referred to by the point template, which will happen at some point later after all dependent resources are downlaoded from UGC servers + asynch streamed in. Asynch point templates have the benefit that they don't precache resources that we never spawn.": "该功能可让您异步生成点模板所引用的实体. 在 UGC 服务器上下载并流式加载所有依赖资源后, 这些实体便会在稍后生成. 使用异步点模板的优势在于:它不会预先缓存那些我们最终并不会生成的资源. ",
  "The amount of seconds after which, if any client hasn't finished streaming the necessary assets, that client is disconnected and the template spawns anyways. Only used in asynchronous point_templates. 0 means use some reasonable default set in the code.": "该时间值表示:若某个客户端在指定秒数内仍未完成所需资源的加载, 系统将断开该客户端的连接, 而模板仍会正常生成. 此设置仅适用于异步类型的 point_templates. 若值为 0, 则表示使用代码中设定的合理默认值. ",
  "Name of an entity filter that can be run on the entities in the template to modify, add, or remove the entities. These filters can be defined in code or in script.": "这是一种实体过滤器, 可应用于模板中的实体以实现修改、添加或删除操作. 此类过滤器既可通过代码定义, 也可通过脚本定义. ",
  "This controls the behavior of client only entities spawned by the point_template. Either you can create them only for clients that are currently connected at the point the point_template is spawned (good for transient things like explosions), or you can create them for clients who connect after the point_template is spawned. This behavior only affects point_templates that create their own spawn groups.": "该设置用于控制由 point_template 生成的仅对客户端可见的实体的行为. 您可以选择仅在 point_template 生成时为当前已连接的客户端创建这些实体(适用于爆炸效果等瞬时出现的物体), 也可以选择在 point_template 生成后为后续连接的客户端创建这些实体. 此设置仅对那些会自行创建生成组的 point_template 生效. ",
  "Name of the point_template to spawn here. If there is an offset between the point_template and its spawned entities in hammer, that offset will be maintained when spawning happens relative to the env_entity_maker.": "在此处生成的点模板的名称. 如果在 Hammer 编辑器中该点模板与其生成的实体之间存在偏移, 那么在通过 env_entity_maker 生成实体时, 该偏移量也将被保留. ",
  "If specified, all the entities created in the template will move this fast in the specified PostSpawn Movement Direction.": "若已指定该参数, 则模板中创建的所有实体都会以该速度沿设定的 PostSpawn 移动方向移动. ",
  "If a PostSpawn Movement Speed is specified, this angle will be added to the movement direction all the entities created by the template.": "如果指定了生成后移动速度, 则此角度会被加到由该模板创建的所有实体的移动方向上. ",
  "This variance is applied to the PostSpawn Movement Direction for each spawned entity in the template. Use it to apply some randomness to the directions.": "此偏移值会作用于模板中每个生成实体的'生成后移动方向'. 利用它可为各实体的移动方向添加随机性. ",
  "If checked, uses the parent's forward vector as the spawn direction. Otherwise uses the entity maker's forward.": "勾选后, 将使用父实体的前向向量作为生成方向; 否则使用实体生成器的前向方向. ",
  "If set to Allow, only entities who match the criteria will pass the filter. ": "如果设置为'允许', 只有符合条件的实体才能通过过滤器.  ",
  "Whether to negate the result of the subfilters, after combining them using the Logic Type chosen.<br>": "是否在按照所选逻辑类型组合各子过滤器后, 对最终结果取反",
  "Activator filter to test.": "待测试的激活器过滤器. ",
  "The name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于过滤的名称. 如果过滤模式为'允许', 则仅显示名称符合该条件的实体 ",
  "The model to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于过滤的模型. 如果过滤模式为'允许', 则仅包含满足条件的实体 ",
  "The context to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities that ": "用于过滤的上下文条件. 如果过滤模式设为'允许', 则仅会包含符合条件的实体 ",
  "The class name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于过滤的类名. 如果过滤模式设为'允许', 则仅包含符合该条件的实体 ",
  "The mass to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于过滤的权重值. 若过滤模式设为'允许', 则仅匹配权重值符合要求的实体 ",
  "The damage type to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only damage types that ": "需要筛选的伤害类型. 若筛选模式设为'允许', 则仅包含指定的伤害类型 ",
  "The attribute to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities who ": "用于过滤的属性. 若过滤模式设为'允许', 则仅符合该条件的实体才会被 ",
  "The classname or entity name to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于筛选的类名或实体名称. 如果筛选模式为'允许', 则仅包含符合条件的实体 ",
  "Radius by which to test the proximity of the enemy.  If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于检测敌方单位距离的半径值. 若过滤模式设为'允许', 则仅对满足以下条件的实体生效 ",
  "Enemies outside this radius are considered invalid if Allow is set and valid if Disallow is set.": "当'允许'选项被选中时, 此半径范围外的敌人被视为无效; 若选择'禁止', 则视为有效. ",
  "Maximum number of squadmates allowed to target any given entity.": "允许同时以任意实体为目标的小队成员数量上限. ",
  "Radius by which to test the proximity.": "用于测试邻近度的半径值. ",
  "The name of the modifier to filter entities by": "用于筛选实体的修饰符名称",
  "Name of the entity whose angles will be sensed.": "将要感应角度的实体的名称. ",
  "The entity we want to check to see if the Target Entity is looking at.": "我们要检查的目标实体, 即被观察的实体. ",
  "The amount of time the Target Entity must look at the 'Look at Entity' to trigger this entity, in seconds.": "目标实体必须注视'注视目标实体'的时长, 以秒为单位, 该时长达到后方可触发此实体. ",
  "The tolerance, in degrees, in the checking to determine when the Target Entity is looking at the Look At Entity.": "用于判断目标实体是否正在注视'注视目标实体'的容差范围, 单位为度. ",
  "Name of the entity whose angular velocity will be sensed.": "将要检测角速度的实体名称. ",
  "The threshold angular velocity to compare against, in degrees per second.": "用于对比的阈值角速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Angular velocity must cross the threshold for at least this long to fire.": "角速度必须持续超过阈值至少这一时长才会触发. ",
  "Use axis helper to determine rotation values (clockwise/counter-clockwise).": "使用坐标轴辅助工具来确定旋转值(顺时针/逆时针). ",
  "Name of the entity whose velocity will be sensed.": "将要检测其速度的实体名称. ",
  "Whether or not to start enabled and active.": "是否以已启用且活跃的状态启动. ",
  "Amount of time in seconds over which to average the measured velocity, 0=instantaneous.": "用于计算测量速度平均值的时长, 以秒为单位; 0表示瞬时值. ",
  "Name of the entity that will be teleported.": "将被传送的实体名称. ",
  "If specified, only this entity will take damage. Otherwise, all entities within the Radius will take damage.": "若指定了特定实体, 则只有该实体会受到伤害; 否则半径范围内的所有实体均会受到伤害. ",
  "All entities within this radius of this entity will take damage. If a 'Target Entity' is specified, only that entity will take damage.": "在此实体的指定半径范围内的所有实体都会受到伤害. 若指定了'目标实体', 则只有该实体会受到伤害. ",
  "Damage done to all affected entities each time this entity fires.": "每次该实体发射时, 对所有受影响的实体造成的伤害值. ",
  "Delay between refires, in seconds.": "两次发射之间的延迟时间, 以秒为单位. ",
  "Type of damage to inflict on entities damaged.": "对受到伤害的实体施加的损伤类型. ",
  "If set this entity will not particpate in the physics pre-settle during compile, but will start awake in game.": "若启用此选项, 该实体在编译阶段将不参与物理预结算, 但在游戏中会处于唤醒状态. ",
  "Override the mass of the object instead of calculating it based on the size / shape and material.": "可手动指定物体质量, 而无需根据其大小、形状及材质来计算. ",
  "A scale multiplier for the object's mass. 0 = use auto-calculated mass based on the object's size / shape and material": "用于调整物体质量的缩放系数. 0表示根据物体的大小、形状及材质自动计算质量",
  "Offset in local space applied to the object's center of mass.": "应用于物体质心的局部空间偏移量. ",
  "Scale on the buoyancy forces applied to this object (not including fluid drag)": "此物体所受浮力的大小(不含流体阻力) (not including fluid drag)",
  "Scale on fluid forces applied to this object (not including buoyancy)": "受作用于该对象的流体作用力影响而产生的缩放比例(不包括浮力) (not including buoyancy)",
  "Override the default collision group": "覆盖默认的碰撞组",
  "If specified, this object will start motion disabled. Once its health has dropped below this specified amount, it will enable motion.": "若设置了该参数, 此对象初始状态为无法移动. 当其生命值降至设定的数值以下时, 即可开始移动. ",
  "If specified, this object will start motion disabled. Any impact that imparts a force greater than this value on the physbox will enable motion.": "若设置了该参数, 此对象初始状态为不可运动. 任何对物理盒体施加的力只要超过此数值, 都会使其开始运动. ",
  "Enables OnPlayerUse output being fired when this object is used": "启用后, 当此对象被使用时会触发 OnPlayerUse 输出",
  "Number of points of damage to take before breaking.  0 means don't break.": "承受多少点伤害后才会损坏. 0 表示不会损坏. ",
  "If the hoverposeflags Position flag is set, this position is the position which the object should move when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "若设置了悬停姿态标志中的'位置'标志, 则该位置即为玩家使用物理枪或按下 +USE 键拿起物体后, 物体应当移动到的位置. ",
  "If the hoverposeflags Angles flag is set, this angle is the angle which the object should orient to when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "若启用了 hoverposeflags 中的 Angles 标志, 则此角度即为玩家使用物理枪或按下 +USE 键拿起物体时, 该物体应朝向的角度. ",
  "When set to 0 OnStartTouch events are never sent. Otherwise it's a delay in seconds before another OnStartTouch is sent for the same entity.": "如果设置为 0, 则永远不会发送 OnStartTouch 事件. 否则, 该值表示针对同一实体再次发送 OnStartTouch 事件前的延迟时间(以秒为单位). ",
  "If set, we'll attach to the body / location corresponding to this attachment.": "若勾选此项, 系统将把内容附加到与此附件对应的主体/位置上. ",
  "The amount of impulse an impact must apply to the constraint to break it. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the constrainted objects.": "使约束断裂所需的冲击力大小. 一种计算方法是将该值设为某个物体的质量 - 当该物体静止在受约束物体上时便足以导致约束断裂. ",
  "The amount of angular impulse required to break the constraint. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "解除约束所需的角冲量数值. 一种计算方法为:取任意参考质量, 乘以解除约束所需的物体质心到作用点的距离. ",
  "A sound played when the constraint is broken.": "当约束条件被破坏时播放的音效. ",
  "If one object teleports more than this many units away it will cause the other constrained object to teleport to an appropriate relative position.": "如果某个对象传送的距离超过此数值, 就会导致另一个受约束的对象也传送到相应的相对位置. ",
  "If true, the joint will not affect the motion of Entity 1. Entity 2 will just follow Entity 1.": "如果设为true, 该关节将不会影响实体1的运动, 此时实体2只会跟随实体1. ",
  "The entity to align to the desired angles.": "需要调整到指定角度的实体. ",
  "The maximum angular velocity that this controller can compensate for, in degrees per second.": "该控制器能够补偿的最大角速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Forces the upright behavior to have perfect damping, instead of progressively damping.": "强制使垂直方向的阻尼效果达到完美状态, 而非逐步增强阻尼. ",
  "Use the helper. Drag it out to match the virtual spring.": "使用辅助工具. 将其拖出来以匹配虚拟弹簧. ",
  "How long the spring would be if it was at rest (nothing hanging on it or attached). 0 means the length of the helper.": "弹簧在静止状态下(即没有任何物体悬挂或连接时)的长度. 数值为0则表示使用辅助长度值. ",
  "Scale on the rest length. You can use this to easily make the spring start out stretched. e.g. a value of 0.75 here means the spring will spawn stretched by ~25%.": "基于原始长度进行缩放. 您可以利用此参数让弹簧初始时处于拉伸状态. 例如, 若此处设置为0.75, 则弹簧生成时会被拉伸约25%. ",
  "The stiffness of the spring.  The larger the number the less the spring will stretch. The maximum should be not more than 30!": "弹簧的硬度. 数值越大, 弹簧的伸长幅度就越小. 该数值最大值不应超过30! ",
  "How much energy the spring loses. Values less than one give you an osscilating spring. A value of one makes the spring return without overshooting": "弹簧的能量损耗量. 小于1的值会使弹簧产生振荡现象. 值为1时, 弹簧能平稳复位而不会超调",
  "When travelling below this many units/sec, will not play any sound.": "当移动速度低于此数值(单位:单位/秒)时, 将不会播放任何声音. ",
  "When travelling at this speed or above, will play sound at full volume.": "当速度达到或超过此值时, 将以最大音量播放声音. ",
  "Play this sound when travelling forward on helper axis": "在沿辅助轴向前移动时播放此声音",
  "Play this sound when travelling backward on helper axis": "在辅助轴上向后移动时播放此声音",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the small reversal sound.": "当沿与行进方向相反的方向加速且加速度超过此数值(单位:单位/秒²)时, 播放轻微的倒车音效. ",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the medium reversal sound.": "当加速度的大小超过此数值(单位:单位/秒²)且方向与行进方向相反时, 播放中等强度的倒车音效. ",
  "When accelerating by more than this many units/sec^2 opposite to direction of travel, play the large reversal sound.": "当沿与行进方向相反的方向加速且加速度超过指定数值(单位:单位/秒²)时, 播放大幅转向音效. ",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the small threshold but less than medium": "当反向滑动幅度略超小阈值但还未达到中等幅度时播放此音效",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the medium threshold but less than large": "当反向速度超过中等阈值但未达到较高水平时播放此声音",
  "Play this sound when making a hard reverse over the large threshold": "当反向移动幅度超过设定阈值时播放此音效",
  "Resistance/friction in the hinge. A value of 1 will hold the child object still under gravity": "铰链处的阻力/摩擦力. 数值为1时, 子对象在重力作用下将保持静止",
  "Minimum rotation limit around hinge axis": "围绕铰链轴的最小旋转限制",
  "Maximum rotation limit around hinge axis": "围绕铰链轴的最大旋转限制",
  "Initial rotation of the hinge (values -1 to 1 where -1 mean open at minimum limit and 1 means open at maximum limit)": "铰链的初始旋转角度(取值范围为 -1 至 1, 其中 -1 表示处于最小开度, 1 表示处于最大开度) (values -1 to 1 where -1 mean open at minimum limit and 1 means open at maximum limit)",
  "Range 0 - 30 (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)": "范围:0 - 30(仅在通过角度输入值来控制相对角度时使用) (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)",
  "Range 0 - 1 (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)": "范围:0 - 1(仅在通过角度输入值控制相对角度时使用) (only used when driving the relative angle through the angle input)",
  "Scale of the load connected to this hinge (1=just the objects directly connected)": "与此铰链相连的负载规模(1表示仅包含直接连接的物体)",
  "Resistance/friction in the hinge": "铰链处的阻力/摩擦力",
  "Resistance/friction in the constraint": "约束中的阻力/摩擦力",
  "Limit relative rotation away from the constraint's Z axis": "限制绕约束的Z轴产生的相对旋转",
  "Maximum swing angle in degrees, if the swing limit is enabled": "启用摆动限制时, 最大摆动角度(单位为度)",
  "Limit relative rotation about the Z axis": "限制绕Z轴的相对旋转",
  "Minimum relative twist angle in degrees, if the twist limit is enabled": "启用扭曲限制时, 最小的相对扭曲角度(单位为度)",
  "Maximum relative twist angle in degrees, if the twist limit is enabled": "启用扭曲限制时, 最大相对扭曲角度(单位为度)",
  "If set, search for a physics body that corresponds with the given bone.": "若勾选此选项, 则会搜索与指定骨骼对应的物理体. ",
  "Linear spring frequency (stiffness).": "线性弹簧频率(刚度). ",
  "Linear spring damping ratio.": "线性弹簧阻尼比. ",
  "Angular spring frequency (stiffness).": "Angular弹簧频率(刚度). ",
  "Angular spring damping ratio.": "Angular弹簧阻尼比. ",
  "Add (or subtract) this amount to the rest length of the pulley rope.": "将此数值加到或减去滑轮绳的剩余长度中. ",
  "The position of the pulley for Entity 2. The pulley for Entity 1 is the origin of this constraint entity. Entity 1 is always suspended from pulley point 1, and Entity 2 is always suspended from pulley point 2.": "实体2所对应的滑轮位置. 实体1的滑轮即为此约束实体的原点. 实体1始终悬挂在滑轮点1处, 而实体2则始终悬挂在滑轮点2处. ",
  "Scale of the mass load connected to this constraint (1=just the objects directly connected)": "与此约束关联的负载规模(1表示仅包含直接相连的对象)",
  "Initial offset in the range from -1 to 1 where -1 means spawn at the min limit, 0 means apply no offset, and 1 means spawn at max limit": "初始偏移值的取值范围为 -1 到 1, 其中 -1 表示生成位置为最小值边界, 0 表示无偏移, 1 表示生成位置为最大值边界",
  "Range 0 - 30 (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "范围:0 - 30(仅在通过偏移量输入项设置相对偏移量时使用) (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)",
  "Range 0 - 1 (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "范围:0 - 1(仅在通过偏移量输入值来设置相对偏移量时使用) (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)",
  "Measured in multiples (e.g. 10x) of the mass where zero means NO limit (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)": "该数值以质量的若干倍来表示(例如 10倍), 值为零表示无限制(仅当通过偏移量输入项来设置相对偏移量时才会使用) (only used when driving the relative offset through the offset input)",
  "Force joint position as constraint pivot": "强制将关节位置设为约束枢轴",
  "Add (or subtract) this amount to the rest length of the rope.": "将此数值加到或从中减去绳索的剩余长度. ",
  "If the constraint is not rigid, this is the minimum length it can be.": "如果该约束并非强制要求, 则此为允许的最小长度. ",
  "The position the rope attaches to object 2": "绳子与物体2的连接位置",
  "-180 min and 180 max = no constraint on this axis.": "-180 为最小值, 180 为最大值, 表示该轴不受任何限制. ",
  "If true, the joint anchors on each entity will be set to match the transform of the constraint entity. If false, the anchors will be set to the specified attachment points, or the physics body origins if no attachments are specified.": "若设为 true, 各个实体上的关节锚点将被设置为与约束实体的变换属性相匹配. 若设为 false, 锚点则会被设置为指定的附着点; 若未指定任何附着点, 则设置为物理体的原点. ",
  "0 for no damping and 1 for critical damping": "0 表示无阻尼, 1 表示临界阻尼",
  "Prevents the object from moving off the ends of the spline. Don't use on splines that are meant to loop.": "可防止对象移出样条线的端点范围. 切勿用于需要形成循环的样条线. ",
  "Resistance/friction for movement along the spline": "沿样条曲线移动时的阻力/摩擦力",
  "When changing splines (e.g. via SetSplineEntity), we smoothly transition the constraint anchor to the new spline over this time interval.": "当更改样条曲线时(例如通过 SetSplineEntity 函数), 我们会在此时间段内将约束锚点平滑地过渡到新的样条曲线上. ",
  "Notify our path when the attached entity moves along it so it can fire passthrough events, etc.": "当所关联的实体沿着路径移动时, 通知该路径以便其触发穿透事件等. ",
  "Object to apply the force to.": "要施加作用力的对象. ",
  "Automatic shut-off after this time has passed (0 = stay on forever or until deactivated)": "超过指定时间后自动关闭(0 = 保持开启状态或直到手动关闭)",
  "Force (will be integrated, units are force kg*in/s^2)": "力(将会被整合使用, 单位为千克·英寸/秒^2)",
  "Angular speed (units are degress/second)": "角速度(单位为度/秒)",
  "Friction that slows the object's rotation when the motor is disabled. Start with a very small value between 0 and 1, and tune from there.": "当电机关闭时, 该参数会产生摩擦力以减缓物体的旋转. 建议先设置一个 0 到 1 之间的极小值, 再根据实际情况进行调整. ",
  "spin up time in seconds (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)": "启动所需时间, 以秒为单位(此值也会影响速度变化的频率) (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)",
  "spin down time in seconds (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)": "转速下降所需时间, 以秒为单位(同时也会影响转速变化的速率) (also affects the rate at which speed changes happen)",
  "Make this larger if the object being driven is constrained to a set of heavier objects.": "如果被驱动的对象受到一组更重物体的约束, 请将其数值调大. ",
  "Object to apply the force to": "要施加作用力的对象",
  "Object the other side of the motor joint is attached to. If blank, the motor is anchored to the world.": "连接到电机关节另一侧的对象. 如果留空, 则电机会固定在世界中. ",
  "The amount of impulse necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the magnet.": "使卡在磁铁上的物体脱离所需的冲量大小. 一种计算方法是将该值设为:若该物体静止放置在磁铁上, 能够使其脱离磁铁吸附力的物体的质量. ",
  "The amount of angular impulse necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "使卡住的物体从磁铁上脱离所需的角度冲量. 一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以使约束解除所需的静止距离(即该距离从物体质心算起). ",
  "A scale multiplier for the object's mass.": "物体质量的缩放倍率. ",
  "The maximum number of physics objects that can be stuck to the magnet at once. 0 = no limit.": "一次可吸附到磁铁上的物理对象最大数量. 0 表示无限制. ",
  "Used to disable shadow casting fromthis entity.": "用于禁用此实体投射阴影的功能. ",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out).": "道具可见的最大距离(0 = 不渐隐). ",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility": "如果为 true, 此几何形状将被用作预计算可见性时的遮挡物",
  "Allow the model to use its animgraph it has one. If the model has no animgraph this setting has no effect and is disabled": "允许模型使用其自带的动画图. 如果模型没有动画图, 此设置将不起作用且会被禁用",
  "The name of a starting animation that this prop will start with when it spawns. After completion, it will switch to the Idle sequence, if it is specified. This setting is ignored for models with an animgraph when Use Animgraph is enabled.": "此属性所控制的模型生成时会先播放的初始动画名称. 播放完成后, 若已指定闲置动画, 则会切换至该动画. 当启用'使用动画图'功能时, 此设置对具备动画图的模型无效. ",
  "The name of the idle animation that this prop will revert to whenever it finishes a random or forced animation. This setting is ignored for models with an animgraph when Use Animgraph is enabled.": "此道具在完成任意随机或强制动画后, 将恢复为对应的闲置动画. 当'使用动画图'选项被启用时, 对于含有动画图的模型而言此设置会被忽略. ",
  "If set, this prop will randomize its cycle when it begins animating. Use this to desynchronize animating props that use the same model.": "若设置了该属性, 则其在开始动画时会随机改变循环周期. 此功能可用于让使用相同模型的多个动画属性不同步. ",
  "Enable to lag compensate this prop, should be use very sparingly!": "启用后可对该物体进行延迟补偿, 但请谨慎使用! ",
  "Enable this to animate on the server in multiplayer games, such as for props with triggers parented to attachment points. Use sparingly as there is a performance cost.": "启用此选项后, 即可在多人游戏中于服务器端实现动画效果, 例如让绑定到附着点的触发器对象产生动画. 不过由于会增加性能开销, 请谨慎使用. ",
  "comma-separated list of interaction layers to interact as": "可交互的互动层列表, 各项以逗号分隔",
  "If set, NPC movement will ignore this prop": "设置后, NPC的移动将忽略此物体",
  "Some props have multiple matieral variations called Material Groups, here you can see what material groups are available for selection.": "某些道具拥有多种材质变体, 这些变体被称为材质组; 在这里您可以查看可供选择的材质组有哪些. ",
  "If a value is selected, it will be applied as the collision property to all of the phsyics shapes generated by this instance of the model, overriding any values specified in the model.": "若已选择某个值, 该值将作为碰撞属性应用于此模型实例所生成的所有物理形状, 并覆盖模型中设定的任何相关值. ",
  "Selects whether to use lightmapping or lightprobes for this mesh. Note: Selecting light probes will disable mesh merging/batching, creating extra draw calls. To merge lightprobed meshes, enable the Bake to World parameter.": "选择为此网格使用光照贴图还是光照探针. 注意:选择使用光照探针会禁用网格合并/批处理功能, 从而导致产生更多绘制调用. 若需合并使用了光照探针的网格, 请启用'烘焙到世界空间'参数. ",
  "Selects the type of shadows that should be cast from this prop_static.": "选择此 prop_static 应投射的阴影类型. ",
  "Allow this prop to emit lighting. Note that this only works on materials with Self Illum parameters, and is only visible in the GPU Path Tracing Preview and in the final lightmap bake.": "允许此属性发射光照. 请注意, 此功能仅适用于具有自发光参数的材质, 且仅在 GPU 路径追踪预览模式及最终生成的光照贴图中可见. ",
  "Used to boost emissive lighting from a mesh. Note that boosting emissive on smaller meshes can create more lighting artifacts/noise.": "用于增强网格模型的自发光光照效果. 请注意, 对较小的网格增强自发光效果可能会导致出现更多光照瑕疵或噪点. ",
  "Used to scale the resolution of the lightmap for this mesh.": "用于调整此网格的光照贴图分辨率. ",
  "Bakes the mesh as if it were double-sided geometry in the lightmapper. Useful on geometry with 'Render Backfaces' enabled via it's material (such as foliage). When the lightmapper sees many and/or large backfaces it will invalidate lightmap samples as an optimization, which can lead to lightmap errors/reduced quality in some circumstances.": "该选项会让光照贴图生成器将网格视为双面几何体来处理. 对于那些通过材质启用了'渲染背面'功能的几何体(如植被)尤为有用. 不过, 当光照贴图生成器检测到大量或较大的背面面片时, 出于优化考虑它会将这些面片从计算中排除, 这在某些情况下可能导致光照贴图出现错误或质量下降. ",
  "If true this geometry is used as an occluder for precomputed visibility. As a rule this geometry should be as simplistic as possible": "若设为 true, 此几何体将被用作预计算可见性时的遮挡物. 通常来说, 此几何体应尽可能简化",
  "This will override all materials on a selected mesh with a specific material": "此操作会将选定网格上的所有材质替换为指定的材质",
  "Auto for standard LOD behaviour, or select an explicit LOD to use. Note that LODs take up more room in the lightmap and do not merge, potentially making them less performant if used on many objects (Set to Auto).": "选择'自动'即可采用标准的LOD机制; 也可直接指定要使用的LOD等级. 请注意, 使用LOD会占用更多的光照贴图空间且无法进行合并处理; 若大量物体都使用LOD, 可能会导致性能下降(建议设为'自动'). ",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (-1 = use fademaxdist).": "物体开始逐渐淡出的距离(-1 表示使用 fademaxdist 的值). ",
  "If true mesh will be baked/merged into the world geometry of the map so that the model is not referenced at runtime. Use this if you want light probed static meshes to merge": "若设为 true, 网格将会被烘焙并合并到地图的世界几何体中, 这样在运行时便不再引用该模型. 如果您希望带有光照探针的静态网格能够合并, 请使用此选项",
  "If true this will not be merged with other geometry during map compile (reduces rendering efficiency).": "若设为 true, 在地图编译时该几何对象将不会与其他几何对象合并(但会降低渲染效率). ",
  "Render this object with other dynamic objects": "将此对象与其他动态对象一同渲染",
  "Cloth scale (stretch) relative to model scale. Use to stretch (not scale) the model, e.g. to reuse a single rope model when different lengths of the rope needed.": "布料缩放比例(拉伸效果)相对于模型缩放比例而言. 该参数用于对模型进行拉伸处理(而非整体缩放), 例如当需要不同长度的绳索时, 可借此重复使用同一绳索模型. ",
  "The prop will ignore any damage events if the damage is less than this amount.": "如果损伤数值小于此值, 该属性将忽略所有损伤事件. ",
  "Use this to override how far this object casts shadows. 0 = default distance.": "使用此选项可自定义该对象投射阴影的范围. 0 表示使用默认距离. ",
  "Scales damage energy when this object is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.<br>Set to 1.0 for materials as strong as flesh, smaller numbers indicate stronger materials.": "当该对象受到物理物体撞击时, 可按比例调整所受伤害的幅度. 注意:为保持向后兼容性, 数值设为0即表示禁用此功能. <br>对于硬度与人体组织相当的材料, 可设为1.0; 数值越小则表示材料的硬度越高. ",
  "Set to true so the player can bash this with held props.": "设置为 true 后, 玩家便可使用手持道具敲击该物体. ",
  "Scales the angular mass of an object. Used to hack angular damage and collision response.": "用于调整物体的角质量, 可借此修改角向伤害值及碰撞响应效果. ",
  "Scales how water forces affect this object.": "用于控制水流作用力对此对象的影响程度. ",
  "If specified this object will use this addon behavior when installed in a composite AI": "若指定此项, 该对象在被集成到复合式 AI 中时将采用此插件行为",
  "If set, NPCs will ignore this prop when navigating.": "设置后, NPC在移动时会忽略此道具. ",
  "If set, don't auto-create a navmesh blocker.": "若勾选此选项, 则不会自动创建导航网格阻挡物. ",
  "If set, this prop will automatically convert back to interactive debris after coming to rest as Debris.": "若已设置, 此属性会使原本处于'碎片'静止状态的物体自动恢复为可交互状态. ",
  "If set, nav mesh will be constantly updated while this obstacle is moving, and not just when this obstacle is settled.": "如果勾选此项, 在此障碍物移动时导航网格也会持续更新, 而不仅限于障碍物静止之后. ",
  "If set, this obstacle will cut the mesh causing NPC's to avoid it regardless of its mass.": "若启用此选项, 该障碍物将阻断网格路径, 使得 NPC 无论其质量大小都会绕道而行. ",
  "If set, this obstacle will be merged with nearby obstacles to improve performance.": "若启用此选项, 该障碍物将与附近的障碍物合并以提高性能. ",
  "Subclass name of the entity to spawn when the crate is broken": "当箱子被打破时需生成的实体子类名称",
  "Number of items to emit upon breakage": "破损时需生成的物品数量",
  "Prop Data names defined in propdata.vdata are typically defined in the VMDL used by this prop. For prototyping, this allows you to select a specific one and ignore the name in the VMDL.": "在 propdata.vdata 中定义的道具数据名称, 通常也会出现在该道具所使用的 VMDL 文件中. 在原型制作阶段, 这样就能直接选择所需的名称, 而无需受 VMDL 中定义的名称限制. ",
  "Disables rendering fixup on bones that become separated": "禁用对发生分离的骨骼进行渲染修正",
  "Filled in by the engine via wc_update_entity, do not edit by hand except to clear.": "此字段由引擎通过 wc_update_entity 自动填充, 除非需要清空, 否则请勿手动修改. ",
  "Scale on the buoyancy / fluid forces applied to this object": "该对象受浮力/流体力影响的缩放比例",
  "Name of the entity that this ornament should attach to, at startup.": "程序启动时, 此装饰物应附着到哪个实体上. ",
  "Subclass of the Vehicle.": "车辆的子类. ",
  "Set the game mass by hand instead of using the code defaults.": "手动设置游戏质量数值, 而无需使用代码默认值. ",
  "Should this entity block or not-block LOS": "是否应阻止该实体视线遮挡?",
  "The Type of Precipitation.": "降水类型. ",
  "The speed at which the target moves along its path.": "目标沿路径移动的速度. ",
  "The name of the first path_track entity in the path that this target should follow.": "此目标应沿其行进的路径上, 第一个 path_track 实体的名称. ",
  "The amount of damage taken before this target is killed.": "该目标在被击杀前承受的伤害总量. ",
  "Number of Fish in this Pool": "此水池中的鱼的数量",
  "How far away a Fish can wander (max 255)": "鱼可以游动的最大距离(最大值为255) (max 255)",
  "The sound played whenever the platform starts moving.": "平台开始移动时播放的音效. ",
  "The sound played when the platform stops moving.": "平台停止移动时播放的音效. ",
  "The vertical height above the track that the train moves. Negative values moves the train below.": "火车在轨道上方的垂直高度. 负值则会使火车位于轨道下方. ",
  "The name of the first path_track in the train's path. The train ": "列车路径中第一个 path_track 的名称. 该列车 ",
  "The maximum speed that this train can move. ": "该列车能够达到的最高速度.  ",
  "The speed that the train will move at after it spawns, 0 = stopped.": "列车生成后将以该速度行驶, 0 表示静止. ",
  "The method through which this train changes its velocity as it moves along the path.": "该列车沿轨道行驶时改变速度的方式. ",
  "The method through which this train changes its orientation as it moves along the path.": "该火车沿路径行进时改变朝向的方式. ",
  "Used for turning and stopping.": "用于启动和停止. ",
  "The height above the track that this train moves.": "该列车行驶时距离轨道的高度. ",
  "The amount of damage this train does to entities that block it.": "该列车对阻挡它的实体造成的伤害量. ",
  "A sound that is played (and looped) while the train is moving.": "列车行驶时播放的音效(会循环播放). ",
  "A sound that is played more frequently as the train speeds up.": "随着火车加速, 这种声音出现的频率也会随之增加. ",
  "A sound played when the train starts moving.": "火车开始移动时播放的音效. ",
  "A sound played when the train stops moving.": "火车停止移动时播放的音效. ",
  "The sound pitch value that the train will approach as it comes to a stop.": "列车即将停稳时其音高值. ",
  "The sound pitch value that the train will approach as it approaches its ": "列车靠近终点时所要达到的音调值 ",
  "Minimum interval at which to play the move ping sound.": "播放移动提示音的最小时间间隔. ",
  "Maximum interval at which to play the move ping sound.": "播放移动提示音的最大间隔时长. ",
  "The target train to control when the player uses these controls.": "玩家使用这些控制方式时, 所要控制的目标列车. ",
  "The tanktrain_ai entity to change the target of.": "需要更改目标的 tanktrain_ai 实体. ",
  "The entity to tell the tanktrain_ai to target.": "指定要让 tanktrain_ai 攻击的目标实体. ",
  "The next path_track in the path.": "路径上的下一个 path_track. ",
  "An alternative path_track to be the next node in the path. Useful for making branching paths. Use the ToggleAlternatePath / EnableAlternatePath inputs to make the alternative path active.": "可作为路径中下一个节点的备用 path_track. 此功能适用于创建分支路径. 使用 ToggleAlternatePath 或 EnableAlternatePath 输入项即可激活该备用路径. ",
  "When the train reaches this path_track, it will set its speed to this speed. ": "当列车抵达该路径节点时, 其速度将被设置为指定数值.  ",
  "Used by NPCs who follow track paths (attack chopper/gunship). This tells them the maximum distance they're allowed to be from the path at this node.": "供沿路径移动的NPC使用(用于攻击武装直升机/炮艇). 该数值指定了在此节点处NPC可偏离路径的最大距离. ",
  "The way that the path follower faces as it moves through this path track.": "路径跟随器沿着路径移动时的朝向方式. ",
  "The number of seconds the player must survive before this autosave takes effect.": "玩家必须存活的秒数, 之后此自动保存才会生效. ",
  "If >0 allow re-triggering after the specified number of seconds passes": "若值大于0, 则允许在经过指定的秒数后重新触发",
  "The amount of damage done to entities that touch this trigger. The damage is done every half-second. See also 'Damage Model' for extra details on how damage can be dealt.": "触碰此触发器的实体所受到的伤害量. 该伤害每半秒触发一次. 关于伤害机制的更多详情, 请参见'伤害模型'. ",
  "Maximum damage dealt per second. This field is only used if you select the Doubling w/Forgiveness damage model, via the spawnflag.": "每秒可造成的最大伤害值. 仅当您通过 spawnflag 选择'双倍伤害并允许修复'伤害模型时, 此字段才会被使用. ",
  "How damage is dealt. Normal always does the specified amount of damage each half second. Doubling starts with the specified amount and doubles it each time it hurts the toucher. Forgiveness means that if the toucher gets out of the trigger the damage will reset to the specified value. Good for making triggers that are deadly over time without having to cause massive damage on each touch.": "伤害机制说明:普通模式会在每半秒造成固定数值的伤害. 双倍模式则从指定数值开始, 每次造成伤害后该数值都会翻倍. 宽容模式是指当触碰者脱离触发区域后, 伤害数值会重置为初始值. 此机制非常适合设计那种随着时间推移才会造成致命伤害、且每次触碰不会产生过大伤害的触发区域. ",
  "When doubling with forgiveness, how many seconds the trigger must go without hurting anything before the damage is reset.": "启用'容错模式'时, 触发器必须保持数秒未对任何物体造成伤害, 伤害值才会重置. ",
  "Should the damaged entity receive no physics force from this trigger.": "受损坏的实体是否不应承受此触发器产生的物理作用力. ",
  "Normally triggers think every half second, in some cases you may need to request it to damage every frame.  This is expensive!": "通常情况下, 该指令每隔半秒触发一次; 但在某些情况下, 您可能需要强制其每帧都造成伤害. 不过这么做代价很高哦! ",
  "Amount of time, in seconds, after the trigger_multiple has triggered before it can be triggered again. If set to -1, it will never trigger again (in which case you should just use a trigger_once).": "该参数以秒为单位, 表示 trigger_multiple 触发后需等待多长时间才能再次触发. 若设置为 -1, 则该触发器永远不会再次触发(这种情况下建议使用 trigger_once). ",
  "The rate, in seconds, that the trigger updates the OpVar": "触发器更新操作变量的频率, 单位以秒计",
  "The minimum value the opvar will be set to": "该操作变量可被设置的最小值",
  "The maximum value the opvar will be set to": "该操作变量可被设置的最大值",
  "The size of the center portion of the trigger volume.": "触发区域中心部分的尺寸. ",
  "In 2D mode the trigger only measures position along the x and y axes, not the z.": "在二维模式下, 触发器仅能测量 x 轴和 y 轴上的位置, 无法测量 z 轴. ",
  "The name of the entity to be looked at.": "待查看实体的名称. ",
  "The time, in seconds, that the player must look the target before firing the output. Resets if player leaves trigger, or looks outside the Field of View threshold.": "玩家在发射输出信号前必须注视目标的时长, 单位为秒. 若玩家离开触发区域或视线超出视野阈值, 该计时器将重置. ",
  "How close the player has to be looking at the target.<br><br> 1.0 = straight ahead<br> 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees<br> -1.0 = all directions": "玩家需要将视线对准目标的角度范围. <br><br> 1.0 = 正前方<br> 0.0 = 前后各90度范围内<br> -1.0 = 任意方向",
  "In 2D mode the look angle FOV is only checked along the x and y axes, not the z.": "在 2D 模式下, 视角范围的检测仅沿着 X 轴和 Y 轴进行, 不会涉及 Z 轴. ",
  "The time, in seconds, to wait after player enters the trigger before firing the OnTimeout output, 0 = never. NOTE: When the timeout expires, the OnTrigger output does NOT fire!": "玩家进入触发器后, 触发 OnTimeout 输出前需要等待的秒数; 0 表示永不触发. 注意:超时时间到了之后, OnTrigger 输出并不会触发! ",
  "If set, player must have clear LOS to the target (ignoring dynamic entities).": "若勾选此选项, 玩家必须能清楚看到目标(忽略动态实体). ",
  "If set, player must have clear LOS to the target (all visible collision).": "若勾选此选项, 玩家必须能清楚看到目标(无任何遮挡物). ",
  "Angles indicating the direction to push touched entities.": "用于指示推动被触摸实体的方向的角度. ",
  "The speed at which to push entities away, in inches / second.": "将实体推开的速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "Trigger on start touch instead of on touch.": "在触摸开始时触发, 而非在触摸时触发. ",
  "The baseline for how hard the wind blows.": "风力的基准值. ",
  "Noise added to wind speed +/-": "添加到风速的数值范围 +/-",
  "Noise added to wind direction.": "添加到风向中的噪声. ",
  "Baseline for how long to wait before changing wind.": "设置改变风力前需要等待的时长基准值. ",
  "Noise added to how long to wait before changing wind.": "用于调整切换风力前的等待时间时产生的随机噪声. ",
  "The strength of the impact. Negative values reverse the direction.": "冲击强度. 负值会反转方向. ",
  "The amount of directional noise (0-1). 0 = no noise, 1 = random direction.": "方向性噪声的强度值(0-1). 0 表示无噪声, 1 表示随机方向. ",
  "The amount to kick player's view if the player is in the trigger.  Proportional to magnitude (0-1).": "当玩家处于触发区域内时, 用于调整玩家视角的偏移量. 该值与幅度成正比(范围:0-1). ",
  "The name of a target entity who's origin is the point to measure the player's distance from.": "目标实体的名称, 该实体的位置即为计算玩家距离的参照点. ",
  "The radius to which the distance should be mapped. If the player is outside the radius he will be ignored.": "距离映射所依据的半径范围. 如果玩家处于该半径范围之外, 则会被忽略. ",
  "The entity specifying the point to which entities should be teleported.": "用于指定实体应被传送到的位置的实体. ",
  "If specified, then teleported entities are offset from the target by their initial offset from the landmark.": "若已指定该参数, 则被传送的实体会相对于目标位置产生偏移, 偏移量即它们与地标的初始距离. ",
  "Rotate around landmark by relative landmark orientations": "根据相对地标方向围绕地标旋转",
  "Mirror the player teleport position through the plane defined by the trigger's origin and up vector": "通过由触发器原点及上方向向量确定的平面, 镜像玩家的传送位置",
  "Only teleport if there is a clear teleport destination.": "仅在存在可传送的目标位置时才执行传送. ",
  "This is the distance from the camera that water will start transitioning to cheap water, in inches.": "这是指从相机开始, 水体逐渐变为'廉价水'的距离, 单位为英寸. ",
  "This is the distance from the camera that water will finish transitioning to cheap water, in inches.": "这是指从摄像机到水体完全变为'廉价水'位置的距离, 单位为英寸. ",
  "Field of view in degrees": "视角范围(单位为度)",
  "Distance to the near plane": "到近平面的距离",
  "Distance to the far plane": "到远裁剪面的距离",
  "The near fog plane.": "近处的雾气平面. ",
  "The far fog/clipping plane.": "远景雾效/裁剪平面. ",
  "The maximum fog density. 0=no fog, 1=full fog.": "最大雾气密度. 0表示无雾, 1表示雾气最浓. ",
  "Which entity should I orient towards?": "我应该以哪个实体为参照呢?",
  "How to determine what the goal forward direction is": "如何确定前进方向的目标是什么",
  "Should the orientation be constrained?": "是否需要限制方向?",
  "Max turn rate, 0 means instantaneously point toward the target": "最大转向速率, 值为0表示可瞬间转向目标方向",
  "Vertical Field of view in degrees": "垂直视野角度(单位:度)",
  "Entity whose movement you want to measure.": "需要测量其移动情况的实体. ",
  "The movement of Entity to Measure will be measured relative to this entity.": "将实体移动到测量点时, 其移动距离将以该实体为基准进行测量. ",
  "This entity will be moved to mimic the motions of Entity to Measure.": "此实体将被移动, 以模仿'待测量实体'的动作. ",
  "The Entity to Move will move relative to this entity.": "将要移动的实体会相对于此实体进行移动. ",
  "A scale to divide the measured movements by, before applying those movements to the Entity to Move. 1 = target entity moves as much as the measured entity, 2 = target entity moves half as far as the measured entity, and 0.5 = target entity moves twice as far as the measured entity.": "该比例值用于对测量得到的移动距离进行缩放, 之后再将缩放后的距离应用于'待移动实体'. 值为1时, 目标实体移动的距离与测量实体相同; 值为2时, 目标实体移动的距离为测量实体的一半; 值为0.5时, 目标实体移动的距离为测量实体的两倍. ",
  "Used as the name of the directory to store screenshots from this camera. Must be unique within the level.": "用作存储该摄像头截图的目录名称, 该名称在同一层级中必须唯一. ",
  "FOV of this camera.": "此摄像头的视野范围. ",
  "The maximum rotation speed of the spotlight, in degrees per second.": "聚光灯的最大旋转速度, 单位为度/秒. ",
  "Length of the spotlight beam.": "聚光灯光束的长度. ",
  "Width of the spotlight beam.": "聚光灯光束的宽度. ",
  "The name that all entities will be fixed up with based upon the fix up style.": "根据修正样式, 所有实体都将被统一设置为此名称. ",
  "This indicates a map file relative to the map's file name": "这表示相对于地图文件名称而言的地图文件路径",
  "Fixup style for instanced entity names.  Uses the 'Fix Up Name' field.": "修正实例化实体名称的样式. 此功能会使用'修正名称'字段. ",
  "This is a replacement parameter.  It goes in the form of $variable value.  All entities inside of that instance that have $variable somewhere will be replaced with the value contents.  Example: $color 255 0 0": "这是一个替换参数, 其格式为 $变量名 值. 所有包含 $变量名的文本片段都会被替换为相应的数值内容. 例如:$color 255 0 0",
  "Unique name so that messages with the same key will replace each other.": "唯一名称, 这样具有相同键值的消息便会相互覆盖. ",
  "The entity to show this hint on top of. The entity used must exist on the client, info_target_instructor_hint can be parented to server only entities for this purpose.": "用于在其上方显示提示信息的实体. 所选实体必须存在于客户端上; 出于此目的, info_target_instructor_hint可设置为仅存在于服务器上的实体的子实体. ",
  "Either show at the position of the Target Entity. Or show the hint directly on the hud at a fixed position.": "可选择在目标实体的位置显示提示, 也可将提示直接显示在HUD的固定位置上. ",
  "Do we allow the hint to follow entites with nodraw set?": "我们是否允许提示信息出现在设置了 nodraw 属性的实体之后?",
  "The text of your hint.": "您的提示文本. ",
  "The text of your hint shown to only the activating player.": "该提示文字仅会显示给触发操作的玩家. ",
  "The color of the caption text": "标题文本的颜色",
  "Do we show the caption text even if the hint is occluded by a wall?": "即使提示信息被墙壁遮挡, 我们是否仍要显示说明文本呢?",
  "The icon to use when the hint is within the player's view.": "当提示信息在玩家的可视范围内时所使用的图标. ",
  "The icon to use when the hint is outside the player's view.": "当提示信息位于玩家视野之外时使用的图标. ",
  "When the hint is offscreen, do we show an icon and arrow?": "当提示信息超出屏幕范围时, 我们是否需要显示图标和箭头?",
  "If using 'show key bindings' for the onscreen icon, this field should be the command we want to show bindings for": "若要对屏幕上的图标使用'显示快捷键'功能, 此字段应填写需要显示快捷键的命令",
  "A height offset from the target entity's origin to display the hint": "从目标实体原点算起的垂直偏移量, 用于显示提示信息",
  "The icon size can pulsate": "图标大小可以动态变化",
  "The icon alpha can pulsate": "图标的透明度可呈现动态变化效果",
  "The icon can shake": "该图标可以晃动",
  "The hint will only be shown to the local player.": "该提示仅会显示给本地玩家. ",
  "The automatic timeout for the hint. 0 will persist until stopped with EndHint.": "提示的自动超时时间. 设为0则提示会一直显示, 直到调用 EndHint 才消失. ",
  "The visible range of the hint. 0 will show it at any distance.": "提示信息的可见范围. 设为0则在任何距离下均会显示. ",
  "When the player first sees it, it will automatically show for them.": "当玩家第一次看到时, 它会自动向他们显示. ",
  "Sound to play when the lesson starts": "课程开始时播放的音效",
  "Panorama Layout file to be used.  Generic Hand, World or Custom.  Custom requires specifying .xml file": "要使用的全景布局文件:通用手部、世界视图或自定义. 若选择自定义则需指定 .xml 文件",
  "Custom Path to a xml file ie - file://{resources}/layout/custom_hint.xml": "自定义 XML 文件路径, 例如:file://{resources}/layout/custom_hint.xml",
  "Attach Type for the Panorama Panel": "全景面板的附加类型",
  "The entity to show this hint on top of. The entity used must exist on the client, info_target_instructor_hint can be parented to server only entities for this purpose. Set hint_vr_panel_type": "用于显示提示信息的实体. 指定的实体必须存在于客户端中; 在此用途下, info_target_instructor_hint可设置为以仅存在于服务器上的实体为父级. 请设置 hint_vr_panel_type",
  "Height offset from the target entities root the panel should be displayed at.": "面板应显示在目标实体根节点上方的距离值. ",
  "Name of the lesson to fire.  Matches name in instructor_lessons.txt.": "要触发的课程名称. 需与 instructor_lessons.txt 中的名称一致. ",
  "Entity to attach this hint to if required by lesson": "如需使用, 请选择要关联此提示的实体",
  "Time scale to blend towards, this is a multiplicative value where 1.0 is normal time, 0.5 is half speed, 2.0 is double speed.": "要过渡到的时间缩放比例, 该值为一个乘数值:1.0表示正常速度, 0.5表示半速, 2.0则表示双倍速度. ",
  "How quickly the change per second goes up to the max.": "每秒变化值提升至最大值的速度有多快. ",
  "Minimum change per second when blending from the current timescale to the desired.": "从当前时间刻度过渡到目标时间刻度时, 每秒的最小变化量. ",
  "The per frame delta between desired and current is multiplied by this to get the maximum change per second.": "期望值与当前值之间每帧的偏差值会乘以该系数, 从而得出每秒允许的最大变化量. ",
  "The name of the fog entity associated with this volume.": "与此体积相关联的雾体实体的名称. ",
  "The name of the postprocess entity associated with this volume.": "与此体积相关的后处理实体的名称. ",
  "The name of the color_correction entity associated with this volume.": "与此卷关联的 color_correction 实体的名称. ",
  "Name of the GameSound entry to play when remapper starts getting valid inputs.": "在输入重映射器开始接收到有效输入时, 要播放的游戏音效名称. ",
  "Name of the GameSound entry to play when remapper stops getting valid inputs.": "当输入重映射器无法接收到有效输入时, 要播放的游戏音效名称. ",
  "Name of the GameSound entry for the sound to play when reaching 0.0 interp value.": "当插值值达到0.0时, 要播放的音效所对应的GameSound条目名称. ",
  "Name of the GameSound entry for the sound to play when reaching 1.0 interp value.": "当插值值达到1.0时播放的音效所对应的GameSound条目名称. ",
  "Name of the GameSound entry to update while moving between 0.0 and 1.0.": "待更新的 GameSound 条目名称, 取值范围为 0.0 至 1.0. ",
  "Tint the skybox": "为天空盒添加色调",
  "Scale brightness by this amount": "按此比例调整亮度",
  "Spawn in a broken state": "以损坏状态生成",
  "If starting broken, have no shards": "如果启动时出现异常, 则说明没有碎片",
  "If set, this helper position is used for Hit input damage.": "设置后, 此辅助位置将用于处理击中输入的伤害. ",
  "Material to swap to when damaged (optional)": "损坏时要替换的材质(可选) (optional)",
  "Use this as the active fog if there are more than one": "若存在多个雾效选项, 请将其设为当前使用的雾效",
  "Technically the scattering value. Higher values make denser fog.": "从技术层面讲, 这就是散射值. 数值越高, 雾气就越浓密. ",
  "Tint color for fog.": "雾气色调颜色. ",
  "Maximum distance to draw fog - WARNING! Changing from default will make fog blockier.": "可绘制雾效的最大距离 - 警告! 更改默认值会导致雾效呈现块状效果. ",
  "Sets the number of slices in the fog volume.  Increasing from default (128) will increase resolution at the expense of GPU time and memory": "设置雾效体积的切片数量. 若数值大于默认值(128), 分辨率会相应提高, 但也会增加GPU的运算负担及内存占用",
  "Thickness of the first slice in the volume at the camera.  The remaining slices will be warped to maintain this resolution as the draw distance is increased": "摄像机视角下, 体积模型中第一层切片的厚度. 随着绘制距离增加, 其余切片也会相应变形以保持该分辨率",
  "Distance from the eye at which fog starts to fade in.": "雾气开始逐渐消散时距离观察者的距离. ",
  "Distance from the eye at which fog finishes fading in and is at full strength.": "雾气开始完全显现、不再逐渐变浓时与观察者之间的距离. ",
  "Sets fade in or out time (in seconds).": "设置淡入或淡出时间(以秒为单位). ",
  "Speed of noise function change": "噪波函数变化速度",
  "How much noise to add to fog density": "要向雾密度中添加多少噪点",
  "Scale of noise (smaller - smoother, larger - more detailed)": "噪波强度(数值越小越平滑, 数值越大细节越丰富)",
  "Controls the fall off curve for the fog at the edges": "控制边缘处雾气的衰减曲线",
  "Override the global tint color in this fog volume.": "在此雾效体积中覆盖全局色调颜色. ",
  "Vertical depth before height fog is maximum intensity": "垂直深度在高度雾效果范围内时强度达到最大值",
  "Horizonal fade width of height fog": "高度雾效的水平渐变宽度",
  "Use LPVs for indirect lighting: higher resolution, but will not honor fog lighting enable/disable on lights": "使用LPV来实现间接光照:分辨率更高, 但无法根据灯光的设置来开启或关闭雾效光照",
  "Volume-local scalar for indirect lighting strength": "用于控制间接光照强度的体积局部标量值",
  "Volume-local scalar for sun (light_environment) light strength": "用于调节太阳光(light_environment)强度的体积局部标量值",
  "Volume-local fog noise strength": "体积局部雾气噪点强度",
  "Should the box hide objects inside or outside of its bounds. If inside is selected, any objects fully inside the box will be hidden. If outside is selected, all active visibility boxes are considered, and objects not intersecting any visibility boxes will be hidden.": "该选项用于设置是否隐藏位于方框边界内或外的对象. 若选择'边界内', 则仅隐藏完全处于方框范围内的对象; 若选择'边界外', 则会综合所有可见性方框进行判断, 隐藏那些未与任何可见性方框相交的对象. ",
  "Limit the box to culling triangles objects in the prefab to which it belongs.": "将该框限制为仅剔除其所属预制件中的三角形对象. ",
  "Limit the box to culling triangles from the specified target objects.": "将该框限制为仅剔除来自指定目标对象的三角形. ",
  "Spcifies the type of geometry which can be culled by the box": "指定可被该包围盒剔除的几何体类型",
  "A name to assign to the node that can be used to refer to the node on the path to toggle pinning on specific path nodes via entity I/O.": "为该节点指定的名称, 可用于在路径中引用该节点, 从而通过实体 I/O 功能对特定路径节点启用/禁用锁定. ",
  "Radius multiplier value": "半径倍数数值",
  "If enabled, the rope simulation treats this node a locaiton to which the rope is attached.": "启用后, 绳索模拟会将此节点视为绳索的固定点. ",
  "Will the particle system be visible on spawn": "粒子系统在生成时是否可见",
  "Max number of seconds to run the particle simulation for. A value of 0 means run the simulation indefinitely.": "粒子模拟的最大运行秒数. 值为 0 则表示无限期运行模拟. ",
  "Units between the individual partcles in the rope simulation.": "绳索模拟中各个粒子之间的距离单位. ",
  "Controls the amount the rope will drop between path nodes. Generally between 0.0 and 1.0, the value is a multiplier on the distance that particles on path can seperate relative to their initial distance.": "用于控制绳子在路径节点间的下垂程度. 该值的范围通常为 0.0 到 1.0, 表示路径上的粒子之间距离相对于初始距离可增大的倍数. ",
  "Radius of the rope.": "绳索的半径. ",
  "Create a static physics representation of the path. Note the collision is generated based on the path, movement applied by the particle system will not be included.": "创建路径的静态物理表示. 请注意, 碰撞检测是基于该路径生成的, 粒子系统所产生的运动效果将不会被纳入考量. ",
  "Surface properties to apply to the static collision if generated": "要应用于生成的静态碰撞体的表面属性",
  "Optional secondary material, can be selected using Skin(1)": "可选的辅助材质, 可通过'皮肤(1)'进行选择(1)",
  "Frequency of the Haptic pulse (0 - 100)": "触觉脉冲频率(0 - 100) (0 - 100)",
  "Amplitude of haptic pulse (0.0 - 1.0)": "触觉脉冲幅度(0.0 - 1.0)",
  "Duration of the haptic pulse in seconds": "触觉脉冲持续时间, 单位:秒",
  "Model to use.": "要使用的模型. ",
  "Name of the sound event that contains the commentary audio for this node.": "包含此节点解说音频的声音事件名称. ",
  "Title of this commentary node.": "此评论节点的标题. ",
  "Name(s) of the speaker(s) in the commentary audio for this node.": "此节点解说音频中发言者的姓名. ",
  "The unique number of this node in the current level. If left at 0, the first unused Node ID will be calculated at runtime.": "当前层级下该节点的唯一编号. 若设置为0, 则运行时会自动分配首个未被使用的节点编号. ",
  "A set of console commands, separated by semi-colon, that should be issued when this node starts playing.": "一组控制台命令, 使用分号分隔, 此节点开始播放时需执行这些命令. ",
  "A set of console commands, separated by semi-colon, that should be issued when this node stops playing (due to completion or interruption).": "一组用分号分隔的控制台命令, 在此节点停止播放时(因播放完成或被中断)需执行这些命令. ",
  "Optional name of an entity that the player's view will be forced to look at when listening to this node.": "可选参数:当玩家正在收听此节点时, 其视角会被强制对准的实体名称. ",
  "Optional name of an entity that the player's view should move to when listening to this node.": "可选参数:当播放此节点时, 玩家视角应对准的实体名称. ",
  "Teleport position associated with this node. If players use Mouse2 to jump to the next node, they'll be moved to that node's corresponding teleport position.": "与此节点关联的传送位置. 如果玩家按下鼠标右键跳转到下一个节点, 他们将被传送至该节点对应的传送位置. ",
  "If set, the player will be unable to move while this node is playing.": "若启用此选项, 在该节点播放期间玩家将无法移动. ",
  "If set, this node will be disabled on startup, and will require the Enable input to be fired before it will be visible to the player.": "若设置了此选项, 该节点将在启动时处于禁用状态, 必须触发'启用'指令后玩家才能看到它. ",
  "If multiple volumes contain an object, the highest priority volume takes precedence.": "如果多个卷中都包含同一对象, 则优先级最高的卷将优先被使用. ",
  "Name of the light probe texture": "光照探针纹理的名称",
  "Can be moved, parented, enabled, or disabled at runtime.": "可在运行时进行移动、设置父对象, 以及启用或禁用. ",
  "Name of the cubemap texture": "立方体贴图纹理的名称",
  "Near clip plane used for the camera when baking the cube map": "生成立方体贴图时供摄像机使用的近裁剪面",
  "Far clip plane used for the camera when baking the cube map": "在烘焙立方体贴图时, 相机使用的远裁剪面",
  "The radius of influence for this cubemap": "此立方体贴图的影响半径",
  "Brightness Units": "亮度单位",
  "Legacy brightness value": "原有的亮度值",
  "How direct lighting should be represented: Static=Fully baked into lightmap (cheapest), Stationary=Dynamic direct light with baked shadows, Dynamic=Fully dynamic (Most expensive)": "直接光照的呈现方式:静态=完全烘焙至光照贴图中(成本最低); 固定=动态的直接光照但阴影已烘焙; 动态=完全动态计算(成本最高) (Most expensive)",
  "How to calculate the light's color": "如何计算光的颜色",
  "Brightness in lumens. (See Light Units group for alternative units of measurement).": "亮度, 单位为流明. (有关其他计量单位, 请参阅'光照单位'组). ",
  "Clamps the distance that a light can reach.": "限制光源的照射距离. ",
  "Controls the light falloff based on the set Range.": "根据设定的范围来控制光线衰减效果. ",
  "Controls the light falloff from the light source.": "用于控制光源的光线衰减效果. ",
  "How indirect (bounce) light should be computed": "如何计算间接(反射)光线",
  "Increases the intensity of indirect (bounce) light": "提高间接光线(反射光)的强度",
  "Point or area light shapes. Point produces sharp shadows whereas Disk and Rectangle are area lights, with shadow softness/falloff influenced by the Area Light Size/Width.": "点光源或区域光源形状. 点光源可产生清晰的阴影; 而圆盘形与矩形则属于区域光源, 其阴影的柔和度/渐变效果受'区域光源尺寸/宽度'参数影响. ",
  "Light source area size, this affects how light/shadows are diffused as they falloff from the light source - Larger sizes produce softer lighting. NOTE: Light Source Type: Point ignores this setting as it is not an area light": "光源区域大小, 该值会影响光线/阴影在远离光源时的扩散效果 - 值越大, 光线越柔和. 注意:对于'点光源'类型而言, 由于它不属于区域光源, 因此此设置无效",
  "Scales the light source shape non-uniformly in x/y. NOTE: Light Source Type: Point ignores this setting as it is not an area light": "在 X/Y 方向上以非均匀方式缩放光源形状. 注意:对于'点光源'类型而言, 由于它不属于区域光源, 因此会忽略此设置",
  "Controls the size & shape of the barn light's aperture, allowing for emulation of many different light types.": "可控制畜棚灯的光圈大小与形状, 从而模拟多种不同类型的灯光效果. ",
  "Blends between a circular or rectangular aperture": "可在圆形与矩形光圈之间进行混合",
  "Skews the light angle in x/y.": "调整光照角度的 X/Y 方向. ",
  "Bake specular into cubemaps. Only works when Direct Lighting Type is set to Baked.": "将镜面反射效果烘焙到立方体贴图中. 此功能仅在'直接光照类型'设置为'烘焙'时才可用. ",
  "USE WITH CAUTION: Artificially softens direct specular (not cubemaps) to simulate cheap, soft area lights. Note: Direct Lighting must be set to Stationary or Dynamic for this to have an effect.": "使用时请谨慎:该选项可人为柔化直接反射光(非立方体贴图), 以模拟廉价且柔和的区域光源效果. 注意:只有将'直接光照'设置为'静态'或'动态'时, 此选项才会生效. ",
  "Whether this light casts shadow": "此光源是否会产生阴影",
  "When this light is visible to a player, add its shadow casters to the player's PVS.": "当玩家能够看到该光源时, 需将其阴影投射物添加到玩家的PVS中. ",
  "Screen size where the shadows will begin fading out": "阴影开始逐渐淡出的屏幕区域",
  "Screen size where the shadows will be fully faded out": "阴影完全淡出时的屏幕尺寸",
  "If true, illumination from this light renders into baked cube maps.": "若设为 true, 此光源的光照效果将被渲染到预烘焙的立方体贴图中. ",
  "Scale brightness by this amount, used for scripting direct light behaviour. NOTE: Only works on lights with Direct Lighting type set to Dynamic or Stationary.": "按此比例调整亮度, 该参数用于编写控制直接光照行为的脚本. 注意:仅对'直接光照类型'设置为'动态'或'静态'的灯光生效. ",
  "Screen size where the light will begin fading out": "光线开始逐渐变暗的屏幕区域",
  "Screen size where the light will be fully faded out": "光线将完全淡出的屏幕区域",
  "Allows large lights to transmit to clients as a workaround for going out of PVS due to sv_pvs_max_distance being set too close.": "该设置允许大型光源信息传输至客户端, 以此作为一种变通方案, 解决因 sv_pvs_max_distance 数值设置过小而导致光源超出PVS范围的问题. ",
  "Light Style": "浅色风格",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent0 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent0 输出的事件名称. ",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent1 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent1 输出的事件名称. ",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent2 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent2 输出的事件名称. ",
  "Name of the event that triggers the OnStyleEvent3 output.": "触发 OnStyleEvent3 输出的事件名称. ",
  "Sets $light_emissive for use in material expressions. The emissive geometry's surface area should be approximately equal to the area light's surface area.": "设置 $light_emissive 以便用于材质表达式. 发光几何体的表面积应大致等于面光源的表面积. ",
  "Volumetric Shadow Mode": "体积阴影模式",
  "Logarithmic Fog Brightness Multiplier": "对数雾气亮度倍增系数",
  "Brightness in candelas": "亮度, 单位为坎德拉",
  "Brightness in nits": "亮度, 单位为尼特",
  "Logarithmic Brightness": "对数亮度",
  "Light Falloff based on set range.": "根据设定范围控制光线衰减. ",
  "Increases the intensity of a lights' Indirect (bounce) light": "提高灯光的间接(反射)光照强度",
  "Shape of the light": "光线形状",
  "Note: Larger sizes produce more diffuse light/shadows.": "注意:尺寸越大, 光线/阴影就越分散. ",
  "Artificially softens direct specular (not cubemaps) to simulate cheap, soft area lights. Note: Direct Lighting must be set to Stationary or Dynamic for this to have an effect.": "可人为柔化直接镜面反射效果(不适用于立方体贴图), 以模拟廉价且光线柔和的区域光源. 注意:只有将'直接光照'设置为'静态'或'动态'时, 此效果才会生效. ",
  "Render the light geometry in the world": "渲染场景中的灯光几何体",
  "Increases the intensity of a lights' Indirect (bounce) light.": "提高灯光的间接光(反射光)强度. ",
  "Used to creat hemispherical light shapes.": "用于创建半球形灯光形状. ",
  "How direct lighting should be represented": "直接照明应如何呈现",
  "If disabled, direct lighting will not render into cubemaps. Not that this only works when Direct Lighting Type is set to Stationary or Dynamic.": "如果禁用此选项, 直接光照将不会渲染到立方体贴图中. 请注意, 此设置仅在'直接光照类型'设为'静态'或'动态'时才会生效. ",
  "Defines the shadow softness. Higher numbers produce more diffuse/softer shadows. 1 is a good starting value.": "用于设置阴影的柔和度. 数值越大, 阴影越模糊/柔和. 1是个不错的起始值. ",
  "Priority for the lights shadowmap": "灯光阴影贴图的优先级",
  "Distance for near clip plane for shadow map": "阴影贴图中近裁剪面的距离",
  "Number of shadow cascades to use.": "要使用的阴影级联数量. ",
  "Size of the region at the edge of the cascade that will be crossfaded to the next (to hide resolution changes)": "渐变区域的大小:该区域位于级联边缘, 会与下一个画面进行交叉淡入淡出处理(以此隐藏分辨率变化) (to hide resolution changes)",
  "Size of the region where shadows are faded out at the end of the cascades": "级联阴影末端的渐隐区域大小",
  "Renders static objects to cascades <= this cascade when using mixed shadows (Stationary / Indexed lights)": "在使用混合阴影(静止物体/索引光源)时, 将静态物体渲染至层级中小于或等于当前层级的级联中",
  "Uses a flat color for the sky lighting. Can be a good starting point but you can get much higher quality lighting by using an IBL/env_sky.": "使用单一颜色作为天空照明. 这可以作为一个不错的起点, 不过使用IBL或环境天空贴图能获得质量更高的照明效果. ",
  "Scales the intensity of the Simple Sky Color.": "调整简单天空颜色的强度. ",
  "Here you can assign any env_sky entity for sky lighting. env_sky supports HDR/EXR high dynamic range lat-long/h-cross/v-cross skybox images is recommended for sky lighting for the best quality results. If you want to use a custom env_sky that is explicitly for sky lighting, you can use an env_sky with 'Start Disabled'.": "在此处, 您可以指定任意 env_sky 实体用作天空照明. env_sky 支持 HDR/EXR 高动态范围图像, 建议使用等距柱状投影或垂直交叉投影格式的天空盒图像以获得最佳照明效果. 若需使用专为天空照明设计的自定义 env_sky, 则可选择'初始状态为禁用'的版本. ",
  "Scale value for IBL intensity fine-tuning": "用于精细调节IBL强度的比例值",
  "This is the color of the virtual ground plane used for skybox IBL / color ambient lighting": "这是用于天空盒IBL和环境光照的虚拟地面平面的颜色",
  "This can be used to prevent the sun in your env_sky/IBL from casting light into your scene, so you can instead use a light_environment; This sets a brightness threshold beyond which light from the IBL is clamped.": "此功能可用于防止 env_sky/IBL 中的阳光照射到场景中, 这样您便可改用 light_environment; 它会设定一个亮度阈值, 超过该值后 IBL 产生的光照就会被限制在阈值范围内. ",
  "Distance range for light. 0=infinite": "光源的作用距离范围. 0表示无限",
  "Reference position.": "参考位置. ",
  "Use the reference position when calculating validity of query positions.": "计算查询位置的有效性时, 请使用参考位置. ",
  "Automatically add any markup entities to this group that overlap this volume": "自动将与此卷重叠的所有标记实体添加到此组中",
  "When auto-grouping (by prefab or by volume), include other markup_group entities in this group. By default this does not happen.": "在按预制体或体积进行自动分组时, 请将其他 markup_group 实体也包含至该组中. 默认情况下不会执行此操作. ",
  "Base keys (entry from propdata.txt)": "基础键值(来自 propdata.txt 的条目)",
  "Optionally set a material group on the created prop model.  Note that material group name comes from the prop model.": "可选择性地为创建的道具模型设置材质组. 请注意, 材质组名称取自该道具模型. ",
  "If set, cloth will trace a ray to find ground plane, ray start raised from the ": "若启用此选项, 布料会发射射线来寻找地面平面, 射线的起始位置会略微抬高 ",
  "Auto start cloth effect": "自动启动布料效果",
  "Offset for the influence point (in the space of the model or attachment)": "影响点的偏移量(以模型或附着物的空间坐标表示) (in the space of the model or attachment)",
  "Offset the influence point from the named attachment rather than the root of the model": "将影响点相对于指定附着点进行偏移, 而非相对于模型的根节点",
  "Center the influence point (will ignore cause attachment to be ignored, but still honor offset)": "将影响点居中(此操作会忽略关联设置, 但仍会保留偏移量)",
  "Limit this effect to the named piece": "将此效果仅应用于指定的片段",
  "Velocity added to each piece (radially away from the influence point)": "每个粒子获得的初速度(方向为从影响点呈放射状向外) (radially away from the influence point)",
  "Magnitude of random vector that will be added to the burst velocity": "将被加到爆发速度上的随机向量的大小",
  "Angular velocity added to each piece (Positive value will cause pieces to flip 'head-first' away from the influence point, negative is 'feet-first')": "每个碎片会被赋予一定的角速度(正值会使碎片以头部为先的方向远离作用点, 负值则使碎片以脚部为先的方向移动)",
  "Largest possible value that will be randomly added/removed to Flip Scale for each piece": "可随机添加到每个片段的翻转缩放值, 或从中减去的最大值",
  "Angular velocity added to each piece": "已将角速度添加到每个部件中",
  "Largest possible value that will be randomly added/removed to Twist Scale for each piece": "为每个片段随机添加或移除的扭曲比例的最大值",
  "If set, the particle system will only be created if the break matches the specified part name": "若勾选此选项, 仅当打断位置与指定的部件名称匹配时才会创建粒子系统",
  "(Optional) part name this is relevant to, for filtering": "(可选)与此相关的部件名称, 用于筛选",
  "(Optional) which entity to attach to, if the attachment name is also specified.": "(可选)如果同时指定了附件名称, 则指定要将其附加至的实体. ",
  "(Optional) attachment to attach this particle to.": "(可选)需要附加此粒子的目标对象. ",
  "(Optional) Set the particle control point #0 to the specified model": "(可选)将粒子控制点 #0 设置为指定的模型",
  "(Optional) Set the particle control point #0 to the specified snapshot": "(可选)将粒子控制点 #0 设置为指定的快照",
  "(Optional) Set this control point to the parent model's active materialgroup name": "(可选)将此控制点设置为父模型当前使用的材质组名称",
  "(Optional) Set this control point the position of the break damage": "(可选)设置此控制点以定义破坏发生的位置",
  "(Optional) Set this control point the direction of the break damage": "(可选)设置此控制点以确定破坏损伤的方向",
  "(Optional) Set this control point to pass through any status effects from the parent object.": "(可选)设置此控制点以使它能承受来自父对象的各种状态效果. ",
  "(Optional) Add additional data to a control Point from this break command.": "(可选)从此断点命令向某个控制点添加额外数据. ",
  "Radius within which we break nested pieces": "用于拆分嵌套片段的半径范围",
  "Uses a slower, but higher quality, solver method": "使用速度较慢但精度更高的求解方法",
  "How much health this stage has before it breaks (-1 to disable damage)": "此阶段在破碎前拥有的生命值是多少(-1表示禁用伤害) (-1 to disable damage)",
  "When this stage starts, optionally set a materialgroup": "当此阶段启动时, 可选择性地设置一个物料组",
  "When this stage is entered, set a bodygroup?": "进入此阶段后, 是否需要设置体组?",
  "Play this sequence when the stage starts": "舞台开始时播放此序列",
  "Should the sequence loop?": "是否循环播放序列?",
  "When this stage breaks, spawn this particle": "当此阶段中断时, 生成该粒子",
  "When this stage breaks, play this sound": "当此阶段中断时, 播放此音效",
  "Name of the modifier to add": "要添加的修饰符名称",
  "How long should the modifier last, in seconds? (-1: Infinite)": "修饰效果应持续多长时间, 以秒为单位?(-1:无限)",
  "Time to fade to these postprocessing settings in seconds": "淡出至这些后期处理设置所需的时间(以秒为单位)",
  "Use exposure settings for this volume?": "是否对此音量使用曝光设置?",
  "Minimum autoexposure scale": "最小自动曝光比例",
  "Maximum autoexposure scale": "最大自动曝光比例",
  "Number of stops to adjust auto-exposure by": "用于调整自动曝光的停数",
  "Is this volume active by default even when not touched by the player? (Master)": "此音量在玩家未进行任何操作时是否仍保持默认激活状态?(主音量) (Master)",
  "X is seconds, Y is brightness multiplier (1 = 100%)": "X表示秒数, Y表示亮度倍数(1即100%)",
  "Override whether this prop should block NPC's Line-Of-Sight.": "覆盖此属性是否应阻挡NPC的视线. ",
  "Override whether AI should consider this prop as walkable on.": "覆盖AI是否应将此属性视作可行走区域的设置. ",
  "Mod damage done by bullets to this prop.": "子弹对该物体造成的模组损伤值. ",
  "Mod damage done by clubs to this prop.": "棍棒对该物体造成的模组伤害值. ",
  "Mod damage done by explosives to this prop.": "爆炸物对该模型造成的模组伤害. ",
  "Mod damage done by fire to this prop.": "火焰对该物体造成的破坏值. ",
  "Enable glow": "启用发光效果",
  "Allow physics props to spawn motion-disabled": "允许物理道具生成时为运动禁用状态",
  "Allow this object to be pushed by the player capsule if it's light enough": "允许玩家控制胶囊推动此物体, 前提是该物体足够轻",
  "Allow pullable from the gravity glove/cannon": "允许通过重力手套/加农炮进行拖拽",
  "Specify a custom physics impact damage table for this prop.": "指定此道具所使用的自定义物理冲击伤害表. ",
  "Amount of damage this prop should take before breaking.": "此道具在破裂前可承受的损伤量. ",
  "Type of explosion to create": "要创建的爆炸类型",
  "Explosive damage done by this prop.": "该道具造成的爆炸伤害值. ",
  "Radius of the explosion caused by this prop when it breaks.": "此道具破碎时产生的爆炸半径. ",
  "Delay before the explosion happens.": "爆炸发生前的延迟时间. ",
  "Sound to play before the explosion happens.": "爆炸发生前播放的音效. ",
  "Allow this prop to be static as well as physically simulated.": "允许此属性既保持静态, 又能接受物理模拟. ",
  "Controls relative weighting of near and far scattering components": "用于控制近处与远处散射成分的相对权重",
  "Roughness multiplier for first lobe of dual-lobe specular": "双瓣镜面反射中第一瓣的粗糙度倍率",
  "Mix between the two roughness lobes": "在两个粗糙度分布区间之间进行混合",
  "How much the transmissive color gets more saturated with distance": "随着距离增加, 透射色的饱和度会提升多少",
  "Allows modifying the specular component's falloff": "可修改镜面反射分量的衰减效果",
  "Select a camera name to override a specific camera's CSM FOV.  Target 'default' applies to all cameras not otherwise specified.": "请选择一个摄像机名称以覆盖特定摄像机的 CSM 视野范围. 选择'默认'则适用于所有未被单独指定的摄像机. ",
  "This value will be used to override the FOV for cascading shadow maps only.  Actual camera FOV remains unchanged.": "该值仅用于覆盖级联阴影贴图的视野范围. 摄像机的实际视野范围保持不变. ",
  "Generates data which can be used to lookup lightmap UVs at a given position, useful for high-fidelity illumination of bullet decals on lightmapped geometry.": "生成可用于在指定位置查找光照贴图UV的数据, 这对在已应用光照贴图的几何体上实现高保真度的弹痕光照效果非常有用. ",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Reverb bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Reverb needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Reverb is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理模式</b>:混响烘焙功能已禁用. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 或 MapBuilder 编译地图时被清理. <br /><b>手动模式</b>:混响需手动进行烘焙. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 编译地图时被添加或更新, 而 MapBuilder 则不会对其进行任何处理. <br /><b>自动模式</b>:混响会在编译地图时自动烘焙. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 或 MapBuilder 编译地图时被添加或更新. ",
  "<b>Automatic, Everywhere</b>: When baking, probes will be generated to cover the entire map.<br/><b>Automatic, Use Probe Generation Volumes</b>: When baking, probes will only be generated within Probe Generation Volumes that have been explicitly placed in the map.<br/><b>Manual</b>: When baking, probes will not be generated. Only probes that have been manually placed in the map will be used.": "<b>自动, 全地图</b>:进行烘焙时, 系统会生成探针以覆盖整个地图. <br/><b>自动, 仅使用探针生成区域</b>:进行烘焙时, 系统只会在地图中显式设定的'探针生成区域'内生成探针. <br/><b>手动</b>:进行烘焙时不会生成任何探针; 仅使用那些手动放置到地图中的探针. ",
  "Don't generate probes inside Probe Exclusion Volumes that have been placed in the map.<br/>(Only used if Generation Type is set to Automatic, Everywhere.)": "请勿在地图上已设置的'探针排除区域'内生成探针. <br/>(仅当'生成类型'设置为'自动生成, 任意位置'时生效)",
  "Only generate probes that are near the nav mesh.<br/>(Only used if Generation Type is set to Automatic, Everywhere.)": "仅生成位于导航网格附近的探针. <br/>(仅当'生成类型'设置为'自动, 任意位置'时才生效. )",
  "The horizontal distance (in meters) between adjacent probes.": "相邻探测点之间的水平距离(单位:米). ",
  "The height (in meters) above the floor at which probes should be placed..": "探头应放置的高度(单位:米), 该高度以地面为基准. ",
  "The number of rays traced from the listener when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in more accurate reflections, at the cost of increased bake times.": "在烘焙反射或混响效果时, 从听音点发射的射线数量. 提高此数值可获得更精确的反射效果, 但会增加烘焙时间. ",
  "The number of times each ray traced from the listener is reflected when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in longer, more accurate reverb tails, at the cost of increased bake times.": "在烘焙反射或混响效果时, 每条从听者位置发出的射线所经历的反射次数. 提高此数值可生成持续时间更长且更精准的混响效果, 但也会相应增加烘焙时间. ",
  "The duration (in seconds) of the IRs generated when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in longer, more accurate reverb tails, at the cost of increased disk space usage.": "在生成反射或混响效果时, 所生成的红外采样数据的时间长度(以秒为单位). 提高此数值可获得持续时间更长且更精确的混响效果, 但也会导致占用的磁盘空间增加. ",
  "The Ambisonic order of the IRs generated when baking reflections or reverb. Increasing this value results in more accurate directional variation of reflected sound, at the cost of increased disk space usage.": "在烘焙反射声或混响时生成的脉冲响应所使用的 Ambisonic 阶数. 提高此值可让反射声的方向变化更为精确, 但会占用更多磁盘空间. ",
  "Reduces the number of probes generated by combining nearby probes that are likely to have similar reverbs.": "通过合并那些可能产生相似混响效果的相邻探针, 从而减少生成的探针数量. ",
  "Number of rays traced per side for each face of the depth cube map computed for each probe.": "为每个探针计算的深度立方体贴图中, 每个面各侧所追踪的光线数量. ",
  "If average depth map values at two probes are within this distance (in meters), then the probes are considered similar.": "若两个探针处深度图数值的平均值之差小于此数值(单位:米), 则认为这两个探针相似. ",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Pathing bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Pathing needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Pathing is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理模式</b>:路径烘焙功能已禁用. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 或地图制作工具编译地图时被清理. <br /><b>手动模式</b>:需要手动进行路径烘焙. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 编译地图时添加或更新, 但地图制作工具不会对其进行任何处理. <br /><b>自动模式</b>:路径会在编译地图时自动烘焙. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 或地图制作工具编译地图时添加或更新. ",
  "Number of point samples to use around each probe when testing whether one probe can see another. To determine if two probes are mutually visible, rays are traced from each point sample of the first probe, to every other point sample of the second probe. Increasing this value prevents paths from being considered occluded by small objects, at the cost of increased bake times.": "在测试一个探针是否能看到另一个探针时, 需要在每个探针周围采集若干点样本. 为判断两个探针是否互相可见, 需从第一个探针的各个点样本处发射光线, 并检测这些光线是否能命中第二个探针上的任意点样本. 提高该数值可避免将那些被小物体遮挡的路径误判为不可见, 但会导致烘焙时间相应增加. ",
  "When testing for mutual visibility between a pair of probes, each probe is treated as a sphere of this radius (in meters), and point samples are generated within this sphere.": "在测试两个探测器之间是否能相互看到时, 每个探测器均被视为具有此半径(单位:米)的球体, 系统会在该球体内生成若干点样本. ",
  "When tracing rays to test for mutual visibility between a pair of probes, the fraction of rays that are unoccluded must be greater than this threshold for the pair of probes to be considered mutually visible.": "在通过射线追踪来检测两个探针之间是否相互可见时, 未被遮挡的射线比例必须高于此阈值, 这两个探针才会被视为相互可见. ",
  "If the distance (in meters) between two probes is greater than this value, the probes are considered to not have any path between them. Increasing this value allows sound to propagate over greater distances, at the cost of increased bake times and memory usage.": "如果两个探测器之间的距离(单位:米)超过此值, 则系统会认为两者之间不存在可传播的声路. 增大该值可允许声音传播至更远的距离, 但也会相应增加烘焙时间和内存占用. ",
  "<b>Cleanup</b>: Custom bake is disabled. Baked data will be cleaned up during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.<br /><b>Manual</b>: Custom data needs to be baked manually. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer but untouched by mapbuilder.<br /><b>Auto</b>: Custom data is baked automatically during map compile. Baked data is added or updated during map compile in Hammer or mapbuilder.": "<b>清理模式</b>:自定义烘焙功能已禁用. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 或地图编辑器编译地图时被清理. <br /><b>手动模式</b>:需手动执行自定义数据烘焙. 烘焙后的数据会在使用 Hammer 编译地图时添加或更新, 但地图编辑器不会对其进行任何处理. <br /><b>自动模式</b>:自定义数据会在编译地图时自动烘焙. 无论使用 Hammer 还是地图编辑器, 烘焙后的数据都会被添加或更新. ",
  "Bake custom occlusion data between probe pairs.": "在探针对之间烘焙自定义的遮挡数据. ",
  "Bake occlusion dimensions data (size and inside outside) per probe.": "为每个探针烘焙遮挡尺寸数据(大小及内外状态). ",
  "Bake custom materials data (top 3 nearby materials) per probe.": "为每个探针烘焙自定义材质数据(距离最近的3种材质). ",
  "Simulate pathing when computing baked occlusion.": "计算烘焙的遮挡信息时模拟路径生成. ",
  "Simulate reflections when computing baked occlusion.": "计算烘焙遮挡时模拟反射效果. ",
  "Number of rays to simulate reflections.": "用于模拟反射的光线的数量. ",
  "Number of bounces to simulate reflections.": "用于模拟反射效果的反弹次数. ",
  "This entity's orientation in the world. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, ": "该实体在世界坐标系中的朝向. 俯仰角即围绕Y轴的旋转角度 ",
  "Which field to use to select the cubemap and its parameters.": "请选择用于指定立方体贴图及其参数的字段. ",
  "Adjust how blurry the cubemap should be. Lower values are more blurry (0-1) ": "调整立方体贴图的模糊程度. 数值越低越模糊(范围:0-1) (0-1) ",
  "Exponent for distance falloff. For example, 2.0 = proportional to square of distance": "距离衰减指数. 例如, 2.0 表示与距离的平方成正比",
  "Set the maximum opacity of the cubemap fog. (0-1)": "设置立方体贴图雾效的最大透明度. (0-1) (0-1)",
  "Set the gradient fog color.": "设置渐变雾气颜色. ",
  "For HDR color values": "用于 HDR 颜色值",
  "Set the maximum opacity of the gradient fog.": "设置渐变雾效的最大不透明度. ",
  "Exponent for distance falloff.": "距离衰减指数. ",
  "Exponent for height falloff.": "高度衰减的指数值. ",
  "How much time it takes to fade in new values.": "新数值渐显所需的时间. ",
  "Controls the Far Z distance clipping plane, beyond which geometry will be culled.": "用于控制远裁剪面的 Z 轴距离, 超出该距离的几何图形将被剔除. ",
  "Set the strength of the player visibility postprocessing effect": "设置玩家可见性后期处理效果的强度",
  "Set a multiplier on the distance used to calculate fog for players. Higher values mean the fog is pushed further away.": "设置用于计算玩家视野范围内雾气距离的倍率. 数值越高, 雾气扩散的范围就越远. ",
  "Set a multiplier on the maximum density of fog for players. Lower values mean less opaque fog.": "设置玩家可见的雾气最大密度倍数. 数值越低, 雾气越稀薄. ",
  "This should be set to match the desired HUD hint entry in the hl2\\resource\\valve_english.txt.": "此值应设置为与 hl2\\resource\\valve_english.txt 中所需的 HUD 提示条目相匹配. ",
  "Determines which spawn points get used first.  Smaller numbers are used before larger numbers.": "用于确定哪些生成点会优先被使用. 数值越小, 越先被使用. ",
  "Select a model to override the model used for enemies spawned at this spawn point.": "选择一个模型, 以替换此生成点处生成的敌人所使用的模型. ",
  "Weapons and items to give to the bot on spawn. Ex. 'vesthelm, usp, awp, smokegreande, hegrenade'": "在机器人生成时给予它的武器与物品. 例如:‘vesthelm, usp, awp, smokegreande, hegrenade’",
  "What armor should the bot spawn with.": "机器人生成时应携带什么护甲?. ",
  "Do the bots that spawn here start alseep? If so, they will wait until they see or hear the player to move.": "在这里生成的机器人会进入睡眠状态吗?如果会的话, 它们就会一直等待, 直到看到或听到玩家才开始行动. ",
  "What behavior the bot should have when idle.": "机器人在闲置状态下应呈现何种行为. ",
  "How hard the bot is to fight and what his skill level is. [0-7] (0 = super easy, 7 = super human).": "这个机器人有多难对付?它的技能水平如何?取值范围为[0-7](0表示极其简单, 7表示超人级别). ",
  "Is the bot agreesive for his difficulty level?": "这个机器人在其难度等级下是否表现得过于好斗呢?",
  "Range around the spawn spot the bot will try to hide. Set to 0 to hold position and never try to hide.": "机器人在生成点周围试图隐藏的范围. 设为0则保持原位且不会尝试隐藏. ",
  "Not used. Hostage models are chosen randomly by the game.": "未使用. 人质模型由游戏随机选取. ",
  "Allows to increase probability of this hostage being picked during random spawn selection process, essentially considering this spawn point specified number of times.": "可提升该人质在随机生成选择过程中被选中的概率, 实际上就是将此生成点被考虑的次数设为指定的数值. ",
  "Hostages sharing same spawn exclusion group will never spawn together.": "处于同一生成排除组的人质永远不会同时生成. ",
  "Allows mixed dynamic cascade shadow maps with Baked shadows.": "允许动态级联阴影贴图与预烘焙阴影混合使用. ",
  "Allows SST generation for this (sun) light.": "允许为此太阳光生成SST数据. ",
  "Relative to origin of the light_environment.": "相对于 light_environment 的原点. ",
  "Softness of Imaginary Shadowing Light.": "虚幻阴影光的柔和度. ",
  "Relative Strength of Imaginary Shadowing Light.": "虚拟阴影光照的相对强度. ",
  "Relative Strength of Ambient/Unshadowed term. Lower values make darker shadows.": "环境光/无阴影条件下的相对强度值. 数值越低, 产生的阴影越暗. ",
  "Always enable shadows for this light, regardless of any global settings.": "无论全局设置如何, 始终为此光源启用阴影. ",
  "Whether this light casts shadow. ": "此光源是否会产生阴影.  ",
  "How direct lighting should be represented: Static=Fully baked into lightmap (cheapest), Stationary=Dynamic direct light with baked shadows, Dynamic=Fully dynamic (Most expensive). NOTE: Stationary and Dynamic omni2's take up 6 dynamic shadow slots, and will likely not cast shadows if you have CSM shadows enabled in a light_environment.": "直接光照的呈现方式:  \n静态 = 完全烘焙到光照贴图中(成本最低)  \n静止 = 动态直接光照但阴影已烘焙  \n动态 = 完全动态计算(成本最高)  \n\n注意:使用'静止'或'动态'模式的泛光灯会占用6个动态阴影资源槽位; 若在 light_environment 中启用了 CSM 阴影功能, 此类灯光很可能无法投射出阴影. ",
  "You can replace the texture of any particle system specified above with a vtex. if empty the default particle behavior will happen.": "您可以将上述任意粒子系统的纹理替换为 vtex 文件. 若未指定纹理, 则会采用默认的粒子行为. ",
  "Scale multiplier of the glow. Used to remap the radius of the particle system. Written to Control Point 17 Y Value": "光晕的缩放倍数. 用于重新映射粒子系统的半径. 该值将写入控制点17的Y值中",
  "Set the light's render color (R G B). Written to Control Point 16": "设置灯光的渲染颜色(红 绿 蓝). 该值将写入控制点16",
  "float value to multiply sprite self illum by. this will affect things like bloom contribution. Written to Control Point 17 Z Value": "用于乘以精灵自发光强度的浮点数值, 该值会影响诸如光晕效果等参数. 此值将写入控制点17的Z值中",
  "Alpha Multiplier on particle system. Written to Control Point 17 X Value": "粒子系统中的 Alpha 倍率值. 该值会被写入控制点 17 的 X 坐标值中",
  "If set, control point 0 of the effect will be at this entity's location. (Otherwise it is at the env_particle_glow origin)": "若勾选此项, 特效的控制点0将位于此实体的位置. (否则将位于 env_particle_glow 的原点处) (Otherwise it is at the env_particle_glow origin)",
  "Name of .vsnap (Particle Snapshot File) to be loaded and used by this particle system (e.g. 'smoke_snapshot1.vsnap')": "待加载并供此粒子系统使用的 .vsnap 文件(粒子快照文件)的名称, 例如:'smoke_snapshot1.vsnap'",
  "Path to a panorama xml file ie - file://{resources}/layout/custom_hint.xml": "全景图 XML 文件的路径, 例如:file://{resources}/layout/custom_hint.xml",
  "Entity (or entities) whose material should be overridden with this texture": "需要将材质替换为此纹理的实体",
  "Attribute name to hook to the texture (Add dynamic expression with the same string in your VMAT)": "要绑定到纹理的属性名称(请在您的 VMAT 中添加一个字符串相同的动态表达式) (Add dynamic expression with the same string in your VMAT)",
  "Offscreen texture width": "离屏纹理宽度",
  "Offscreen texture height": "离屏纹理高度",
  "The damage filter associated with this place.": "与此地点相关的损伤过滤条件. ",
  "How likely it is to spawn at this location, default 100.": "在此位置生成的可能性, 默认为100. ",
  "How far the named region extends.": "所命名的区域的覆盖范围有多大. ",
  "Localization string token.": "本地化字符串标记. ",
  "Explosion radius.": "爆炸半径. ",
  "The name of the event that you want to listen for.": "您想要监听的事件名称. ",
  "If set, will only fire its output if the event is generated from someone of the specified team.": "若设置此选项, 则仅当事件由指定团队的成员触发时才会输出结果. ",
  "The name associated with this place.": "与此地点相关联的名称. ",
  "Team number associated with this buyzone.": "与此购买区域关联的团队编号. ",
  "Filter to use to see if activator collides with me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation. Allow means 'Allow to Block' for this entity.": "用于检测激活器是否会与我发生碰撞的过滤器. 更多说明请参见 filter_activator_name. 此处的'允许'含义为'允许进行阻挡'之意. ",
  "This is a Bomb Target designed for the Heist game mode.": "这是专为抢劫游戏模式设计的炸弹目标. ",
  "Used to manually assign a named env_cubemap, env_cubemap_box or env_combined_light_probe_volume to a mesh. Note: This forces the mesh into a slower rendering path and does not support the explicit assignment of lightprobes. Use with caution.": "用于手动为网格指定名为 env_cubemap、env_cubemap_box 或 env_combined_light_probe_volume 的资源. 注意:此操作会使网格采用较慢的渲染路径, 且不支持显式指定光照探针. 请谨慎使用. ",
  "Overrides the default radius of the explosion when the C4 bomb explodes. Max range is 2048": "用于设置C4炸弹爆炸时的作用半径. 最大作用范围值为2048",
  "Determines the target population of pets.": "确定宠物的目标群体. ",
  "Set to true if the map should use the mapper-placed spawn points instead of generating random ones.": "若要让地图使用地图编辑器设定的出生点而非随机生成的出生点, 请将此选项设为 true. ",
  "Set to true if you want to manually place info_deathmatch_spawns and not have the engine generate them.": "若希望手动设置 info_deathmatch_spawns 的值而无需由引擎自动生成, 请将其设为 true. ",
  "Sets the maximum distance bots can see enemies. Default is -1, unlimited.": "设置机器人能够看到敌人的最大距离. 默认值为 -1, 表示无限制. ",
  "Enable or disable GPU Culling of the Skybox (required for clutter in skybox).": "启用或禁用天空盒的GPU剔除功能(此功能对于处理天空盒中的杂乱物体很有必要). ",
  "Enable or disable traces for rain droplet effects.": "启用或禁用雨滴效果的追踪功能. ",
  "Controls the amount of rain splashes.": "控制雨水的飞溅程度. ",
  "Strength of the puddle ripples.": "水洼涟漪的强度. ",
  "Rotates the puddle ripples (0 to 1, i.e. 0.5 is reversed, 0.25 is 90 degrees).": "用于旋转水洼的涟漪效果(取值范围为0到1:0.5表示反转, 0.25表示旋转90度). ",
  "How wet the environment was before drying.": "干燥处理前环境的潮湿程度. ",
  "How much the environment dried out.": "环境变得多么干燥啊. ",
  "Distance to the near plane for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "在 Hammer 中, 用于预览视截体范围的近平面距离. ",
  "Distance to the far plane for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "在Hammer中用于预览视锥体时, 到远裁剪面的距离. ",
  "Render color for preview of the frustum in hammer.": "用于在 Hammer 中预览视锥体渲染颜色的参数. ",
  "Aspect ratio of the camera for preview of the frustum in hammer. ": "用于在 Hammer 中预览视锥体效果的摄像机宽高比.  ",
  "This is the horizontal field of view.": "这是水平视场角. ",
  "If the path is not constant speed, this specifies the speed of this segment.  The segment is defined as the line from this node to the next node in the direction of camera travel.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "如果路径并非以恒定速度行进, 此参数用于指定当前段落的移动速度. 该段落指的是从当前节点沿摄像机行进方向到下一个节点之间的线段. \n若路径为恒定速度行进, 则此参数将被忽略. ",
  "Percentage of the segment used to ease the speed from the previous segment to the speed of this segment.\nIf Ease In & Ease Out total to more than 100%, their values will be normalized to total 100%.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "用于将速度从前一段的速度平滑过渡到本段速度的百分比值. \n如果'缓入'与'缓出'的百分比之和超过100%, 系统会自动将其归一化至100%. \n若路径速度为恒定值, 则此设置将被忽略. ",
  "Percentage of the segment used to ease the speed from this segment to the speed of the next segment.\nIf Ease In & Ease Out total to more than 100%, their values will be normalized to total 100%.\nThis value is ignored if the path is constant speed.": "用于平滑过渡当前段落与下一段落速度的百分比值. \n如果'缓入'和'缓出'的数值之和超过100%, 则会自动标准化为总和100%. \n当路径速度为恒定值时, 此值将被忽略. ",
  "Aspect ratio of the camera.": "摄像头的宽高比. ",
  "Set to true if the camera should use vertical FOV (Default false)": "若相机需使用垂直视野范围, 请设为 true(默认值为 false) (Default false)",
  "Controls the timing of the camera.  If true the duration value on the path is used, otherwise the individual time values on the nodes are used.  (Default true)": "用于控制摄像机的计时方式. 若设为 true, 则使用路径上的持续时间值; 否则使用各节点上单独设定的时间值. (默认值为 true)  (Default true)",
  "The amount of time in seconds the camera will take to traverse the path.  Ignored if Constant Speed is false. (Default 5)": "相机沿路径移动所需的时间(以秒为单位). 若'恒定速度'设为假, 则此值将被忽略. (默认值为 5) (Default 5)",
  "Set to true if the camera animation should loop when reaching the end of the path. By default, the camera animation will hold the last frame.": "若将相机动画设置为在到达路径终点后继续循环播放, 请将此选项设为 true. 默认情况下, 相机动画会停留在最后一帧. ",
  "Name of the conveyor models that will animate along with the conveyor.": "将要与传送带一同动画显示的传送带模型名称. ",
  "The direction conveyor moves.": "传送带的移动方向. ",
  "How long it will take to transition to the new speed.": "过渡到新速度需要多长时间?. ",
  "The text that will print in the chat next to the award amount.  Will look like this:\t'1000: <Award Text>'": "该文本将显示在聊天栏中奖励金额的旁边. 显示格式为:‘1000: <奖励文本>’",
  "The team to filter by. If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "要筛选的团队. 如果筛选模式为'允许', 则仅包含符合条件的实体 ",
  "The position of this entity's center in the world. Rotating entities typically rotate around their origin.": "该实体在世界坐标系中的中心位置. 通常情况下, 实体的旋转都是围绕其原点进行的. ",
  "If enabled, causes this entity/prop to to render in fast water reflections (i.e. when a water material specifies $reflectonlymarkedentities) and in the world impostor pass.": "启用后, 该实体/道具将出现在快速水面反射效果中(即当日面材质设置为 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时), 同时也会出现在世界替身渲染阶段. ",
  "Used to disable rendering into shadow depth (for flashlight) for this entity.": "用于禁用对此实体的阴影深度渲染(适用于手电筒效果). ",
  "Used to hint projected texture system whether it is sufficient to cache shadow volume of this entity or to force render it every frame instead.": "用于提示投影纹理系统:是否只需缓存该实体的阴影体积, 或者需要每一帧都重新渲染. ",
  "Used to disable flashlight (env_projectedtexture) lighting and shadows on this entity.": "用于禁用该实体上的手电筒(env_projectedtexture)光照及阴影效果. ",
  "Some models have multiple versions of their textures, called skins. Set this to a number other than 0 to use that skin instead of the default.": "某些模型拥有多个纹理版本, 这些版本被称为皮肤. 将此值设为非 0 的数值即可使用指定的皮肤而非默认皮肤. ",
  "Some models have multiple bodygroups. Set this to a number other than 0 to use that bodygroup instead of the default.": "某些模型包含多个身体部件组. 将此值设为非 0 的数字即可使用指定的身体部件组, 而非默认组. ",
  "Used to disable dynamic shadows on this entity.": "用于禁用此实体上的动态阴影. ",
  "Name of a function in this entity's script scope which will be called automatically.": "在此实体的脚本作用域内, 会被自动调用的函数的名称. ",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (<0 = subtract from fademaxdist).": "叠加层开始淡出的距离(<0 表示从 fademaxdist 值中减去该数值). ",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under low end/medium end/XBox360,": "如果您在 worldspawn 中设置了渐变效果, 或者引擎运行在低端/中端配置或 Xbox360 上",
  "Specifies the direction to throw gibs when this breakable breaks. Be sure to select Use Precise Gib Dir in the Gibs Direction field!": "指定此可破坏物体破碎时碎片的飞散方向. 请务必在'碎片方向'字段中选择'使用精确碎片方向'! ",
  "Used by HL1Port to specify a custom gib model to break into, overriding the 'Material Type'.": "供 HL1Port 使用, 用于指定自定义的残骸模型, 从而覆盖'材质类型'设置. ",
  "If set, the name of a path corner entity that this NPC will walk to, after spawning.": "若已设置, 则为此NPC生成后将要行走到的路径拐角实体的名称. ",
  "Hint groups are used by NPCs to restrict their hint-node searching to a subset of the map's hint nodes. Only hint nodes with matching hint group names will be considered by this NPC.": "提示组用于让NPC将提示节点的搜索范围限定在地图上特定的一组提示节点中. 只有提示组名称相匹配的提示节点才会被该NPC纳入考虑范围. ",
  "Limits NPC to using specified hint group for navigation requests, but does not limit local navigation.": "限制 NPC 仅能使用指定的提示组来处理导航请求, 但不限制本地导航. ",
  "Holds the NPC in stasis until specified condition. See also 'Wake Radius' and 'Wake Squad'.": "使 NPC 处于静止状态, 直至指定条件满足. 另请参阅'唤醒半径'与'唤醒小队'. ",
  "Auto-wake if player within this distance": "若玩家处于此距离内则自动唤醒",
  "Wake all of the NPCs squadmates if the NPC is woken": "若某个NPC被唤醒, 则唤醒该NPC所在小队的所有成员",
  "Activity associated with this hint node. Various parts of the NPC AI play this activity at times. i.e. Actbusy nodes will play this activity when an NPC acts busy on the node.": "与此提示节点相关联的活动. NPC人工智能的各个模块有时会执行该活动. 例如:当NPC在该节点上表现出忙碌状态时, Actbusy节点就会触发此活动. ",
  "The node ID of an associated target node, if any.": "关联目标节点的节点ID(如果有的话). ",
  "Chapter Title that appears onscreen when this level starts.": "此关卡开始时在屏幕上显示的章节标题. ",
  "Game Title that appears onscreen when this level starts.": "此关开始时在屏幕上显示的游戏标题. ",
  "[Used on PC] Prevents occlusion testing for entities that take up more than X% of the screen.": "[适用于PC] 防止对占据屏幕面积超过X%的实体进行遮挡测试. ",
  "[Used on PC] Prevents occluders from being used if they take up less than X% of the screen.": "[适用于 PC] 如果遮挡物的占用屏幕面积小于 X%, 则禁止其被使用. ",
  "[Used on 360] Prevents occlusion testing for entities that take up more than X% of the screen.": "[用于360] 防止对占据屏幕面积超过 X% 的实体进行遮挡检测. ",
  "[Used on 360] Prevents occluders from being used if they take up less than X% of the screen.": "[用于360] 当遮挡物占据的屏幕面积小于X%时, 禁止其被使用. ",
  "Detail.vbsp file to use for emitting detail props (found in directory <root>/modname)": "用于生成细节道具的 Detail.vbsp 文件(位于 <root>/modname 目录中)",
  "Material for detail sprites to use for drawing detail props": "用于绘制细节道具的细节精灵素材",
  "Distance at which these brushes should fade out.": "这些笔刷开始淡出的距离. ",
  "Set whether or not these brushes should collide with other entities.": "设置这些画笔是否应与其他实体发生碰撞. ",
  "Name of the first overlay material to display.": "要显示的第一个覆盖层材质的名称. ",
  "Amount of time that the first overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the second overlay.": "第一个覆盖层显示的时长, 之后便会开始显示第二个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the second overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第二个叠加层材质的名称. 若留空, 则叠加层显示结束, 该实体也会被视为执行完毕. ",
  "Amount of time that the second overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the third overlay.": "第二个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 超时后便会开始显示第三个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the third overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第三个覆盖层材质的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示覆盖层, 该实体也会视为处理完成. ",
  "Amount of time that the third overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the fourth overlay.": "第三个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后便会开始显示第四个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the fourth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第四个覆盖层材质的名称. 若留空, 则停止显示覆盖层, 该实体也会被视为处理完成. ",
  "Amount of time that the fourth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the fifth overlay.": "第四层覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后便会开始显示第五层覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the fifth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第五个叠加素材的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示叠加内容, 该实体也会视为执行完毕. ",
  "Amount of time that the fifth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the sixth overlay.": "第五个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后便会开始显示第六个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the sixth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "第六个要显示的叠加素材的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示叠加素材, 该实体也会被视为执行完毕. ",
  "Amount of time that the sixth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the seventh overlay.": "第六个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后系统将开始显示第七个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the seventh overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "第七个要显示的覆盖层材质的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示覆盖层, 此实体也会视作任务已完成. ",
  "Amount of time that the seventh overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the eighth overlay.": "第七个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后便会开始显示第八个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the eighth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第八个覆盖层材质的名称. 若留空, 则停止显示覆盖层, 该实体也会被认为已执行完毕. ",
  "Amount of time that the eighth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the ninth overlay.": "第八个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 超时后便会开始显示第九个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the ninth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "要显示的第九个叠加材质的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示叠加内容, 该实体也会被视为执行完成. ",
  "Amount of time that the ninth overlay should be displayed for, after which it will begin showing the tenth overlay.": "第九个覆盖层需要显示的时长, 之后系统便会开始显示第十个覆盖层. ",
  "Name of the tenth overlay material to display. If left blank, overlay displaying will finish, and this entity will consider itself done.": "第十个要显示的叠加素材的名称. 如果留空, 则停止显示叠加内容, 该实体也会被视为执行完毕. ",
  "Amount of time that the tenth overlay should be displayed for, after which this entity will stop displaying overlays.": "第十个叠加层需要显示的时长, 之后该实体将不再显示任何叠加层. ",
  "Which effect to use.": "选择要使用的效果. ",
  "Color emitted by this light.": "此光源发出的颜色. ",
  "If this is specified, then this light will use the bump map on the particles. Each particle system can have one ambient and one directional light.": "如果设置了此项, 该光源将会对粒子应用凹凸贴图. 每个粒子系统可包含一个环境光和一个定向光. ",
  "Set this to the name of the env_smokestack that you want this light to affect.": "将此项设置为您希望灯光作用到的 env_smokestack 的名称. ",
  "Name of an entity used to determine where the sun is in the skybox. The sun should be lined up on a line from this entity to the env_sun entity.": "该实体的名称用于确定太阳在天空盒中的位置. 太阳应位于此实体与 env_sun 实体连成的直线上. ",
  "The old way to orient env_sun is to point it at a target. The new way is to specify the angles. If you use the new way, set this property to YES.": "以往设置 env_sun 方向的方法是将它指向某个目标点, 现在则可以通过指定角度来实现. 若采用新方法, 请将此属性设为 YES. ",
  "A value of 0 0 0 will act the old way.": "设置为 0 0 0 则会采用原有的运作方式. ",
  "A value of -1 means the overlay will act the old way.": "值为 -1 表示覆盖层将采用旧模式运行. ",
  "Material of the inner glow.": "内发光材质. ",
  "Material of the overlay glow.": "叠加发光效果的材料. ",
  "Scales the distance used to test for sun glow occlusion, 0.99 will act the old way.": "用于调整计算太阳辉光遮挡时所用的距离值, 设置为0.99则采用旧版计算方式. ",
  "Sets the max number of ragdolls that can be in the world at a time on DX8 hardware (if they are flagged to fade). Set to -1 if you want to use the 'Max Ragdoll Count' value.": "设置在 DX8 硬件上, 同一时刻世界中允许存在的布娃娃模型的最大数量(仅限标记为可渐隐的模型). 若想使用'最大布娃娃数量'的值, 请设为 -1. ",
  "Sets the max number of gib that can be spawned at a time under DX8. (-1=use Max Gib Count setting)": "设置在 DX8 模式下一次可生成的 Gib 最大数量. (-1 表示使用'最大 Gib 数量'设置)",
  "Whether the effect should be active": "该效果是否应处于激活状态",
  "Distance that the blurriness is at its peak near the viewpoint.": "模糊效果在靠近视点处最为明显的距离. ",
  "Distance that the focus is in full effect near the viewpoint.": "焦点在视点附近能产生完全效果的距离. ",
  "Radius (in pixels) to blur the surrounding pixels.": "模糊半径(以像素为单位), 用于模糊周围的像素. ",
  "Distance where blurriness is at its peak far from the viewpoint.": "距离视点最远的、模糊程度达到极值的区域. ",
  "Distance that the focus is in full effect far from the viewpoint.": "焦点能完全发挥作用的距离, 即该距离内物体均处于聚焦状态. ",
  "Entity to use as a focal point.": "用作焦点的实体. ",
  "Distance behind the focal plane to remain in focus.": "焦点平面后方能保持对焦的最大距离. ",
  "The distance at which this effect will be fully translucent.": "此效果完全变为半透明时的距离. ",
  "The distance at which this effect will be at full intensity.": "此效果达到最大强度时的作用距离. ",
  "If larger than the maximum distance, this is the length at which the glow will fade completely out, between the span of the maximum distance and this length.": "如果该值大于最大距离, 则在最大距离与此值之间的范围内, 光晕会逐渐完全消失. ",
  "Size of the glow to be rendered for visibility testing. Must be larger than the distance from the sprite center to empty space. So if this glow is inside geometry (like a light bulb), set this value to be bigger than the bulb's radius. Any time a sphere of this radius would be visible (poking through any nearby geometry), the glow will be rendered.": "用于可见性测试的发光效果尺寸. 该值必须大于从精灵中心到周围空白区域的距离. 因此, 如果该发光效果位于某个几何物体内部(比如灯泡内), 则需将该值设为大于灯泡的半径. 只要以该半径为半径的球体能够被看见(即穿透了周围的几何物体), 发光效果就会被渲染出来. ",
  "The duration of the reverse fade.": "反向淡入/淡出的持续时间. ",
  "The material to watch. When the player stands on/off this material, this entity's outputs will be fired.": "可交互的材质. 当玩家站在该材质上或离开时, 此实体会触发相应输出. ",
  "A ladder goes between any two func_ladderendpoints pointing at each other.": "在任何两个彼此相对的 func_ladderendpoints 之间都会生成一条梯子. ",
  "The name of a brush model to render as the window.": "用于在窗口中渲染的画笔模型名称. ",
  "When the viewer is closer than this distance, the alpha is set to 'TranslucencyLimit'.": "当观察者距离小于此数值时, 透明度值将被设为'TranslucencyLimit'. ",
  "When the viewer is at this distance, the portal becomes solid and closes off.": "当观察者与 portal 的距离达到此数值时, portal 便会变得实体化并关闭. ",
  "This value limits the translucency of the bmodel and prevents it from becoming invisible when the viewer is right on top of it.": "该数值用于限制模型的不透明度, 避免当观察者恰好位于模型正上方时模型变得不可见. ",
  "(Optional) brush model that is drawn after the fading brush model. This model should have alpha in its textures so you can see through it.": "(可选)在渐隐画笔模型之后绘制的画笔模型. 该模型的纹理需包含透明度信息, 这样才能让背景显现出来. ",
  "(Don't change). Differentiates between shipping HL2 maps and maps using new engine features.": "(请勿修改)用于区分基于HL2引擎的地图与使用了新引擎特性的地图. ",
  "Set this if this brush is in heirarchy with a moving object of some kind, and the player can stand on this brush.": "如果此笔刷区域属于某个可移动物体的层级结构, 且玩家能够站在该区域上, 请勾选此项. ",
  "Set this if this brush casts lightmap shadows.": "如果此笔刷会产生光照贴图阴影, 请勾选此项. ",
  "Set this to true if you would like your background to be invisible instead of a black fill.": "如果您希望背景透明而非显示为黑色填充, 请将此选项设为 true. ",
  "Default animation sequence for the model to be playing after spawning.": "模型生成后默认播放的动画序列. ",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from for all gibs spawned by this shooter, instead of their own origins.": "请选择一个 info_lighting, 以指定一个光源位置供此发射器生成的所有虚拟物体使用, 而非使用它们自身的位置作为光源. ",
  "The speed of the water current in the volume, used to move the bubbles.": "用于驱动气泡移动的体积内水流速度. ",
  "How much the fog min/max values will scale the default value by when players are zoomed in (scoped).": "当玩家使用瞄准镜放大视野时, 雾气的最小/最大值将按默认值的多少倍进行缩放?. ",
  "The amount of random spread in the particle's velocity after they spawn.": "粒子生成后其速度的随机波动范围. ",
  "The default speed at which the particles move after they spawn.": "粒子生成后移动的默认速度. ",
  "The initial size of the particles after they spawn.": "粒子生成后的初始大小. ",
  "The size of the particles at the point at which they are removed.": "粒子被移除时的尺寸. ",
  "The rate of particle emission. i.e. particles per second.": "粒子发射速率, 即每秒发射的粒子数量. ",
  "The length of the jet determines the lifetime of each particle.": "喷射长度决定了每个粒子的存活时间. ",
  "Thing to shoot out. Can be a .mdl or a .vmt.": "可发射的物体. 可以是 .mdl 文件或 .vmt 文件. ",
  "Thing to shoot out.  Can be a .mdl or a .vmt.": "可发射的物件. 可以是 .mdl 文件或 .vmt 文件. ",
  "The name of the soundscape to use. Corresponds to an entry in the soundscapes*.txt file in the hl2\\scripts directory.": "要使用的声景名称. 该名称需与 hl2\\scripts 目录中 soundscapes*.txt 文件里的一行内容相对应. ",
  "Text Size.": "文字大小. ",
  "If specified, tesla lightning will originate from the specified entity. Otherwise, they originate from this entity.": "若指定了目标实体, 特斯拉闪电将从该实体处发出; 否则, 闪电将从当前实体处发出. ",
  "Sound to be played whenever lightning is created.": "生成闪电时播放的音效. ",
  "Material to use for the tesla lightning beams.": "用于生成特斯拉闪电束的材质. ",
  "Radius around the origin to find a point to strike with a tesla lightning beam.": "以原点为中心的半径范围, 用于确定特斯拉闪电束的瞄准点. ",
  "Minimum number of tesla lightning beams to create when creating an arc.": "创建电弧时至少需要生成的特斯拉闪电束数量. ",
  "Maximum number of tesla lightning beams to create when creating an arc.": "创建电弧时可生成的特斯拉闪电束的最大数量. ",
  "Minimum width of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最小宽度. ",
  "Maximum width of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电光束的最大宽度. ",
  "Minimum lifetime of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电束的最短持续时间. ",
  "Maximum lifetime of the tesla lightning beams.": "特斯拉闪电束的最大持续时间. ",
  "Minimum time delay between random arcing.": "随机电弧产生之间的最小时间间隔. ",
  "Maximum time delay between random arcing.": "随机电弧产生之间的最大时间延迟. ",
  "The amount of tolerance in the view checking when determining whether the player's input is still under control. 1.0 = straight ahead, 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees, -1.0 = all directions. If the player isn't within the tolerance, the player regains control.": "用于判定玩家的输入是否仍在可控范围内的容差数值. 1.0表示正前方, 0.0表示±90度范围, -1.0表示任意方向. 若玩家位置超出该容差范围, 玩家便会重新获得控制权. ",
  "Distance from the origin to project the decal.": "从原点到贴花投射点的距离. ",
  "Higher values render after lower values. This value can be 0-3.": "数值越大则越后渲染. 该数值的取值范围为 0 到 3. ",
  "Distance at which the overlay starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist).": "叠加层开始淡出的距离(<0 表示使用 fademaxdist 的值). ",
  "Boolean value (0 or 1).": "布尔值(0 或 1). ",
  "The node ID of one end of the node connection.": "节点连接的某一端的节点ID. ",
  "Entity or class to allow passage even when node is off": "即使节点处于关闭状态也能允许通行的实体或类",
  "Allowed entity is the only entity NOT allowed when this is set to 'yes'": "当此选项设为'是'时, 允许的实体反而成为唯一不被允许的实体",
  "Movement through this link must be precise. Used for NPCs ": "通过此链接进行移动时必须保持精准. 适用于NPC ",
  "Set this to 'Yes' if this controller is intended to control air links. ": "如果此控制器用于控制空中链路, 请将此项设为'是'.  ",
  "The name of an entity in the map that the spotlight will point at. This will override the spotlight's angles.": "聚光灯所指向的地图中实体的名称. 此设置将覆盖聚光灯的角度设置. ",
  "The downward pitch of the light from the sun. 0 is horizontal, -90 is straight down.": "太阳光线的向下倾斜角度. 0表示水平方向, -90表示垂直向下. ",
  "Amount to scale the ambient light by when compiling for hdr.": "编译 HDR 内容时, 用于调整环境光亮度的数值. ",
  "The angular extent of the sun for casting soft shadows. Higher numbers are more diffuse. 5 is a good starting value.": "用于生成柔和阴影的太阳角度范围. 数值越大, 阴影越分散. 5是一个不错的初始值. ",
  "This is the shadow direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis.": "这是阴影的方向. 俯仰角指绕Y轴的旋转角度, 偏航角指绕Z轴的旋转角度, 横滚角则指绕X轴的旋转角度. ",
  "This is the color of the shadows.": "这是阴影的颜色. ",
  "This is the maximum distance the shadow is allowed to cast, in inches.": "这是阴影可投射的最大距离, 单位為英寸. ",
  "This is the light cast direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis.": "这是光源的投射方向. 俯仰角指围绕Y轴的旋转角度, 偏航角指围绕Z轴的旋转角度, 横滚角指围绕X轴的旋转角度. ",
  "This is the color of the sunlight.": "这就是阳光的颜色. ",
  "This is the number of seconds it takes to get from 0 to 255.": "这就是从0增加到255所需的秒数. ",
  "This is the distance of the sun, greater distances produce more orthogonal shadows.": "这是太阳的距离, 距离越远产生的垂直阴影就越多. ",
  "This is the field of view that the sunlight casts in. Use lower values for more distant sun and sharper shadows.": "这是阳光照射的范围. 对于距离较远的太阳以及需要更清晰的阴影效果时, 请使用较小的数值. ",
  "This controls the near clipping plane's distance from the player.": "此选项用于控制近裁剪面与玩家之间的距离. ",
  "This offsets the from the player position where the sun is attached.": "此值用于调整太阳附着点相对于玩家位置的偏移量. ",
  "Enables/disables shadows from this projected texture.": "启用/禁用由此投影纹理生成的阴影. ",
  "This is the shadow casting direction. Pitch is rotation around the Y axis, yaw is the rotation around the Z axis, and roll is the rotation around the X axis. (Note that pitch is negated vs. light_environment's pitch.)": "这是阴影投射的方向. 俯仰角表示绕Y轴的旋转, 偏航角表示绕Z轴的旋转, 横滚角则表示绕X轴的旋转. (注意:此处的俯仰角值与 light_environment 中的俯仰角值符号相反. )",
  "Maximum dynamic shadow distance. Higher values are slower, default on PC is 400 units.": "最大动态阴影距离. 数值越大性能消耗越高, PC端的默认值为400单位. ",
  "If true, the CSM shadow angles are automatically harvested from the light_environment's angles. If false, this entity's angles are used.": "若设为 true, CSM 阴影角度将自动从 light_environment 的角度值中获取; 若设为 false, 则使用该实体的角度值. ",
  "The direction the water will move, when told to 'Open'.": "水流在收到'开启'指令后的流动方向. ",
  "Position of the water brush when spawned. The range is a value between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "水画笔生成时的位置. 该值的范围为 0.0 至 1.0, 其中 0 表示起始位置, 1 则表示起始位置加上(移动方向 * 移动距离). ",
  "The speed that the water brush moves, in inches per second.": "水笔的移动速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "The distance from the starting point that the water brush should move, in inches.": "水笔从起点开始移动的距离, 单位为英寸. ",
  "When set to Yes, the rope starts out detached from its target endpoint.": "设置为'是'后, 绳索初始状态为未连接到目标端点. ",
  "When set to yes, the rope can be detached from either endpoint when shot.": "设置为'yes'后, 射击时绳索可从任意一端断开. ",
  "A sentence played when the player tries to use the button, and fails because it's locked.": "当玩家试图使用某个按钮但因按钮处于锁定状态而无法使用时, 会播放此语句. ",
  "A sentence played when the button is unlocked.": "按钮解锁后播放的语句. ",
  "Limit the usable look-at-angle. -1 is looking directly away, 0 is looking perpendicular, 1 is looking directly at.": "限制可使用的注视角度:-1 表示完全背对, 0 表示垂直正视, 1 表示正眼直视. ",
  "Sound played when the button is door.": "按钮被点击时播放的音效. ",
  "A sentence played when the player tries to use the door, and fails because it's locked.": "当玩家试图使用门但却因门被锁住而失败时播放的语句. ",
  "A sentence played when the door is unlocked.": "门解锁后播放的语句. ",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under low end/medium end/XBox360, then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "若在 worldspawn 中设置了渐隐效果, 或者引擎运行在低端/中端配置或 Xbox360 上, 那么即便未设置 fademindist/fademaxdist, 引擎仍会强制对道具应用渐隐效果. ",
  "If the door 'Spawn Position' is set to Ajar, these are the angles to spawn at, instead of being open or closed.": "如果将门的'生成位置'设置为'半开状态', 则门会以这些角度生成, 而非处于完全打开或关闭的状态. ",
  "The color of the glow (if enabled).": "光晕的颜色(若已启用). ",
  "(Optional) Brushes faces to directly attach to the env_cubemap. Press Pick then click on faces in the 3D View to select them. Use CTRL while clicking to add or remove from the selection.": "(可选)使用笔刷在面上绘制以将其直接关联到 env_cubemap. 先点击'选取', 然后在 3D 视图中点击相应面来进行选择. 按住 CTRL 键点击可向当前选择中添加或移除面. ",
  "Maximum number of seconds until each particle dies. Particles live for a random duration between 'Minimum Particle Lifetime' and this. Will be clamped to a max of 15.": "每个粒子死亡前可存活的最大秒数. 粒子的实际存活时间会在'粒子最短存活时间'与此值之间随机生成. 该值最大不得超过15秒. ",
  "When set, the dust will be affected by any env_wind entity settings in the map.": "设置后, 灰尘效果将受地图中任何 env_wind 实体的参数影响. ",
  "The material to use for the particles": "用于粒子的材质",
  "The size of the particles, in units/inches.": "颗粒的大小, 单位为单位/英寸. ",
  "The distance between the particles inside the volume. The lower the number, the denser the particles, and the more overdraw there will be. It is best to keep it as high as you can without it looking bad.": "体积内各粒子之间的距离. 数值越低, 粒子越密集, 产生的过度绘制现象也越明显. 建议在视觉效果不受影响的前提下, 尽可能将此值设得大一些. ",
  "Time to go from density 0 to density 1, in seconds.": "从密度为0变为密度为1所需的时间, 单位为秒. ",
  "The speed that the particles should rotate, in degrees per second.": "粒子旋转的速度, 单位为每秒度数. ",
  "The speed that the particles should move around, in units/inches per second.": "粒子移动的速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "Size of the dust puff.": "灰尘颗粒的大小. ",
  "Speed at which the dust particles should move.": "灰尘颗粒的移动速度. ",
  "Name of the script to use for this model.": "用于此模型的脚本名称. ",
  "Name of the entity that the camera should point at and track while active.": "摄像头在激活状态下应对准并跟踪的目标实体名称. ",
  "If set, the camera will focus on the specified attachment on the 'Entity to Look At'.": "如果启用此选项, 相机将会对准'要观察的实体'上指定的附件进行聚焦. ",
  "The amount of time the camera should control the player's view for, after which it deactivates itself. If the camera should stay active until told to deactive, set the 'Infinite Hold Time' spawnflag.": "相机控制玩家视角的时长, 超时后相机会自动停用. 若希望相机持续生效直至被手动停用, 请设置'无限保持时间'生成标记. ",
  "The first path corner in a track that the camera should move along once it's activated. If not specified, the camera won't move.": "相机激活后沿轨迹移动时的第一个路径拐点. 若未指定, 则相机不会移动. ",
  "Gradually interpolate player's position to here on start. (Episodic only)": "游戏开始时, 玩家的位置将逐步插值到此处. (仅限剧集模式) (Episodic only)",
  "The speed that the camera tries to follow it's look target.": "相机试图跟随其注视目标的速度. ",
  "The FOV when using this camera.": "使用此摄像头时的视野范围. ",
  "How fast we change to the new fov.": "我们切换到新视野范围的速度有多快. ",
  "The starting speed that the camera moves at, if it's on a path track.": "摄像机沿路径移动时的起始速度. ",
  "The speed at which the camera accelerates to path corner's desired speeds.": "相机加速至路径拐角处所需速度的速率. ",
  "The speed at which the camera decelerates to path corner's desired speeds.": "相机减速至路径拐角处所需速度的速率. ",
  "Player FOV": "玩家视野范围",
  "Amount of time it should take to reach the specified FOV": "达到指定视野范围所需的时长",
  "Entity to move to. (End of move will match origin and angles).": "要移动的实体. (移动结束后其位置与角度会与原点一致). ",
  "Optional attachment point on the entity to move to.": "可选的实体上用于移动的目标点. ",
  "Amount of time it should take to reach the target entity's origin and angles.": "到达目标实体的原点及对应角度所需的时长. ",
  "Which team (or all) to allow to touch this trigger.": "允许哪些团队(或全部团队)触发此操作?. ",
  "How the player's view moves to the view of the camera.": "玩家的视角如何过渡到摄像机的视角. ",
  "Name of the entity that the camera uses to translate the view.": "相机用来转换视图的实体名称. ",
  "Use this attachment on the proxy's parent for position and orientation.": "将此附件用于代理的父级对象以确定其位置和朝向. ",
  "How much the angle of the proxy affects the angle of the view. 0.0 will keep the players view angles unmodified. 1.0 will add in the whole tilt from the proxy.": "代理对象的倾斜角度对视角的影响程度. 值为0.0时, 玩家的视角角度保持不变. 值为1.0时, 视角会完全跟随代理对象的倾斜角度变化. ",
  "If the player maintains an offset from the proxy apply fake acceleration on the player based on the movement of the proxy.": "如果玩家与代理之间存在偏移量, 则需根据代理的移动情况对玩家施加虚假加速度. ",
  "If this is set fake acceleration will be more noticeable in the direction of the proxy.": "如果启用此选项, 模拟加速效果在代理方向上会更为明显. ",
  "Multiply the fake acceleration by this ammount.": "将模拟加速度乘以该数值. ",
  "Move the player's angles to the camera - this will stop them from looking around.": "将玩家的视角角度调整为与摄像机一致 - 这样他们就不会四处张望了. ",
  "Name of the prop to control.": "要控制的属性名称. ",
  "Name of the pose parameter to control.": "待控制的姿势参数名称. ",
  "Normalized value for the pose parameter from 0.0 and 1.0 (maps to min and max range).": "姿态参数的归一化值, 范围为 0.0 至 1.0(分别对应最小值与最大值). ",
  "Number of seconds (0.0 to 10.0) for client to match absolue pose values.": "客户端用于匹配绝对位姿值的秒数, 取值范围为 0.0 至 10.0. ",
  "Base cycles per second from -10.0 to 10.0.": "每秒基础周期数, 取值范围为 -10.0 至 10.0. ",
  "Modulation time offset from -1.0f to 1.0.": "调制时间偏移值, 范围从 -1.0f 到 1.0. ",
  "Modulation cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "每秒调制周期数, 取值范围为 -10.0f 至 10.0. ",
  "Modulation extents from 0.0f to 10.0.": "调制范围为 0.0f 至 10.0. ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger1 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时, OnTrigger1输出触发的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger2 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时, OnTrigger2输出生效的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger3 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "当此实体被触发时, OnTrigger3输出被激活的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger4 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "此实体被触发时, OnTrigger4输出信号被触发的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger5 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "该实体被触发时, OnTrigger5输出信号触发的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger6 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "该实体被触发时, OnTrigger6 输出项触发的概率(取值范围为 0 到 1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger7 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "当此实体被触发时, OnTrigger7输出信号被触发的概率(范围:0到1). ",
  "Chance (from 0 to 1) of the OnTrigger8 output firing when this entity is triggered.": "当此实体被触发时, OnTrigger8输出信号被发出的概率(取值范围为0到1). ",
  "The first entity.": "第一个实体. ",
  "The second entity.": "第二个实体. ",
  "If the speaker is in Measuring mode, this is the name of the entity where the sound level is to be measured.": "如果扬声器处于测量模式, 此处显示的即为需要测量声级的对象的名称. ",
  "The name of an info_target entity through which to play any sounds heard by this microphone. If specified, the microphone will consider itself in Speaker mode.": "用于播放此麦克风所接收到的声音的 info_target 实体名称. 若指定了该名称, 麦克风将处于'扬声器模式'. ",
  "Only useful in Speaker mode. If specified, when the microphone is enabled, it'll set the global dsp_speaker preset to this value. Sounds played back through speakers will then be affected by the selected DSP.": "仅在扬声器模式下有用. 如果设置了该值, 当麦克风启用时, 系统会将全局 dsp_speaker 预设值设为该值. 随后通过扬声器播放的声音将受到所选 DSP 的影响. ",
  "Microphone sensitivity, 0=deaf, 1=default, 10=extremely sensitive). Only applicable in Measuring mode.": "麦克风灵敏度:0=无响应, 1=默认, 10=极其灵敏. 仅适用于测量模式. ",
  "Smoothing factor, 0=no smoothing, 1=maximum smoothing). Only applicable in Measuring mode.": "平滑系数, 0表示无平滑处理, 1表示最大程度的平滑处理). 仅在测量模式下适用. ",
  "Sounds beyond this range won't be heard, irrelevant of attenuation. ": "在此范围之外的声音均无法被听到, 无论衰减程度如何.  ",
  "Filename of the movie to play": "要播放的电影文件名",
  "Whether or not the user may skip the video with common keys": "用户是否可以使用常用快捷键跳过视频",
  "If set to true, the movie will loop forever": "如果设置为 true, 影片将无限循环播放",
  "Time it takes for the video to fade in": "视频淡入所需的时间",
  "Name of the point_template to spawn here.": "在此处生成的 point_template 的名称. ",
  "If a PostSpawn Movement Speed is specified, all the entities created in the template will move in this direction.": "如果指定了生成后的移动速度, 那么模板中创建的所有实体都将沿此方向移动. ",
  "If in hierarchy, is spawn direction in world space, or object local space of parent": "若在层级结构中, 生成方向是指世界空间方向还是父物体的局部空间方向",
  "Whether to negate the result of the subfilters, after combining them using the Logic Type chosen.\n": "是否在按照所选逻辑类型组合各个子过滤器后, 对最终结果取反. \n",
  "Radius to constrain players to.": "限制玩家活动范围的半径值. ",
  "Width of the constraint edge. This is the distance in which to start slowing players down as they approach the edge of the radius.": "约束边界的宽度. 此数值表示玩家靠近半径边界时, 开始减速的距离. ",
  "Factor applied to the player's max speed as they approach the radius edge.": "该系数用于调整玩家靠近半径边缘时的最大速度. ",
  "A list of physics key/value pairs that are usually in a physics prop .qc file. Format is 'key,value,key,value,etc'.": "通常存在于物理属性 .qc 文件中的一系列键值对列表. 格式为'键,值,键,值, 以此类推'. ",
  "If the 'Use Preferred Carry Angles' spawnflag is set, this angle is the angle which the object should orient to when the player picks it up, with the physgun or +USE.": "若启用了'使用首选抓取角度'生成标志, 则当玩家使用物理枪或按 +USE 拾起物体时, 该角度即为物体应朝向的角度. ",
  "The name of a phys_constraintsystem that this constraint should be a part of. All constraints on a set of entities should be placed in the same system, or they will fight each other during simulation.": "此约束应隶属于的 phys_constraintsystem 的名称. 针对同一组实体的所有约束都应置于同一个系统中, 否则它们在模拟过程中可能会相互冲突. ",
  "The amount of force an impact must apply to the constraint to break it. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the constrainted objects.": "使约束被破坏所需的冲击力大小. 一种计算方式是将该值设为某个物体的质量 - 当该物体静止在受约束物体上时, 所产生的力刚好足以破坏该约束. ",
  "The amount of torque required to break the constraint. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "使约束失效所需的扭矩值. 一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以使约束失效所需的静止距离(即从该物体质心到约束点的距离). ",
  "Adding iterations makes the interactions among constraints in a system tighter.  It will not compensate for errors due to collision, but will help in cases where objects of disparate mass are constrained to each other.": "增加迭代次数可让系统中各约束条件之间的相互作用更加紧密. 虽然这无法纠正因碰撞产生的误差, 但在质量差异较大的物体相互受约束的情况下则能发挥作用. ",
  "The amount of damage done by the explosion created when the cannister blows up.": "容器爆炸时产生的爆炸所造成的伤害量. ",
  "The radius of the explosion to create when the cannister blows up.": "罐体爆炸时产生的爆炸半径. ",
  "The amount of damage the cannister takes before exploding.": "罐体在爆炸前所能承受的损伤量. ",
  "When the cap has been blown off, and the escaping gas is thrusting the cannister about, this is the amount of thrust generated.": "当瓶盖被吹开, 逸出的气体推动着容器移动时, 所产生的推力大小即为此值. ",
  "The amount of time that gas leaks from the cannister before being considered empty.": "从气罐中气体泄漏直至被视为已排空所需的时间. ",
  "The sound played when the gas is escaping from the cannister.": "气体从罐体中逸出时发出的声音. ",
  "The entity whose mass center will be overridden.": "将被覆盖质心位置的实体. ",
  "How long the spring would be if it was at rest (nothing hanging on it or attached). 0 means the length of the brush.": "弹簧在静止状态下(没有任何物体悬挂或连接时)的长度. 数值0表示画笔的长度. ",
  "Stiffness of the spring.  The larger the number the less the spring will stretch.": "弹簧的刚性:数值越大, 弹簧的伸展程度就越小. ",
  "How much energy the spring loses.  The larger the number, the less bouncy the spring.": "弹簧所损失的能量值. 数值越大, 弹簧的弹性越差. ",
  "The amount of energy the spring loses proportional to the relative velocity of the two objects the spring is attached to.": "弹簧损失的能量量与它所连接的两个物体之间的相对速度成正比. ",
  "If the spring's length ever exceeds this length, the spring breaks.": "一旦弹簧的长度超过该数值, 弹簧便会断裂. ",
  "Name of the entity that will be converted to a physics object when the ConvertTarget input is fired.": "当触发 ConvertTarget 输入时, 将被转换为物理对象的实体名称. ",
  "Sets the mass when the object(s) are converted (0 means auto-calculate)": "设置对象转换后的质量值(0 表示自动计算) (0 means auto-calculate)",
  "The amount of force necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to set it to the mass of an object that would break this constraint if it were resting on the magnet.": "将卡在磁铁上的物体扯下来所需的力的大小. 一种计算方法就是将其设定为:当某个物体静止在磁铁上时, 刚好能克服此约束力所需的质量值. ",
  "The amount of torque necessary to break a stuck object off the magnet. A way of calculating this is to multiply any reference mass by the resting distance (from the center of mass of the object) needed to break the constraint.": "将卡在磁铁上的物体分离所需的扭矩值. 一种计算方法是将任意参考质量乘以使物体脱离束缚所需的距离(该距离指从物体质心到磁铁中心的距离). ",
  "The method by which the fading distance should be determined. If 'No', the fade distances is the distance from the player's view to the object, in inches. If 'Yes', the fade distance is the size of the object onscreen, in pixels.": "用于确定渐隐距离的方法. 若选择'否', 则渐隐距离指从玩家视角到物体的距离, 单位为英寸; 若选择'是', 则渐隐距离指物体在屏幕上所占的大小, 单位为像素. ",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist). If 'Screen Space Fade' is selected, this represents the number of pixels wide covered by the prop when it starts to fade.": "道具开始渐隐的距离(<0 表示使用 fademaxdist 的值). 若选择'屏幕空间渐隐', 此数值即表示道具开始渐隐时所覆盖的像素宽度. ",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible (0 = don't fade out). If 'Screen Space Fade' is selected, this represents the *minimum* number of pixels wide covered by the prop when it fades.": "道具可见的最大距离(0 表示不淡出). 若选择了'屏幕空间淡出'模式, 此值则表示道具在淡出过程中所占的*最小*像素宽度. ",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under dx7 [hl2/ep1/portal] or dx8 [ep2/tf], then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "若您在 worldspawn 中设置了渐隐效果, 或者引擎运行在 DX7 [hl2/ep1/portal] 或 DX8 [ep2/tf] 模式下, 那么即便未设置 fademindist 或 fademaxdist, 引擎仍会强制对实体执行渐隐处理. ",
  "Select an info_lighting to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "请选择一个 info_lighting, 以指定光照采样的位置, 而非使用该实体的原点. ",
  "Disable per-vertex lighting on this object.": "禁用此对象上的逐顶点光照. ",
  "When vertex lighting is enabled, prevent the geometry from self-shadowing -- casting shadows onto itself.": "启用顶点光照时, 需防止几何体产生自阴影现象 - 即阴影投射到其自身上. ",
  "When vertex lighting is enabled, ignore the surface normal of faces when calculating the vertex lighting.": "启用顶点光照后, 计算顶点光照时将忽略面的表面法线. ",
  "Whether VRAD should create indirect lighting from this prop.": "是否让VRAD为该道具生成间接光照. ",
  "Prevent this static prop from combining with any other static props in vbsp.": "防止此静态属性在 vbsp 处理过程中与其他任何静态属性合并. ",
  "Resize the static prop.": "调整静态属性的大小. ",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade (<0 = use fademaxdist).": "道具开始逐渐消失的距离(<0 表示使用 fademaxdist 的值). ",
  "If you specify a fade in the worldspawn, or if the engine is running under dx7, then the engine will forcibly fade out props even if fademindist/fademaxdist isn't specified.": "若在 worldspawn 中设置了淡入效果, 或者引擎运行在 DX7 模式下, 那么即便未设置 fademindist/fademaxdist 参数, 引擎仍会强制对场景中的物体执行淡出处理. ",
  "The name of the idle animation that this prop will revert to whenever it finishes a random or forced animation.": "该装饰物在完成随机或强制动画后会恢复到的待机动画的名称. ",
  "If set, this prop will randomly choose and play animations, based upon the times specified in 'Min/Max Random Anim Time'. Inbetween the random animations, it will revert to playing the 'Default Animation'.": "若设置此属性, 系统会根据'随机动画最短/最长时间'中设定的数值随机选取并播放动画. 在这些随机动画之间, 则会恢复播放'默认动画'. ",
  "If set, the prop will not use bone followers, even if it has them defined.": "若勾选此项, 该属性将不会使用骨骼跟随器, 即使已为其定义了骨骼跟随器. ",
  "If set, this prop will use the autoaim feature on consoles (slower look movement when this prop is directly under the crosshair).": "若启用此选项, 该道具将在主机上启用自动瞄准功能(当该道具位于准星正下方时, 视角转动速度会变慢). ",
  "If set, the prop will not loop its animation, but hold the last frame.": "如果勾选此选项, 属性将不会循环播放动画, 而是停留在最后一帧. ",
  "Minimum time between random animations.": "随机动画之间的最小时间间隔. ",
  "Maximum time between random animations.": "随机动画之间的最大时间间隔. ",
  "Select a path_corner entity to specify a location to sample lighting from, instead of using this entity's origin.": "请选择一个 path_corner 实体来指定光照采样的位置, 而非使用该实体的原点. ",
  "Force this prop to animate every frame. Don't use this unless you know what you are doing.": "强制让此属性在每一帧都进行动画处理. 除非您清楚自己在做什么, 否则请勿使用此选项. ",
  "Scales damage energy when this object is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.\nSet to 1.0 for materials as strong as flesh, smaller numbers indicate stronger materials.": "当该物体受到物理物体的撞击时, 可调节损伤能量的数值. 注意:为保持向后兼容性, 设为0即表示禁用此功能. \n对于与人类皮肤强度相当的材料, 此值应设为1.0; 数值越小则表示材料越坚硬. ",
  "(Optional) The name of a door whose open/closed state controls the on/off state of this area portal.": "(可选)该门的名称, 其开启/关闭状态将决定此区域传送门的开启/关闭状态. ",
  "The amount of damage the surface takes before breaking.": "表面在破裂前所能承受的损坏量. ",
  "If the 'Surface Type' is set to Glass, this value sets how fragile the glass pieces are after the surface has been broken.": "若'表面类型'设为玻璃, 此数值用于设定表面破碎后玻璃碎片的易碎程度. ",
  "How close the player has to be looking at the target. 1.0 = straight ahead\n 0.0 = +/- 90 degrees\n -1.0 = all directions).": "玩家需要面向目标的角度范围. 1.0表示正前方, \n0.0表示±90度范围, \n-1.0则表示任意方向. ",
  "The time, in seconds, to wait after player enters the trigger before firing the OnTimeout output, 0 = never.": "玩家进入触发区域后, 触发 OnTimeout 输出前需等待的秒数; 0 表示永不触发. ",
  "If nonzero, scale the force by this amount when running with alternate ticks. This fixes problems with an overly large force due to the longer frametime on when running with sv_alternateticks 1.": "若该值不为零, 则在启用 sv_alternateticks 1 时, 系统会按此比例对作用力进行缩放. 这样可解决因帧间隔时间变长而导致作用力过大的问题. ",
  "Only affect players if they are falling (and not pressing jump)": "仅对正在下落且未按下跳跃键的玩家生效 (and not pressing jump)",
  "Player must be falling this fast for push to happen": "只有当玩家的下落速度达到此数值时, 推动效果才会触发",
  "Filter to use to see if activator's children trigger me. See filter_activator_name for more explanation.": "用于判断激活器的子项是否会触发本项的过滤器. 详情请参阅 filter_activator_name. ",
  "Forces the teleported object to snap to the angles of the destination landmark.": "强制使被传送的物体对齐到目标地标的角度. ",
  "Name to give built NPCs": "为生成的NPC起个名字",
  "Name to give built addons": "为已构建的插件命名的名称",
  "Points available to spend for NPCs": "可供NPC使用的积分",
  "Points available to spend for addons": "可用于购买附加组件的积分",
  "The name of a point_camera entity in the map that the material should be rendered from.": "材质渲染时所使用的地图中 point_camera 实体的名称. ",
  "If set, will write the data from the event into the table 'event_data' on this entity.": "若设置此项, 则会将事件中的数据写入到此实体的 ‘event_data’ 表中. ",
  "The exact weapon class name you want to check for.  i.e. weapon_deagle, weapon_awp, weapon_knife, etc.": "您想要查询的具体武器类别名称, 例如 weapon_deagle、weapon_awp、weapon_knife 等. ",
  "Near Z for projected texture": "投影纹理的近景Z值",
  "Far Z for projected texture": "投影纹理的远裁剪面距离",
  "Quality of shadows.": "阴影质量. ",
  "Limit flashlight effect to only effect target entity.": "将手电筒效果仅应用于目标实体. ",
  "Control whether flashlight effects static world geometry.": "控制手电筒效果是否作用于静态世界几何结构. ",
  "Indicates if this is a simple, non-light casting texture projection": "表示该纹理投影是否为简单的、非光线投射类型的投影",
  "Scale the light color by this brightness": "按此亮度比例调整灯光颜色",
  "Light Color RGB-Intensity": "浅色 RGB 强度",
  "Amount of time it takes for a color change to occur.": "颜色发生变化所需的时间. ",
  "Angles are interpreted as being relative to camera.": "角度值是以相机为参照来解释的. ",
  "This is a parameter.  It goes in the form of $variable type [default value].": "这是一个参数, 其格式为 $变量类型 [默认值]. ",
  "If using 'show key bindings' for the onscreen icon, this field should be the command we want to show bindings for when gamepad is enabled (and PS3/X360)": "若要为屏幕上的图标启用'显示按键绑定'功能, 此字段需填写在启用游戏手柄(及PS3/X360手柄)后需要显示按键绑定的对应命令",
  "The visible range of the hint.": "提示信息的可见范围. ",
  "The event to trigger by name from modevents.res": "根据 modevents.res 中的名称触发相应事件",
  "Distance that the player must be before the event is generated.": "玩家需处于该距离范围内才会触发事件. ",
  "Percentage chance the hallucination starts enabled. 0 is always off, 100 is always on": "幻觉效果初始处于启用状态的概率. 0表示始终关闭, 100表示始终开启",
  "Number of seconds the hallucination stays visible from the first frame it can be seen": "从首次可见起, 幻觉效果保持可见的秒数",
  "Number of seconds the hallucination stays invisible before it can be seen again. 0 to disable recharging": "幻觉状态保持不可见状态的秒数, 之后才能再次被看到. 设为0则禁用重新充电功能",
  "The angular extent of the light for casting soft shadows. Higher numbers are more diffuse. 5 is a good starting value.": "用于生成柔和阴影的光照角度范围. 数值越大, 阴影越分散. 5是个不错的初始值. ",
  "Name of a trigger the specifies the volume in which a player must be to control this tank.": "用于指定玩家必须身处的音量范围以便控制该坦克的触发器名称. ",
  "If set to 0, it'll use the base weapon bullet's damage.": "如果设置为0, 则会使用基础武器的子弹伤害. ",
  "If set to 0, it'll use the Damage Per Bullet value.": "如果设为 0, 则会使用每发子弹造成的伤害值. ",
  "(Seconds) How long to keep firing at last known position after lose sight of target": "(秒)失去目标后, 继续向最后已知位置发射的时间长度",
  "(Seconds) After lost enemy and persistence time has passed, how long to occasionally fire at enemy's last known position": "(秒)在失去敌人目标且持续时间过后, 每隔多久向敌人最后已知位置发射一次子弹",
  "If Parent is specified, this is the attachment point on the parent to aim from.": "如果指定了父级对象, 此值即表示以父级对象为参照时的附着点. ",
  "If Parent is specified, this is the attachment point on the parent to fire from. If you specify this, you'll want to specify the Gun Base Attachment too.": "若已指定父对象, 此处即表示从父对象上的哪个附着点发射. 指定此参数时, 建议同时指定'枪械基座附着点'. ",
  "If Parent + the Gun Pitch Pose Param is specified, then the gun itself will be invisible and the func_tank will steer a gun on the parent using the pose parameters.": "若指定了父物体以及枪械俯仰姿态参数, 则枪械本身将不可见, 而 func_tank 会依据这些姿态参数来控制父物体上的枪械转动. ",
  "The center yaw pose parameter of the gun on the parent": "父级物体上武器的中心偏航姿态参数",
  "If Parent + the Gun Yaw Pose Param is specified, then the gun itself will be invisible and the func_tank will steer a gun on the parent using the pose parameters.": "若指定了父物体以及炮口偏转姿态参数, 则炮身本身将不可见, 而 func_tank 会借助这些姿态参数来控制父物体上的炮口进行转向. ",
  "The center pitch pose parameter of the gun on the parent": "父级物体上枪械的中心俯仰姿态参数",
  "Only applies to player use. -1 = unlimited ammo.": "仅适用于玩家使用. -1 表示弹药数量不限. ",
  "Point where NPC must stand to man this func_tank.": "NPC必须站立的位置, 以便操作此func_tank. ",
  "If specified, NPC's manning this func tank won't fire at the player, after firing at a non-player, for this amount of time.": "若设置了该参数, 在此时间段内, 操控此功能型坦克的NPC在向非玩家目标开火后便不会再向玩家射击. ",
  "The player grace period is ignored if the player's under this distance from the func_tank.": "如果玩家与 func_tank 的距离小于该数值, 则玩家的宽限期设置将失效. ",
  "The tank must have the player as a target for this amount of time before it's allowed to fire.": "坦克必须将玩家设为目标并保持该状态一定时间后, 才允许开火. ",
  "The team number to filter by.  If the filter mode is Allow, only entities whose ": "用于筛选的团队编号. 若筛选模式设为'允许', 则仅显示符合该条件的实体 ",
  "What style of glow should be used.": "应使用哪种发光样式?. ",
  "The behavior tree file to use for this bot ( empty = classic AI ).": "此机器人要使用的行为树文件(留空则表示使用经典 AI). ",
  "Bonus crates spawn loot that is higher than default and will not be included in the initial spawn wave collection..": "奖励补给箱中会掉落比普通补给箱品质更高的物品, 这些物品不会被计入初始刷新波次的物品列表中. ",
  "Overrides the default radius of the c4 bomb explosion. Effective radius is 3.5x this. Max value is 2048": "用于覆盖C4炸弹爆炸的默认半径. 实际生效半径为该值的3.5倍. 最大值设为2048",
  "Overrides the radius of the c4 bomb explosion at bomb site A. Effective radius is this value x 3.5 units. Set to -1 to ignore.": "用于设置A点炸弹处C4炸弹爆炸的有效半径, 实际半径为该数值乘以3.5单位. 设为-1则忽略此设置. ",
  "Overrides the radius of the c4 bomb explosion at bomb site B. Effective radius is this value x 3.5 units. Set to -1 to ignore.": "用于设置B点炸弹处C4炸弹爆炸的有效半径. 实际生效半径为该数值乘以3.5个单位. 设为-1则表示忽略此设置. ",
  "Fade player visibility beyond far z distance.": "淡化超出远景Z轴距离的玩家可见度. ",
  "Distance at which the prop starts to fade.": "道具开始淡出的距离. ",
  "Maximum distance at which the prop is visible.": "道具可被看见的最大距离. ",
  "Respawn time in seconds.": "重生时间, 以秒为单位. ",
  "Shoot at this target.": "向这个目标射击. ",
  "Minimum number of rounds in a burst.": "连发时的最小回合数. ",
  "Maximum number of rounds in a burst.": "一次连续操作中允许的最大轮数. ",
  "Minimum delay between bursts. (seconds)": "两次突发操作之间的最小延迟时间(秒) (seconds)",
  "Maximum delay between bursts. (seconds)": "突发事件之间的最大延迟时间(秒) (seconds)",
  "The 'cone of inaccuracy' of the shots fired by this entity.": "此实体发射的子弹的'精度范围'. ",
  "How to distribute bullets within the spread. Even distribution is a true scatter throughout the spread. Biased towards the outside makes the shots 'miss' the target by tending towards the outside of the spread.": "如何在散布范围内分配弹点:均匀分布意味着弹点真正随机散布于整个范围内; 而偏向外侧则会使弹点倾向于散布范围的外缘, 从而'偏离'目标. ",
  "The weapon that this entity emulates when it shoots.": "该实体射击时所模仿的武器. ",
  "Angles indicating the direction to slow player velocity.": "用于指示降低玩家速度方向的角度. ",
  "Team(s) this entity should block": "此实体需要屏蔽的团队",
  "Does this func_nav_blocker block flow in the level? Only func_nav_blockers with this enabled will cause flow recomputation on blocking/unblocking.": "这个 func_nav_blocker 会阻碍关卡中的流动路径吗?只有启用了此选项的 func_nav_blocker 才会在被启用或禁用时触发流动路径的重新计算. ",
  "When an item spawns in a spawn point, other nearby spawn points with the same ID will have less chance of spawning an item.": "当某个刷怪点生成物品后, 附近具有相同ID的其他刷怪点生成物品的概率也会降低. ",
  "Weight used to distribute item": "用于分配项目的权重",
  "This point is behind a specific door": "该点位于某扇门的后面",
  "Must be enabled when placed in the map": "放置在地图上时必须启用",
  "Disable if you need to generate alerts for players to activate their tablets": "如需为玩家生成激活平板设备的提示信息, 请禁用此选项",
  "Must be enabled for mission scripting flow to control explosions": "必须启用此功能, 才能通过任务脚本流程来控制爆炸效果",
  "Dronegun always spawns on game start, no input required.": "无人机枪在游戏开始时总会自动出现, 无需任何操作. ",
  "This is a security door": "这是一扇安全门",
  "The default text to display": "默认显示的文本",
  "Text that will be inserted in the place of a %s1 if you token has one - if you don't know what that is, don't use this": "如果您的令牌中包含 %s1, 此处的文本将会替换它 - 如果您不清楚这是什么, 请勿使用此功能",
  "The font that will be used (should match an entry in your Scheme.res file)": "将使用的字体(需与 Scheme.res 文件中的某个条目相匹配)",
  "Sometimes the text panel needs to be smaller to force a wrap, but keep the same font size.": "有时需要缩小文本面板的尺寸以强制文字换行, 同时保持字体大小不变. ",
  "The color of the text.": "文本颜色. ",
  "C4 must be planted within this radius to destroy this entity": "必须将C4放置在此半径范围内才能摧毁该实体",
  "The area of the map witin this sphere will be named according to this entity.": "此球形区域内的地图区域将依据该实体进行命名. ",
  "Localization token for this region's name.": "此地区的名称本地化标记. ",
  "Area of denial radius": "禁用区域半径",
  "Path to the KV3 configuration file.": "KV3 配置文件的路径. ",
  "How long the player must use this item until pickup, must be positive": "玩家必须使用该物品多长时间后才能拾取, 该数值必须为正数",
  "Name of sound script empty to play when use begins, e.g. Player.PickupWeapon": "音效脚本名称:在使用开始时播放的音效脚本, 例如 Player.PickupWeapon",
  "Set higher with damage to hurt to make chicken invincible.": "设置更高的伤害数值, 就能让小鸡变得无敌. ",
  "Set higher with health to make chicken invincible.": "将生命值设得更高即可使小鸡无敌. ",
  "Holiday submodels of chicken": "节日主题鸡肉副产品",
  "Makes this volume an unbound/infinite/master volume.": "将此音量设为无限制/无限/主音量. ",
  "Use the Min/Max exposure settings for this volume?": "是否对此音量使用最小/最大曝光设置?",
  "Time to transition to these postprocessing settings in seconds": "过渡到这些后期处理设置所需的时间(以秒为单位)",
  "Game modes supported by this map.": "此地图支持的游戏模式. ",
  "Game modes supported by this map": "此地图支持的游戏模式",
  "Path to game convar config file to execute after loading this map and the default gamemode config (applies in all modes).": "加载此地图及默认游戏模式配置后需要执行的游戏变量配置文件路径(适用于所有模式). ",
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // 4. 输入 / 输出说明 (Input / Output Descriptions) (共 1474 条)
  // ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  "Enable hint.": "启用提示功能. ",
  "Disable hint.": "禁用提示. ",
  "Fired when an NPC has reached this node and started using it. Passes along the NPC.": "当某个NPC到达该节点并开始使用时触发. 此时会传递该NPC的相关信息. ",
  "Fired when an NPC has stopped using this node. Passes along the NPC.": "当某个 NPC 停止使用该节点时触发, 并传递该 NPC 的信息. ",
  "Turn the link on, enabling travel between the nodes.": "启用该链接, 即可在各节点间进行跳转. ",
  "Turn the link off, disabling travel between the nodes.": "关闭链接即可禁止节点间的跳转. ",
  "Change the allowed pass when off": "修改关闭状态下的允许密码",
  "Change the invert exclusion rule": "更改反向排除规则",
  "Tests to see if the controlled links are navigable by a human hull and enables the ones that are.": "用于测试受控链接是否可由人类操作器访问, 并启用那些可访问的链接. ",
  "Fired when this NPC takes damage.": "当此NPC受到伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC has begun dying before other death-related callbacks.": "在此NPC开始死亡、且其他与死亡相关的回调函数尚未触发时调用. ",
  "Fired when this NPC is killed.": "当此NPC被杀死时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches 75% of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当该NPC的生命值降至最大值的75%时触发(即使它随后死亡). ",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches half of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当此NPC的生命值降至最大值的一半时触发(即使它已经死亡). ",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches 25% of its maximum health (even if they die).": "当此NPC的生命值降至最大值的25%时触发(即使其随后死亡). ",
  "Fired when this NPC establishes line of sight to its enemy (outputs entity).": "当该NPC能够看到其敌人时触发(输出实体信息). ",
  "Fired when this NPC loses line of sight to its enemy.": "当此NPC无法看到其敌人时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC loses its enemy. Usually due to the enemy being killed/removed, or because this NPC has selected a newer, more dangerous enemy.": "当此NPC失去攻击目标时触发. 通常是因为目标被杀死或移除, 或是此NPC选择了另一个更具威胁性的目标. ",
  "Fired when this NPC loses line of sight to its enemy, and that enemy is a player.": "当该 NPC 无法再看到其敌人且该敌人为玩家时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC loses its enemy, and that enemy was a player. Usually due to the enemy being killed/removed, or because this NPC has selected a newer, more dangerous enemy.": "当该NPC失去了它的目标敌人且该敌人为玩家时触发. 通常是因为敌人被杀死或移除, 又或者该NPC选择了另一个更具威胁性的新目标. ",
  "Fired when this NPC is hurt by a player.": "当该NPC受到玩家伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC is hurt by a player OR by one of the player's squadmates.": "当该NPC受到玩家或玩家的队友伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC has refused to join the player's squad.": "当该 NPC 拒绝加入玩家的小队时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player +Uses this npc.": "当玩家使用此NPC时触发. ",
  "Fired when ANYTHING calls Use on this npc (such as other NPCs).": "当任何对象(例如其他NPC)对该NPC调用'Use'时触发. ",
  "Overrides this entity's health, ignoring max health constraints. This is for prototyping only and all uses of this input should be audited before shipping! Values <=0 are ignored.": "可强制设置该实体的生命值, 不受最大生命值限制. 此功能仅用于原型开发, 发布前务必对所有使用此功能的实例进行审核! 值为0或负数时将被忽略. ",
  "Changes this entity's relationship with another entity or class. Format: <entityname/classname> <D_HT/D_FR/D_LI/D_NU> <priority>": "用于更改此实体与另一实体或类之间的关系. 格式:<实体名/类名> <D_HT/D_FR/D_LI/D_NU> <优先级>",
  "Set this NPC's health.": "设置此NPC的生命值. ",
  "Sets NPC bodygroup. Format is <BodygroupName,index> ": "设置NPC的身体组. 格式为 <身体组名称,索引> ",
  "Sets the value that scales damage energy when this character is hit by a physics object. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.": "设置当角色被物理物体击中时, 用于缩放伤害数值的系数. 注意:为保持向后兼容性, 值为0表示此功能处于禁用状态. ",
  "Ignite, burst into flames": "点燃, 瞬间起火",
  "Ignite, with a parameter lifetime.": "启动, 并指定生命周期参数. ",
  "Ignite, with a parameter number of hitbox fires.": "触发效果, 参数值为命中的区域数量. ",
  "Ignite, with a parameter hitbox fire scale.": "触发效果, 参数为命中框火焰缩放比例. ",
  "Extinguish ourself if we're on fire": "若身上着火, 请自行灭火",
  "Break, smash into pieces": "打碎, 弄成碎片",
  "Set the name of this NPC's squad. It will be removed from any existing squad automatically. Leaving the parameter blank will remove the NPC from any existing squad.": "设置此NPC所属小队的名称. 该NPC将自动从当前所在小队中移除. 若将此参数留空, 则该NPC会从所有小队中移除. ",
  "Set an easing parameter Format: <name=value>": "设置缓动参数, 格式:<name=value>",
  "Set the nav restriction volume. Parameter is the name of the target markup volume. Empty parameter will clear the nav restriction.": "设置导航限制区域. 参数为目标标记区域的名称. 若参数为空, 则清除导航限制设置. ",
  "Fired when an NPC is spawned. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "当 NPC 生成时触发. 触发源为该 NPC, 字符串内容即该 NPC 的名称. ",
  "Fired when any spawned child died": "任何生成的子实体死亡时触发",
  "Fired when the spawned is exhausted (all children have been spawned).": "当生成器耗尽时触发(即所有子项均已生成). ",
  "Fired when the spawner is exhausted (all children have been spawned) and all spawned children have died.": "当生成器耗尽资源(即所有子项均已生成)且所有生成的子项均已死亡时触发. ",
  "Fired when all spawned children have died. This does not mean the spawned is exhausted, so a new child may be spawned any time after this (unless the maker is disabled).": "当所有生成的子项都死亡后触发此事件. 但这并不表示生成器已用尽资源, 因此在此之后随时都可能生成新的子项(除非生成器被禁用). ",
  "Spawns an NPC.": "生成一个NPC. ",
  "Toggles the spawner enabled/disabled state.": "切换生成器的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Enables the spawner.": "启用生成器. ",
  "Disables the spawner.": "禁用生成器. ",
  "Adds to the number of NPCs that can spawn before the spawner is exhausted. If an exhausted spawner is given some children to spawn, it still wont begin spawning until it is re-enabled with the Enable input.": "可增加生成器在耗尽前能够生成的NPC数量. 即便给一个已耗尽的生成器分配了需要生成的NPC, 它也只有在通过'启用'指令重新激活后才会开始生成. ",
  "Sets the number of NPCs that can spawn before the spawner is exhausted. If an exhausted spawner is given some children to spawn, it still won't begin spawning until it is re-enabled with the Enable input.": "设置生成器在耗尽前能够生成的NPC数量. 即便给一个已耗尽的生成器分配了可生成的NPC, 它也不会开始生成, 除非通过'启用'指令重新激活. ",
  "Sets the maximum number of NPCs that can be alive at any one time from this spawner.": "设置此刷怪器一次最多能生成并存活的NPC数量. ",
  "Sets how often (in seconds) a new NPC will be spawned.": "设置生成新NPC的间隔时间(以秒为单位). ",
  "Spawn an NPC somewhere within the maker's radius.": "在制作器的作用范围内随机生成一个 NPC. ",
  "Spawn an NPC somewhere within a line behind the maker.": "在创建者后方的某条直线上生成一个NPC. ",
  "Spawn multiple NPCs (uses destination group, else radius).": "生成多个NPC(使用目标组, 否则按半径生成). ",
  "Switch to a different set of Destination entities.": "切换到另一组目标实体. ",
  "Set the minimum spawn distance from player to destination node.": "设置玩家与目标节点之间的最小生成距离. ",
  "Select (override) the entity to center the spawn destination around.": "请选择(覆盖)一个实体, 以将其作为生成点的中心点. ",
  "Set the Batch Count to a new value. See help for Batch Count to understand how it works.": "将批量计数设置为一个新值. 请参阅关于批量计数的帮助说明以了解其运作方式. ",
  "Set this maker to keep spawning NPCs forever.": "设置此生成器以让NPC持续生成. ",
  "Set this maker to no longer infinitely spawn, using MaxChildren instead. By default, MaxChildren will be reduced by the number of live children (pass in 1 to disable).": "将此生成器设置为不再无限生成, 转而使用 MaxChildren 进行控制. 默认情况下, MaxChildren 的值会减去当前存活子项的数量(传入 1 即可禁用该功能). ",
  "Tell the driver to attack nearby enemies with the vehicle's weaponry (if any)": "指示驾驶员使用车辆上的武器(若有)攻击附近的敌人 (if any)",
  "Tell the driver to stop attacking nearby enemies with the vehicle's weaponry.": "命令驾驶员停止使用车辆的武器攻击周围的敌人. ",
  "Tell the driver to go to a specific path corner and continue from there.": "告诉司机前往指定的路径拐角处, 然后从那里继续前进. ",
  "Set the Maxspeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "设置最大速度(以车辆最大速度的百分比表示). ",
  "Set the Minspeed (percentage of vehicle's maxspeed).": "设置最小速度(车辆最大速度的百分比). ",
  "Tell the driver to start driving.": "告诉司机开始驾驶. ",
  "Tell the driver to stop driving.": "告诉司机停车. ",
  "Fired when an NPC spawns at this destination.": "当NPC在该目的地生成时触发. ",
  "Begin operating on the object": "开始对对象进行操作",
  "Set the object's state to READY. Fire this input when the object has been unlocked/opened or otherwise made ready for interaction.": "将对象的状态设置为'就绪'. 当对象已解除锁定/打开, 或已准备好供交互时使用此输入. ",
  "Fire this input when the NPC has completed the interaction with this object.": "在NPC完成与此对象的互动后触发此输入. ",
  "Fired when the NPC begins to approach the position": "当NPC开始靠近指定位置时触发",
  "Make the item ready to operate": "使项目处于可操作状态",
  "Fired when the NPC is ready to operate": "当 NPC 准备就绪可执行操作时触发",
  "The item is done": "任务已完成",
  "Apply relationship changes. This will change all Subject entities' relationships to all Target entities.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT:</b> Once you ApplyRelationships, this entity is then 'ALWAYS ON' until you send a Disable input or RevertRelationship input. During the time this entity is 'ON', any entities that spawn who match the Subject or Target names will be affected.<br><br><b>IMPORTANT:</b> Unpredictable results may occur when two ai_relationship entities refer to the same set or subset of target or subject entities. This situation should be avoided.": "应用关系更改. 此操作将会修改所有'主体'实体与所有'目标'实体之间的关系. <br><br><b>重要说明:</b>一旦应用了这些关系, 该实体将始终处于'开启'状态, 直至您发送'禁用'指令或'撤销关系'指令为止. 在该实体处于'开启'状态时, 任何新生成的名称与'主体'或'目标'名称相匹配的实体都会受到影响. <br><br><b>重要说明:</b>若有两个 ai_relationship 实体指向相同的'主体'或'目标'实体集合(或子集), 则可能导致不可预测的结果. 这种情况应尽量避免. ",
  "Revert relationship changes. This will return the relationship to what it was at the time the ApplyRelationship input was called (or when this ai_relationship was spawned if StartActive is set).": "撤销关系变更. 此操作会将关系恢复至调用 ApplyRelationship 输入时的状态(如果设置了 StartActive, 则恢复至该 ai_relationship 生成时的状态). ",
  "Revert relationship changes to the default relationship, which may have changed since this ai_relationship was applied. This returns control of the entity relationship to the code.": "将关系设置还原为默认状态, 该状态可能在此 ai_relationship 应用后发生了变更. 此操作会将实体关系的控制权交还给代码. ",
  "Begin the leading behavior": "启动引导行为",
  "Stop the leading behavior": "停止引导行为",
  "Updates the Target Entity to the entity matching the string parameter.": "将目标实体更新为与字符串参数相匹配的实体. ",
  "Notify success of leading": "通知引导操作已成功",
  "Notify failure of leading": "通知前置处理失败",
  "Fires when NPC reaches the lead point": "当NPC到达引导点时触发",
  "Fires when NPC has played out any arrival speech": "当 NPC 说完所有抵达时的台词后触发",
  "Fires when NPC achieves the goal": "当NPC达成目标时触发",
  "Fires when NPC fails to achieves the goal": "当NPC未能达成目标时触发",
  "Fires when NPC completes behavior (any post-success or fail acting is complete)": "当 NPC 完成行为时触发(无论成功还是失败, 行为执行完毕即触发) (any post-success or fail acting is complete)",
  "Update the busy search range for all actors.": "更新所有角色的繁忙状态搜索范围. ",
  "Force an NPC to act busy. Takes parameters, separated by spaces: <Targetname> <hint node targetname> <optional:teleport> <optional:$customactivityorsequence> <maximum time to actbusy>. If no hint node targetname is specified, it'll search for a random one. If no max time is specified, it'll use the default. Specifying 0 as the max time will make the NPC act busy until disturbed. If the optional teleport parameter is specified, the NPC will teleport to the act busy point. A custom move animation can be specified by prepending $ to the name of it. i.e. $ACT_RUN will make the NPC Run. Sequence names can be used instead of activities.": "强制让 NPC 表现得很忙碌. 此命令需要多个参数, 参数之间用空格分隔:<目标名称> <提示节点名称> <可选:传送> <可选:$自定义动作或序列名> <表现忙碌的最大时长>. 若未指定提示节点名称, 则会随机选择一个. 若未指定最大时长, 则使用默认值. 将最大时长设为 0 可让 NPC 持续表现忙碌状态直至受到干扰. 若指定了传送参数, NPC 将被传送到指定位置. 只需在动作名称前加上 $ 即可指定自定义的移动动画, 例如 $ACT_RUN 会让 NPC 奔跑. 也可使用序列名称来代替具体动作. ",
  "Force an NPC outputted from another entity to act busy. (only usable from an output that specifies an entity)": "强制让由其他实体生成的NPC表现得忙碌不堪. (仅能在指定了实体的输出结果中使用) (only usable from an output that specifies an entity)",
  "Force an NPC outputted from another entity to find a HINT_NPC_EXIT_POINT hintnode and vanish.": "强制由其他实体生成的NPC寻找标记为HINT_NPC_EXIT_POINT的提示节点并消失. ",
  "Fired when an NPC targeted by this goal starts an ActBusy animation.": "当此目标所指定的NPC开始播放ActBusy动画时触发. ",
  "Fired when an NPC targeted by this goal finishes an ActBusy.": "当此目标所指定的 NPC 完成一次 ActBusy 时触发. ",
  "Fired when an NPC target by this goal finishes a forced Leave.": "当此目标所指定的 NPC完成强制离开操作时触发. ",
  "Change the Actbusy Type to the specified value. See 'Actbusy Type' for valid values.": "将 Actbusy 类型更改为指定的值. 有关有效值的信息, 请参阅'Actbusy 类型'. ",
  "Turn on active searching.": "启用实时搜索功能. ",
  "Turn off active searching.": "关闭当前搜索功能. ",
  "Fired when the NPC loses sight of the see entity (if one is specified).": "当 NPC 无法再看到目标实体时触发(若已指定目标实体). ",
  "Fired when this NPC leaves his actbusy because of sighting an enemy.": "当该NPC因发现敌人而结束忙碌状态时触发. ",
  "Tell the queue manager that the player has started blocking a spot in the queue.": "告知队列管理器:该玩家已开始占用队列中的位置. ",
  "Tell the queue manager that the player has stopped blocking a spot in the queue.": "请告知队列管理器:该玩家已不再占用队列中的位置. ",
  "Force the queue to move up, sending the front-most NPC out of the queue.": "强制将队列向上移动, 使最前面的NPC脱离队列. ",
  "Fired when the queue moves. Outputs the number of NPCs left in the queue.": "队列发生变动时触发. 返回当前队列中剩余的NPC数量. ",
  "Fired when the NPC at the head of the queue starts to leave. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "当队列最前端的 NPC 开始离开时触发. 触发对象为该 NPC, 传入的字符串即为该 NPC 的名称. ",
  "Fired when the NPC at the head of the queue leaves. The activator is the NPC, and the string is the name of the NPC.": "当队列首位的NPC离开时触发. 触发对象即为该NPC, 传入的字符串为该NPC的名称. ",
  "Removes this entity from the world": "从世界中移除此实体",
  "Change the Hint Group": "更改提示分组",
  "Enable this entity": "启用此实体",
  "Disable this entity": "禁用此实体",
  "Fires when AI conditions satisfied": "满足AI条件时触发",
  "Fires when AI conditions timed out": "当AI条件超时时会触发",
  "Fires if/when there are no matching actors in the map.": "若地图中不存在匹配的演员, 则触发该事件. ",
  "Allows designers to change the idle modifier at runtime": "允许设计人员在运行时更改空闲状态修饰符",
  "Starts playback of the scene file": "开始播放场景文件",
  "Pauses playback of the scene file": "暂停场景文件的播放",
  "Resumes playback of the scene if it has been paused": "如果场景处于暂停状态, 则恢复播放",
  "Cancels playback of the scene": "取消场景播放",
  "Cancels playback of the scene at the next interrupt event in the scene.": "取消播放:在场景中出现下一个中断事件时停止播放. ",
  "Multiplies the the pitch": "调整音高倍数",
  "Finds an actor who can respond to the specified concept string while the scene continues playing": "在场景持续播放的过程中, 查找能够响应指定概念字符串的角色",
  "Stop waiting on an actor to stop talking.": "停止等待演员结束讲话. ",
  "Pause playback of the scene at the next interrupt event in the scene.": "在场景中的下一个中断事件处暂停场景播放. ",
  "Change the entity Target1 references.": "更改实体 Target1 所引用的对象. ",
  "Change the entity Target2 references.": "更改目标实体 Target2 的引用. ",
  "The scene has started": "场景已开始",
  "The scene has completed": "场景已完成",
  "The scene has been canceled": "该场景已取消",
  "The scene has been paused": "场景已暂停",
  "The scene has been resumed": "场景已恢复",
  "Remove the manager and all scenes referenced by it (and all scenes referenced by logic_scene_list_manager's embedded in this one).": "移除该管理器以及所有被它引用的场景(包括嵌入在此管理器中的 logic_scene_list_manager 所引用的所有场景). ",
  "Start the AI event.": "启动AI事件. ",
  "Stop this AI event if it is currently active.": "如果此 AI 事件正在运行, 请将其停止. ",
  "Set the animation target to use. An empty string will disable the puppet.": "设置要使用的动画目标. 留空则禁用木偶动画. ",
  "Fired when this NPC establishes line of sight to its enemy, and that enemy is a player (outputs player entity).": "当该NPC能够看到其敌人, 且该敌人为玩家时触发(输出玩家实体). ",
  "Fired when this NPC hears the player.": "当该NPC听到玩家的声音时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC hears combat sounds.": "当此NPC听到战斗声响时触发. ",
  "This NPC just finished getting up after being a ragdoll.": "这个NPC刚从'布娃娃模式'中恢复过来. ",
  "A new condition was set on the NPC. Only a subset of conditions are sent through this to reduce the amount of entity IO happening.": "已为该NPC设置新条件. 为减少实体输入输出操作的频率, 仅有部分条件会通过此途径发送. ",
  "A condition was removed from the NPC. Only a subset of conditions are sent through this to reduce the amount of entity IO happening.": "该条件已从 NPC 中移除. 为了减少实体间的输入输出操作, 只有部分条件会被通过此方式传递. ",
  "An ability has started, but may not complete.": "某项技能已开始施展, 但可能无法完成. ",
  "An ability has been finished.": "一项能力已完成. ",
  "Fired when NPC touches a surface material defined in the touch material modifier.": "当 NPC 接触到在'接触材质修饰器'中定义的表面材质时触发. ",
  "Fired when NPC leaves a surface material defined in the touch material modifier.": "当 NPC 离开在触摸材质修饰器中定义的表面材质时触发. ",
  "Changes this NPC's enemy filter to the named filter.": "将此NPC的敌方目标筛选器设置为指定的筛选器. ",
  "Ignore danger sounds for the specified number of seconds.": "忽略指定秒数内出现的危险提示音. ",
  "Force the NPC to holster their weapon. Ignored if the NPC is scripting, if the NPC's weapon is already holstered, or if the NPC doesn't use weapons.": "强制让NPC收起武器. 若NPC正在执行脚本、武器已处于收起状态或NPC不使用武器, 则此指令无效. ",
  "Identical to HolsterWeapon, except the weapon is destroyed once it has been holstered and concealed.": "与 HolsterWeapon 的功能相同, 唯一区别在于武器在被收起并隐藏后会随即销毁. ",
  "Force the NPC to draw their weapon. Ignored if the NPC is scripting, if the NPC's weapon is already drawn, or if the NPC doesn't use weapons.": "强制让NPC拔出武器. 若NPC正在执行脚本、武器已拔出, 或NPC不使用武器, 则此指令无效. ",
  "Become a temporary ragdoll that then can be later unrgadolled.": "变成一个临时的布娃娃模型, 之后还可以恢复原状. ",
  "Become a temporary animated ragdoll that then can be later unrgadolled.": "变成一个临时的动画布偶, 之后还能恢复原状. ",
  "Rise from your grave.": "从坟墓中苏醒吧. ",
  "Rise from your grave to attack an enemy. Animgraph NPCs will turn to face the enemy during their unragdoll. Parameter is the enemy, usually the !activator on the trigger that's firing this input.": "从墓穴中苏醒并攻击敌人. 处于非布娃娃状态的动画图NPC会转向敌人方向. 参数即为目标敌人, 通常是触发此指令的 !activator. ",
  "Enter scripting state. In this state, NPCs ignore a variety of stimulus that would make them break out of their scripts: They ignore danger sounds, ignore +USE, don't idle speak or respond to other NPC's idle speech, and so on.": "进入脚本模式. 在此模式下, NPC会忽略各种可能导致其脱离脚本设定的刺激因素:它们会忽略危险声响、忽略 +USE 操作, 不会进行闲置状态下的对话, 也不会回应其他NPC的闲置对话, 等等. ",
  "Exit scripting state.": "退出脚本执行状态. ",
  "Set an animation graph parameter Format: <name=value>": "设置动画曲线参数, 格式:<名称=值>",
  "Sets the active ragdoll profile.": "设置当前使用的布娃娃物理效果配置文件. ",
  "Enable the teleport buffer around this NPC, if it's been disabled previously.": "如果传送缓冲区此前被禁用过, 请重新启用该 NPC 周围的传送缓冲区. ",
  "Disable the teleport buffer around this NPC.": "禁用此 NPC 周围的传送缓冲区域. ",
  "Enable the phys proxy.": "启用物理代理. ",
  "Disable the phys proxy.": "禁用物理代理. ",
  "Disables the AI's random lookAts.": "禁用AI的随机观察功能. ",
  "Enables the AI's random lookAts.": "启用 AI 的随机观察功能. ",
  "Disable the NPC's Hearing senses. They won't hear any AI sounds (NPC/Combat/Player/Weapon/etc)": "禁用NPC的听觉感知功能. 这样它们就听不到任何AI产生的声音(包括NPC、战斗、玩家、武器等发出的声音)",
  "Enable the NPC's Hearing senses.": "启用NPC的听觉感知功能. ",
  "Disable the NPC's ability to see. They won't hear determine visibility of any enemies / friends.": "禁用NPC的视觉感知能力. 这样它们便无法察觉到敌方或友方单位的位置了. ",
  "Enable the NPC's ability to see.": "启用NPC的视觉能力. ",
  "Set named actor to be the look at target": "将指定名称的角色设为注视目标",
  "Clear the look at target set by ForceLookAtTarget": "清除由 ForceLookAtTarget 设置的观察目标",
  "NPC does not look at the player hands": "NPC不会注视玩家的手",
  "NPC will look at the player hands": "NPC会注视玩家的手",
  "Adds an ability to the NPC": "为 NPC 添加一项新能力",
  "Enables an ability on the NPC.": "启用NPC的某项能力. ",
  "Disables an ability on the NPC.": "禁用NPC的某个技能. ",
  "Return the ability on the NPC to the AI's control (i.e. AI will decide whether or not the ability is enabled or disabled)": "将该NPC的技能控制权交还给AI(即由AI决定该技能是启用还是禁用)",
  "Removes an ability to the NPC": "移除NPC的一项能力",
  "Disable all abilities on the NPC. Parameter: 0 - Do not disable all abilities, 1 - Do disable all abilities": "禁用该NPC的所有能力. 参数说明:0 - 不禁用所有能力, 1 - 禁用所有能力",
  "Force this NPC to use a specified movement gait. Empty string cancels the override; otherwise use 'Slow,Medium,Fast,VeryFast' .": "强制指定该NPC所使用的移动速度模式. 留空则可取消此设置; 可选项包括'慢速、中速、快速、极快'. ",
  "Force this NPC to use a specified movement gait set. Empty string cancels the override": "强制该NPC使用指定的移动姿态集. 若输入空字符串则取消该设置",
  "Force this NPC to aim or not aim. Parameter: 0 - Return to AI, 1 - Force Aiming, 2 - Force Not Aiming. Note that an NPC forced to Not Aim may be non-functional in combat.": "强制指定该NPC是否进行瞄准. 参数说明:0 - 恢复为AI控制, 1 - 强制瞄准, 2 - 强制不进行瞄准. 请注意, 强制设置为不进行瞄准的NPC可能在战斗中无法正常运作. ",
  "Force an NPC to go into an Act Busy. The parameter is the act busy entry name found in actbusy.vdata": "强制使 NPC 执行'忙碌行为'. 参数应为 actbusy.vdata 文件中对应的忙碌行为条目名称",
  "Force an NPC to exit a performing Act Busy.": "强制使 NPC 结束当前的忙碌动作. ",
  "Set the hint group you want the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "设置您希望 NPC 寻找提示的提示组. 此设置的优先级高于 vdata 中指定的首选提示组. ",
  "Adds a hint group that the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "添加一个提示组, 供 NPC 查找提示使用. 此设置会优先于 vdata 中指定的首选提示组. ",
  "Removes a hint group that the NPC to find hints for. This takes precedence over preferrred hint groups specified in vdata.": "移除目标NPC所使用的提示组. 此设置会优先于在vdata中指定的首选提示组. ",
  "Adds a nav attribute by name that the NPC is not allowed to navigate on.": "按名称添加一个导航属性, 该属性表示 NPC 不可在其上进行导航. ",
  "Removes a nav attribute by name that the NPC was not allowed to navigate on.": "按名称移除那些禁止 NPC 通过的导航属性. ",
  "Update (or Create) this NPC's memory of an enemy and its location": "更新(或创建)此NPC对敌人及其位置的记忆",
  "Clears out the NPC's knowledge of a named entity.": "清除NPC对指定实体的记忆信息. ",
  "Turn on the NPC Gag flag. NPC won't speak outside of choreographed scenes.": "启用NPC禁言标志. 在此之后, NPC仅在预设场景中才会说话. ",
  "Turn off the NPC Gag flag.": "关闭NPC禁言标志. ",
  "Cancel any speech that the NPC is currently speaking.": "取消NPC当前正在说的所有语音内容. ",
  "BeginRappel": "开始提醒",
  "Fires when done rappeling": "完成速降后触发",
  "The helicopter will immediately move at top speed toward its current goal, or in its current orientation if it's on top of its goal.": "直升机将立即以最高速度朝当前目标飞去; 若直升机已位于目标上方, 则会保持当前朝向飞行. ",
  "The helicopter will immediately move at the specified speed (you provide this as parameter override in units per second) towards its current goal.": "直升机将立即以指定的速度(该数值由您以'每秒单位数'的形式作为参数传入)朝着当前目标移动. ",
  "Change the helicopter's max speed.": "修改直升机的最大速度. ",
  "Tell the helicopter to move to a path corner on a new path.": "指示直升机移动到新路径上的某个路径拐角点. ",
  "Self Destruct.": "自动销毁. ",
  "Activate. Use to wake up a helicopter that spawned with the 'Await Input' spawnflag on.": "激活. 用于唤醒那些设置了'等待输入'生成标志的直升机. ",
  "Set a track for the helicopter to adhere to. The helicopter will do nothing if he's on the same path, and will move to the closest point on the specified track if he's on a different path.": "设置直升机要遵循的轨迹. 如果直升机已在该轨迹上, 则不会采取任何行动; 若不在该轨迹上, 则会移动到指定轨迹上距离最近的点. ",
  "The helicopter will first fly to the closest point on the path if he's on a different path. Then he'll fly along the path to the specified track point.": "如果直升机所处的路径与目标路径不同, 它会先飞到目标路径上距离最近的点, 随后再沿该路径飞向指定的轨迹点. ",
  "Start patrolling back and forth along the current track.": "开始沿当前轨迹来回巡逻. ",
  "Stop patrolling back and forth along the track. This will cause the helicopter to come to rest at the track which he's currently flying toward.": "停止沿着轨道来回巡逻. 这样直升机就会停留在它当前正飞向的轨道上. ",
  "When tracking an enemy, choose the point on the path furthest from the enemy, but still in firing range.": "在追踪敌人时, 请选择路径上距离敌人最远但仍在射击范围内的点. ",
  "When tracking an enemy, choose the point on the path nearest from the enemy.": "在追踪敌人时, 请选择路径上离敌人最近的点. ",
  "The helicopter is now allowed to disobey direct commands to go to particular points if he senses an enemy. He will move to the closest point (or farthest point, if ChooseFarthestPathPoint is used), on the path if he senses an enemy.": "现在, 当直升机察觉到有敌人存在时, 即便收到前往特定地点的指令, 它也可以不予执行. 此时, 若检测到敌人, 它会移动到路径上距离最近的点(若启用了 ChooseFarthestPathPoint 选项, 则移动到最远的点). ",
  "The helicopter can not disobey direct commands. He will continue to fly along his patrol path or to his specified target even if he senses an enemy.": "直升机必须服从直接指令. 即便探测到敌情, 它仍会沿既定巡逻路线飞行或前往指定目标. ",
  "Disable collisions against the player.": "禁用与玩家的碰撞检测. ",
  "Enable collisions against the player.": "启用与玩家的碰撞检测. ",
  "Fires when targeted": "目标对象被指定时触发",
  "Fires when no longer targeted": "不再成为目标时触发",
  "Turn on: Look for enemies": "启用:搜寻敌人",
  "Turn off: Stop looking for enemies": "关闭:停止搜索敌人",
  "Fires when the enemy finder has no enemies.": "当敌人查找器找不到任何敌人时触发. ",
  "Fires when the enemy finder acquires enemies.": "当敌人查找器发现敌人时触发. ",
  "Summons an NPC to act out the scripted sequence.": "召唤一个NPC来执行预设的剧情序列. ",
  "Summons an NPC to the script location. They will play their scripted idle (or ACT_IDLE if none is specified) until BeginSequence is triggered.": "将一个 NPC 召唤至脚本所在位置. 该 NPC 会执行预设的闲置动作(若未指定则执行 ACT_IDLE), 直到 BeginSequence 指令被触发. ",
  "Stops the scripted sequence. If fired after a sequence starts, this input will not take effect until the NPC finishes playing the scripted action animation.": "终止预设的脚本序列. 若在序列开始后触发此指令, 则该指令要等到 NPC 播放完脚本动作动画后才会生效. ",
  "Sets the name of the action sequence that will play when the action sequence plays. Can be used for branching sequences.": "用于设置动作序列播放时所执行的动作序列名称. 该名称也可用于实现动作序列的分支控制. ",
  "Forces a particular NPC to be the target of the scripted sequence": "强制指定某个NPC作为脚本序列的目标",
  "Fires when the scripted sequence begins playing.": "当脚本序列开始播放时触发. ",
  "Fires when the action animation begins playing and each time it loops.": "当动作动画开始播放以及每次循环时触发. ",
  "Fires when the action animation completes.": "动作动画结束时触发. ",
  "Fires when the sequence is cancelled.": "序列被取消时触发. ",
  "Fires when the sequence is cancelled without ever playing (OnCancelSequence will also fire).": "当序列在尚未播放的情况下被取消时触发(此时 OnCancelSequence 也会被触发). ",
  "Fires when an AE_SCRIPT_EVENT_FIREEVENT anim event occurs while playing the script.": "当播放脚本过程中触发 AE_SCRIPT_EVENT_FIREEVENT 动画事件时, 该事件即被触发. ",
  "Fires when NPC reaches this target": "当 NPC 到达目标位置时触发",
  "Fires when NPC leaves this target": "当NPC离开此目标时触发",
  "Starts all target NPC(s) performing the scripted command.": "使所有目标NPC执行预设的指令. ",
  "Cancels the scripted command on all target NPCs that are performing it.": "取消所有正在执行该命令的目标NPC上的脚本命令. ",
  "Fired when any target NPC finishes performing the scripted command.": "当任意目标NPC完成执行脚本命令时触发. ",
  "Fired when we fail to command any target NPC(s) to perform the scripted command. This occurs if no target NPCs could be found, or if they were found but if they failed to be able to execute the action. Note that resilient actions will not trigger a failure ever; they will just try to restart the action again later if they fail.": "当无法指挥任何目标 NPC 执行预设命令时, 会触发此事件. 这种情况可能发生在找不到目标 NPC, 或者找到了但 NPC 无法执行相应动作的情况下. 需要注意的是, 具备韧性特性的动作绝不会导致失败; 即便执行失败, 它们也会稍后尝试重新执行该动作. ",
  "Fired when the scripted command is aborted, either because the AI needed to switch away, or because a different scripted action was started.": "当脚本命令被中止时触发, 原因可能是 AI 需要切换至其他任务, 也可能是启动了其他脚本动作. ",
  "Load and execute a script file": "加载并执行脚本文件",
  "Execute a fragment of script code": "执行一段脚本代码",
  "Call a script function": "调用脚本函数",
  "Calls a script function from this entity's private script scope.": "用于调用当前实体私有脚本作用域中的脚本函数. ",
  "Calls a script function in the global script scope.": "调用全局脚本作用域中的脚本函数. ",
  "Removes this entity from the world.": "将此实体从世界中移除. ",
  "Removes this entity and all its children from the world.": "从世界中移除该实体及其所有子实体. ",
  "Removes this entity, all its children, and anything constrained to it, from the world.": "从场景中移除此实体、其所有子实体以及所有受其约束的对象. ",
  "Adds an entity I/O connection to this entity. Parameter format: outputname>targetname>inputname>parameter>delay>max times to fire (-1 == infinite). Very dangerous, use with care.": "用于为当前实体添加一个实体输入输出连接. 参数格式为:输出名称>目标实体名称>输入名称>参数>延迟时间>最大触发次数(-1表示无限次). 此操作极具风险, 请谨慎使用. ",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser1 output to be fired.": "触发此实体的 OnUser1 输出事件. ",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser2 output to be fired.": "触发此实体的 OnUser2 输出信号. ",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser3 output to be fired.": "触发此实体的 OnUser3 输出. ",
  "Causes this entity's OnUser4 output to be fired.": "触发该实体的 OnUser4 输出. ",
  "Fired in response to FireUser1 input.": "因接收到 FireUser1 输入而触发. ",
  "Fired in response to FireUser2 input.": "因接收到 FireUser2 输入而触发. ",
  "Fired in response to FireUser3 input.": "因接收到 FireUser3 输入而触发. ",
  "Fired in response to FireUser4 input.": "因接收到 FireUser4 输入而触发. ",
  "Fired when the entity is killed and removed from the game. Parameter is the inflictor.": "当实体被杀死并从游戏中移除时触发. 参数即为导致其死亡的实体. ",
  "Change this entity to attach to a specific attachment point on its parent. Entities must be parented before being sent this input. The parameter passed in should be the name of the attachment.": "将此实体设为绑定到其父对象上的特定附着点. 在发送此指令前, 必须先设置实体的父对象. 传入的参数应为该附着点的名称. ",
  "Change this entity to attach to a specific attachment point on it's parent. Entities must be parented before being sent this input. The parameter passed in should be the name of the attachment. The entity will maintain it's position relative to the parent at the time it is attached.": "将此实体关联到其父实体上的某个特定附着点. 在发送此指令前, 必须先为实体设置父节点. 传入的参数应为该附着点的名称. 实体在附着后将始终保持在相对于父节点的原位置上. ",
  "Removes this entity from the the movement hierarchy, leaving it free to move independently.": "将该实体从移动层级结构中移除, 使其能够独立移动. ",
  "Bone merges this entity to a parent entity. Call again passing nothing to end the bone merge.": "该函数可将当前实体合并至父实体. 如需取消合并操作, 只需再次调用此函数且不传递任何参数即可. ",
  "Changes the model skin to the specified number.": "将模型皮肤更改为指定的编号. ",
  "Turn shadow off.": "关闭阴影功能. ",
  "Turn shadow on.": "开启阴影效果. ",
  "Used to attempt to fix sorting problems when rendering. True activates, false deactivates": "用于尝试修复渲染时的排序问题. 设为 True 则启用, False 则禁用",
  "Set the value of a render attribute used in material dynamic expressions. Examples: $myfloat=0.25 $myfloat4=1.0,0.0,1.0,1.0": "设置用于材质动态表达式的渲染属性值. 示例:$myfloat=0.25 $myfloat4=1.0,0.0,1.0,1.0",
  "Remove a render attribute previously set by SetRenderAttribute, restoring it to its previous value.": "移除通过 SetRenderAttribute 设置的渲染属性, 使其恢复为先前的值. ",
  "Fired when this object catches fire.": "当此对象着火时触发. ",
  "Toggles the platform's state.": "切换平台状态. ",
  "Tells the platform to go up.": "指示平台向上移动. ",
  "Tells the platform to go down.": "指示平台关机. ",
  "Enable this entity.": "启用此实体. ",
  "Disable this entity.": "禁用此实体. ",
  "Turn on a permanent glow effect for this prop.": "为该道具启用永久发光效果. ",
  "Turn off this prop's glow effect.": "关闭此属性的发光效果. ",
  "Set the sprite's alpha (0 - 255).": "设置精灵的透明度(0 - 255). ",
  "Set the sprite's color (R G B).": "设置精灵的颜色(红 绿 蓝). ",
  "Set state of global to ON.": "将全局状态设置为开启. ",
  "Set state of global to OFF.": "将全局状态设置为关闭. ",
  "Toggles state of global between ON and OFF.": "用于切换全局状态:开启或关闭. ",
  "Set state of global to DEAD.": "将全局状态设置为 DEAD. ",
  "Sets the counter value of this global.": "设置此全局变量的计数器值. ",
  "Adds to the counter value of this global. Negative numbers subtract.": "将数值添加到此全局计数器的当前值中; 负数则会进行减法操作. ",
  "Causes the Counter output to be fired, passing the current counter value for this global.": "触发计数器输出, 同时传递当前全局计数器的数值. ",
  "Fired in response to the GetCounter input, passing the current value of the counter.": "响应 GetCounter 输入而触发, 同时传递计数器的当前值. ",
  "Sets the entity to use as damage filter. Pass in an empty string to clear the damage filter.": "设置用作伤害过滤器的实体. 传入空字符串可清除伤害过滤器. ",
  "Adds a context to this entity's list of response contexts. The format should be 'key:value'.": "向该实体的响应上下文列表中添加一条上下文信息. 格式必须为'键:值'. ",
  "Remove a context from this entity's list of response contexts. The name should match the 'key' of a previously added context.": "从该实体的响应上下文列表中移除指定上下文. 所输入的上下文名称须与先前添加的上下文的'key'值一致. ",
  "Removes all contexts in this entity's list of response contexts.": "移除该实体的响应上下文列表中的所有上下文. ",
  "Breaks the breakable.": "打破不可破坏之物. ",
  "Sets whether or not the breakable can break.": "设置可破坏对象是否能够被破坏. ",
  "Sets whether or not the breakable has collision at all.": "设置可破坏物体是否具有碰撞属性. ",
  "Sets a new value for the breakable's health. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "设置可破坏物体的生命值. 当该值降至零时, 物体即会破碎. ",
  "Adds health to the breakable. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "为可破坏物体增加生命值. 当其生命值降至零时, 该物体便会破碎. ",
  "Removes health from the breakable. If the breakable's health reaches zero it will break.": "减少可破坏物体的生命值. 当其生命值降至零时, 该物体便会破碎. ",
  "Set mass of this object.": "设置此物体的质量. ",
  "Fired when this prop has begun dying (breaking) before other death-related callbacks.": "当此属性开始消亡(损坏)时触发, 此事件会在其他与消亡相关的回调之前发生. ",
  "Fired when this breakable breaks.": "当此可破坏物体发生破坏时触发. ",
  "Fired when the health of this breakable changes, passing the new value of health as a percentage of max health, from [0..1].": "当此可破坏物体的生命值发生变化时触发, 此时传递的参数为当前生命值占最大生命值的百分比, 取值范围为 [0..1]. ",
  "Damaging the entity applies physics forces to it.": "破坏实体会对其施加物理力. ",
  "Damaging the entity does *not* apply physics forces to it.": "破坏实体并不会对其施加物理力. ",
  "Fired each time this breakable takes any damage.": "每次此可破坏物体受到任何伤害时触发. ",
  "Turn the light on.": "打开灯光. ",
  "The the light off.": "关灯. ",
  "Toggle the light's current state.": "切换灯光的当前状态. ",
  "Fades from first value in old pattern, to first value in the new given pattern. Pattern format is a string of characters, where 'a' is total darkness, 'z' fully bright. i.e. 'aaggnnttzz' would be a steppy fade in from dark to light.": "从旧模式中的首个值逐渐过渡到新模式中的首个值. 模式格式为一系列字符, 其中‘a’代表完全黑暗, ‘z’代表完全明亮. 例如‘aaggnnttzz’即表示从黑暗逐步过渡到明亮的效果. ",
  "Toggles this trigger between enabled and disabled states.": "用于在启用与禁用状态之间切换此触发器. ",
  "Fired when an entity starts touching this trigger. The touching entity must pass this trigger's filters to cause this output to fire.": "当某个实体开始触碰此触发器时触发. 只有通过了触发器过滤条件的实体才能引发此事件. ",
  "Fired when an entity starts touching this trigger, and no other entities are touching it. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters are considered.": "当某个实体开始触碰此触发器且此时没有其他实体触碰它时触发. 只有通过了该触发器过滤条件的实体才会被纳入考量. ",
  "Fired when an entity stops touching this trigger. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters will cause this output to fire.": "当实体不再接触此触发器时触发. 只有通过了该触发器过滤条件的实体才会引发此事件. ",
  "Fires when an entity stops touching this trigger, and no other entities are touching it. Only entities that passed this trigger's filters are considered.": "当某个实体不再触碰此触发器, 且没有其他实体触碰它时触发. 只有符合该触发器过滤条件的实体才会被纳入考量. ",
  "Sets the sound pitch, expressed as a range from 1 to 255, where 100 is the sound's default pitch.": "设置声音的音高, 取值范围为 1 到 255, 其中 100 为声音的默认音高. ",
  "Starts the sound.": "开始播放声音. ",
  "Stops the sound if it is playing.": "若声音正在播放, 则停止播放. ",
  "Toggles the sound between playing and stopping.": "切换声音的播放与暂停. ",
  "Sets the sound volume, expressed as a range from 0 to 10, where 10 is the loudest.": "设置音量大小, 取值范围为0到10, 其中10表示音量最大. ",
  "Fades the sound up to full volume over a specified number of seconds, with a range from 0 to 100 seconds.": "在指定的秒数内将音量逐渐提升至最大, 指定范围在0到100秒之间. ",
  "Fades the sound to silence over a specified number of seconds, with a range from 0 to 100 seconds.": "在指定的秒数内将声音逐渐淡出至静音, 该数值范围为 0 到 100 秒. ",
  "Set the name of the entity to play the sound from. The sound will follow the entity as it moves.": "设置要播放声音的实体名称. 该声音会随实体的移动而同步播放. ",
  "Set the name of the sound event to play": "设置要播放的声音事件的名称",
  "Start the sound event. If an entity name is provided, the sound will originate from that entity": "启动声音事件. 如果指定了实体名称, 声音将从该实体处发出",
  "Pause the sound event.": "暂停声音事件. ",
  "UnPause the sound event.": "恢复声音事件的播放. ",
  "Stop the sound event": "停止声音事件",
  "Sound Event GUID": "声音事件 GUID",
  "Fired when the sound finished playing": "声音播放完毕时触发",
  "Set the name of the parameter to set on the soundevent.": "设置要应用于声音事件的参数名称. ",
  "Set the name of the sound event to play.": "设置要播放的音效事件的名称. ",
  "Start the sound event using a snd_event_point and pass its guid output to this.": "使用 snd_event_point 启动声音事件, 并将其生成的 GUID 输出传递给此处. ",
  "Change the target stack name": "修改目标堆栈名称",
  "Change the target operator name": "更改目标运营商名称",
  "Change the target opvar name": "更改目标操作变量名称",
  "Change the target opvar index": "更改目标操作变量索引",
  "Change the value of the OpVar (does not set it in the stack)": "修改 OpVar 的值(但不会将其设置到堆栈中) (does not set it in the stack)",
  "Change the value of the OpVar and set it in the stack": "修改 OpVar 的值并将其设置到堆栈中",
  "Set the OpVar value in the stack": "设置堆栈中的 OpVar 值",
  "Enable the entity": "启用该实体",
  "Disable the entity": "禁用该实体",
  "Set the on-disable value for the player that causes this input": "设置触发此输入的播放器的禁用状态值时使用的值",
  "Set the min distance map value": "设置最小距离映射值",
  "Set the max distance map value": "设置最大距离映射值",
  "Fired when the player enters the outer distance.": "当玩家进入外部距离范围时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player exits the outer distance.": "当玩家离开外部距离范围时触发. ",
  "Set the name of the entity to check distance/occlusion from. This check will follow the entity as it moves.": "设置需要检测距离/遮挡关系的实体名称. 该检测功能会随实体的移动而同步进行. ",
  "Increments target brush's current texture frame by one.": "将目标画笔当前使用的纹理帧数加一. ",
  "Sets target brush's texture frame to the specified index.": "将目标画笔的纹理帧设置为指定的索引. ",
  "Starts the animation": "开始播放动画",
  "Stops the animation": "停止动画",
  "Enable the Object.": "启用对象. ",
  "Disable the Object.": "禁用该对象. ",
  "Create a splash effect.": "创建溅射效果. ",
  "Enables this tonemap controller": "启用此色调映射控制器",
  "Sets min exposure for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的最小曝光值",
  "Sets max exposure for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的最大曝光值",
  "Sets percentage target for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的百分比目标值",
  "Sets percentage bright pixels for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的亮像素百分比",
  "Sets average luminosity for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的平均亮度",
  "Sets rate of adjustment for this tonemap controller": "设置此色调映射控制器的调节速率",
  "Sets accelerate exposure down for this tonemap controller": "设置可加快此色调映射控制器的曝光调整速度",
  "Set the Max Ragdoll Count.": "设置最大布娃娃数量. ",
  "Set the max gib count.": "设置最大吉布数量. ",
  "Turn on the smokestack.": "打开烟道. ",
  "Turn off the smokestack.": "关闭烟筒. ",
  "Toggles the smokestack between on and off state.": "切换烟囱的开启/关闭状态. ",
  "Set the length of the smoke trail.": "设置烟雾轨迹的长度. ",
  "Set the rate at which to emit smoke particles (particles per second).": "设置烟雾粒子的发射速率(单位:粒子/秒). ",
  "Set the speed at which the smoke particles move after they're spawned.": "设置烟雾粒子生成后的移动速度. ",
  "Set the amount of random spread in the velocity of the smoke particles after they're spawned.": "设置烟雾粒子生成后其速度的随机散布范围. ",
  "Start the screen fade.": "开始屏幕淡入效果. ",
  "Fired when the fade has begun.": "淡入效果开始时触发. ",
  "Enable this ladder.": "启用此阶梯. ",
  "Disable this ladder.": "禁用此阶梯. ",
  "Fired whenever a player gets on this ladder.": "每当有玩家登上此阶梯时便会触发. ",
  "Fired whenever a player gets off this ladder.": "每当有玩家从该梯子上下来时触发. ",
  "Sets the brush's alpha value.": "设置画笔的透明度值. ",
  "Change the NPC class excluded from collisions": "修改不受碰撞检测影响的 NPC 类别",
  "Set the state of invversion for NPC class exclusion (0 or 1)": "设置NPC类排除的反转状态(0 或 1) (0 or 1)",
  "Enables all collisions with this func_brush.": "启用与此 func_brush 的所有碰撞检测. ",
  "Disables all collisions with this func_brush.": "禁用与此 func_brush 的所有碰撞检测. ",
  "Toggle enable state.": "切换启用状态. ",
  "Make the vgui screen visible.": "使 VGUI 屏幕可见. ",
  "Make the vgui screen invisible.": "使 VGUI 屏幕不可见. ",
  "Make slideshow visible.": "显示幻灯片. ",
  "Make slideshow invisible.": "使幻灯片演示不可见. ",
  "Sets the display text.": "设置显示文本. ",
  "Removes all slides from slideshow.": "移除幻灯片演示中的所有幻灯片. ",
  "Adds slides by keyword.": "根据关键词添加幻灯片. ",
  "Sets min random time between slides.": "设置幻灯片之间的最小随机间隔时间. ",
  "Sets max random time between slides.": "设置幻灯片之间的最大随机时间间隔. ",
  "0 - random, 1 - forward, 2 - backward": "0 - 随机, 1 - 正向, 2 - 反向",
  "Sets if lists can be randomly picked twice in a row.": "设置是否允许连续两次随机选取同一列表. ",
  "Make movie visible.": "使电影可见. ",
  "Make movie invisible.": "将影片设置为不可见. ",
  "Force the gibshooter to create and shoot a gib.": "强制使碎肉发射器生成并发射碎肉块. ",
  "Turns the beam on.": "打开光束. ",
  "Turns the beam off.": "关闭光束. ",
  "Toggles the beam between on and off.": "切换光束的开启与关闭状态. ",
  "Causes the beam to strike once. It will stay on for its set Life and then turn off (it will never turn off if Life is set to zero).": "使光束发射一次. 光束会持续其设定的持续时间后自动关闭(若持续时间设为零, 则不会关闭). ",
  "Sets the beam's alpha (0 - 255).": "设置光束的透明度值(0 - 255). ",
  "Sets the beam's render color (R G B).": "设置光束的渲染颜色(红 绿 蓝). ",
  "Sets the red color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置红色通道的值(0 - 255). ",
  "Sets the green color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置绿色颜色通道的值(0 - 255). ",
  "Sets the blue color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置蓝色通道的值(0 - 255). ",
  "Set the amplitude of beam noise (0 - 255).": "设置光束噪声的幅度(0 - 255). ",
  "Set the scroll speed in units per second (0 - 100).": "设置滚动速度, 单位为每秒像素数(0 - 100). ",
  "Set the width of the beam, in pixels.": "设置光束的宽度, 单位为像素. ",
  "Fired when an entity touches the beam. Only fired if the entity passes the 'Touch Type' choice.": "当实体接触到光束时触发. 仅当该实体符合'接触类型'的条件时才会触发. ",
  "Enable this dispenser.": "启用此分配器. ",
  "Triggers the blood effect.": "触发血液特效. ",
  "Triggers the explosion.": "触发爆炸. ",
  "Trigger the explosion.": "触发爆炸. ",
  "Fires when the player is pushed by the explosion.": "当玩家被爆炸冲击波推开时触发. ",
  "Trigger the impact": "触发影响",
  "Start the fire.": "点燃火焰. ",
  "Puts out the fire permanently in the number of seconds specified.": "在指定的秒数内彻底扑灭火焰. ",
  "Puts out the fire temporarily in the number of seconds specified.": "在指定的秒数内暂时扑灭火焰. ",
  "Fires when the fire is first ignited.": "初次点火时触发. ",
  "Fires when the fire is fully extinguished.": "在火焰完全熄灭时触发. ",
  "Enable fire source.": "启用火源. ",
  "Disable fire source.": "禁用火源. ",
  "Enable fire sensor.": "启用火灾传感器. ",
  "Disable fire sensor.": "禁用火灾传感器. ",
  "Fires when the heat level has been sustained for the specified length of time.": "当温度值持续处于设定时长时触发. ",
  "Fires when the heat level drops below the target level.": "当温度低于目标值时触发. ",
  "Ignite the target entity.": "点燃目标实体. ",
  "Set the fog start distance.": "设置雾效起始距离. ",
  "Set the fog end distance.": "设置雾效结束距离. ",
  "Turn the fog on.": "开启雾效. ",
  "Turn the fog off.": "关闭雾效. ",
  "Set the primary fog color.": "设置主雾气颜色. ",
  "Set the secondary fog color.": "设置次要雾气颜色. ",
  "Set the far clip plane distance.": "设置远剪裁面距离. ",
  "Set the angles to use for the secondary fog direction.": "设置用于次要雾效方向的角度. ",
  "Set the current amount of fog to blend into the 2D skybox.  0 is no fog, 1 is fully fogged.": "设置当前雾气浓度, 以决定其与 2D 天空盒的融合程度. 0 表示无雾, 1 则表示完全被雾气笼罩. ",
  "Set the current max fog density.": "设置当前的最大雾气密度. ",
  "Set the amount of fog to blend into the 2D skybox to lerp to.  0 is no fog, 1 is fully fogged.": "设置要与 2D 天空盒进行混合的雾效强度. 0 表示无雾, 1 表示完全被雾覆盖. ",
  "Set the current max density to lerp to.  0 is no fog, 1 is fully fogged.": "设置当前要使用线性插值法过渡的最大浓度值. 0表示无雾, 1表示完全有雾. ",
  "Start fog transition.": "开始雾效过渡. ",
  "Set the fade time between post process settings.": "设置后期处理效果之间的渐变时间. ",
  "Set the local contrast strength.": "设置本地对比度强度. ",
  "Set the local contrast strength at the edge of the screen (controlled by vignette).": "设置屏幕边缘的局部对比度强度(由暗角效果控制). ",
  "Set the vignette start distance (from screen center).": "设置暗角效果的起始距离(以屏幕中心为基准). ",
  "Set the vignette end distance.": "设置暗角效果的结束距离. ",
  "Set the strength of the desaturated blur on the vignette.": "设置暗角效果中去色模糊的强度. ",
  "Set the fadeout strength.": "设置淡出强度. ",
  "Set the film grain effect strength [0..1]": "设置胶片颗粒效果强度 [0..1]",
  "Set top-of-screen vignette strength [0..1]": "设置屏幕顶部暗角强度 [0..1]",
  "Turns the laser on.": "开启激光器. ",
  "Turns the laser off.": "关闭激光. ",
  "Toggles the laser between on and off.": "切换激光的开启与关闭. ",
  "Shows the message and plays the sound.": "显示消息并播放声音. ",
  "Fired when the message is activated.": "消息被激活时触发. ",
  "Set the amplitude (0-16)": "设置振幅值(0-16) (0-16)",
  "Set the frequence. Should be a value between 0 and 255, where 0.1 = jerk, and 255.0 = rumble.": "设置频率值. 该值必须在0到255之间, 其中0.1表示轻微震动, 255.0则表示强烈震动. ",
  "Start the shake.": "开始摇晃. ",
  "Stop the shake.": "停止晃动. ",
  "Stop the tilt.": "停止倾斜. ",
  "Performs the view punch.": "执行视图打孔操作. ",
  "Toggle the soundscape enabled state.": "切换音景的启用状态. ",
  "Fired when this soundscape becomes the active one.": "当此音景被设为当前激活音景时触发. ",
  "Start the spark effect.": "启动火花特效. ",
  "Stop the spark effect.": "停止火花效果. ",
  "Toggle the on/off state of the spark effect.": "切换火花效果的开启/关闭状态. ",
  "Spark once.": "点击一下即可. ",
  "Set the sprite's scale (0 - 8.0).": "设置精灵的缩放比例(0 - 8.0). ",
  "Hide the sprite. Won't be drawn until the 'ShowSprite' input is received.": "隐藏精灵. 在接收到'ShowSprite'指令前, 它将不会被绘制. ",
  "Show the sprite.": "显示精灵. ",
  "Toggle the sprite between hidden and shown.": "切换精灵的显示与隐藏状态. ",
  "Fired when a wind gust begins.": "当一阵风开始吹起时触发. ",
  "Fired when a wind gust ends.": "当阵风结束时触发. ",
  "Turn on the random announcements.": "开启随机公告功能. ",
  "Turn off the random announcements.": "关闭随机公告功能. ",
  "Toggle the random announcements off and on.": "切换随机公告的启用与禁用. ",
  "Adjust the ammo modifier.": "调整弹药修正值. ",
  "This will force all connected players to take the weapon(s) specified.": "这将强制所有连线的玩家装备指定的武器. ",
  "This will force the player who activated to equip the specified weapon.": "此操作会强制触发此功能的玩家装备指定的武器. ",
  "Display the message text.": "显示消息文本. ",
  "Set the text to display.": "设置要显示的文本. ",
  "Start displaying the message text, if the player is within the message radius.": "当玩家位于消息的有效范围内时, 开始显示消息文本. ",
  "Stop displaying the message text.": "不再显示消息文本. ",
  "Sets the message text to display.": "设置要显示的消息文本. ",
  "Command to execute.": "要执行的命令. ",
  "Find an entity that meets the specified criteria.  Will fire OutEntity if found and pass the entity as !Caller.": "查找符合指定条件的实体. 如果找到, 将触发 OutEntity 并将该实体作为参数 !Caller 传递. ",
  "Fired when FindEntity is input and an entity was found. Passes the found entity as !Caller.": "当输入 FindEntity 且成功找到实体时触发. 此时找到的实体会作为 !Caller 参数传递. ",
  "Count the number of players in the zone, and fire the corresponding outputs.": "统计该区域内玩家的数量, 然后输出相应结果. ",
  "Fired whenever a count finds a player inside the zone, with the player as the activator.": "每当计数器检测到有玩家处于区域内时便会触发, 此时该玩家即为触发者. ",
  "Fired whenever a count finds a player outside the zone, with the player as the activator.": "每当计数器检测到有玩家处于区域外时即触发此事件, 此时该玩家即为触发者. ",
  "Fired after a count, and contains the number of players found inside the zone.": "在计数完成后触发, 该参数表示在区域内检测到的玩家数量. ",
  "Fired after a count, and contains the number of players found outside the zone.": "在计数完成后触发, 其中包含了位于区域外的玩家数量. ",
  "Toggle the enable/disable state of this player spawn position.": "切换此玩家生成位置的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Set position of landmark.": "设置地标的位置. ",
  "Fired when the level starts streaming in.": "在关卡开始流加载时触发. ",
  "Fired when the level finishes streaming in.": "在关卡流加载完成后触发. ",
  "Fired when the level starts streaming out.": "在关卡开始流式加载时触发. ",
  "Fired when the level finishes streaming out.": "在关卡流送完成时触发. ",
  "Start loading the level.": "开始加载关卡. ",
  "Activate the loaded spawn group.": "激活已加载的生成组. ",
  "Start unloading the level.": "开始卸载关卡. ",
  "Tell the particle system to start emitting.": "指示粒子系统开始发射. ",
  "Tell the particle system to stop emitting.": "指示粒子系统停止发射粒子. ",
  "Tell the particle system to freeze, with optional transition time.": "指示粒子系统进入冻结状态, 可指定过渡时间. ",
  "Tell the frozen particle system to unfreeze, with optional transition time.": "指示被冻结的粒子系统解除冻结, 可选择性地指定过渡时间. ",
  "Tell the particle system to stop emitting and play its End Cap Effect.": "指示粒子系统停止发射粒子, 并播放其末端效果. ",
  "Destroy the particle system and remove all particles immediately.": "立即销毁粒子系统并移除所有粒子. ",
  "Set a Control Point via format - CP: X Y Z": "按照格式设置控制点 - CP: X Y Z",
  "Set X Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 X 分量",
  "Set Y Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 Y 分量",
  "Set Z Component of Data Control Point": "设置数据控制点的 Z 分量",
  "Set the light's render color (R G B).": "设置灯光的渲染颜色(红 绿 蓝). ",
  "Set the light brightness.": "设置灯光亮度. ",
  "Set the maximum light distance.": "设置最大光照距离. ",
  "Set the inner (bright) angle.": "设置内侧(亮部)角度. ",
  "Set the outer (fading) angle.": "设置外侧(渐变)角度. ",
  "Set the radius of the spotlight at the end point.": "设置终点处聚光灯的半径. ",
  "Change the lightstyle (see Appearance field for possible values).": "更改灯光样式(可能的值请参见'外观'字段). ",
  "Turn the light off.": "关掉灯光. ",
  "Toggle the light on/off.": "切换灯光的开关状态. ",
  "Sets the 'fadeInDuration' variable, used to fade cc lookup usage when entity is enabled.": "设置 'fadeInDuration' 变量, 该变量用于控制实体启用时 cc 查找功能的渐显时长. ",
  "Sets the 'fadeOutDuration' variable, used to fade cc lookup usage when entity is disabled.": "设置 'fadeOutDuration' 变量, 该变量用于控制实体被禁用时 cc 查找功能的渐隐时长. ",
  "Move the brush to the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "将画笔移动到终点位置(起点位置 +(移动方向 × 移动距离)). ",
  "Move the brush to the starting position.": "将画笔移动到起始位置. ",
  "Move the brush to a specific position between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "将画笔移动到 0.0 到 1.0 之间的指定位置, 其中 0 代表起始位置, 1 则代表起始位置加上(移动方向 × 移动距离)后的位置. ",
  "Set a new start position for our current location.": "设置当前位置的新的起始点. ",
  "Set the speed and update immediately.": "设置速度后立即更新. ",
  "Teleport to this entity's origin.": "传送到此实体的初始位置. ",
  "Update the end position to be this distance from the start position.": "将结束位置更新为距起始位置此距离的位置. ",
  "Update the start position to be this distance from the end position.": "将起始位置更新为距结束位置此距离的位置. ",
  "Fired when the brush reaches the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "当画笔到达终点位置时触发(起点位置 +(移动方向 × 移动距离)). ",
  "Fired when the brush reaches the starting position.": "当画笔回到起始位置时触发. ",
  "Sets the speed as a ratio of the specified Max Rotation Speed, where 0 is stopped and 1 is the Max Rotation Speed. Negative values rotate backwards. Any non-zero values with this call will cause rotating to start": "设定旋转速度, 该值表示相对于设定的最大旋转速度的比例:0 表示静止, 1 表示达到最大旋转速度. 负值则表示反向旋转. 只要调用此参数并传入任何非零值, 旋转即会开始",
  "Snap to the initial position and stop moving.": "回到初始位置并停止移动. ",
  "Start the rotator rotating at maximum Speed": "以最大速度启动旋转器",
  "Stop the rotator from rotating.": "停止旋转器的转动. ",
  "Stop the rotator from rotating when it gets around to the start position again (on its rotation axis).": "当旋转器再次回到起始位置(即其旋转轴上)时, 停止其旋转. ",
  "Set angles that can be snapped back to.": "设置可恢复到指定角度的值. ",
  "Start the rotator rotating forward at maximum speed.": "以最高速度让旋转器开始正向旋转. ",
  "Start the rotator rotating backward at maximum speed.": "以最大速度让旋转器反向旋转. ",
  "Toggle the rotator between rotating and not rotating.": "切换旋转器的旋转状态:开启或关闭旋转功能. ",
  "Reverse the direction of rotation of the rotator, preserving the current speed.": "反转旋转器的旋转方向, 同时保持当前转速不变. ",
  "Enables the acceleration and deceleration of this rotator": "启用此旋转器的加速与减速功能",
  "Disables the acceleration and deceleration of this rotator (instantly starts/stops)": "禁用此旋转器的加速与减速功能(可立即启动/停止)",
  "Fired this brush has stopped moving.": "这个画笔已停止移动. ",
  "Fired this brush has started moving": "这支画笔已开始移动",
  "Set the speed at which the texture scrolls.": "设置纹理滚动的速度. ",
  "Apply a force instantaneously to the rope. The parameter should be a vector containing the force to be applied (X Y Z).": "对绳索瞬间施加一个力. 该参数应为一个向量, 包含需要施加的力的大小及方向(X Y Z). ",
  "Break the rope, if it's marked to do so.": "如果绳子上有标记, 请将其弄断. ",
  "Lock the button, preventing it from functioning.": "锁定该按钮, 使其无法使用. ",
  "Unlock the button, allowing it to function.": "解除按钮锁定, 使其可以正常使用. ",
  "Disable the button, preventing entities from finding the button (removes all capabilities of the button)": "禁用该按钮, 防止实体识别到该按钮(这会移除按钮的所有功能) (removes all capabilities of the button)",
  "Enable the button, allowing entities to find the button again": "启用该按钮, 以便实体能重新找到它",
  "Activate the button as if it was pressed.": "模拟点击按钮的效果. ",
  "Activate the button as if it was pressed, sending it to the bottom position.": "模拟点击按钮, 使其处于底部位置. ",
  "Unpress the button, sending it to the top position.": "松开按钮, 使其回到顶部位置. ",
  "Fired when the button is damaged.": "按钮受损时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button is pressed.": "按下按钮时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button is used while locked.": "当按钮处于锁定状态但仍被使用时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button reaches the in/pressed position.": "当按钮处于按下/触发位置时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button reaches the out/released position.": "当按钮回到初始/释放位置时触发. ",
  "Move to a position. The parameter must be a value between 0 and 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "将对象移动到指定位置. 该参数值必须在 0 到 1 之间:0 表示未旋转时的初始位置, 1 则表示旋转后的位置 + '距离'. ",
  "Immediately teleport to a position. The parameter must be a value between 0 and 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "立即传送到指定位置. 该参数的值必须介于 0 到 1 之间, 其中 0 表示未旋转时的位置, 1 则表示旋转后的位置加上'距离'值. ",
  "Fired whenever the button moves. The output is the position of button from 0 to 1, where 0 is the unrotated position and 1 is the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "每当按钮发生移动时即触发. 输出值为按钮的位置, 范围在0到1之间, 其中0表示未旋转时的位置, 1则表示旋转后的位置加上'距离'. ",
  "Fired when the button is first pressed.": "在按钮首次被按下时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button is first released from being pressed.": "当按钮从按下状态释放时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button has reached position 1, the rotated position + 'Distance'.": "当按钮移动到位置1, 即旋转后的位置加上'距离'值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the button has reached position 0, the unrotated starting position.": "当按钮到达位置0, 即未旋转的初始位置时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the button reaches a goal position: i.e. when it becomes open, becomes closed, or reaches the point specified by a 'SetPosition' input.": "每当按钮到达目标位置时便会触发:即当按钮打开、关闭或到达'SetPosition'输入所指定的位置时. ",
  "Fired when the door starts closing.": "门开始关闭时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door starts opening.": "当门开始打开时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully open position. Reversed if 'Start Open' flag is set.": "当门完全打开时触发. 若设置了'初始即为打开状态'标志, 则情况相反. ",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully closed position. Reversed if 'Start Open' flag is set.": "当门完全关闭时触发. 若设置了'初始为开启状态'标志, 则情况相反. ",
  "Fired when the door is blocked while closing.": "当门在关闭过程中受阻时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door is blocked while opening.": "门在开启过程中被阻挡时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door is unblocked while closing.": "当门在关闭过程中解除阻塞时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door is unblocked while opening.": "在门在开启过程中解除阻塞时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player uses the door, but it is locked.": "当玩家尝试使用被锁住的门时触发. ",
  "Open the door, if it is not fully open.": "如果门尚未完全打开, 请将其打开. ",
  "Close the door, if it is not fully closed.": "如果门未完全关上, 请将其关好. ",
  "Toggle the door between open and closed.": "切换门的状态:开或关. ",
  "Lock the door.": "锁上门. ",
  "Unlock the door.": "打开门. ",
  "Set the door speed.": "设置门速. ",
  "Set whether NPCs can use this door or not.": "设置 NPC 是否可以使用这扇门. ",
  "Fired when the door is told to close.": "当指令门关闭时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door is told to open.": "当指令门打开时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully open position.": "当门完全打开时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door is ajar and told to open.": "当门处于半开状态且收到打开指令时触发. ",
  "Fired when the door reaches the fully closed position.": "当门完全关闭时触发. ",
  "Open the door away from the specified entity.": "打开远离指定实体的门. ",
  "Set the distance (in degrees) between Open and Closed.": "设置'打开'与'关闭'状态之间的角度距离(单位:度). ",
  "Set the speed at which the door rotates. 100 is default.": "设置门旋转的速度. 100为默认值. ",
  "Turn on.": "启用. ",
  "Turn off.": "关闭. ",
  "Sets the script model's sequence.": "设置脚本模型的执行顺序. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded for any reason.": "因任何原因加载地图时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded to start a new game.": "地图加载完毕并开始新游戏时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded from a saved game.": "在从存档加载地图时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded due to a level transition.": "在因关卡切换而导致地图加载时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded as a background to the main menu.": "在主菜单的背景地图加载完成后触发. ",
  "Fired only in multiplayer, when a new map is loaded.": "仅在多人游戏中加载新地图时触发. ",
  "Fired only in multiplayer, when a new round is started. Only fired in multiplayer games that use round-based gameplay.": "仅在多人游戏中开始新一轮时触发. 仅适用于采用回合制玩法的多人游戏. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded in Demo Mode.": "在演示模式下加载地图时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded with a VR HMD active.": "当地图在 VR 头戴式显示器已激活的状态下加载时触发. ",
  "Fired when the map is loaded without a VR HMD active.": "当地图加载完成但并未激活 VR HMD 时触发. ",
  "Set the value that will be compared against the compare value.": "设置待与比较值进行对比的值. ",
  "Set the value that will be compared against the compare value and performs the comparison.": "设置待与比较值进行对比的数值, 以执行比较操作. ",
  "Set the compare value.": "设置比较值. ",
  "Force a compare of the input value with the compare value.": "强制将输入值与比较值进行对比. ",
  "Fired when the input value is less than the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "当输入值小于比较值时触发. 此时会将输入值作为数据发送. ",
  "Fired when the input value is equal to the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "当输入值与比较值相等时触发. 此时会将输入值作为数据发送. ",
  "Fired when the input value is different from the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "当输入值与对比值不一致时触发. 此时会将输入值作为数据发送. ",
  "Fired when the input value is greater than the compare value. Sends the input value as data.": "当输入值大于比较值时触发. 此时会将输入值作为数据发送. ",
  "Set the boolean value without performing the comparison. Use this to hold a value for a future test.": "设置布尔值而无需执行比较操作. 此功能可用于保存某个值以供日后测试使用. ",
  "Set the boolean value and test it, firing OnTrue or OnFalse based on the new value.": "设置布尔值并进行测试, 系统会根据新值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse. ",
  "Toggle the boolean value between true and false.": "切换布尔值, 在真与假之间切换. ",
  "Toggle the boolean value and tests it, firing OnTrue or OnFalse based on the new value.": "切换布尔值并对其进行测试, 根据新值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse. ",
  "Test the input value and fire OnTrue or OnFalse based on the value.": "测试输入值, 并根据该值触发 OnTrue 或 OnFalse. ",
  "Fired when the input value is true (nonzero).": "当输入值为 true(非零值)时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value is false (zero).": "当输入值为 false(零)时触发. ",
  "Tests the state of all the logic_branches in the list and fires the appropriate output.": "测试列表中所有逻辑分支的状态, 并触发相应的输出. ",
  "Fired when all the logic_branches in the list become true.": "当列表中的所有逻辑分支均为真时触发. ",
  "Fired when all the logic_branches in the list become false.": "当列表中的所有逻辑分支均为假值时触发. ",
  "Fired when one of the logic branches in the list changes, but some are true and some are false.": "当列表中的某个逻辑分支发生变更, 且部分为真部分为假时触发. ",
  "Compares the Input value to the case values, and fires the appropriate output, if any.": "将输入值与各个案例值进行比较, 若匹配则触发相应的输出(如有). ",
  "Fires a random OnCase output with at least one connection.": "随机触发一个至少已连接一个节点的 OnCase 输出. ",
  "Fires a random OnCase output with at least one connection, with no repeats until all cases have been picked, at which point the shuffle starts over.": "随机触发一个至少已建立一条连接的 OnCase 输出, 且在所有情况均被触发一遍之前不会重复触发同一情况, 之后才会重新开始随机选取. ",
  "Starts the shuffle over so that the next PickRandomShuffle can select from all cases.": "重新启动随机排序, 这样下次调用 PickRandomShuffle 时就能从所有条目中进行选择. ",
  "Fired when the input value does not equal any of the Case values.": "当输入值与任何Case值都不匹配时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case01 value.": "当输入值等于 Case01 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case02 value.": "当输入值等于 Case02 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case03 value.": "当输入值等于 Case03 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case04 value.": "当输入值等于 Case04 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case05 value.": "当输入值等于 Case05 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case06 value.": "当输入值等于 Case06 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case07 value.": "当输入值等于 Case07 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case08 value.": "当输入值等于 Case08 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case09 value.": "当输入值等于 Case09 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case10 value.": "当输入值等于 Case10 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case11 value.": "当输入值等于 Case11 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case12 value.": "当输入值等于 Case12 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case13 value.": "当输入值等于 Case13 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case14 value.": "当输入值等于 Case14 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case15 value.": "当输入值等于 Case15 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case16 value.": "当输入值等于 Case16 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case17 value.": "当输入值等于 Case17 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case18 value.": "当输入值等于 Case18 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case19 value.": "当输入值等于 Case19 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case20 value.": "当输入值等于 Case20 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case21 value.": "当输入值等于 Case21 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case22 value.": "当输入值等于 Case22 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case23 value.": "当输入值等于 Case23 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case24 value.": "当输入值等于 Case24 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case25 value.": "当输入值等于 Case25 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case26 value.": "当输入值等于 Case26 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case27 value.": "当输入值等于 Case27 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case28 value.": "当输入值等于 Case28 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case29 value.": "当输入值等于 Case29 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case30 value.": "当输入值等于 Case30 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case31 value.": "当输入值等于 Case31 的值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the input value equals the Case32 value.": "当输入值等于 Case32 的值时触发. ",
  "Input value": "输入值",
  "Compares the values and fires appropriate outputs": "比较各值并触发相应的输出",
  "Fires if the values are equal": "当数值相等时触发",
  "Fires if the values are not equal": "若值不相等则触发",
  "Fires the specified activity event.": "触发指定的活动事件. ",
  "Set the name of the entity to associate this event with.": "设置与此事件相关联的实体名称. ",
  "Set the name of the entity to base this entities location on. This check will follow the entity as it moves.": "设置作为参照的实体名称, 此检查功能会随该实体的移动而同步更新. ",
  "Fired when the count of all npcs transitions to the min count or less.": "当所有NPC的数量降至最低数量或更低时触发. ",
  "Fired when the count of all npcs transitions to the max count or greater.": "当所有 NPC 的数量达到或超出最大数量时触发. ",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of all npcs.": "输出所有 NPC 数量的系数. ",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of all NPCs, that is closest to player.": "输出距离玩家最近的 NPC 与玩家之间的距离值. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 1 transitions to the min count or less.": "当NPC 1的数量降至最低值或更低时触发. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 1 transitions to the max count or greater.": "当NPC 1的数量变为最大值或更高时触发. ",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 1.": "输出 NPC 1的数量系数. ",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 1, that is closest to player.": "输出距离玩家最近的 NPC 1 与玩家之间的距离. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 2 transitions to the min count or less.": "当NPC 2的数量降至最低数量或更低时触发. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 2 transitions to the max count or greater.": "当NPC 2的数量变为最大值或更大时触发. ",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 2.": "输出 NPC 数量的因子 2. ",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 2, that is closest to player.": "输出距离玩家最近的第二个 NPC的距离. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 3 transitions to the min count or less.": "当NPC 3的数量降至最小数量或更低时触发. ",
  "Fired when the count of npc 3 transitions to the max count or greater.": "当NPC 3的数量变为最大值或更多时触发. ",
  "Outputs the factor of the count of npc 3.": "输出 NPC 数量的系数 3. ",
  "Outputs distance to the NPC, of NPCs 3, that is closest to player.": "输出距离玩家最近的第三个NPC的距离. ",
  "Set a new Refire Interval.": "设置新的重新发射间隔. ",
  "Reset the timer. It will fire after the Refire Interval expires.": "重置计时器. 计时器会在'重新触发间隔'结束后再次触发. ",
  "Force the timer to fire immediately.": "强制定时器立即触发. ",
  "Toggle the timer on/off.": "切换计时器的开/关状态. ",
  "Set a new Minimum Random Interval.": "设置新的最小随机间隔值. ",
  "Set a new Maximum Random Interval.": "设置一个新的最大随机间隔值. ",
  "Add time to the timer if it is currently enabled.  Does not change the Refire Interval.": "若计时器当前处于启用状态, 则可为其增加时间. 此操作不会影响重新触发间隔. ",
  "Subtract time from the timer if it is currently enabled.  Does not change the Refire Interval.": "若计时器当前处于启用状态, 则将其计时时间减去指定值. 此操作不会影响重新触发间隔时间. ",
  "Pauses the timer, maintaining its current remaining time.": "暂停计时器, 并保持当前的剩余时间不变. ",
  "Unpauses the timer, continuing from where it left off when frozen.": "恢复计时器运行, 从暂停时的状态继续计时. ",
  "Fired when the timer expires.": "计时器到期时触发. ",
  "Fired every other time for an oscillating timer.": "每两次触发一次, 适用于周期性计时器. ",
  "Enable collisions between the first and second entity.": "启用第一个实体与第二个实体之间的碰撞检测. ",
  "Disable collisions between the first and second entity.": "禁用第一个实体与第二个实体之间的碰撞. ",
  "Disable collisions between the first entity and use the parameter to find the second entity.": "禁用第一个实体间的碰撞, 并使用该参数来查找第二个实体. ",
  "Input value and fire the output with the remapped value.": "输入数值后, 系统会输出经过重映射处理后的值. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input is received, with the remapped input value as the parameter.": "当接收到 InValue 输入时触发, 此时重新映射后的输入值会作为参数传递. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input rises above the minimum legal value.": "当 InValue 输入值高于最低合法值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input rises above the maximum legal value.": "当 InValue 输入值超过允许的最大值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input falls below the minimum legal value.": "当 InValue 输入值低于最小合法值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input falls below the maximum legal value.": "当 InValue 输入值低于允许的最大值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the InValue input is received, with the remapped RGB color as the parameter.": "当接收到 InValue 输入时触发, 此时重映射后的 RGB 颜色值会作为参数传递. ",
  "Add an amount to the counter and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将数值加到计数器上, 然后以计算结果触发 OutValue 输出. ",
  "Divide the counter by an amount and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器的值除以指定数值, 然后将计算结果作为输出值发送. ",
  "Multiply the counter by an amount and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器的值乘以指定数值, 然后将计算结果作为输出值发送至 OutValue. ",
  "Set the counter to a new value and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "将计数器设置为新值, 并输出计算结果到 OutValue. ",
  "Set the counter to a new value without firing any outputs.": "将计数器设置为新值, 但不会触发任何输出. ",
  "Subtract an amount from the counter and fire the OutValue output with the result.": "从计数器中减去指定数值, 然后将计算结果作为输出值发送出去. ",
  "Set the upper bound of the counter and fire the OutValue output with the current value.": "设置计数器上限值, 随后将当前值作为输出值发送至 OutValue. ",
  "Set the lower bound of the counter and fire the OutValue output with the current value.": "设置计数器的下限值, 然后将当前值作为输出值发送到 OutValue. ",
  "Causes the counter fire its OnGetValue output with the current value of the counter. Used for polling the counter when you don't want constant updates from the OutValue output.": "使计数器触发其 OnGetValue 输出, 输出当前计数器的值. 适用于不希望从 OutValue 输出获得持续更新时, 对计数器进行轮询的场景. ",
  "Fired when the counter value changes.": "计数器值发生变化时触发. ",
  "Fired when the counter value meets or goes below the min value. The counter must go back above the min value before the output will fire again.": "当计数器值等于或低于最小值时触发. 只有计数器值重新高于最小值后, 该触发才会再次生效. ",
  "Fired when the counter value meets or exceeds the max value. The counter must go below the max value before the output will fire again.": "当计数器数值达到或超出最大值时触发. 只有计数器数值重新低于最大值后, 才会再次触发. ",
  "Fired when the counter value changes from the minimum value.": "当计数器值从最小值发生变化时触发. ",
  "Fired when the counter value changes from the max value.": "当计数器值从最大值变为其他值时触发. ",
  "Fired in response to the GetValue input. Used for polling the counter when you don't want constant updates from the OutValue output.": "响应 GetValue 输入而触发. 适用于在不希望 OutValue 输出持续更新的情况下轮询计数器数值. ",
  "Fired when the vector, from the start entity to the end entity, changes. Passes along the vector as a parameter.": "当从起始实体指向结束实体的向量发生变化时触发. 该向量会作为参数传递. ",
  "Turn on. The Navigation Entity will have its navigation properties set.": "启用后, 导航实体的各项导航属性即会被设置. ",
  "Turn off. The Navigation Entity will have its navigation properties returned to the default settings.": "关闭后, 导航实体的各项导航属性将恢复为默认设置. ",
  "Toggle on/off.": "开启/关闭. ",
  "Force an autosave.": "强制执行自动保存. ",
  "Force an autosave as autosavedangerous.sav. If the player is alive after the passed number of seconds it replaces the standard auto save.": "强制执行自动保存, 生成的文件名为 autosavedangerous.sav. 若在指定的秒数之后玩家仍存活, 该文件将替换常规的自动保存文件. ",
  "Set MinimumHitPoints to this.": "将 MinimumHitPoints 设置为此值. ",
  "Show the world geometry the target layer, but not the associated entities": "显示目标图层上的世界几何体, 但不显示相关的实体",
  "Hide the world geometry of the target layer, but not the associated entities": "隐藏目标图层的世界几何体, 但保留关联的实体",
  "Spawn the entities associated with the layer, but don't change the visiblity of the world geometry": "生成与该图层关联的实体, 但请勿更改场景几何体的可见性",
  "Destroy the entities spawned by the world layer, but don't change the visibilty of the world geometry": "销毁由世界图层生成的实体, 但切勿更改世界几何体的可见性",
  "Show the world geometry of the target layer and spawn the associated entities": "显示目标图层的世界几何结构并生成相关实体",
  "Hide the world goemtry of the target layer and destory the associated entities": "隐藏目标图层的世界几何体并销毁相关的实体",
  "Fired when the entities associated with the layer have been spawned.": "当与图层关联的实体成功生成后触发. ",
  "Spawn an instance of the template at this origin and angle.": "在此原点位置及角度处生成模板的实例. ",
  "Spawn an instance of the template that the same origin and angle as the specified entity (specify by targetname in parameters)": "生成一个模板实例, 其原点与角度与指定的实体相同(通过参数中的 targetname 指定).  (specify by targetname in parameters)",
  "Fired when an instance of the entity template has been spawned.": "在实体模板的实例被生成时触发. ",
  "Fired when a ForceSpawn input failed to spawn the template, either due to lack of space or being in player's view, depending on the spawnflags.": "当 ForceSpawn 输入尝试生成模板失败时触发此事件, 失败原因可能是空间不足或该位置处于玩家视野内, 具体取决于 spawnflags 的设置. ",
  "Test the activator against the filter and fires OnPass or OnFail output.": "测试激活器对过滤器的响应情况, 随后触发 OnPass 或 OnFail 输出. ",
  "Fired in response to TestActivator input if the activator passes the filter.": "当测试激活器符合过滤条件时, 会根据其输入内容触发相应操作. ",
  "Fired in response to TestActivator input if the activator fails to pass the filter.": "若 TestActivator 未能通过过滤器校验, 则会根据其输入内容触发相应操作. ",
  "Toggle the sensor between enabled and disabled.": "切换传感器的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Check to see if the Target Entity is facing the Look At Entity within the specified tolerance, firing either the OnFacingLookat or OnNotFacingLookat output based on the result.": "勾选此项可检查目标实体是否在允许的误差范围内正对着'注视目标'实体, 并根据结果触发 OnFacingLookat 或 OnNotFacingLookat 输出. ",
  "Fired when the forward direction of the Target Entity changes. Passes the new forward direction as a parameter.": "当目标实体的前进方向发生变化时触发. 此时会将新的前进方向作为参数传递. ",
  "Fired when the Target Entity points at the Look At Entity for more than the specified Duration, or in response to a Test input.": "当目标实体注视'注视目标实体'的时间超过指定时长时, 或者接收到测试输入时触发. ",
  "Fires in response to a Test input when the Target Entity is not pointing at the Look At Entity.": "当目标实体未指向'注视目标'实体时, 因测试输入而触发. ",
  "Normalized value (0..1) where 1 is facing directly at target and 0 is at or beyond the angle of tolerance.": "标准化数值范围为 0 到 1:1 表示正对目标方向, 0 则表示处于或超出允许的角度范围. ",
  "Checks to see if the Target Entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds the Threshold Velocity, ": "检查目标实体的角速度是否达到或超过阈值速度 ",
  "Checks to see if the Target Entity's angular velocity meets or exceeds the Threshold Velocity. Once the Fire Interval expires, ": "检查目标实体的角速度是否达到或超出阈值速度. 当发射间隔时间结束后 ",
  "Fired when the Target's Angular Velocity changes, passing the new magnitude of the angular velocity.": "当目标的角速度发生变化时触发, 并传递角速度的新数值. ",
  "Fired when the Target Entity goes from slower than the threshold angular velocity to faster than the threshold angular velocity.": "当目标实体的角速度从低于阈值变为高于阈值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the Target Entity goes from faster than the threshold angular velocity to slower than the threshold angular velocity.": "当目标实体的角速度从高于阈值变为低于阈值时触发. ",
  "Fired when the Target Entity reaches the threshold angular velocity from a different velocity.": "当目标实体从其他速度状态达到阈值角速度时触发. ",
  "Fired when the Target's Velocity changes, passing the new magnitude of the velocity.": "当目标的速度发生变化时触发, 并传递速度的新大小值. ",
  "Enable the sensor.": "启用传感器. ",
  "Disable the sensor.": "禁用传感器. ",
  "Distance of the target entity away from this entity.": "目标实体与此实体之间的距离. ",
  "Force a single fire, damaging either the Target Entity or all entities within the radius.": "强制触发一次攻击, 对目标实体或半径范围内的所有实体造成伤害. ",
  "Enable this entity. It will start damaging entities everytime it fires, and refire based upon the specified Delay.": "启用此实体. 每次触发时它将开始对其他实体造成伤害, 并会在指定的延迟时间后再次触发. ",
  "Disable this entity. It will stop damaging entities.": "禁用此实体. 这样做将使其不再对其他实体造成伤害. ",
  "Toggle this entity between On/Off state.": "切换此实体的开启/关闭状态. ",
  "Wake up this physics object, if it is sleeping.": "唤醒处于休眠状态的物理对象. ",
  "Put this physics object to sleep. It will wake if given the Wake input, or if force is applied to it. Note that physics objects go to sleep automatically after coming to rest for a while, so you don't really need to use this.": "让这个物理对象进入休眠状态. 只要接收到'唤醒'指令或受到外力作用, 它就会被唤醒. 需要注意的是, 物理对象在静止一段时间后也会自动进入休眠状态, 因此实际上你无需手动调用此功能. ",
  "Enable physics motion/collision response.": "启用物理运动/碰撞响应. ",
  "Disable physics motion/collision response.": "禁用物理运动/碰撞响应. ",
  "If this object is being carried by a player, with the physgun or +USE, force it to be dropped.": "若有玩家通过物理枪或 +USE 操作携带此物体, 强制使其掉落. ",
  "Fired when this entity is damaged.": "当此实体受到伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired when this entity becomes awake (collision/force is applied).": "当此实体被唤醒时触发(即受到碰撞或外力作用). ",
  "Fired when motion is enabled due to damage/physcannon/force.": "因受到伤害、使用物理加农炮或受力而导致运动被启用时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player tries to +USE the physbox. This output will fire only if the Generate output on +USE spawnflag is set.": "当玩家尝试通过 +USE 操作来使用物理盒子时触发. 仅当'在启用 +USE 时生成输出'标志被设置时, 此输出才会触发. ",
  "Fired when it touches with another entity. Activator is the other entity.": "当与另一个实体接触时触发. 激活对象即为那个其他实体. ",
  "Force the constraint to break.": "强制解除约束. ",
  "Enable the constraint.  Do this when the objects don't exist when the constraint spawns - or when you have deactivated the constraint.  Broken constraints can NOT be turned on.  They have been deleted.": "启用该约束. 当约束生成时相关对象尚不存在, 或者您已停用该约束时, 请执行此操作. 已损坏的约束无法被启用, 它们已被删除. ",
  "Disable this constraint.": "禁用此约束. ",
  "Fired when the constraint breaks.": "当约束条件被违反时触发. ",
  "Enable the controller.": "启用控制器. ",
  "Disable the controller.": "禁用控制器. ",
  "Set the spring rest length.": "设置弹簧的静止长度. ",
  "Increase the spring rest length by the given amount.": "将弹簧的静止长度增加指定的数值. ",
  "Decrease the spring rest length by the given amount.": "将弹簧的静止长度按指定数值缩短. ",
  "Set the spring frequency (stiffness).": "设置弹簧频率(刚度). ",
  "Set the spring damping ratio.": "设置弹簧阻尼比. ",
  "Set angular velocity around the hinge (motor) in deg/sec": "设置绕铰链(电机)的角速度, 单位为度/秒",
  "Set Motor Friction, 0 = no friction, 1 = friction that is about enough to counter gravity": "设置电机摩擦力:0表示无摩擦力, 1表示足以抵消重力的摩擦力",
  "Set the minimum hinge angle (degrees)": "设置最小铰链角度(度) (degrees)",
  "Set the maximum hinge angle (degrees)": "设置最大铰链角度(度) (degrees)",
  "Turn Motor Off, will turn all friction off": "关闭电机:此操作将关闭所有摩擦力",
  "Set Motor target velocity in deg/sec, use 0 to just turn friction on": "设置电机的目标转速, 单位为度/秒; 输入0则仅开启摩擦力功能",
  "Set Motor target angle, degrees. Exact number depends on constrained bodies reference frames and initial configuration. See constraint limits for reference to sensible range of values.": "设置电机的目标角度, 单位为度. 具体数值取决于受约束物体的参考坐标系及初始配置. 可查阅约束限制以了解合理的取值范围. ",
  "The min limit has been reached.": "已达到最小限制值. ",
  "The max limit has been reached.": "已达到最大限制值. ",
  "Fires if the attached objects start rotating around the hinge axis relatively to each other.": "当附加的对象开始相对于彼此绕铰链轴旋转时触发. ",
  "Fires if the attached objects stip rotating around the hinge axis relatively to each other.": "若附加对象彼此之间围绕铰链轴发生相对旋转, 则会触发此事件. ",
  "Normalized input to drive along the slide axis. E.g 0 = min limit and 1 = max limit": "标准化输入值用于沿滑动轴驱动. 例如:0 表示最小限值, 1 表示最大限值",
  "Set linear velocity along the constraint": "设置沿约束方向的线速度",
  "The requested force has been reached on the X axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "X轴方向已达到所需的力值. 若力的施加最小时间设为零, 则不会触发. ",
  "The requested force has been reached on the Y axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "已在 Y 轴上达到所要求的力值. 如果最小施力时间为零, 则不会触发. ",
  "The requested force has been reached on the Z axis.  Won't fire if force min time is zero.": "Z轴已达到所要求的力值. 如果最小施力时间为零, 则不会触发. ",
  "Set the transition time used when changing splines": "设置更改样条曲线时使用的过渡时间",
  "Set the spline to a new entity": "将样条曲线设置为新的实体",
  "Enable the limits at the ends of the spline": "启用样条曲线两端的限制",
  "Disable the limits at the ends of the spline": "禁用样条线两端的限制",
  "Turn the force on": "开启力场",
  "Turn the force off": "关闭力场",
  "Set Force Scale": "设置强制缩放比例",
  "Sets target speed": "设置目标速度",
  "Sets friction -- only applies when the motor is off": "设置摩擦力 - 仅在电机关闭时生效",
  "Turns motor on": "启动电机",
  "Turns motor off": "关闭电机",
  "Turn the magnet on.": "打开磁铁开关. ",
  "The the magnet off. This will detach anything current stuck to the magnet.": "关闭磁铁功能. 这样即可解除所有当前吸附在磁铁上的物体. ",
  "Fired when an entity is grabbed by the magnet.": "当实体被磁铁吸附时触发. ",
  "Fired when an entity is released by the magnet.": "当实体被磁铁释放时触发. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to loop. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制该属性执行动画并使其循环播放. 此参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to loop unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制使该对象播放指定动画并循环播放, 除非该对象已经在播放该动画. 此参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Changes the Idle Animation to the one specified in the parameter and force it to loop.": "将闲置动画更改为参数中指定的动画, 并强制其循环播放. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to not loop. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制该属性触发动画, 且禁止循环播放. 此参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation and force it to not loop unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制让该组件播放指定动画, 且禁止其循环播放 - 除非该组件原本就在播放该动画. 此参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Changes the Idle Animation to the one specified in the parameter and force it to not loop.": "将闲置动画更改为参数中指定的动画, 并强制其不循环. ",
  "Set the playback rate for the animation.": "设置动画的播放速率. ",
  "Sets bodygroup. Format is <BodygroupName,index> ": "设置身体部位组. 格式为 <身体部位组名称,索引> ",
  "Make the prop visible.": "使该属性可见. ",
  "Make the prop invisible.": "使该道具不可见. ",
  "Enable collision on the prop.": "启用道具的碰撞检测. ",
  "Disable collision on the prop.": "禁用该道具的碰撞功能. ",
  "Enable and disable NAVIgnore on the prop.": "启用或禁用该属性上的 NAVIgnore. ",
  "Fired whenever a new animation has begun playing.": "每当有新的动画开始播放时即触发. ",
  "Fired whenever an animation is complete.": "每当动画播放完成时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever a non-looping animation playing forward hits the end (cycle=1).": "当非循环动画正向播放至结尾时触发(此时循环次数=1). ",
  "Fired whenever a non-looping animation playing backward hits the beginning (cycle=0).": "当非循环动画反向播放至起始点(cycle=0)时触发. ",
  "Fires off an event when the current cycle of a looped animation is complete.": "当循环动画的当前周期结束时, 会触发一个事件. ",
  "Enable gravity on physics object": "启用物理对象的重力效果",
  "Disable gravity on physics object": "禁用物理物体的重力效果",
  "Set the Physics Impact Damage Scale for this character. NOTE: 0 means this feature is disabled for backwards compatibility.": "设置该角色的物理冲击伤害比例. 注意:值为0表示该功能已禁用, 以维持向后兼容性. ",
  "Set whether or not this prop should automatically convert back to interactive debris after it comes to rest as debris.": "设置此属性:当碎片静止后, 是否应自动变回可交互的碎片. ",
  "Add an attribute with a value of 1.": "添加一个值为 1 的属性. ",
  "Remove an attribute.": "移除属性. ",
  "Fired when motion is enabled on this prop, either via 'Health Level to Override Motion' or from the EnableMotion input.": "当通过'要覆盖运动的生命值等级'或'启用运动'输入项为该道具启用运动时, 便会触发此事件. ",
  "Fired when this entity becomes awake (collision/force is applied to it while it's asleep).": "当此实体从休眠状态被唤醒时触发(即在休眠期间受到碰撞或外力作用). ",
  "Fired when the player tries to +USE the prop. This output will fire only if the Generate output on +USE spawnflag is set.": "当玩家尝试通过 +USE 操作来使用物体时触发. 仅当'在 +USE 操作时生成输出'标志被启用时, 此输出才会触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the prop is out of the allowed world bounds.": "每当属性值超出允许的范围时即触发. ",
  "Ignite, burst into flames.": "点燃, 瞬间燃起火焰. ",
  "Ignite, with a parameternumber of hitbox fires.": "触发效果, 并传入参数:命中框触发次数. ",
  "Fade out then remove (kill) self. Parameter override = duration of fade": "渐隐后移除自身. 参数覆盖值即渐隐持续时间",
  "Attach the ornament to a different entity. Parameter should be the name of entity to attach to.": "将装饰物附加到另一个实体上. 参数应为要附加到的实体的名称. ",
  "Detach from the Target Entity and become invisible. The ornament can be re-attached with the SetAttached input.": "与目标实体分离并变得不可见. 通过'SetAttached'指令可重新将装饰物附着到目标实体上. ",
  "Passenger entered the vehicle (argument is passenger index)": "乘客已上车(参数为乘客索引) (argument is passenger index)",
  "Passenger exited the vehicle (argument is passenger index)": "乘客已下车(参数为乘客的索引) (argument is passenger index)",
  "Prevent passengers from entering or exiting the vehicle.": "防止乘客上下车. ",
  "Re-allow passengers to enter or exit the vehicle.": "允许乘客重新上下车. ",
  "Toggle the brush on/off. When off, the brush will be non-solid and invisible.": "切换画笔的开启/关闭状态. 关闭时, 画笔将变为半透明且不可见. ",
  "Start the target moving.": "启动目标物体的移动. ",
  "Stop the target from moving.": "阻止目标移动. ",
  "Toggle the target between moving and stopped.": "切换目标的移动与停止状态. ",
  "Fires when the target is killed.": "目标被击杀时触发. ",
  "Set the speed of the train, as a ratio of max speed [0, 1]": "设置列车速度, 以最大速度的百分比表示, 取值范围为 [0, 1]",
  "Set the speed of the train, as a ratio of max speed. Negative values reverse the direction [-1, 1]": "设置火车的行驶速度, 数值为最大速度的百分比. 负值表示反向行驶. 取值范围为 [-1, 1]",
  "Set the speed of the train. Must be a positive value from 0 to max speed.": "设置列车速度. 该值必须为介于 0 和最大速度之间的正数. ",
  "Stop the train.": "停止列车. ",
  "Start the train moving forward.": "启动列车向前行驶. ",
  "Start the train moving backward.": "使列车开始向后行驶. ",
  "Resume the train moving in the current direction after it was stopped via the 'Stop' or 'Toggle' input.": "在通过'停止'或'切换'指令使列车暂停后, 继续使其沿当前方向行驶. ",
  "Reverse the direction of the train.": "反转火车的运行方向. ",
  "Toggle the train between start and stop.": "切换列车的启动与停止状态. ",
  "Trigger the track change.": "触发曲目切换. ",
  "Start moving to a destination and stop when you get there. This must be in the same path.": "开始向目标位置移动, 到达后停止. 起点与终点必须位于同一路径上. ",
  "Teleport to a destination and stop there. This can be in a new path.": "传送到目标位置并停在那里. 该位置可以位于新的路径上. ",
  "Lock the current orientation of the train.": "锁定列车当前的行驶方向. ",
  "Unlock the current orientation of the train.": "解锁列车当前的运行方向. ",
  "Set a new max speed for the train.": "设置列车的最大速度. ",
  "Fired when the train starts moving in either direction.": "当列车开始向任意方向移动时触发. ",
  "Fires when this train picks a new point to move towards (and just after OnStart).": "当列车选定一个新的移动目标点时触发(在 OnStart 之后立即触发). ",
  "Fired when this train arrives at a destination that was specified by the MoveToPathNode Input.": "当此列车抵达由 MoveToPathNode 输入参数所指定的目的地时触发. ",
  "Fired when the tank is killed.": "坦克被击毁时触发. ",
  "Cause the track to toggle to/from its alternate path.": "使轨迹在主路径与备用路径之间切换. ",
  "Enable the alternate path of the track.": "启用轨道的备用路径. ",
  "Disable the alternate path of the track.": "禁用音轨的备用路径. ",
  "Cause the track to toggle on/off/": "使音轨切换开启/关闭",
  "Enable the track.": "启用该追踪功能. ",
  "Disable the track.": "禁用该轨迹. ",
  "Fired when any entity following this path passes this path_track node.": "当任何沿此路径移动的实体经过该 path_track 节点时触发. ",
  "Cause the level change. Use this when triggering the level change with a button, etc.": "用于触发等级变更. 当通过按钮等方式触发等级变更时请使用此功能. ",
  "Fired when the level changes.": "等级发生变化时触发. ",
  "Set a new amount of damage for this trigger.": "设置此触发器的新伤害数值. ",
  "Fired whenever this trigger hurts something other than a player.": "每当此触发器对非玩家单位造成伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever this trigger hurts a player.": "每当此触发器对玩家造成伤害时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever an entity is removed.": "每当某个实体被移除时触发. ",
  "Tests if the trigger is being touched and fires an output based on whether the value is true or false.": "用于检测触发器是否被触碰, 并根据返回值(true或false)来触发相应输出. ",
  "Fired whenever the trigger is activated.": "每当触发器被激活时即触发. ",
  "Fired when the TestTouch input is true (something is touching the trigger.)": "当 TestTouch 输入值为真时触发(即有物体触碰了触发器)",
  "Fires for each entity inside the trigger when the TestTouch input is true. Each call provides the individual entity as the activator.": "当 TestTouch 输入值为真时, 该事件会针对触发器内的每个实体触发一次. 每次调用时, 相应的实体会被作为触发者传递进去. ",
  "Fired when the TestTouch input is not true (nothing is touching the trigger.)": "当 TestTouch 输入值为假时触发(即没有任何物体触碰触发器)",
  "Fired when the trigger is activated. Does NOT fire if the timeout expires.": "触发器被激活时触发. 若超时时间已到则不会触发. ",
  "Fired after the timeout interval expires if the player never looked at the target. OnTrigger does NOT fire in this case.": "若在超时时长过后玩家仍未注视目标, 则会触发此事件. 在此情况下, OnTrigger不会触发. ",
  "Fired once when the player looks until they have unlooked/untouched.": "在玩家观看完毕后(即不再观看/触摸时), 此事件会被触发一次. ",
  "Fired when the player was looking and unlooked while still touching.": "当玩家在保持触摸状态的情况下进行注视与取消注视操作时触发. ",
  "Set the push speed in inches / second.": "设置推送速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "Sets the angles indicating the direction to push touched entities.": "设置用于指示推动被触摸实体的方向的角度. ",
  "Set the baseline for how hard the wind blows.": "设置风力强度的基准值. ",
  "Fire the impact, pushing all entities within the volume.": "触发冲击效果, 将范围内的所有实体推开. ",
  "Set the magnitude of the impact.": "设置影响的强度. ",
  "Fired after an impact. The parameter passed along is the force of the impact that was generated.": "在发生碰撞后触发. 传递的参数为产生的碰撞力度. ",
  "Fired continuously when entities are touching the trigger volume. The output parameter is the distance from the ": "当实体接触到触发区域时会持续触发. 输出参数为该实体距离触发区域的… ",
  "Set the distance that water starts transitioning to cheap water.": "设置水开始转变为廉价水的距离. ",
  "Set the distance that water finishes transitioning to cheap water.": "设置水完全转变为廉价水所需的距离. ",
  "Changes camera's FOV over time": "随时间改变摄像机的视野范围",
  "Turn the camera on, and turn all other cameras off.": "打开该摄像头, 并关闭所有其他摄像头. ",
  "Turn the camera on.": "打开摄像头. ",
  "Turn the camera off.": "关闭摄像头. ",
  "Enable Depth of Field.": "启用景深效果. ",
  "Disable Depth of Field.": "禁用景深效果. ",
  "Set DOF Near Blurry Range.": "设置景深近模糊范围. ",
  "Set DOF Near Crisp Range.": "设置近景清晰度范围. ",
  "Set DOF Far Crisp Range.": "设置深度范围远景清晰区间. ",
  "Set DOF Far Blurry Range.": "设置景深远景模糊范围. ",
  "Set DOF Tilt to Ground Amount (0..1).": "设置景深倾斜相对于地面的幅度(取值范围:0..1). ",
  "Activates / deactivates orientation toward the target": "启用/禁用朝向目标的定向功能",
  "Sets the target to orient toward": "设置目标对象的方向",
  "Set the Entity to Measure, whose movement should be measured.": "设置需要测量其运动的实体. ",
  "Set the Measure Reference entity.": "设置度量参考实体. ",
  "Set the Entity to Move, which will be moved to mimic the measured entity.": "设置要移动的实体, 该实体将会被移动以模拟被测量的实体. ",
  "Set the Movement Reference entity.": "设置移动参考实体. ",
  "Set the scale to divide the measured movements by.": "设置缩放比例, 用于对测量到的移动值进行换算. ",
  "Enable the logic_measure_movement.": "启用 logic_measure_movement 功能. ",
  "Disable the logic_measure_movement.": "禁用 logic_measure_movement 功能. ",
  "Start the intro credits rolling.": "开始播放片头字幕. ",
  "Start the outro credits rolling.": "开始播放片尾字幕. ",
  "Show the HL2 logo.": "显示《半条命2》的徽标. ",
  "Fired when the credits having finished rolling.": "在片尾字幕播放完毕后触发. ",
  "Fired when a Portal player initiates slow time.": "当 Portal 玩家启动时光减速时触发. ",
  "Fired when a Portal player stops slowing time.": "当 Portal 玩家停止减慢时间时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player turns on his flashlight. This output has the value of how much energy the player had when this happened [0..1].": "当玩家打开手电筒时触发. 该输出的数值表示此时玩家的能量值, 范围在 [0..1] 之间. ",
  "Fired when the player turns off his flashlight. This output has the value of how much energy the player had when this happened [0..1].": "当玩家关闭手电筒时触发. 此输出的数值表示此时玩家的能量值 [0..1]. ",
  "Requests the current player's health from the proxy. This will fire the PlayerHealth output with the value.": "向代理请求当前玩家的生命值. 该操作将会触发 PlayerHealth 输出并返回相应数值. ",
  "The player's current health value.": "玩家当前的生命值. ",
  "Player fired an AR2 combine ball that didn't kill any enemies.": "玩家发射了一枚AR2组合弹, 但并未击杀任何敌人. ",
  "Puts the player's flashlight in slow-power-drain mode (for Episodic darkness)": "将玩家的手电筒设为低耗电模式(适用于剧情中的黑暗场景) (for Episodic darkness)",
  "Puts the player's flashlight to default power drain": "将玩家的手电筒功耗恢复为默认值",
  "Sets the player's health to this value.": "将玩家的生命值设置为该数值. ",
  "Request the ammo state of the player. It will fire PlayerHasAmmo or PlayerHasNoAmmo outputs.": "请求获取玩家的弹药状态. 此操作会触发 PlayerHasAmmo 或 PlayerHasNoAmmo 输出. ",
  "Fired by request if the player has any ammo.": "若玩家拥有任何弹药, 则可应请求将其发射出去. ",
  "Fired by request if the player doesn't have any ammo.": "若玩家没有任何弹药, 则根据请求将其停用. ",
  "Fires when the player dies.": "玩家死亡时触发. ",
  "Lowers the players weapon.": "降低玩家的武器高度. ",
  "Cause player to take less damage from physics objects, and never more than 30 points from any individual strike.": "使玩家受到物理物体的伤害降低, 且单次受到的伤害值绝不会超过30点. ",
  "Undo effects of EnableCappedPhysicsDamage": "撤销 EnableCappedPhysicsDamage 产生的效果",
  "Set the entity that the HUD locator should track. (Usually a vehicle)": "设置HUD定位器需要追踪的实体(通常为载具).  (Usually a vehicle)",
  "Changes name of statistic counter": "更改统计计数器的名称",
  "Increments named statistic counter by specified value": "将指定的统计计数器按给定数值进行递增",
  "Turn the spotlight on.": "让聚光灯聚焦于此. ",
  "Turn the spotlight off": "关闭聚光灯",
  "Start the rotator rotating.": "开始让旋转器转动. ",
  "Reverse the direction of rotation of the rotator.": "反转旋转器的旋转方向. ",
  "Fires when light turns on.": "灯光开启时触发. ",
  "Fires when light turns off.": "灯光关闭时触发. ",
  "Start showing the hint. If an entity name is passed as a parameter, the hint is shown only to that entity.": "开始显示提示信息. 如果传入了实体名称作为参数, 则仅对该实体显示提示信息. ",
  "Stop showing the hint if it hasn't already timed out.": "若提示尚未超时, 则停止显示. ",
  "Set the player that should receive this hint to the activator of this input. Only necessary to use this if the player isn't the activator of the ShowHint input. You shouldn't use !player for this, because that only works in singleplayer, and the point of this is to handle multiple players. Instead, fire this input from an output of the entity that the target player activated to initiate the series of events that caused you to want to show them this hint.": "将应接收此提示的玩家设置为触发该输入操作的玩家. 只有当触发 ShowHint 输入操作的玩家并非目标玩家时, 才需要设置此参数. 切勿使用 !player 作为参数值, 因为该值仅适用于单人模式, 而此功能旨在支持多玩家场景. 正确的做法是从目标玩家所激活的实体输出端触发该输入, 从而启动一系列事件并最终显示提示内容给该玩家. ",
  "Start blending to the desired timescale.": "开始混合, 直至达到所需的时间尺度. ",
  "Stop and blend back to the default timescale (1.0f).": "停止并恢复为默认的时间缩放率(1.0f). ",
  "Reset immediately to normal timescale (1.0f).": "立即重置为正常时间比例(1.0f). ",
  "Enable rendering.": "启用渲染. ",
  "Disable rendering.": "禁用渲染. ",
  "Toggle rendering.": "切换渲染模式. ",
  "Change the text.": "修改文本. ",
  "Set the text to an integer value.": "将文本设置为整数值. ",
  "Set the text color.": "设置文本颜色. ",
  "Sets next pathcorner": "设置下一个路径拐角",
  "Fires when a path follower passes this point": "当路径跟随者经过此点时触发",
  "Sets momentum type": "设置动量类型",
  "Sets momentum modifier": "设置动量修正值",
  "Sets snap value": "设置吸附值",
  "Sets engage distance": "设置触发距离",
  "Sets disengage distance": "设置脱离距离",
  "Fires when the interp value changes, passing the new position [0.0 .. 1.0]": "当插值值发生变化时触发, 并传递新的位置值 [0.0 .. 1.0]",
  "Fires when the interp value changes, passing the change in position [-1.0 .. 1.0]": "当插值值发生变化时触发, 此时会传入位置变化值 [-1.0 .. 1.0]",
  "Fires when the interp value hits 0.0": "当插值值变为0.0时触发",
  "Fires when the interp value hits 1.0": "当插值值达到1.0时触发",
  "Fires when the interp value hits a custom specified value": "当插值值达到自定义设定的值时触发",
  "Fires when engaged due to enering the Engage Distance (and pressing USE if needed)": "当进入触发距离后(必要时按下使用键)即会触发 (and pressing USE if needed)",
  "Fires when disengaged due to going beyond the Disengage Max Distance (or releasing USE if needed)": "当角色因超出'解除绑定最大距离'而导致绑定解除时(或必要时松开USE键), 便会触发此事件 (or releasing USE if needed)",
  "Enable the UI.": "启用用户界面. ",
  "Disable the UI (may hide it).": "禁用用户界面(可能会将其隐藏). ",
  "Ignore user input.": "忽略用户输入. ",
  "Accept user input.": "接受用户输入. ",
  "Add a CSS class to the panel.": "为面板添加一个 CSS 类. ",
  "Remove a CSS class from the panel.": "从面板中移除 CSS 类. ",
  "Add a CSS class to the panel only for local player.": "仅为本地玩家添加一个CSS类到面板. ",
  "Remove a CSS class from the panel only for local player. ": "仅对本地玩家移除面板上的 CSS 类.  ",
  "Damages the panel": "损坏面板",
  "Completely breaks the panel": "会彻底破坏面板结构",
  "Restore the panel": "恢复面板",
  "Fires when the panel first breaks.": "面板首次断开时触发. ",
  "Resets scattering and anisotropy to default values": "将散射与各向异性参数重置为默认值",
  "Set overall fog strength": "设置整体雾气强度",
  "Set fade in/out speed": "设置淡入/淡出速度",
  "Set draw distance": "设置绘制距离",
  "Forces the fog volume to update if a light's state has changed": "强制在光源状态发生变更时更新雾效体积",
  "Turns on/off indirect fogging": "开启/关闭间接雾效",
  "Set the radius parameter provided the particle system": "设置粒子系统所使用的半径参数",
  "Set the slack parameter which may be used by the particle system to determine how much the rope droops.": "设置松弛度参数, 粒子系统会依据此参数来决定绳索下垂的程度. ",
  "Disable the contraint which pins a particle to the specified path node.": "禁用将粒子固定在指定路径节点上的约束. ",
  "Trigger the relay with an input that has the player as activator and HandID as value": "使用玩家作为激活器且以HandID作为值的输入信号来触发继电器",
  "Fired when the map was loaded in commentary mode.": "在解说模式下地图加载完成时触发. ",
  "Fired when commentary mode was turned on mid-way through a map.": "在地图进行过程中开启解说模式时触发. ",
  "Forces a node to start playing.": "强制节点开始播放. ",
  "Forces a node to start playing, and prevents the player from stopping the playback until it has completed.": "强制让节点开始播放, 并在播放完成前阻止播放器停止播放. ",
  "Enable this node, making it visible to the player.": "启用此节点, 使其对玩家可见. ",
  "Disable this node, making it invisible to the player.": "禁用此节点, 使其对玩家不可见. ",
  "Set a new origin for this commentary node. If it's not in use, it'll teleport to this location immediately. If it's currently being listened to, it'll return to this location when it finishes playing.": "设置此解说节点的新起始位置. 若该节点当前未被使用, 则会立即传送到该位置; 若正在播放中, 则会在播放结束后回到该位置. ",
  "Fired when this node starts playback.": "当此节点开始播放时触发. ",
  "Fired when this node stops playback.": "当此节点停止播放时触发. ",
  "Set color": "设置颜色",
  "Set brightness": "设置亮度",
  "Turn on the light.": "打开灯光. ",
  "Turn off the light.": "关灯. ",
  "Toggle the light.": "切换灯光. ",
  "Set the light's color.": "设置灯光的颜色. ",
  "Set the light's color temperature in Kelvin.": "设置灯光的色温值, 单位为开尔文. ",
  "Set the light's brightness in EV.": "设置灯光的曝光值亮度. ",
  "Set the light's brightness multiplier, which defaults to 1.": "设置灯光的亮度倍率, 默认值为1. ",
  "',' separated list of styles from light_styles.vdata to play in sequence. The last entry will loop. The last style can be 'on'/'off' to enable/disable the light with no light style.": "按逗号分隔的样式列表, 这些样式取自 light_styles.vdata 并按顺序播放. 最后一个样式会循环播放. 最后一个样式也可设为'on'或'off', 分别用于开启或关闭灯光(此时无需指定具体样式). ",
  "Set the fog strength.": "设置雾气强度. ",
  "Set the fog multiplier, which defaults to 1.": "设置雾效倍数, 默认值为1. ",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 0.": "当当前灯光样式触发了由'样式输出事件0'所指定的事件类型时, 便会触发此事件. ",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 1.": "当当前灯光样式触发'样式输出事件1'所指定的类型事件时便会调用此函数. ",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 2.": "当当前光源样式触发了由'样式输出事件 2'所指定的事件类型时, 此事件即被触发. ",
  "Fired when the current light style plays an event of the type specified by Style Output Event 3.": "当当前灯光样式触发'样式输出事件3'所指定的事件类型时, 将触发此事件. ",
  "Changes the entity's parent in the movement hierarchy.": "更改实体在运动层级中的父级. ",
  "Fired when the entity is killed and removed from the game.": "当实体被杀死并从游戏中移除时触发. ",
  "Sets whether the light is enabled (takes parameter of 0 or 1)": "设置灯光是否启用(参数值可为 0 或 1) (takes parameter of 0 or 1)",
  "Set light color": "设置灯光颜色",
  "Set light brightness": "设置灯光亮度",
  "Set appearance 0=Normal 1=Flicker A, 2=Slow, strong pulse 3=Candle A ...": "设置外观:0=正常; 1=闪烁 A; 2=缓慢且强烈的脉冲; 3=烛光 A...",
  "Changes the entity's team": "更改实体的所属队伍",
  "Fires when the player +uses this weapon": "当玩家使用该武器时触发",
  "Fires when the player picks up this weapon": "玩家拾起该武器时触发",
  "Set the reserve ammo on this weapon": "设置此武器的备用弹药量",
  "Set the ammo on this weapon": "设置此武器的弹药数量",
  "Toggle CanBePickedUp": "切换'可拾取'状态",
  "End the multiplayer game.": "结束多人游戏. ",
  "Set Fog Start Distance": "设置雾效起始距离",
  "Set Fog End Distance": "设置雾效结束距离",
  "Set Fog Start Height": "设置雾效起始高度",
  "Set Fog End Height": "设置雾效结束高度",
  "Set Fog Max Opacity": "设置雾效最大透明度",
  "Set Fog Falloff Exponent": "设置雾气衰减指数",
  "Set Fog Vertical Exponent": "设置雾效垂直指数",
  "Set Fog Color": "设置雾气颜色",
  "Set Fog Strength": "设置雾效强度",
  "Set Player Visibility Postprocessing Strength": "设置玩家可见度后处理强度",
  "Set Player Fog Distance Multiplier": "设置玩家雾效距离倍率",
  "Set Player Fog Max Density Multiplier": "设置玩家雾气最大密度倍率",
  "Shows the hint message.": "显示提示信息. ",
  "Hides the hint message.": "隐藏提示信息. ",
  "Sets this spawn point as enabled.": "将此生成点设置为启用状态. ",
  "Sets this spawn point as disabled.": "将此生成点设置为禁用状态. ",
  "Toggle the enabled/disabled state of this spawn point.": "切换此生成点的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Fires when a player starts to use a hostage": "当玩家开始使用人质时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is first picked up": "在首次抓起人质时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is dropped, but not rescued": "人质被放下但未被解救时触发",
  "Fires when the hostage is rescued": "人质获救时触发",
  "Set the glow scale multiplier (0 - 8.0).": "设置发光效果的缩放倍数(0 - 8.0). ",
  "Set the Alpha scale multiplier (0 - 1.0).": "设置Alpha缩放倍数(0 - 1.0). ",
  "Disable breaking.": "禁用断行功能. ",
  "Reenable breaking.": "重新启用中断功能. ",
  "Specify how many seconds before it explodes.": "请指定爆炸前的秒数. ",
  "Enable the logic_eventlistener.": "启用 logic_eventlistener. ",
  "Disable the logic_eventlistener.": "禁用 logic_eventlistener. ",
  "Fired when the event has been detected.": "检测到事件时触发. ",
  "Starts blocking nav areas.": "开始阻止导航区域的使用. ",
  "Stops blocking nav areas.": "停止屏蔽导航区域. ",
  "Fires when C4 explodes": "C4爆炸时触发",
  "Fires when a C4 is planted": "放置C4时触发",
  "Fires when a C4 is defused": "当C4被拆除时触发",
  "Fires win conditions for the win.": "触发胜利条件即可获胜. ",
  "Toggle the direction": "切换方向",
  "Set the speed in inches per second,": "设置速度, 单位为英寸/秒",
  "Set the duration in seconds to transition to the new speed,": "设置从当前速度过渡到新速度的时长(以秒为单位)",
  "Set the money value that will be awarded. (without awarding it)": "设置要奖励的金额(但不会实际发放) (without awarding it)",
  "Add money to players on team TERRORIST.": "为恐怖分子队伍中的玩家添加金钱. ",
  "Add money to players on team COUNTER TERRORIST.": "向反恐精英队的玩家添加金钱. ",
  "Add money directly to the player activating this entity. (no chat description)": "将金钱直接添加到激活此实体的玩家账户中. (无聊天描述) (no chat description)",
  "If the player has [money amount] or more, take [money amount] away.": "如果玩家拥有的金钱数额达到 [money amount] 或以上, 则扣除 [money amount]. ",
  "Fires when input SpendMoneyFromPlayer succeeded.": "当从玩家处收取金钱操作成功时触发. ",
  "Fires when input SpendMoneyFromPlayer failed. (Player didn't have enough money)": "当尝试从玩家账户扣款失败时触发(玩家余额不足)",
  "Run callback registered using OnScriptInput.": "执行通过 OnScriptInput 注册的回调函数. ",
  "Remove paint from the brush entity.": "清除画笔实体上的颜料. ",
  "Turns off rendering of this entity in reflections when using $reflectonlymarkedentities in water material.": "当在水面材质中启用 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时, 此选项可禁止在反射效果中渲染该实体. ",
  "Turn on rendering of this entity in reflections when using $reflectonlymarkedentities in water material.": "启用此选项后, 在水面材质中使用 $reflectonlymarkedentities 时, 该实体也会出现在反射效果中. ",
  "Add the EF_NODRAW flag to this entity. Some entities manage this on their own so be aware you can override that value.": "为该实体添加 EF_NODRAW 标志. 部分实体会自行处理此标志, 因此请注意您可能会覆盖其原有设置. ",
  "Remove the EF_NODRAW flag to this entity. Some entities manage this on their own so be aware you can override that value.": "移除该实体的 EF_NODRAW 标志. 部分实体会自行管理此标志, 因此请注意您可能会覆盖其原有值. ",
  "This object will not recieve light or shadows from projected textures (flashlights).": "此对象不会受到投影纹理(手电筒光线)产生的光线或阴影影响. ",
  "This object may recieve light or shadows from projected textures (flashlights).": "该对象可能会接收来自投影纹理(如手电筒光线)的光线或阴影. ",
  "Execute a game script file from disk": "从磁盘中执行游戏脚本文件",
  "Execute a string of script source code": "执行一段脚本源代码",
  "Adds an entity I/O connection to this entity. Format: <output name> <targetname>:<inputname>:<parameter>:<delay>:<max times to fire (-1 == infinite)>. Very dangerous, use with care.": "用于为该实体添加输入/输出连接. 格式:<输出名称> <目标实体名>:<输入名称>:<参数>:<延迟时间>:<最大触发次数(-1 表示无限)>. 此操作极具风险, 请谨慎使用. ",
  "Used by HL1Port. Sets the brush texture index. Use a material_modify_control entity instead.": "供 HL1Port 使用. 用于设置笔刷纹理索引. 建议改用 material_modify_control 实体. ",
  "Used by HL1Port. Increments the brush texture index. Use a material_modify_control entity instead.": "由 HL1Port 使用. 用于递增笔刷纹理索引. 建议改用 material_modify_control 实体. ",
  "Makes the breakable able to picked up by the physcannon.": "使可破坏物体能够被物理加农炮拾取. ",
  "Makes the breakable not able to picked up by the physcannon.": "使可破坏的物体无法被物理加农炮拾取. ",
  "Fired when the physcannon has ripped this breakable off of the wall. Only fired if ACT_PHYSCANNON_DETACH is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当物理加农炮将该可破坏物体从墙上分离时触发此事件. 仅当该可破坏物体所使用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_DETACH 时才会触发. ",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the Pre physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_PRE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当玩家试图使用物理加农炮抓取该物体, 导致其开始执行'物理加农炮拉动前'动画时触发此事件. 仅在该可破坏物体所使用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_PRE 动画时才会触发. ",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using. If the prop has Pre pull anim, this will be fired after the Pre anim has finished playing.": "当玩家试图使用物理锤抓取该物体并触发'物理锤拉动'动作时, 会触发此事件. 仅当该可破坏物体所使用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE 动作时才会触发. 若该物体设有'拉动前动画', 则此事件会在该前置动画播放完毕后被触发. ",
  "Fired when this prop has finished playing the physcannon-pull activity, caused by the player trying to grab this prop with the physcannon. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE activity is defined in the model this breakable is using. If the prop has Pre & Post pull anims, this will be fired after the Post anim has finished playing.": "当物体完成物理加农炮牵引动作后触发此事件, 该动作由玩家尝试使用物理加农炮抓取该物体所引发. 仅当可破坏物体所使用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE 动作时, 此事件才会触发. 若该物体设有牵引前与牵引后的动画, 则此事件会在牵引后动画播放完毕后被触发. ",
  "Fired when this prop starts playing the Post physcannon-pull activity. Only fired if the ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_POST activity is defined in the model this breakable is using.": "当该属性开始执行'物理加农炮拉动后'的动作时触发此事件. 仅在该可破坏物所使用的模型中定义了 ACT_PHYSCANNON_ANIMATE_POST 动作时才会触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC reaches half of its maximum health.": "当此NPC的生命值降至最大值的一半时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC hears a sound (other than combat or the player).": "当此 NPC 听到声音时触发(战斗声或玩家的声音除外). ",
  "Fired when this NPC enters a sleep state.": "当该NPC进入睡眠状态时触发. ",
  "Fired when this NPC comes out of a sleep state.": "当此NPC从睡眠状态中醒来时触发. ",
  "Fired when the NPC starts a forced interaction.": "当NPC开始强制交互时触发. ",
  "Fired when the NPC aborts a forced interaction for some reason (target NPC died, couldn't be pathed to, etc)": "当 NPC 因某种原因中止强制交互时触发(例如目标 NPC 死亡、无法找到路径等)",
  "NPCs in actbusies can no longer perform dynamic interactions.": "处于活动状态的NPC将无法再执行动态交互. ",
  "HACK: Sets this NPC's body group (from 0 - n). You'd better know what you are doing!": "提示:用于设置该NPC的身体组别(范围:0 - n). 请务必确保自己清楚此举的后果! ",
  "Wakes up the NPC if it is sleeping.": "如果NPC正在睡觉, 则将其唤醒. ",
  "Force the NPC to use a dynamic interaction with another NPC. Parameter format: <target NPC name> <dynamic interaction name>": "强制让某个NPC与另一个NPC执行动态交互. 参数格式:<目标NPC名称> <动态交互名称>",
  "This NPC will instantly become a ragdoll with ZERO force (just go limp). OnDeath, OnHalfHealth, etc. Outputs will **NOT** BE FIRED.": "该NPC会在不受任何外力作用的情况下立刻变成布娃娃状态(完全瘫软). 此时'OnDeath'、'OnHalfHealth'等触发事件**均不会**被调用. ",
  "Start displaying the first overlay.": "开始显示第一个覆盖层. ",
  "Stop displaying any overlays.": "停止显示任何覆盖层. ",
  "Switch to displaying a specific overlay. Pass in the desired overlay number in the parameter.": "切换为显示指定的覆盖层. 请在参数中填入所需的覆盖层编号. ",
  "Start the effect with the duration in seconds as the passed parameter.": "以传入的参数值作为持续时间来启动效果. ",
  "Stop the effect.": "停止效果. ",
  "Enable sun rendering.": "启用太阳渲染. ",
  "Disable sun rendering.": "禁用阳光渲染. ",
  "Change the sun's color. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "更改太阳的颜色. 格式:<红色值 0-255> <绿色值 0-255> <蓝色值 0-255>",
  "Set the Max Ragdoll Count on DX8 hardware.": "设置 DX8 硬件上允许的最大布娃娃对象数量. ",
  "Set the max gib count under DX8.": "设置 DX8 下的最大 GIB 数量. ",
  "Set the distance in front of the focus region at which the scene will be completely blurred using the near blur radius. Must be smaller than NearFocusDepth.": "请使用近景模糊半径来设置焦点区域前方使场景完全模糊的距离. 该值必须小于 NearFocusDepth. ",
  "The area between the near focus and far focus distances is perfectly in focus. Must be smaller than FarFocusDepth.": "近对焦距离与远对焦距离之间的区域均能保持完美对焦. 该数值必须小于远对焦深度. ",
  "The area between the near focus and far focus distances is perfectly in focus. Must be smaller than FarBlurDepth.": "近焦距与远焦距之间的区域均能保持完美对焦. 该数值必须小于FarBlurDepth. ",
  "Set the distance beyond the focus region at which the scene will be completely blurred using the far blur radius. Must be larger than FarFocusDepth.": "使用远景模糊半径来设置聚焦区域之外、画面开始完全模糊的距离. 该值必须大于FarFocusDepth. ",
  "Set the blur radius (in pixels) to use at the near blur distance. Set to 0 to disable near blur.": "设置在近处模糊距离下使用的模糊半径(以像素为单位). 设置为 0 可禁用近处模糊. ",
  "Set the blur radius (in pixels) to use at the far blur distance. Set to 0 to disable far blur.": "设置在远距离模糊时使用的模糊半径(以像素为单位). 设置为 0 可禁用远距离模糊功能. ",
  "Set the focal target for the effect.": "设置效果的焦点目标. ",
  "Set the distance behind the focal point that will remain in focus.": "设置焦点后方仍能保持对焦的距离. ",
  "Change the render color of the glow. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "修改发光效果的渲染颜色. 格式:<红色值 0-255> <绿色值 0-255> <蓝色值 0-255>",
  "Begin doing the reverse of the current fade.": "开始执行与当前渐变效果相反的操作. ",
  "Start watching the player's surface.": "开始监视播放器的界面. ",
  "Stop watching the player's surface.": "停止监视玩家的界面. ",
  "Fired when the player moves onto the specified game material.": "当玩家移动到指定的游戏材质上时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player moves off the specified game material.": "当玩家离开指定的游戏材质区域时触发. ",
  "Revert to using the default tonemap auto exposure.": "恢复为使用默认的色调映射自动曝光设置. ",
  "Set a custom tonemap auto exposure minimum.": "设置自定义的色调映射自动曝光最小值. ",
  "Set a custom tonemap auto exposure maximum.": "设置自定义色调映射自动曝光的最大值. ",
  "Set a custom bloom scale.": "设置自定义的光晕缩放比例. ",
  "Set the rate for autoexposure adjustment.": "设置自动曝光调节的速率. ",
  "Set a custom bloom exponent.": "设置自定义的泛光指数. ",
  "Set a custom bloom saturation.": "设置自定义泛光饱和度. ",
  "Set a target for percentage of pixels above a certain brightness. (default: 2)": "设置亮度高于特定值的像素所占百分比的目标值. (默认值:2)",
  "Set a custom brightness target for SetTonemapPercentBrightPixels. (default: 60)": "为 SetTonemapPercentBrightPixels 设置自定义的亮度目标值. (默认值:60)",
  "Sets custom tonemapping param (ask Alex for details; default: 3).": "设置自定义的色调映射参数(详情请咨询 Alex; 默认值:3). ",
  "Set fade start distance.": "设置渐隐起始距离. ",
  "Set fade end distance.": "设置渐隐结束距离. ",
  "Sets the movie to display.": "设置要播放的电影. ",
  "Use custom UVs.": "使用自定义UV. ",
  "Start using this video as the master of it's group.": "开始将此视频设为其所属组的主视频. ",
  "Set the minimum U.": "设置最小单位值. ",
  "Set the maximum U.": "设置最大U值. ",
  "Set the minimum V.": "设置最小 V 值. ",
  "Set the maximum V.": "设置最大V值. ",
  "Sets the cycler's sequence.": "设置循环序列. ",
  "Activates the bubbles.": "激活气泡效果. ",
  "Deactivates the bubbles.": "禁用气泡显示. ",
  "Toggles the bubbles on and off.": "切换气泡显示的开关. ",
  "Sets the bubble density.": "设置气泡密度. ",
  "Sets bubble emission rate in bubbles per second.": "设置气泡的发射频率, 单位为每秒产生的气泡数. ",
  "Sets current speed in inches per second.": "设置当前速度, 单位为英寸/秒. ",
  "Set max density lerp to.": "设置最大密度插值值. ",
  "Set the value the fog will scale the default value by when players are zoomed in (scoped).": "设置玩家放大视角(使用瞄准镜时)时, 雾效相对于默认值需要缩放的倍数. ",
  "Turns the steam jet on.": "开启蒸汽喷射功能. ",
  "Turns the steam jet off.": "关闭蒸汽喷射. ",
  "Toggles the steam jet between on and off.": "切换蒸汽喷射的开启与关闭. ",
  "Sets the length of steam jet.": "设置蒸汽喷射的长度. ",
  "Sets the particle emission rate in particles per second.": "设置粒子发射速率, 单位为每秒发射的粒子数量. ",
  "Sets the default speed of the particles in units per second.": "设置粒子的默认速度, 单位为每秒移动的距离. ",
  "Sets the spread speed in units per second.": "设置扩散速度, 单位为每秒单位数. ",
  "Enable the soundscape.": "启用声音场景. ",
  "Disable the soundscape.": "禁用声音场景. ",
  "Add score to player.": "为玩家添加分数. ",
  "Set the message text.": "设置消息文本. ",
  "Change the color of the spotlight": "更改聚光灯的颜色",
  "Force an update of the spotlight position and orientation": "强制更新聚光灯的位置与朝向",
  "Turn emitter on.": "开启发射器. ",
  "Turn emitter off.": "关闭发射器. ",
  "Force a single arc.": "强制使用单一弧线. ",
  "Unlocks the filename/map combination.": "解锁文件名与地图的对应组合. ",
  "Completes the filename/map combination.": "完成文件名与地图名的组合. ",
  "Saves bonus map data.": "保存奖励地图数据. ",
  "Return Player Control.": "返回玩家控制界面. ",
  "Take Player Control.": "夺取玩家控制权. ",
  "Fired whenever this entity starts controlling the player's input.": "每当该实体开始控制玩家的输入时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever this entity stops controlling the player's input.": "每当此实体停止控制玩家的输入时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the moveleft key.": "每当玩家按下向左移动键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the moveright key.": "每当玩家按下向右移动键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the forward key.": "每当玩家按下前进键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the backward key.": "每当玩家按下后退键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the attack key.": "每当玩家按下攻击键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player presses the secondary attack key.": "每当玩家按下次要攻击键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the moveleft key.": "每当玩家松开向左移动键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the moveright key.": "每当玩家松开向右移动键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the forward key.": "每当玩家松开前进键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the backward key.": "每当玩家松开向后移动键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the attack key.": "每当玩家松开攻击键时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player releases the secondary attack key.": "每当玩家松开次要攻击键时触发. ",
  "An output that fires whenever the X axis of the player's input changes. i.e. -1 when the player has moveleft key down, 1 when the player has moveright key down, and 0 if neither.": "此输出值会在玩家输入的X轴方向发生变化时触发. 当玩家按下左移键时值为 -1, 按下右移键时值为 1; 若两个键都未按下, 则值为 0. ",
  "An output that fires whenever the Y axis of the player's input changes. i.e. -1 when the player has backward key down, 1 when the player has forward key down, and 0 if neither.": "此输出值会在玩家输入的Y轴发生变化时触发. 具体来说:当玩家按下向后键时返回-1, 按下向前键时返回1; 若两者都未按下则返回0. ",
  "An output that fires whenever the state of the player's attack key changes. i.e. 1 when the player has the attack key down, 0 otherwise.": "该输出值会在玩家的攻击键状态发生变化时触发. 即当玩家按下攻击键时值为1, 否则为0. ",
  "An output that fires whenever the state of the player's secondary attack key changes. i.e. 1 when the player has the secondary attack key down, 0 otherwise.": "此输出值会在玩家的二级攻击键状态发生变化时触发. 当玩家按下二级攻击键时值为1, 否则为0. ",
  "Force the decal to apply itself to the world.": "强制将贴花应用到场景中. ",
  "Turn the link on.": "启用该链接. ",
  "Turn the link off.": "关闭链接. ",
  "Set the shadow color.": "设置阴影颜色. ",
  "Set the shadow direction.": "设置阴影方向. ",
  "Set the maximum shadow cast distance.": "设置最大阴影投射距离. ",
  "Set shadows disabled state.": "设置阴影禁用状态. ",
  "Set the light color.": "设置灯光颜色. ",
  "Set the sun direction.": "设置太阳方向. ",
  "Set the distance of the sun.": "设置太阳的距离. ",
  "Set the field of view the sun casts.": "设置太阳照射的视野范围. ",
  "Set the near z distance.": "设置近景 Z 距离. ",
  "Sets the north offset.": "设置北方偏移值. ",
  "Set the texture cookie of the sunlight.": "设置阳光的纹理缓存. ",
  "Set the if shadows are enabled": "设置是否启用阴影",
  "Sets the color.": "设置颜色. ",
  "Move the water brush to the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "将水笔移动到终点位置(起始位置 +(移动方向 × 移动距离)). ",
  "Move the water brush to the starting position.": "将水笔移动到起始位置. ",
  "Move the water brush to a specific position between 0.0 and 1.0, where 0 is the starting position and 1 is the starting position + (move direction * move distance).": "将水笔移动到 0.0 到 1.0 之间的特定位置:其中 0 代表起始位置, 1 代表起始位置加上(移动方向 × 移动距离)后所得的位置. ",
  "Fired when the water brush reaches the end position (starting position + (move direction * move distance)).": "当水笔到达终点位置(起始位置 +(移动方向 × 移动距离))时触发. ",
  "Fired when the water brush reaches the starting position.": "当水墨笔回到起始位置时触发. ",
  "Set the speed as a ratio of the specified Max Rotation Speed, where 0 is stopped and 1 is the Max Rotation Speed. Negative values rotate backwards.": "将速度设置为指定'最大旋转速度'的比例值, 其中 0 表示停止, 1 表示达到最大旋转速度. 负值则表示反向旋转. ",
  "Causes the func_rotating to fire its OnGetSpeed output with its current speed.": "使 func_rotating 以其当前速度触发 OnGetSpeed 输出. ",
  "Fired when the GetSpeed input is called.  The current speed of the func_rotating is passed with this output.": "在调用 GetSpeed 输入项时触发. 此时会通过此输出参数返回 func_rotating 当前的运行速度. ",
  "Fired when the door arrives at it's goal angle.": "当门转动到目标角度时触发. ",
  "Sets the open distance (in degrees) and moves there.": "设置打开角度(以度为单位), 并移动到该角度. ",
  "Starts the glow.": "启动发光效果. ",
  "Stops the glow.": "停止发光. ",
  "Set the particle rotation speed (in degrees per second).": "设置粒子旋转速度(单位为度/秒). ",
  "Set the particle movement speed (in inches per second).": "设置粒子移动速度(单位:英寸/秒). ",
  "Set the particle density. It should be a range from 0 to 1.": "设置粒子密度, 取值范围为 0 到 1. ",
  "Spawn a dust puff.": "生成一阵尘土. ",
  "Enable the point_viewcontrol, and start controlling the player's view.": "启用 point_viewcontrol, 随后即可开始控制玩家的视角. ",
  "Disable the point_viewcontrol, and stop controlling the player's view.": "禁用 point_viewcontrol, 停止对玩家视角的控制. ",
  "Set a new target for the camera to point at.": "设置摄像头要对准的新目标. ",
  "Set a new attachment on the target for the camera to point at.": "设置目标对象的新附件, 以便摄像头对准它. ",
  "Return the camera view to the player's eyes.": "将摄像头视角恢复为玩家的视角. ",
  "Teleport the player to the current position of the camera.": "将玩家传送到摄像机当前所在的位置. ",
  "Set the speed that the camera will try to track it's target.": "设置摄像头试图跟踪目标时的速度. ",
  "Have the camera start following a new path.": "让摄像头开始沿新路径移动. ",
  "Fired when the point_viewcontrol deactivates, due to the Disable input being received, the Entity to Look At being destroyed, or the Hold Time expiring.": "当 point_viewcontrol 被停用时触发, 触发原因可能是收到了禁用输入指令、目标实体被销毁, 或是保持时间已到. ",
  "Enable the point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, and start controlling the players' view.": "启用 point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, 然后开始控制玩家的视角. ",
  "Disable the point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, and stop controlling the players' view.": "禁用 point_viewcontrol_multiplayer, 停止控制玩家的视角. ",
  "Start the movement to the target entity.": "开始向目标实体移动. ",
  "Starts the unstoppable outtro movement per each player.": "启动每位玩家无法阻挡的片尾动作. ",
  "Enable the view proxy, and start modifying the player's view.": "启用视图代理, 随后即可开始修改玩家的视角. ",
  "Disable the view proxy, and start modifying the player's view.": "禁用视图代理, 然后开始修改播放器的视图. ",
  "Move the player to the view proxy.": "将玩家移动到视图代理处. ",
  "Sets the pose parameter to control.": "设置要控制的姿势参数. ",
  "Set the pose parameter to a normalized value between 0.0 and 1.0 (maps to min and max range).": "将姿态参数设置为 0.0 至 1.0 之间的标准化值(对应最小值与最大值范围). ",
  "Set the interpolation time to a number of seconds between 0.0 and 10.0.": "将插值时间设置为 0.0 到 10.0 秒之间的任意数值. ",
  "Set the pose parameter's base cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "将姿态参数的每秒基础循环次数设置在 -10.0f 到 10.0 之间. ",
  "Set the type of frequency modulation.": "设置频率调制的类型. ",
  "Set the modulation time offset from -1.0f to 1.0.": "设置调制时间偏移值, 范围从 -1.0f 到 1.0. ",
  "Set the modulation cycles per second from -10.0f to 10.0.": "设置每秒的调制周期值, 范围在 -10.0f 到 10.0 之间. ",
  "Set the modulation extents from 0.0f to 10.0.": "将调制范围设置为 0.0f 至 10.0. ",
  "Randomize the frequency modulation by an extremeness of 0.0 to 1.0.": "在 0.0 到 1.0 的范围内随机调整频率调制值. ",
  "Trigger the relay, causing its OnTrigger output to fire if it is enabled.": "触发继电器, 若其已启用, 则会触发 OnTrigger 输出. ",
  "Toggle the relay between enabled and disabled.": "切换继电器的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Cancel any events fired by this relay that are currently pending in the I/O event queue.": "取消此中继触发的、当前尚在 I/O 事件队列中等待处理的所有事件. ",
  "Fired when the relay is spawned. If the relay is set to only trigger once, it will ": "在中继被创建时触发. 若该中继被设置为仅触发一次, 则它会在之后不再响应 ",
  "Fired when the relay is triggered. If the relay is set to only trigger once, it will ": "在继电器被触发时调用. 若继电器设置为仅触发一次, 则它只会 ",
  "Toggle between enabled and disabled.": "在启用与禁用状态之间切换. ",
  "Start a message from this entity using the matching OnRegisteredActivating - but the activator is the registered entity.": "从此实体发起一条消息, 调用相匹配的 OnRegisteredActivating 方法 - 只不过激活器即为该已注册的实体. ",
  "Stores an entity to later be used as an activator.": "用于存储实体, 以便日后作为激活器使用. ",
  "Fired to send a message using the registered as the activator.": "已触发, 正在通过注册的激活器发送消息. ",
  "Trigger this entity, causing its OnTrigger outputs to fire if it is enabled.": "触发此实体, 若该实体已启用, 则其 OnTrigger 输出便会触发. ",
  "Toggle this entity between enabled and disabled.": "切换此实体的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Cancel any events fired by this entity that are currently pending in the I/O event queue.": "取消此实体触发的、当前正处于 I/O 事件队列中等待处理的所有事件. ",
  "Fired when this entity is spawned. If this entity is set to only trigger once, it will ": "当此实体被生成时触发. 若该实体被设置为仅触发一次, 则它会 ",
  "This output has a chance to fire when the entity is triggered.": "此输出有概率在实体被触发时生成. ",
  "Enable the timer.": "启用计时器. ",
  "Disable the timer.": "禁用计时器. ",
  "Set the microphone to output through a different speaker entity.": "将麦克风的输出目标设置为其他扬声器实体. ",
  "Fired in Measuring mode whenever the sound level changes.": "在测量模式下, 每当声级发生变化时即触发. ",
  "Fired whenever a sound is routed out through the specified speaker (if any).": "每当声音通过指定的扬声器输出时便会触发(若存在指定扬声器). ",
  "Fired whenever this microphone hears any sound it cares about.": "每当此麦克风侦测到它需要关注的声音时便会触发. ",
  "Set the MaxValue without firing any outputs.": "设置 MaxValue 值, 但不会触发任何输出. ",
  "Set the MinValue without firing any outputs.": "设置 MinValue 值且不会触发任何输出. ",
  "Play the movie.": "播放电影. ",
  "Play the movie for all connected players.": "为所有已连接的玩家播放影片. ",
  "Plays a movie with specific settings used for level transitions.  Pass the name of the movie in the parameters.  To be fired at the end of a level.": "播放一段用于关卡过渡的电影, 需使用指定的设置. 请在参数中传入电影名称. 该指令应在关卡结束时调用. ",
  "Fade movies out for all players connected.": "让所有已连接的玩家看到的电影画面逐渐淡出. ",
  "Fired when the movie has completed playing back or was skipped by the user.": "当影片播放完成或被用户跳过时触发. ",
  "Spawn an instance of the template at the original position.": "在原始位置生成模板的实例. ",
  "Fired after spawning an instance of this template.": "在此模板的实例生成之后触发. ",
  "Teleport the target entity.": "传送目标实体. ",
  "Teleport the target entity to wherever the point_teleport entity is currently. ": "将目标实体传送到 point_teleport 实体当前所在的位置.  ",
  "Teleport the entity specified by the parameter override. Use this to teleport an entity other than the one specified in the Entity To Teleport field.": "根据参数设置传送指定的实体. 该功能适用于传送那些未在'待传送实体'字段中指定的实体. ",
  "Start constraining any players within the radius.": "开始限制半径范围内的所有玩家. ",
  "Stop constraining any players previously constrained.": "解除对之前被限制的所有玩家的限制. ",
  "Fired when a player breaks through the constraint.": "当玩家突破限制时触发. ",
  "Show this object and allow it to collide, doesn't override notsolid": "显示此对象并允许其发生碰撞, 但不会覆盖'非实体'属性",
  "Hide this object and stop collisions": "隐藏此对象并禁止碰撞",
  "Change the collision to act like debris": "将碰撞效果设置为类似碎片的效果",
  "Fired when a player picks this object up, either with the physgun or +USE.": "当玩家使用物理枪或按 +USE 键拾起该物体时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player punts this object with the physgun.": "当玩家使用物理枪将此物体踢出时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player picks this object up WITH THE PHYSGUN. +USE pickups do not fire this output.": "当玩家使用物理枪拾取该物体时触发. 通过 +USE 方式拾取的物体不会触发此输出. ",
  "Fired when a player drops this object.": "当玩家丢弃此对象时触发. ",
  "Start gas escaping from the cannister.": "气体开始从罐体中泄漏. ",
  "Stop gas escaping from the cannister.": "阻止气体从罐体中泄漏. ",
  "Force the cannister to explode.": "强制使罐体爆炸. ",
  "Wakes up the cannister, if it is sleeping.": "唤醒休眠中的罐子. ",
  "Fired when gas starts to escape from the cannister.": "当气体开始从容器中泄漏时触发. ",
  "Set the Spring Constant.": "设置弹簧常数. ",
  "Set the Spring Length.": "设置弹簧长度. ",
  "Set the Spring Damping.": "设置弹簧阻尼值. ",
  "Fires after the conversion has taken place.": "转换完成后触发. ",
  "Converts this entity's target to a physically simulated object.": "将该实体的目标转换为受物理模拟影响的对象. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制让该属性执行动画. 参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Force the prop to play an animation unless the prop is already playing the animation. The parameter should be the name of the animation.": "强制该组件播放动画, 除非它已经在播放动画. 此参数应为动画的名称. ",
  "Set the Default Animation to the one specified in the parameter.": "将默认动画设置为参数中所指定的动画. ",
  "Set the visible bodygroup, by index.": "按索引设置可见的体型组. ",
  "Change into a ragdoll immediately.": "立即变成布娃娃. ",
  "Fade out then remove this prop.": "淡出后移除该道具. ",
  "Disable fluid/floating simulation to reduce cost.": "禁用流体/漂浮模拟以降低成本. ",
  "Set this prop's body group (from 0 - n).": "设置此属性的体组编号(范围:0 至 n). ",
  "Allow this prop to play its own sound when punted": "允许此组件在被踢出时播放自己的音效",
  "Prevent this prop from playing its own sound when punted": "防止该道具在被踢出时播放自身音效",
  "Fired when the player picks up the prop with the physcannon or +USE.": "当玩家使用物理加农炮或按+USE键拾起道具时触发. ",
  "Fired when the player drops the prop with the physcannon or USE.": "当玩家使用物理加农炮或USE键放下道具时触发. ",
  "Fired whenever the player picks up this prop (with the physcannon or with +USE).": "每当玩家拾起此道具时(使用物理加农炮或按下 +USE 键)便会触发. ",
  "Begins ragdoll boogie effect. Parameter override = number of seconds to boogie.": "启动布娃娃舞动效果. 参数值即为舞动持续的秒数. ",
  "Open the portal. When the portal is open is can be seen through.": "打开传送门. 传送门开启后即可透视查看. ",
  "Close the portal. When the portal is closed it cannot be seen through.": "关闭传送门. 传送门关闭后便无法透视了. ",
  "Toggle the open/closed state of the portal.": "切换门户的开启/关闭状态. ",
  "Deactivate the occluder, When inactive, it can be seen through.": "禁用遮挡物:禁用后即可透视看到其后方内容. ",
  "Activate the occluder. When active, it cannot be seen through.": "启用遮挡物. 启用后, 该遮挡物将无法被穿透. ",
  "Toggle the active/inactive state of the occluder.": "切换遮挡物的启用/禁用状态. ",
  "Shatter the window. Input a vector. First two coordinates are the X,Y center of the shattering (as values from from 0-1). The third coordinate is the radius of the shatter, in inches.": "击碎窗口. 请输入一个向量:前两个坐标值分别表示击碎区域的 X 和 Y 中心点(数值范围为 0 到 1), 第三个坐标值则是击碎区域的半径, 单位为英寸. ",
  "ToggleDirection": "切换方向",
  "SetSpeed": "设置速度",
  "Fired when the trigger is activated.": "触发器被激活时触发. ",
  "Fired after the timeout interval expires if the player never looked at the target.": "若玩家始终未注视目标, 则在超时时长到期后触发. ",
  "Set a new target to teleport to.": "设置一个新的传送目标. ",
  "Install this AddOn to the specified NPC": "将此插件安装到指定的NPC上",
  "Remove this AddOn from the NPC it is attached to": "从该NPC身上移除所绑定的插件",
  "Fires when an NPC is created.": "在创建NPC时触发. ",
  "Fires when an NPC fails to be created.": "当NPC创建失败时触发. ",
  "Fires when an Addon is created.": "在创建插件时触发. ",
  "Fires when an Addon fails to be created.": "当插件创建失败时触发. ",
  "Set the camera to use. The parameter should be the name of a point_camera entity in the map.": "设置要使用的摄像机. 该参数应为地图中 point_camera 实体的名称. ",
  "Fire to modify a material variable. The argument is the value to set the variable to.": "按下'Fire'即可修改材质变量, 参数即为要设置给该变量的值. ",
  "This sets the material variable to the current time on the server.": "此操作会将材质变量设为服务器上的当前时间. ",
  "Force an animated material with the MaterialModifyAnimated proxy to play a set of animation frames. Format is: <Frame Start> <Frame End> <Frame Rate> <Loop>\nSetting <Frame End> to -1 uses the last frame of the texture. <Loop> should be 1 or 0.": "强制使用 MaterialModifyAnimated 代理让带有动画效果的材料播放指定的动画帧序列. 格式为:<起始帧> <结束帧> <帧率> <是否循环>\n将 <结束帧> 设为 -1 则表示使用纹理中的最后一帧. <是否循环> 的值应为 1 或 0. ",
  "Force a material with the MaterialModifyAnimated proxy to lerp a material var between two floating point values. Format is: <Start Value> <End Value> <Transition Time> <Loop>\n<Loop> should be 1 or 0.": "强制使用 MaterialModifyAnimated 代理让某个材质变量在两个浮点数值之间进行插值计算. 格式如下:<起始值> <结束值> <过渡时间> <是否循环>\n<是否循环> 的值应为 1 或 0. ",
  "Fired when a Portal player successfully places the primary portal.": "当 Portal 玩家成功放置主传送门时触发. ",
  "Fired when a Portal player successfully places the secondary portal.": "当 Portal 玩家成功放置次级传送门时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player starts to duck.": "当玩家开始下蹲时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player releases the duck button.": "当玩家松开躲避按钮时触发. ",
  "Fired when a player jumps.": "玩家跳跃时触发. ",
  "Change portalgun bodygroup to show potatos.": "将 Portalgun 的主体组改为显示土豆. ",
  "Change portalgun bodygroup to not show potatos.": "将 Portalgun 的主体组设置修改为不显示土豆. ",
  "Set wether the player is allowed to drop a carried object.": "设置是否允许玩家丢弃所携带的物品. ",
  "Force the player to use the view model grab controller for all objects that are picked up.": "强制要求玩家对所有拾取的物品均使用视图模型抓取控制器. ",
  "Force the player to use the physics grab controller for all objects that are picked up.": "强制玩家对所有拾取的物体使用物理抓取控制器. ",
  "Resets the grab controller used by the player to its default behavior.": "将玩家使用的抓取控制器重置为默认行为. ",
  "Forces the motion blur effect on the player. Set to < 0 to disable this override.": "强制对玩家启用运动模糊效果. 设置为 < 0 则可禁用此设置. ",
  "Turn on the texture": "开启纹理功能",
  "Turn off the texture": "关闭纹理显示",
  "Turn on per frame updating (for moving lights)": "启用逐帧更新功能(适用于移动光源) (for moving lights)",
  "Turn off per frame updating (for moving lights)": "关闭逐帧更新功能(适用于移动光源) (for moving lights)",
  "Change the light color/brightness": "更改灯光颜色/亮度",
  "Turn on display of particle simulation benchmark": "启用粒子模拟基准测试的显示",
  "Turn off display of particle simulation benchmark": "关闭粒子模拟基准测试的显示",
  "Start measuring particle simulation speed": "开始测量粒子模拟速度",
  "Stop measuring particle simulation speed": "停止测量粒子模拟速度",
  "This message will get relayed and will be available from the instance.": "该消息会被转发, 随后即可在实例中查看. ",
  "A message from outside can trigger this to cause something to happen in the instance.": "外部发来的消息可触发此机制, 从而使实例内发生特定事件. ",
  "Generate the event on input.": "在输入时生成事件. ",
  "Enable the hallucination algorithm": "启用幻觉算法",
  "Disable the hallucination algorithm": "禁用幻觉生成算法",
  "Set Visible Time": "设置可见时间",
  "Set Recharge Time": "设置充值时间",
  "Set the focal distance of the depth blur effect (in the range [0,1]).": "设置深度模糊效果的焦距值(取值范围为 [0,1]). ",
  "Set the depth blur effect strength.": "设置深度模糊效果的强度. ",
  "Set the screen blur effect strength.": "设置屏幕模糊效果的强度. ",
  "Set the film grain effect strength.": "设置胶片颗粒效果的强度. ",
  "Turn the tank on": "打开坦克电源",
  "Turn the tank off (go dormant)": "关闭坦克(进入休眠状态) (go dormant)",
  "How fast to fire (0 = don't fire)": "发射速度(0 表示不发射)",
  "Set the Damage Per Bullet": "设置每发子弹造成的伤害值",
  "World position that I should aim at": "我应该瞄准的世界坐标位置",
  "Direction to aim at.": "瞄准方向. ",
  "Name of entity I should follow/attack": "我需要跟随/攻击的目标实体名称",
  "Entity I should follow/attack (output from other entity only)": "我应当追随/攻击的实体(仅由其他实体输出) (output from other entity only)",
  "Clear the entity I should be attacking.": "清除我应该攻击的目标. ",
  "Find a nearby NPC to man this func_tank.": "寻找附近的NPC来操控这个func_tank. ",
  "Start searching for NPCs to man this func_tank.": "开始搜索可操控此 func_tank 的 NPC. ",
  "Stop searching for NPCs to man this func_tank.": "停止寻找NPC来操控这个func_tank吧. ",
  "Force the NPC manning this func_tank (if any) to leave.": "强制让负责操作此 func_tank 的 NPC(如果存在的话)离开. ",
  "Set the max range of the func_tank.": "设置 func_tank 的最大作用范围. ",
  "Fires when the tank fires its bullets": "当坦克发射子弹时触发",
  "Fires when target is newly in range and can be shot": "当目标重新进入可射击范围时触发",
  "Fires when when target goes out of range": "当目标超出作用范围时触发",
  "Fires when tank runs out of ammo": "当坦克的弹药耗尽时触发",
  "Fires when an NPC starts to control this tank. Players do NOT fire this input.": "当NPC开始控制该坦克时触发. 玩家不会主动触发此输入. ",
  "Fires when the NPC controller of the tank stops controlling it. Players do NOT fire this input.": "当坦克的NPC控制器停止对坦克进行控制时触发. 玩家不会主动触发此事件. ",
  "Fires when a Player starts to control this tank. NPCs do NOT fire this input.": "当玩家开始控制该坦克时触发. NPC不会触发此事件. ",
  "Fires when the Player controller of the tank stops controlling it. NPCs do NOT fire this input.": "当坦克的玩家控制器停止控制坦克时触发. NPC不会触发此输入. ",
  "Fires once when the tank is done waiting to fire between rounds": "在坦克完成每轮射击前的等待后触发一次",
  "Change the glow's color. Format: <Red 0-255> <Green 0-255> <Blue 0-255>": "更改发光颜色. 格式:<红色 0-255> <绿色 0-255> <蓝色 0-255>",
  "Sets the glow red color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置发光红色通道的值(0 - 255). ",
  "Sets the glow green color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置绿色辉光颜色通道的值(0 - 255). ",
  "Sets the glow blue color channel's value (0 - 255).": "设置发光效果的蓝色通道值(0 - 255). ",
  "Forces a bonus crate to spawn on intput.": "强制在指定输入位置生成奖励箱. ",
  "If spawned from a env_entity_maker, you need to call this after spawn for it to work properly.": "如果该实体是由 env_entity_maker 生成的, 则需在生成后调用此函数方能正常工作. ",
  "If spawned from a env_entity_maker, you NEED to call this after spawn for it to work properly.": "如果该实体是由 env_entity_maker 生成的, 则必须在生成后调用此函数才能使其正常工作. ",
  "Activate the bomb and specify how many seconds before it explodes.": "激活炸弹并设定爆炸前等待的秒数. ",
  "Fired when C4 is defused by a player": "当玩家成功拆除C4时触发",
  "Fired when a player successfully begins to defuse the bomb": "当玩家成功开始拆除炸弹时触发",
  "Fired when a player starts defusing and then stops": "当玩家开始拆弹后又停止时触发",
  "Sets this buyzone as enabled.": "将此购买区域设置为启用状态. ",
  "Sets this buyzone as disabled.": "将此购买区域设置为禁用状态. ",
  "Make it so only terrorist can buy from this buyzone.": "设置后只有恐怖分子才能从这个购买区购买物品. ",
  "Make it so only CT's can buy from this buyzone.": "设置后只有反恐精英方可从此购买区购买物品. ",
  "Make it so all teams can buy from this buyzone.": "让所有团队都能从这个购买区进行购买. ",
  "Make it so no teams can buy from this buyzone (this essentially disables the buyzone).": "设置后, 任何团队都无法从此购买区进行购买(这相当于禁用了该购买区). ",
  "Fire output based on snd_surround_speaker cvar value": "根据 snd_surround_speaker 配置值来输出音频",
  "Fired if player is using 2 speakers.": "当玩家使用两个扬声器时触发. ",
  "Fired if player is using 4 speakers.": "当玩家使用4个扬声器时触发. ",
  "Fired if player is using 5.1 speakers.": "当玩家使用5.1声道扬声器时触发. ",
  "End the round in a draw after x seconds.": "在 x 秒后以平局结束本轮. ",
  "End the round, terrorists win after x seconds.": "回合结束, 恐怖分子在 x 秒后获胜. ",
  "End the round, CTs win after x seconds.": "结束本回合:经过x秒后, 反恐精英阵营获胜. ",
  "Fires when the round ends regardless of it ended via input to this entity or not.": "无论是否通过向该实体输入指令来结束回合, 回合结束时都会触发此事件. ",
  "Add score to team TERRORIST.": "为恐怖分子队添加分数. ",
  "Add score to team COUNTER TERRORIST.": "为反恐特工队添加分数. ",
  "Set the speed of the action animation": "设置动作动画的速度",
  "Turn on: Start engine & enable throttle": "启用:启动引擎并开启油门",
  "Turn off: Stop engine, disable throttle, engage brakes.": "关闭:停止引擎, 禁用油门, 启动刹车. ",
  "Prevent the player from entering or exiting the vehicle.": "防止玩家进入或离开载具. ",
  "Re-allow the player to enter or exit the vehicle.": "重新允许玩家进入或退出载具. ",
  "Player entered the vehicle": "玩家已进入载具",
  "Player exited the vehicle": "玩家已离开载具",
  "Player Pressed attack key": "玩家按下了攻击键",
  "Player Pressed attack2 key": "玩家按下了攻击2键",
  "State of attack button [0,1]": "攻击状态按钮 [0,1]",
  "State of attack2 button [0,1]": "攻击状态2按钮 [0,1]",
  "Turns the handbrake on": "启用手刹",
  "Releases the handbrake": "松开手刹",
  "Steer the vehicle +/-1": "控制车辆方向 +/-1",
  "Throttle +/-1": "速率调节 +/-1",
  "Fired when the warning sound plays that announcing incoming rockets": "在播放警告音效以提醒有火箭即将来袭时触发",
  "Fired when the barrage of rockets start launching (after the announce)": "在火箭群开始发射时触发(通告之后) (after the announce)",
  "Fired when the end game starts and no more rockets will fire, but the zones start shrinking": "当游戏结束阶段开始且不再有火箭发射, 但安全区域开始缩小时触发",
  "When players kill all enemies in this wave/section": "当玩家消灭该波次/区域内的所有敌人时",
  "Called when the round resets": "回合重置时调用",
  "Called right before the level restarts, so the spawns can be set up": "在关卡重新启动前调用此函数, 以便设置生成点",
  "Called when the round is lost and the players are killed": "回合失败且玩家全部阵亡时调用",
  "Called when the round is lost because time ran out": "时间耗尽导致回合失败时调用",
  "Called when the mission is completed": "任务完成时被调用",
  "Sets the angles indicating the direction to slow player velocity.": "设置用于指示降低玩家速度方向的角度. ",
  "Fill up the ammo of all weapons held by the activator of this entity.": "为此实体的激活者所携带的所有武器重新装填弹药. ",
  "Swap to this skybox.": "切换到此天空盒. ",
  "Input to spawn the dronegun.": "输入指令以召唤无人机炮台. ",
  "Make text visible.": "使文本可见. ",
  "Make text invisible.": "使文本不可见. ",
  "OnHostageFirstPickedUp": "人质首次被解救时",
  "OnHostageRescued": "人质已获救",
  "Fired when a player finishes the long use.": "当玩家完成长时间使用后触发. ",
  "Fires output when health changes.": "当生命值发生变化时触发输出. ",
  "Toggle - If on, turn off, if off, turn on.": "切换功能 — 开启时则关闭, 关闭时则开启. ",
  "Enable.": "启用. ",
  "Disable.": "禁用. ",
  "Sets the camera to use for this monitor. Takes the name of a point_camera entity in the map.": "设置此显示器所使用的摄像机. 需填写地图中某个 point_camera 实体的名称. ",
  "Triggered when a map is vetoed (multiple times at once)": "当地图被否决时触发(可一次否决多张地图) (multiple times at once)",
