  "Yes, wait for speech to finish.": "是的, 请等待语音播放完毕. ",
  "No, start leading while speaking.": "不, 说话时就开始引导. ",
  "Yes, wait for speech to finish before starting to lead.": "是的, 请等待语音播放完毕后再开始引导. ",
  "Yes, speak the start greeting before starting to lead.": "是的, 开始引导前请先说出开场问候语. ",
  "No, don't speak the greeting.": "不, 不要说问候语. ",
  "No. Stop to fight, resume leading when safe.": "不行, 暂时停下来战斗, 确保安全后再继续前进. ",
  "Yes, lead while fighting.": "是的, 边战斗边带领大家. ",
  "No, don't pause.": "不, 不要暂停. ",
  "Yes, pause scenes player lags.": "是的, 暂停时场景播放器会出现卡顿. ",
  "No.": "否. ",
  "Yes, prevent speech.": "是的, 阻止语音输出. ",
  "Yes. ": "是的.  ",
  "No, let other AI dictate facing while waiting.": "不, 等待时让其他 AI 来控制朝向吧. ",
  "Yes, turn to face while waiting.": "是的, 等待时请转过身去. ",
